         </fo:block>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethf30"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. f. 30</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 5)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex, composite155×145 mm (weight: 923g), 154 fols, 18 quires.  Unit 1:  nineteenth–mid-twentieth century. Unit 2:  nineteenth–mid-twentieth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                The book is bound in wooden boards covered with dark brown blind-tooled leather. The inner sides of both boards are decorated with textile <fo:inline id="d1e3060">inlays</fo:inline>
                                featuring vertical yellow and light blue vertical stripes on a red background.
                              
                                The boards are cut to the same size as the bookblock and present external shallow bevels.
                              
                                Full dark-brown leather cover.
                                The turn-ins have been trimmed out and at the corners they form butt mitres.
                                <fo:inline id="d1e3069">Additional leather patches</fo:inline> used to fill the gap between the turn-ins
                                but they have been removed, presumably to resew the bookblock.
                                The cover shows a blind-tooled decoration, identical on both sides of the cover. The turn-ins and the edges are decorated as well.
                                The decoration consists of three concentric frames surrounding a central rectangular panel featuring a Latin cross.
                                Frames composed by the repetition of single tools, enclosed between <fo:inline id="d1e3072">triple straight lines</fo:inline>,
                                alternate with empty ones.
                                Proceeding from the outer to the inner frame, the repeating decoration motifs are <fo:inline id="d1e3075">criss-crosses</fo:inline>,
                                and <fo:inline id="d1e3078">wavy lines</fo:inline> with <fo:inline id="d1e3081">double circles</fo:inline> between them.
                                The cross is formed by <fo:inline id="d1e3085">X-form</fo:inline> motifs between <fo:inline id="d1e3088">single straight lines</fo:inline>.
                                At the ends of the arms of the cross there are <fo:inline id="d1e3091">corniform</fo:inline> motifs and three <fo:inline id="d1e3094">double circles</fo:inline>.
                                Double straight lines outline the shape of the cross, dividing the area around it in four panels.
                                In the panels at the foot of the cross, the triple straight lines form two triangles, each surmounted by a <fo:inline id="d1e3097">double circle</fo:inline>.
                                  In the panels above, they intersect forming a <fo:inline font-style="italic">crux decussata</fo:inline>. <fo:inline id="d1e3104">Double circles</fo:inline> are stamped
                                at the intersections of the straight lines and at the corners of the empty frames.
                                A <fo:inline id="d1e3107">triple straight line</fo:inline> runs along the edges of the boards with <fo:inline id="d1e3110">double circles</fo:inline> stamped
                                at intervals.
                                Turn-ins are decorated with the <fo:inline font-style="italic">crux
                                    decussata</fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e3116">double circle</fo:inline> motifs.
                              
                                Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern; Z-plied threads.
                                Between each pair of sewing stations there are two lengths of thread.
                                The sewing has been repaired several times with different threads. Groups of folios are stitched together
                                through the inner margin.
                              
                                The spine of the leather cover, together with the endbands, has been removed to resew the manuscript.
                                A small fragment of the leather spine is still attached at the head.
                                The small holes close to the head and tail of the quires testify to the former presence of endbands.
                              </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner (i–ii+1–152).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>18 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">2 (Fols ir–iiv)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8+1 (Fols 1r–9v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 10r–19v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10+2 (Fols 20r–31v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 32r–39v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 40r–47v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 48r–55v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">12 (Fols 56r–67v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8+1 (Fols 68r–76v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 77r–84v)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 85r–92v)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8+1 (Fols 93r–101v)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 102r–109v)</fo:inline> – XIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 110r–117v)</fo:inline> – XIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">12 (Fols 118r–129v)</fo:inline> – XV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 130r–139v)</fo:inline> – XVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 140r–147v)</fo:inline> – XVII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">5 (Fols 148r–152v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 1</fo:block>
         <fo:block>Parchment, 149 fols (fols i–147), nineteenth–mid-twentieth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3167LIT2701Dawit">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r–147vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Psalter, incomplete, CAe 2701.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 1r–130v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e3175"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Psalms of David and
                                        Book of Odes</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3190LIT2000Mazmur">
               <fo:inline>I-1-1) Fols 1r–117v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Psalms of David, CAe 2000.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ፍካ​ሬ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​ወኃ​ጥአ​ን፡ ​መዝ​ሙር፡ ​ዘዳ​ዊት፡
                                    ​ብፁ​ዕ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘኢ​ሖረ፡ ​በም​ክረ፡ ​ረሲ​ዓን ፨ ​ወዘ​ኢቆ​መ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ኃጥ​አን።
                                    ​ወዘ​ኢነ​በረ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መን​በረ፡ ​መስ​ተሳ​ልቃን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወረ​ገመ​ኒ፡ ​በአ​ማል​ክቲሁ ፨
                                    ​ወአ​ንሰ፡ ​ነሣ​እኩ፡ ​ዘእ​ምላ​ዕሌ​ሁ፡ ​ሰይፈ ፨
                                     (fol. 117v)  ​ወመ​ተር​ኩ፡ ​ርእሶ ፨
                                    ​ወአ​ሰሰ​ልኩ፡ ​ፅዕ​ለተ፡ ​እም​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3250LIT1828Mahale">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2) <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes, CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3256LIT1828Mahale#Moses1">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-1) Fols 117v–118v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: First Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ለሙ​ሴ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ማኅ​ልይ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​ወጸ​ሎቱ፡ ​ለሙ​ሴ።
                                        ​ንሴ​ብሖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ስቡ​ሐ፡ ​ዘተ​ሰብሐ ፨
                                        ​ፈረ​ሰ፡ ​ወመ​ስተ​ፅዕ​ነ፡ ​ወረ​ወ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ስተ​ጋብ​አ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​ባሕር ፨ 
                                        ​ወደ​ቂቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ልሰ፡ ​ኃለ​ፉ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​የብ​ስ፡ ​በማ​ዕከ​ለ፡ ​ባሕር ፨ ።
                                        ​ወማ​ይሰ፡ ​ሎመ፡ ​አረ​ፍት፡ ​በይ​ምን፡ ​ወአ​ረፍ​ት፡ ​በጽ​ግም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3297LIT1828Mahale#Moses2">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-2) Fols 118v–120r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Second Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም፡ ​ሕግ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ዘሙ​ሴ፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም፡ ​ሕግ።
                                             ፪  ​አጽ​ምእ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወእ​ንግ​ርከ ፨
                                        ​ወት​ስማ​ዕ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ቃል፡ ​አፉየ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወአ​ምዕ​ዑኒ፡ ​በአ​ማል​ክቲ​ሆሙ ፨
                                        ​ወአ​ነ፡ ​አቀ​ንዖ​ሙ፡ ​በዘ​ኢኮ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝብ ፨
                                        ​ወአ​ምዕ​ዖሙ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ፡ ​በዘ​ኢይ​ሌብው ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3344LIT1828Mahale#Moses3">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-3) Fols 120r–121v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Third Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘሣ​ልስ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ዘሙ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሳ​ልስ፡ ​ሕግ።
                                             ፫  ​እስ​መ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ትነ​ድድ፡ ​እመ​ዓትየ ፨
                                        ​ወታ​ውዒ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ታሕተ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ይት​ፈደ​ዮሙ፡ ​ወይ​ትቤ​ቀሎ​ሙ፡ ​በቀ​ለ፡ ​ለፀሩ ፨
                                        ​ወይ​ትቤ​ቀሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለጻ​ላእቱ ፨
                                        ​ወያ​ነጽ​ሕ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝቡ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3391LIT1828Mahale#Hannah">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-4) Fols 121v–122v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Hannah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሓና፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሐና፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል።
                                             ፬  ​ጸን​ዓ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                        ​ወተ​ለዓ​ለ፡ ​ቀር​ንየ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ንየ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ጻድ​ቅ፡ ​ይኰ​ንን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​አጽ​ናፈ፡ ​ምድር ፨
                                        ​ወይ​ሁቦ​ሙ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ለነ​ገሥ​ትነ ፨
                                        ​ወያ​ሌዕ​ል፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መሲሑ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3439LIT1828Mahale#Hezekiah">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-5) Fols 122v–123r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Prayer of Hezekiah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቅያ​ስ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡  ​ሕዝ​ቅያ​ስ። ። ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ።
                                         ፭  ​አን​ሰ፡ ​እቤ፡ ​በኑ​ኃ፡ ​መዋ​ዕልየ ፨
                                        ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አና​ቅፀ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ኀደ​ጉ፡ ​ዘተ​ረፈ፡ ​ዓመ​ትየ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​እነ​ግር፡ ​ጽድ​ቀከ፡ ​በዳ​ኅናየ ፨
                                        ​ወት​ረ፡ ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​ወእ​ዜም​ር፡ ​ለከ ፨
                                        ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወትየ ፨
                                        ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3494LIT1828Mahale#Manasseh">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-6) Fols 123r–124r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Prayer of Manasseh (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ምና​ሴ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ምና​ሴ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                             ​፮፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አኀ​ዜ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                                        ​አም​ላኮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊነ ፨
                                        ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ ​ወለ​ያዕ​ቆብ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሐይ​ወትየ ፨
                                        ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኪያ​ከ፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                        ​ወለ​ከ፡ ​ሰብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3547LIT1828Mahale#Jonah">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-7) Fols 124r–124v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Jonah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                             ፯  ​ጸራ​ኅኩ፡ ​በም​ንዳ​ቤየ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላኪየ ፨
                                        ​ወሰ​ምዓ​ኒ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ከር​ሠ፡ ​ሲኦል ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወእ​ለሰ፡ ​አቀ​ቡ፡ ​ከን​ቶ፡ ​ወሐ​ሰተ፡ ​ገደ​ፉ፡ ​ሣህሎ ፨
                                        ​ወአ​ንሰ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​በተ​ጋን​ዮ፡ ​እሰ​ውዕ፡ ​ለከ ፨
                                        ​መጣ​ነ፡ ​ጸለ​ይኩ፡ ​በሕ​ይወ​ትየ፡ ​አአ​ስዮ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3594LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths1">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-8) Fols 124v–125v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: First Song of the Three Youths in the Furnace (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ዘእ​ምኣ​ዛር​ያ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ዘእ​ምአ​ዛር​ያ።
                                        ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ ፨
                                        ​እኵ​ት፡ ​ወስ​ቡሕ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ይት​ኃፈ​ሩ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ትእ​ግል​ቶሙ፡ ​ወይ​ትቀ​ጥቀ​ጥ፡ ​ኃይ​ሎሙ ፨
                                        ​ወያ​አም​ሩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ባሕ​ቲት​ከ፡ ​ልዑል ፨
                                        ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3642LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths2">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-9) Fols 125v–126r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Second Song of the Three Youths (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሠለ​ስቱ፡ ​ደቂ​ቅ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ፫ ​ደቂ​ቅ።
                                             ፱  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ ፨
                                        ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                        ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​በመ​ልዕ​ልተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                         (fol. 126r)  ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወክ​ቡር፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3690LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths3">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-10) Fols 126r–127r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Third Song of the Three Youths (​ኀበ፡ ​ባረ​ኩ፡ ​ኣና​ንያ፡ ​ወኣ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ኀበ፡ ​ባረ​ኩ፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል።
                                             ፲ ይ ባ ር ​ክዎ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                        ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱኒ፡ <fo:inline>ውልዑልኒ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ይ ባ ር ​ክዎ፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                        ​ንባ​ርኮ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨
                                        ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3750LIT1828Mahale#Habakkuk">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-11) Fols 127v–128v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Habakkuk (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዕን​ባቆ​ም፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እን​ባቆ​ም፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                             ​፲፩  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕኩ፡ ​ድም​ፀከ፡ ​ወፈ​ራህኩ ፨
                                        ​ርኢ​ኩ፡ ​ግብ​ረከ፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ርኩ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ወኃ​ይልየ ፨
                                        ​ዘይ​ሠር​ዖን፡ ​ለእ​ገር​የ፡ ​ወለ​ፍጻ​ሜየ ፨
                                        ​ወዲ​በ፡ ​ልዑ​ላት፡ ​ያጼ​እነኒ ፨
                                        ​ከመ፡ ​እማ​ዕ፡ ​በማ​ኅል​ይሁ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3802LIT1828Mahale#Isaiah">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-12) Fols 128v–129v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Isaiah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                            <fo:inline>፪ (!)</fo:inline> ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ትገ​ይስ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡
                                        ​አም​ላኪየ ፨
                                         (fol. 129r)  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ትእ​ዛዝ​ከ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​ምድር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ሖር፡ ​ሕዝ​ብየ፡ ​ወባ​ዕ፡ ​ቤተከ ፨   ​ወዕ​ፁ፡ ​ኆኅ​ተከ ፨
                                        ​ወተ​ኃባ​ዕ፡ ​ኅዳ​ጠ፡ ​ምእረ ፨
                                        ​እስ​ከ፡  የ<fo:inline>[ኀ]</fo:inline>​ልፍ፡  ​መዓ​ቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3862LIT1828Mahale#Mary">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-13) Fols 129v–130r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Our Lady Mary (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡) or Magnificat</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ድን​ግል።
                                             ​፲፫  ​ተዐ​ብዮ፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                        ​ወት​ትሐ​ሠይ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ንየ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወተ​ወክ​ፎሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ቍል​ዔሁ ፨
                                        ​ወተ​ዘከ​ረ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤሎሙ ፨
                                        ​ለአ​በዊ​ነ፡ ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ዘር​ኡ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3909LIT1828Mahale#Zachariah">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-14) Fols 130r–130v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Zachariah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ካህ​ን፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                             ​፲፬  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​እስ​ራኤል ፨
                                        ​ዘተ​ሣሃ​ለነ፡ ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ተ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝበ፡ ​ዚአሁ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                   ​ወሠ​ረቀ፡ ​ያር​እዮ​ሙ፡ ​ብር​ሃኖ ፨
                                   ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ይነ​ብሩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ​ወጽ​ላሎ​ተ፡ ​ሞት ፨
                                   ​ከመ፡ ​ያር​ትዕ፡ ​እገ​ሪነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ሰላም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e3956LIT1828Mahale#Simeon">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2-15) Fol. 130v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Simeon, or Nunc Dimittis (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                             ​፲፭  ​ይእ​ዜ፡ ​ትሥ​እሮ፡ ​ለገ​ብርከ ፨
                                        ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዝከ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ዘአ​ስተ​ዳሎ​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ ፨
                                        ​ከመ፡ ​ትክ​ሥት፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ለአ​ሕዛብ ፨
                                        ​ወክ​ብረ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ​ከ፡ ​እስ​ራኤል ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-1-3) Fol. 130v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e4003">Stichometry to the Psalms of David and the Book of Odes</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ለቀ​ዳማ​ዊ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ቃሉ ፨
                                            ​፲፻​፯፻፡
                                            ​ወለ​ካል​እ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ቃሉ ፨
                                            ​፲፻​፯፻፡ ​ወለ​ሣል​ስ፡ ​፶፡ ​ቃሉ፡ <fo:inline>ነ (!)</fo:inline>​፻፯፻<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                            ​ወመ​ንፈ​ቁ፡ ​በዘ ፸  ወ ፯ ፡ ​መዝ​ሙር፡ ​ኀበ፡
                                            ​ይብል ፨
                                            ​መር​ሖሙ፡ ​መዓ​ልተ፡ ​በደ​መና፡ ​በህየ ፨
                                            ​ወማ​ኅል​የ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4073LIT2362Songof">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 131r–138r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​መሓ​ልየ፡ ​መሓ​ልይ፡), CAe 2362.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                 ​ማኅ​ልየ፡ ​ማኅ​ልይ፡ ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ​ዘሰ​ሎሞ​ን።
                                 ​ይስ​እመ​ኒ፡ ​በስ​እመ​ተ፡ ​አፉሁ ፨
                                 ​አዳ​ም፡ ​አጥ​ባት​ኪ፡ ​እም​ወይ​ን።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይነ​ብር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገነ​ት፡ ​ካል​አን፡ ​ርእ​ይዎ ፨
                                    ​ቃል​ከ፡ ​አስ​ምዓኒ ፨
                                    ​ጕየ​ይ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​እኁ​የ፡ ​ወተ​መሰ​ላ፡ ​ለወ​ይጠል ፨
                                    ​ወእ​መ፡ ​አኮ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ወሬ​ዛ፡ ​ኃየል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4126LIT2509Weddas">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 138va–147vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ማር​ያም), incomplete, CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>Musical notation throughout.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4135LIT2509Weddas#Sunday">
               <fo:inline>I-3-1) Fols 138va–139vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Sunday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        <!--beginning is a title-->
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አሐ​ዱ፡
                                         ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘን​ጽሕ ​ት፡ ​ድን​ግል ፨
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡  እ ​ሙ፡ ​ለብ​ርሃ​ን። ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ወ ​ስእ​ለታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡
                                        ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሰ​ንበ​ተ፡ ​ክር<fo:inline>[ስ]</fo:inline>​ቲያ​ን፡
                                        ​ተሰ​መይ​ኪ፡ ​ፍቅ ​ርተ፡ ​ኦቡ​ርክ​ት፡ ​እም​አን ​ስት፡
                                        ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዳግ​ሚት፡ ​ቀመ​ር፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ትሰ​መዪ፡ <fo:inline>[​ቅድ​ስተ፡]</fo:inline> ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወው​ስቴ​ታ፡ ​ጽላ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳን ፨
                                        ፲  ​ቃላ​ት፡ ​እለ፡ ​ተጽ​ሕፋ፡ ​በአ​ጻብ​ዒሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨ 
                                        ​ያጽ​ንዓ​ነ፡ ​በር​ትዕ​ት፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሚ​ነ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡ ​ይጸ​ግወ​ነ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡
                                        ​ወም​ሕረቶ ፨  ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ​ነ፡
                                        <fo:inline>በብዝ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ምሕ​ረቱ ፨ 
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4215LIT2509Weddas#Monday">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2) Fols 139vb–140vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Monday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሠ​ኑይ፡ ​ፈቀ​ደ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ያግ​እዞ፡ ​ለአ​ዳም፡  ​ኅዙ​ነ፡ ​ወት​ኩዘ፡ ​ልብ፡ 
                                        ​ወያ​ግብ​ኦ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዘት​ካት፡ ​መን​በሩ ፨ 
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨  ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​እም​ድን​ግል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ዘር​አ፡
                                        ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ወአ​ድኃ​ነነ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወረ​ሰይ​ካ፡ ​ለሔ​ዋን ፨  ​አግ​አዚ​ተ፡ ​እም​ፃዕ​ረ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ወወ​ሀብ​ከነ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡
                                        ​ባረ​ክና​ከ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ቲከ ፨ 
                                        ​ሰአ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>Musical notation is added interlineally in a secondary hand.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4257LIT2509Weddas#Tuesday">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3) Fols 140vb–142rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Tuesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሠ​ሉስ።  ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ምክ​ህነ፡ ​ወቀ​ዳሚ​ተ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡ ​ወመ​ሠረ​ተ፡
                                        ​ንጽ​ሕነ፡ ​ኮነ፡ በ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል ፨ 
                                        ​እን​ተ፡ ​ወለ​ደት፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ዘእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡  ​ቃለ፡  ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ይሰ​ፍሑ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ብሉ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት ፨ 
                                        ​መጽ​አ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​በዕ​በየ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ሰአ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4292LIT2509Weddas#Wednesday">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4) Fols 142rb–144ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Wednesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘረ​ቡዕ፡  ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ይብ​ሉ፡ ​ብፅ​ዕት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡
                                        ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ዳግ​ሚት ፨  ​ዲበ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ኆኅ​ተ፡ ​ምስ​ራቅ ፨
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ከብ​ካብ፡ ​ንጹ​ሕ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ንሶ​ሰወ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​መሐ<fo:inline>ሬ (!)</fo:inline>፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​መፍ​ቀሬ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​አድ​ኃነ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳቲ​ነ፡ ​በም​ጽአ​ቱ፡  ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡
                                        ​ቅድ​ስት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4327LIT2509Weddas#Thursday">
               <fo:inline>I-3-5) Fols 144ra–146rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Thursday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሐ​ሙሰ፡  ​ዕፀ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​በነ​ደ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳም ፨ 
                                        ​ወአ​እፁ​ቂሃ፡ ​ኢት​ውዒ፡ <fo:inline>ተ (!)</fo:inline>​መስ​ል፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ርኩ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ከማ​ነ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ባሕ​ቲታ ፨  ​ወተ​ወል​ደ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ልሔ​ም፡ ​በከ​መ፡
                                        ​ሰበ​ኩ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​አድ​ኀነ​ነ፡ ​ወቤ​ዘወ​ነ፡ ​ወረ​ሰየ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁሰ ፨ 
                                        ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅድ።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4362LIT2509Weddas#Friday">
               <fo:inline>I-3-6) Fols 146rb–147vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Friday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘዐ​ርብ። <fo:inline>[​ቡር​ክት፡]</fo:inline> ​አን​ቲ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ወ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ፡ 
                                        ኦ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ርኩ​ስ፡ ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​ለነ፡
                                        ​እም​ኔኪ፡ ​ፀሐ​የ፡ ​ጽድቅ ፨  ​ወአ​ቅረ​በነ፡ ​ታሕ​ተ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሁ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በእ​ንተ​ዝ፡ ​ንዌ​ድሰ​ኪ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ንብ​ል፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ ፨ 
                                        ​ተፈሥ ሒ ፡ ​ኦም​ልእ​ተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምስ​ሌኪ፡
                                        ​ሰአ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4410LIT2509Weddas#Saturday">
               <fo:inline>I-3-7) Fols 147vb–147vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Saturday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text breaks off with the end of the page.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሰ​ንበ​ተ፡ ​አይሁ ​ድ፡  ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ወብ  (fol. 148ra) 
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. iir: Probably an ownership note, written in pencil in a crude hand.
                                        The beginning of the note is hardly legible. The name of <fo:inline id="d1e4576PRS13713WaldaG">Walda Giyorgis</fo:inline>
                                        can be deciphered. The end of the note states that the manuscript belongs to <fo:inline id="d1e4579PRS13714KidanaM">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic"/> Kidāna Māyā</fo:inline>
                                        (sic for Māryām).
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 130v–131r: Probably an ownership note, written in red ink, mentioning the
                                        names of <fo:inline id="d1e4615PRS15173AmdaMikael">ʿĀmda Mikāʾel</fo:inline>
                                        and his son <fo:inline id="d1e4618PRS15174WaldaKiros">Walda Kiros</fo:inline>.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​አም​ደ፡ ሚ  (fol. 131r)  ​ካኤል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                            ​ወለ​ወል​ዱ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ኪሮ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>This unit contains comparatively few scribal corrections. Occasionally, erroneous
                                        characters are erased (e.g. fols 21v, 54r, 81r) and, sometimes,
                                        corrections are written above the erasures (e.g.  30v, 109r, 144va).
                                        Compressed script (e.g. 10r, 104v), line take-ups
                                        (e.g. 7r, 92v, 135r), and more rarely line take-downs (e.g. fol. 85r)
                                        are used. Throughout p1_i1.4, omitted words have been added in the upper margin, including their musical notation. A
                                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">tamallas</fo:inline>-sign indicates
                                        their position within the main text (e.g. 139ra, 141vb, 143rb).
                                        The end of p1_i1.2.1 is written in continuous script, without
                                        line breaks after verses (118v).
                                        The second parts of the last verses of Ps 64 are erased (47r).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>On several folios, supplications consisting of the word
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡</fo:inline>, followed by the names
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4671PRS13715Sofonyas">Sofonyās</fo:inline> (fols 7v, 101v, 111r),
                                        Gabra ʾIyasus (fols 22v),
                                        Sofonyās Walda ʾIyasus  (fol. 76v), and
                                        Sofonyās Gabra ʾIyasus Walda ʾIyasus (fol. 117v),
                                        are written in originally empty space by a secondary hand. It is difficult to determine whether these supplications refer
                                        to one or more persons.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols iv, iir, iiv, 14v, 15r: Scribbles and pen trials.
                                        Crude drawing of a human figure (fol. iir).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 15r, 36r, 38r: Erased text in the originally empty space, possibly a supplication.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 138r: Erased rubricated note after the end of the main text.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1r–138r: 1
                                    column (21–23 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 48r. The characters per line are 10–35.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            103 × 116 mm (fol. 48r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 17 mm, bottom: 37 mm, right: 15 mm, left: 10 mm (fol. 48r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 138va–147vb: 2
                                    columns (22 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 140r. The characters per line per column are 14–15.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            111 × 113 mm (fol. 140r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 9 mm, bottom: 43 mm, right: 15 mm, left: 11 mm (fol. 140r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper line is written above the ruling. The bottom line is written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling pattern: 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Tears resulting from parchment making have been repaired by sewing, e.g. on fols 11, 28, 70.
                                        The rounded holes, on e.g. 19, 107, 147, have not been repaired. </fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is deficient.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth–mid-twentieth century</fo:inline>
                            Unit 1 can be dated palaeographically to the period between the nineteenth
                            and mid-twentieth century.
                            The original owner(s) cannot be ascertained anymore; possibly supplications were erased (see Varia note 6).
                            Later persons involved with the history of the manuscript were <fo:inline id="d1e4723PRS13713WaldaG">Walda Giyorgis</fo:inline>
                            and the probable secondary owner <fo:inline id="d1e4725PRS13714KidanaM">Kidāna Māryām</fo:inline> (see
                            Additional note 1) and <fo:inline id="d1e4731PRS13715Sofonyas">Sofonyās</fo:inline> (see Varia note 4).
                        </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 2</fo:block>
         <fo:block>Parchment, 5 fols (fols 148–152), nineteenth–mid-twentieth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4768LIT2509Weddas#Saturday">
               <fo:inline>I) Fol. 148ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Saturday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text begins abruptly with the beginning of the page with the last sentences of
                                        <fo:inline>“Praise of Mary” (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ት፡ ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ክብ​ረ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ዘኢ​ትጠ​ፍእ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ፡ ​ዘኢ​ትት​ነሠ​ት፡ ​በት​ረ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ዘኢ​ትጸ​ንን፡ ​ምስ​ማኮ​ሙ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱሳን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሰዓ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ኄር፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ፡ ​ይም​ሐረ​ነ፡ ​ወይ​ሰሃ​ለነ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተነ ፨ 
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>Musical notation is added interlineally in a secondary hand.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e4806LIT1113Anqasa">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 148ra–152vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gate of Light’ (​አን​ቀጸ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡), CAe 1113.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ወግ​ናይ፡ ​ዘእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡  ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ወብ​ጽዕ​ት፡ ​ስብ​ሕት፡ ​ወቡ​ርክት ፨ 
                                    ​ክብ​ርት፡ ​ወል​ዕል ​ት፡ <fo:inline>ወልአንቀጸ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ብር​ሃን፡
                                        ​መዓ​ርገ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ወማ​ኅደ​ረ፡  ​መለ​ኮት፡ ​ቅድ​ስተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን ፨ 
                                    ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ተሰ​መይ​ኪ፡
                                    ​ስም​ረተ፡ ​አብ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሰዓ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ያጽ​ንዓ​ነ፡ ​በር​ትዕ​ት፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሚ​ነ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡ ​ይጸ​ግወ​ነ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቶ፡
                                    ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ​ነ፡ ​በብ​ዝኃ፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ።
                                    ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ኦወ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ወክ​ብር፡
                                    <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ድ፡ ​ወመ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ኵሎ፡
                                    <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                                    (b)   ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ሣ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ይክ​ፍለ​ኒ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት። ። ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 152vb: ‘Salutations for Mary for the Canonical Hours’ (​ሰላ​ምታ፡ ​ዘማ​ርያ​ም፡ ​ዘሰ​ብዐ​ቱ፡ ​ጊዜ​ያት፡), incomplete, CAe 2807.Beginning of .</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">Incipit:  ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ወመ​አዛ፡ ​እፍ​ረት፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ኪ፡ ​ኮል። ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>This unit contains very few scribal corrections. Erroneous
                                        characters are erased on fol. 148va, and
                                        an omitted word is added interlineally  148va.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 150v, 151r, 152vb: Rubricated notes, possibly supplications, had been added in the upper margin, but have now mostly been lost
                                        due to material damage to these folios.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 152vb: Pen trial.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 148ra–152vb: 2
                                    columns (22 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 148ra.
                                        The measurements are
                                        approximative, as the folios are very damaged and brittle. The characters per line per column are 15–17.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            100 × 105 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 16 mm, bottom: 36 mm, right: 20 mm, left: 10 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic">Punctuation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block linefeed-treatment="preserve">
                                        A chain of nine-dot asterisks after the <fo:inline>“Praise of Mary” (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509</fo:inline> (fol. 148ra).
                                    </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling is visible. Primary pricks are mostly visible, ruling pricks are not visible due to the bad condition
                                        of the folios’ margin. The upper line is written above the ruling. The bottom line is written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is deficient.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth–mid-twentieth century</fo:inline>
                            Unit 2 can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            nineteenth and the mid-twentieth century.
                        </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf30">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf30</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
