               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 19va–29rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Antiphonary for Lent: Set of antiphons for the second week of the Great Fast (​ቅድ​ስት፡,
                     Qǝddǝst).</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዋዜ​ማ፡ ​ዘቅ​ድስ​ት፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                    ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ለው ​ሉደ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ት፡
                                    ​ትኩ​ነነ፡ ​መር​ሐ፡ ​በፍ​ኖት፡
                                    ​በኵ  (b)  ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሰዓ​ት፡
                                    ​ቀደ​ሳ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ለሰ​ንበት ፤
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሰላ፡  ​በሐ፡ ​በል​ዋ፡ ​ተሳ​ለም​ዋ፡ ​ጊሡ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሃ፡
                                    ​ኢት​ርሐ​ቁ፡ ​እም​ኔሃ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡
                                    ​ሰላ​ማዊ​ት፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ጽዮ​ን፡ ​በመ​ስቀ​ሉ፡ ​ታበ​ርህ፡ ​ለኵሉ
                                     ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
