            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e11862LIT2361somade#ThirdWeek">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 29rb–40ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Antiphonary for Lent: Set of antiphons for the third week of the Great Fast (​ምኵ​ራብ፡,
                     Mǝkʷrāb).</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዋዜ​ማ፡ ​ዘም​ኵራ​ብ፡ ​በ፩፡
                                    ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ሰን​በት፡ ​ቦዐ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡  ​ምኵ​ራበ፡ ​አይ​ሁድ፡
                                    ​ምሕ​ሮሙ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​መ፡ ​ኪያ​የ፡
                                    ​ኢአ  (fol. 29va)  ​መን​ክሙ፡ ​ለግ​ብር​የ፡ ​እመ​ኑ፡ ​አን​ትሙ፡
                                    ​ጊዜ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ዓመ​ታት፡ ​ዕለ​ታተ፡ ​ሰን​በታ​ት፡
                                    ​ኢፈ​ለጥ​ክሙ፡ ​ዕን​ዳኢ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሰላ፡  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ናሁ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​እነ፡
                                    ​በእ​ንቲ​አነ፡ ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ሰላ​መ፡ ​በመ​ስቀ​ሉ፡ ​እሞ​ት፡ ​ባል​ሐነ፡
                                    እ ​ግዚ ​ኣ፡ ​ለሰ​ንበ​ት፡
                                    ​ተሣ​ሃለነ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
