            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e12151LIT2361somade#FourthWeek">
               <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 40ra–49va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Antiphonary for Lent: Set of antiphons for the fourth week of the Great Fast (​መፃ​ጕዕ፡,
                     Maṣ́agʷǝʿ).</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዋዜ​ማ፡ ​ዘመ​ጻጕ​ዕ፡
                                        ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​ለሰ​ንበ​ት፡  ​ወአ​ቡሃ፡ ​ለም​ሕረ​ት፡
                                    ​ቤት​የሰ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​ይሰ​መይ፡ ​ቤተ፡
                                    እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወማ​ኅደ​ሩ፡ ​ለል​ዑል፡
                                    ​ቤተ፡ ​ረሰ<fo:inline>[ይ]</fo:inline>​ክሙ፡ ​አን​ትሙ፡
                                    ​በዓ​ተ፡ ​ፈያ​ት፡ ​ቤ፡ ​አሕ​የዎ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                    ​ለመ​ጻጕ<fo:inline>[​ዕ፡]</fo:inline> (b)  
                                    ​ለዘ​፴፡ ​ወ፰​ት፡ ​ክረ​ምተ፡ ​ሐመ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሰላ፡  ​ሶበ​ሰ፡ ​ይሠ​ርቅ፡ ​ፀሐ​ይ፡ ​ንሕ​ነኒ፡
                                    ን  (fol. 49va)  ​ርከ​ብ፡ ​ሰላ​መ፡ ​በት<fo:inline>ወ (!)</fo:inline>​ክል​ተ፡
                                    ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​አሚ​ነነ፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ብሂ​ለነ፡ ​ተፈ​ሢሐ​ነ፡ ​ልበ​ነ፡ ​አን​ጺሐ​ነ፡ ​ንሳ​ለማ፡
                                    ​ለጽ​ዮን ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
