               <fo:inline>I-6) Fols 64ra–74ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Antiphonary for Lent: Set of antiphons for the sixth week of the Great Fast (​ገብ​ር፡ ​ኄር፡,
                     Gabr ḫer).</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዋዜ​ማ፡ ​ዘገ​ብር፡ ​ኄር፡ 
                                    በ ​፬፡
                                        ​ገብ​ር፡ ​ኄር፡ ​ወገ​ብር፡ ​ምዕመ ​ን፡ ​ገብ​ር፡ ​ዘአ​ሥመ​ሮ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዚ​ኡ፡ ​ዘበ​ምል​ክና​ከ፡ ​ሠና​የ፡ ​ገበ​ርከ፡ ​ብፁ​ዕ፡
                                    ​አን​ተ፡ ​ገብ​ር፡ ​ኄር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሰላ፡ 
                                    ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚአ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በሰ​ማያ​ት፡ ​ወሰ​ላም፡ ​በም​ድር፡
                                    ​ለዘ​በመ​ስቀ​ሉ፡ ​ተሰ​ዱ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዘ​ቀደ​ሳ፡
                                    ​ለሰ​ንበት ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
