         </fo:block>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethg34"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 34</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 13)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex, composite91×84 mm (weight: 228g), 74 fols, 8 quires.  Unit 1:  1682–1692. Unit 2:  eighteenth–nineteenth century. Unit 3:  1700–1716.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                  The book is bound in wooden boards.
                                
                                  The boards are flush with the bookblock and have shallow external bevels. The grain runs vertically.
                                  The external surface and the edges of the boards are polished and a finishing layer of dark colour has been added.
                                
                                  Chainstitch sewing on two sewing stations (one pair); S-plied thread.
                                  In the first quire, between the sewing stations, there is one length of thread. In the rest of the quires there are double lengths.
                                  The sewing is closed on the lower board, by locking the two ends of the thread in the holes of the boards.
                                
                                  The small holes close to the head of the quires are probably what remains of quire tackets.
                                
                                  Uncoloured threads are inserted in the outer margins for navigating the text.
                                  More specifically, <fo:inline id="d1e15045">leaf string markers</fo:inline> are inserted in the upper margin of fols 45, 51, 53 and in the upper ruling prick
                                  of fol. 55.
                                  A string, likely functioning as a bookmark, is attached to the first sewing station.
                                </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner (1–74).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>8 quires. I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 1r–8v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 9r–18v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 19r–28v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 29r–36v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 37r–46v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 47r–56v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 57r–66v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 67r–74v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 1</fo:block>
         <fo:block>Parchment, 8 fols (fols 1r–8v), 1682–1692.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e15107LIT4722ProtectivePrayer">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r–8v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ፍት​ሐተ፡ ​ሥራ​ይ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ሥራ​የ፡ ​ኪን፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ወዲ​ያቆ​ናት፡), CAe 4722.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ። ​ፍት​ሐተ፡ ​ሥራ​ይ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወባ​ርያ፡ ​ሥራ​የ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​መና​ፍስ​ተ፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​ሥራ​የ፡
                                <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ሥራ​የ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ሥራ​የ፡ ​ኮን፡ ሥ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ካህ​ናት፡
                                ​ወዲ​ያቆ​ናት፡ ​ሥራ​የ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ወማ​ረት፡ ​ፍታ​ሕ፡ ​ሥራ​ዮሙ፡ ​ለመ​ስና​ያን፡ ​ዮፍ​ታሔ፡ ፫ ​በል፡ ሥ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እም​ላዕ​ለ፡
                                ​ነፍ​ሱ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሁ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e15124PRS13624TaklaG">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ጊዮ​ርጊ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​በስ​መ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፫ ​በል፡ ​ከፍ​ትና​ኤል፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወአ​ስማ​ተ፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ጐድ​ጊዶ፡ ​ሰማ​የ፡ ​ነጺ​ሮ፡ ​እሳ​ተ፡ ​አባ​ዲዶ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይት​ጌበ​ሩ፡ ​ዕብ​ነ፡ ​ወቂ​ሮ፡ ​ፅፀ፡ ​ሰቢ​ሮ፡ ​ቍጽ​ለ፡ 
                                <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ቲሮ፡
                                ​እመ​ሂ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይት​ጌበ​ሩ፡ ​ባሕ​ረ፡ ​በጽ​ቢጾ፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ​ገሲ​ሶ፡ ​ሥራ​ዮሙ፡ ​ይግ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ባዕ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ርእ​ሶሙ፡
                                ​በከ​መ፡ ​ፈታ​ሕ፡ ​ፍታ​ሕ፡ ​ቦሙ፡ ​ለጴ​ጥሮ​ስ፡ ​ወለ​ጳው​ሎስ፡ ​ከመ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ፍታ​ሕ፡ ​አን​ቀፀ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ 
                                ​ትም​ህር​ተ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ቡአ​ት፡ ​ፍት​ሐት፡ ​ዘመ​ልድ፡ ዶ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>An omitted letter has been added above the line on fol. 6v.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The name of the original owner has been erased everywhere, and that of <fo:inline id="d1e15259PRS13624TaklaG">Takla Giyorgis</fo:inline> been
                                            inserted, frequently partly above the line (e.g. fols 1r, 6v, 8r).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1r–8v: 1
                                    column (11 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 2r.The characters per line are 15–20.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            65 × 70 mm (fol. 2r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 6 mm, bottom: 19 mm, right: 7 mm, left: 7 mm (fol. 2r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Primary pricks are visible and ruling pricks are mostly visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the
                                            ruling. Ruling pattern (fols 1r–8v): 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->1682–1692. Mediocre and irregular hand.<fo:block>Ink: Black.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>1682–1692</fo:inline>
                            ʾIyāsu, probably <fo:inline id="d1e15274PRS5616IyasuI">ʾIyāsu I</fo:inline>, and Sinodā, probably <fo:inline id="d1e15276PRS8870Sinoda">Sinodā</fo:inline>, are mentioned on fol. 8r,
                            which would date the production of this unit to 1682–1692.
                            The name of the original owner has been erased everywhere,
                            and that of <fo:inline id="d1e15280PRS13624TaklaG">Takla Giyorgis</fo:inline> been
                            inserted (see Varia note 3).
                        </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 2</fo:block>
         <fo:block>Parchment, 28 fols (fols 9r–36v), eighteenth–nineteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e15302LIT6549AmhTheol">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 9r–36v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Amharic treatise on the nature and life of Christ, CAe 6549, in Amharic and Gǝʿǝz.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">
                           ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                ​እግ​ዚአ ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ማት፡ በ ​ሐን​ድነ​ት፡ ​በሶ​ስት​ነት፡ ​እን​ደነ​በረ፡ <fo:inline>ነአምናለን፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ለሐ​ንደ​ነቱ​ና፡
                                ​ለሶ​ስት​ነቱ፨ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ጸባ​ኦት፡ ​ፍጹ​ም፡ ​ምሉ​ዕ፡ ​ሰማ​ያተ፡ ​ወም​ድረ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ከ፨ </fo:inline>
                                ​ተና​ገሩ፡ ​ብሎ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይስ​ኒ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፡ ​እን​ዳለ፨ ​ወን​ጌል​ም፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ታጠ​ምቅ​ዎሙ፡ ​በሉ፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እን​ዳለ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ኃጥ​አን​ም፡ ​እን​ደ፡ ​ሰይ​ጣና​ት፡ ​ጸል​ምተ​ው፡ ​እን​ደ፡ ​ጽላ​ት፡ ​ጠቍ​ረው፡ ​ይነ​ሣሉ፡ <fo:inline>ያነግዜ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፨ ​ጻድ​ቃን​ን፨ ​ንዑ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ቡሩ​ካኑ፡ ​ለአ​ቡየ፡
                                ​ብሎ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ <fo:inline>ያዎርስቸዋል፨ (!)</fo:inline> ​ኃጥ​አን​ን፡ ​ሑሩ፡ ​እም​ኔየ፡ ​ርጉ​ማን፡ ​ብሎ፡ ​ከዘ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ያሰ​ናብ​ታቸ​ዋል፨ ​ከመ​ዝ፡ ​እም​ነት​ነ፡ ​ወሃ​ይማ​ኖት​ነ፡
                                ​ውእ​ቱ፨
                                 ​ዕቀ​በኒ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e15339PRS13624TaklaG">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ጊዮ​ርጊ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 36v: Supplication for <fo:inline id="d1e15466PRS13624TaklaG">Takla Giyorgis</fo:inline>. The note has been added after the end of the
                                            Amharic treatise on the nature and life of Christ.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዕቀ​በኒ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e15475PRS13624TaklaG">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ጊዮ​ርጊ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 10v, 17v, 30r: Occasionally, erroneous characters have been erased (e.g. fol. 17v),
                                            and the corrected text written in compressed script above the erasure on fols 10v, 20r.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 9r–36v: 1
                                    column (13 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 30r.The characters per line are 15–18.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            61 × 78 mm (fol. 30r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 13 mm, bottom: 18 mm, right: 11 mm, left: 8 mm (fol. 30r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling is visible; pricking is visible. Primary pricks are visible. Ruling pricks are mostly visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling. Ruling pattern (fols 9r–36v): 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 2:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Eighteenth–nineteenth century.. Slightly irregular hand. Characters are broad.<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Incipit (alternating red and black lines); the beginning of a new section on fol. 18r;
                                        the name of <fo:inline id="d1e15449PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:inline>;
                                        elements of numerals, punctuation marks, and the text divider on fol. 36v.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>eighteenth–nineteenth century</fo:inline>
                                Unit 2 can be dated palaeographically to the eighteenth–nineteenth century.
                                <fo:inline id="d1e15501PRS13624TaklaG">Takla Giyorgis</fo:inline> is mentioned in a secondary supplication (see
                                Additional note 1).
                            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 3</fo:block>
         <fo:block>Parchment, 38 fols (fols 37r–74v), 1700–1716.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e15521LIT6467Heresies">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 37r–41r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Treatise on the heretics’ (​ነገ​ረ፡ ​መና​ፍቃ​ን፡), CAe 6467.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The order in which the heresies are listed here and their wording
                                differs slightly from the other witnesses of this treatise.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወካ​ዕበ፡ ​ንጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ስሕ ​ተቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለመ​ናፍ​ቃን፡ ​ክር​ዳዳ​ተ፡ ​አመ​ፃ፡ ​ዘዘ​ርዖ​ሙ፡ ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ፡ ​ፀራ​ዊ፡ ​ማእ​ከለ፡ ​አር​ናዩ፡
                                ​ለበዓ ለ ፡ ​ገራ​ህት፡
                                እ ​ግዚ ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨ 
                                ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ናጤ​ይቅ፡ ​ተፈ​ልጦ​ትነ፡ ​እም​ኔሆሙ ፨  ​ፈጢ​ኖስ፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​ለፌ፡
                                 ​እማ​ርያ​ም፡  ​ህላ​ዌሁ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ፡  ​ንሕ​ነሰ፡  ​ንቤ፡
                                ​ሀሎ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ክታ​ርዮስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ይቤ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ንስ​ሐ፡ ​ለጊ​ጉያ​ን፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡
                                ​ጥም​ቀት ፨
                                ​ንሕ​ነሰ፡ ​ንቤ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ቦን​ስሐ፡ ​ለአ​ባስ​ያን፡ ​ወስ​ርየ​ተ፡ ​ሐጢ​አት፡
                                ​ለነ​ሳኅ​ያን ፨ 
                                ​ወባ​ሕቱ፡ ​ኢየ​ሐል​ቅ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ስሕ​ተቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለመ​ናፍ​ቃን ፨ 
                                ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ኅሩመ ፤  ​ዘመን ፤ 
                                ​ወእ​ድሜ ፤  ​ዘአ​ብጽ  (fol. 41r)  ​ሐነ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡
                                ​ፍጻሜ ፨ ፨ ፤ ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e15616NAR0005calend">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 41r–43v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 0005.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​መስ​ከረ​ም፡  በ ፩ 
                            ​በር​ተሎ​ሜዎስ ፨  በ ፰ 
                        ​ዘካ​ርያስ ፨
                                ፲  ​ጼዴ​ና፡ ​ወእ​ሌኒ ፨
                                ፲ ወ ፭ 
                                ​እስ​ጢፋ​ኖስ፡  ፲ ወ ፯ 
                                ​መስ​ቀል ፨
                                ፲ ወ ፰ 
                                ​አቡ​ነ፡ <fo:inline>ኤኖስጣቴዎስ (!)</fo:inline>፨
                                ​ሠረ​ቀ፡  ​ጥቅ​ምት፡ ​አመ፡  ፲ ወ ፪ 
                                ​ላሊ​በላ፡ ​ወማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ ፨
                                ፲ ወ ፬ 
                                ​አቡ​ነ፡ ​አረ​ጋዊ፡ ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨ ፲ ወ ፯ 
                                ​እስ​ጢፋ​ኖስ ፨
                                ፳ ወ ፪ 
                                ​ሉቃ​ስ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሠረ​ቀ፡  ​ነሐ​ሴ፡ ​አመ፡  ፩  ​ደና​ግል፡  ፫ 
                                ​ሶፍ​ያ፡  ፮  ​ማር​ያም፡ ​መግ​ደላ​ዊት፡  ፯ 
                                ​ጽን​ሰታ፡  ፲  ​ማኅ​በር፡  ፲ ወ ፪ 
                                ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ንፍ​ሐተ፡ ​ቀር​ን፡
                                 ፲ ወ ፫  ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ታቦ​ር፡
                                 ፲ ወ ፮  ​ፍል​ሰታ፡
                                 ፲ ወ ፯  ​ፍል​ሰቱ፡ ​ለጊ​ዮር​ጊስ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡
                                 ፳ ወ ፩  ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​ፍል​ሰታ፡
                                 ፳ ወ ፩  ​ፍል​ሰተ፡ ​አቡ​ነ፡ ​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡
                                 ፳ ወ ፮  ​ሳራ፡
                                 ፳ ወ ፰ 
                                ​አብ<fo:inline>[ር]</fo:inline>ሃ  (fol. 43v)  ​ም፡ ​አመ፡  ፳ ወ ፱ 
                                ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዚእነ ፨
                                ​ሠረ​ቀ፡  ​ጳጕሜ ፤  ​አመ፡  ፫ 
                                ​ሩፋ​ኤል ፤ 
                                ​መል​አክ ፨ ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e15832LIT6555Oegzio">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 43v–44v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ኦእ​ግዚ​ኦ፡ ​መሐ​ረነ፡ ), CAe 6555.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ኦእ​ግዚ​ኦ፡ ​መሐ​ረነ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዚ​ኦ፡ <fo:inline>ዚኦ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​መሐ​ረነ ፨  ​ኦሥ​ሉስ፡
                                 ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አም​ላከ​ነ፡ <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>ከነ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወተ​ስፋ​ነ፡ ​መሐ​ር፡ ​ልሁ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​አድ​ኅን፡ ​ነፍ​ሳቲነ ፨ 
                                ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​መሐ​ሪ፡ ​ይም​ሐረነ ፨  ​ይር​ከበ​ነ፡ ​ለቅ​ዳሴ፡ ​ሰላ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡
                                ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሥላሴ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​አስ​ትዩ​ነ፡  ​ለአ​ድኅኖ ፨  ​ሥሉ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሰላ​መክ​ሙ፡ ​ወይኖ ፨ 
                                ​ከመ፡ ​ያም​ዕዘ​ነ፡ ​ዕፍ​ረተ፡ ​ከዊኖ ፤  ​ዘይ​ሁብ፡ ​በተ​አምኖ ፨ 
                                ​ቅብ​ዑነ፡ ​ሜሮኖ ፨ 
                                ​አር​ዕዩነ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ነሶ​ሳወ ፨  ​ሥሉ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሰላ​መክ​ሙ፡ ​ስን​ዕወ ፨ 
                                ​ሰጊ​ደ፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ዘአ​ንቃ​ዕደወ ፨  ​ከመ፡  ​ይባ​ርክ፡  ​አብ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ፍጹ​መ፡
                                ​ግጽወ ፨  ​ኪያ​ነ፡ ​ዘለ​ሐኴ፡ ​ሰፊ​ሐ፡ ​አዕ​ዳወ ፨
                         </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e15923LIT4513Hymn">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 44v–49r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘In the night, I remembered the greatness of your humility’ (​ተዘ​ከር​ኩ፡ ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ብዝ​ኀ፡ ​ትሕ​ትና​ከ፡), CAe 4513.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ተዘ​ከር​ኩ፡
                                 (fol. 45r) 
                                ​በሌ​ሊት፡  ​ብዝ​ኃ፡ ​ትሕ​ትና​ከ፡  ፻  ​እን​ተ፡ ​የአዱ ፨ 
                                ​እም​ዓቅም ፨ 
                                ​ጊዜ፡ ​አሐ​ዝከ፡ ​ሠገ​ራተ፡ ​ሮም ፨  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ሰላም ፨
                                ​እንተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኃለ​ፍከ፡ <fo:inline>ሌሌተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ኃበ፡ ​የአ​ምር፡ ​ይሁዳ ፨  ​ለጌ​ቴሴ​ማኒ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​አጸዳ ፨ 
                                ​ከመ፡ ​ትጹ​ር፡ ​ከበ​ደ፡ ​ዕዳ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​አእ​ርግ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለነ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ ፨  ​በጊ​ዜ፡  ፫  ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ዘና​ቄር​ብ፡
                                ​ለመ​ሥዋ​ዕተ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት ፨  ​ከመ፡ ​ሠር​ዑ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡  ​ኀበ፡  ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ኀብ​ሩ፡ ​በጽ​ርሐ፡ ​ጽዮ​ን፡ ​እን​ግልጋ ፨ 
                                ​ዘፈ​ነው​ከ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​እን​በለ፡ ​ንትጋ ፨  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ሀበ​ነ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡
                                 ወ ​ጸጋ ፨ 
                                ​ፈኑ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​እን​በለ፡ ​ንትጋ ፨  ​ያኅ​ድገ​ነ፡ ​ምግ​ባራ​ት፡ ​ዘሥጋ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16022LIT6556SalastuEdaw">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 49r–54r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘3 ʿǝdaw  ʿǝruyāna ʾakāl Three men, equal in person’ (፫ ​ዕደ​ው፡ ​ዕሩ​ያነ፡ ​አካ​ል፡), CAe 6556.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ፫ ​እደ​ው፡ ​ዕሩ​ያነ፡ ​አካ​ል፡ ​በገ​ጽ፡  ​ዘአ​ስተ​ርአ​ይክ​ሙ፡ ​እን​በለ፡ ​ሕጸጽ ፨
                                 (fol. 49v)  
                                ​ግና​ይ፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ለን​ግሥ​ክሙ፡ ​ሰጊ​ዶ፡ ​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡ ​በር​እሱ። ​ኀበ፡ ​ገብ​ርክ​ሙ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትገ​ይሡ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አጋ​ዕዝ​ት፡
                                ​ዘት​ሤለሱ ፨
                                ሰ  ​ለክሙ ፨ በ ​ላዕ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡
                                ​ሥላ​ሴክ​ሙ፡ ​ተረ​ክበ፡ ​በዮ​ርዳ​ኖስ፡ ​ወበ​ታቦ​ር፡ ​ዳግ​መ፡ ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ከመ፡
                                ​ነበ​ቦ፡ ግ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሕፅ​ረነ፡ ​ለነ፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ሰዓት ፨  ​እም​እለ፡ ​ይት​በኃ​ተው፡ ​አጋ​ንንት ፨ 
                                ​አው​ደነ፡ ​ሕፅ​ር፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​መላ​እክት ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ናሁ፡ ​ሰፈ​ነ፡ ​ሌሊት ፨ 
                                ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ኪያ​ነ፡ ​ለዘ​ፈጠ​ረ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ናም​ልኮ ፨ 
                                ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለማ​ርያ​ም፡ ​እመ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒትነ ፨ 
                                ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለመ​ስቀ​ለ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እፀ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ት፡ ​ኃይ​ልነ፡ ​ወፀ​ወንነ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16096LIT6558Salam">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 54v–56v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Salutation to you, our grace and our glory’ (​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ሞገ​ስነ፡ ​ወክ​ብር​ነ፡), CAe 6558.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ <fo:inline>ሞሳስነ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወክ​ብር ​ነ፡
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​አክ ​ሊለ፡ ​ምክ​ህነ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መድኃ ​ኒት​ነ፡ ​ሰላ፡ ​ነቅ​ዓ፡ ​ጽጌ፡ ​ረዳ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ርግ​ብ፡
                                ​ፀዓዳ ፨  ​ገነ​ት፡ ​ነባ​ቢት ፨ 
                                ​ዘበ​ድን​ግል​ና፡ ​ሕት​ምት፡ ​ዘም​ስለ፡ ​ሰጊድ ፨  ​ንኤ​ምኃ​ኪ፡ ​ለባ​ርኮ​ትከ፡ ​ስፍ​ሒ፡ ​እዴኪ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ጸግ​ዊ፡ ​ለደ​ቂቀ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ምሥ​ያጥ ፨  ​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ፡ ​ብዙ​ኅ፡
                                ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​ምስ​ያጥ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ይጸ​ራዕ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሤጥ፡ ​ድካ​መ፡ ​ጌጋ​ይየ፡ ​ትማ​እ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ጽድ​ቀ፡ ​ዚአ​ኪ፡ ​በጽ​ንዓ፡ ​መደ​ልወ፡ ​ጥበ​ብ፡ ​ሶበ፡
                                ​መል​ዓ፡ ​ሰማ​ኒት፡ ወ ፸  ​ሕፍ​ነ፡ ​ማይ፡ ​ኃያ​ለ፡ ​ወሞዓ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16157LIT6559Salam">
               <fo:inline>VII) Fols 57r–58r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Salutation to you, full of grace, full of glory’ (​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ምል​እተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ምል​እተ፡ ​ክብ​ር፡ ), CAe 6559.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡  ​ምል​ዕተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ምል​ዕተ፡ ​ክብ​ር፡ ​ወብ​ዕል፡ ​እን​በለ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ትጋ ፨ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ሰማ​ያዊ፡ ዘ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ለድ​ኪ፡ ​በሥጋ ፨  ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>ግ ፨ 
                                ​አን​ቀጸ፡ ​ሥጋ​ኪ፡ ​በድ​ንግ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ና፡ ​ንሡግ ፨  ​ሐሊ​በኪ፡ ​ጠበጠ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​በ፡ ​አእ​ሩግ ፨ 
                                ​ዘየ​ዓው​ድዎ፡ ዘ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ንጌ​ል፡ ​አፍ​ላግ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ሰማ​ያዊ​ት፡ ​በድ​ንግል ፡ ​ና፡ ​ሕት​ምት፡ ​ወበ​ቅድ​ስና፡ ​ሥር​ጉት፡ ​ንሕ​ብ፡ ​ዘአ​ስኒ​ት፡ ​ዘሲ​ና፡ ​እጸ​ት፡
                                 ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​እም፡ ​አመ፡ ​ንዕ​ስኪ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ኢተ​አም​ር፡ ​ብእሴ ፨  ​ሐው​ልተ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡ ​ዘነ​ቢይ፡ ​አው​ሴ፡ ​ለኪ፡
                                ​ወለወ  (fol. 58r)  ​ልድ​ኪ፡ ​ይደ​ሉ፡ ​ውዳሴ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16228LIT6560SalamAngels">
               <fo:inline>VIII) Fols 58r–60r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Hymn to the angels, the Twenty-Four Heavenly Priests, and Four Living Creatures, CAe 6560.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለከ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ዖፈ፡ ​ሉዓሌ ፨  ​እም​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ብካ​ይ፡ ​ወወ​ይሌ፡ ​መራ​ዔ፡ ​አባ​ግዕ፡ ​አን<fo:inline>[ስ]</fo:inline>​ሳ፡
                                ​በኢ​ስሳሌ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ቦኡ፡ ​አጸ​ደ፡ ​ጽሌ፡
                                 ​ሰላ፡  ​ለከ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሱሳ ፨  ​አለ​ባዌ፡ ​ኅቡ​ዕ፡ ​ኅሠ​ሣ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ይት​ሐተ​ም፡ ​ጌጋ​የ፡ ​አበሳ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ማኅ​በረ፡  ​ትጉ​ሃን፡ ​አእ​ላፍ ፨  ​ዘገ​ዳመ፡ ​ናህ​ይ፡ ​አእ​ላፍ፡ ​አኮ፡ ​አኮ፡ ​ዘገ​ዳመ፡ ​ሐፍ ፨
                                ​ውዳ​ሴክ ሙ ፡   ​አብ​ደር​ኩ፡ ​ለአ​ባል​የ፡ ​እም​ሊቁ ፨  ​ለሕ​ሊና​የ፡ ​ዘነ​ዋሕ፡ ​ዕመ​ቁ፡ ​አስ​ዮቶ፡
                                ​አን  (fol. 60r)  ​ትሙ፡ ​አል​ጽቁ ፨ <fo:inline>ኦሰማያውን፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ዕቀ​ቡኒ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ክሙ፡
                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16299LIT2824RepCh108">
               <fo:inline>IX) Fols 60r–63r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Salutations for the Holy Fathers’ (​ሰላ​ምታ፡ ​ዘአ​በው፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡), CAe 2824.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለክ​ሙ።  ​አር​እስ​ተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ዓበ​ይት። ​ጸዋ​ርያ​ነ፡ ​ኃዲ​ስ፡ <fo:inline>ሖርመት (!)</fo:inline>፨  ​ግዕ​ዘክ​ሙ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት። ​አበ​ውየ፡ ​መላ​እክት ፨
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡  ​መና​ኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ማት፡ ​እን​ጦኒ ፨  ​መቃ​ርስ፡ ​ረቡኒ ፨ 
                                ​ሲኖ​ዳ፡ ​ብፁ​ዕ፡ ​ደመ​ና፡ ​ኰናኒ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለለ  ​፩፩ 
                                ​ገድ​ላቲ​ክሙ፡ ​በአ​ዘክ​ሮ፡ ​ስኢ​ንየ፡ ​ለፈ​ክሮ ፨  ​አበ​ውየ፡ ​ንዑ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳት ፨ 
                                ​አማ​ኅፀ​ንኩ​ክሙ፡ ​ዘበ​አኅ​ብሮ ፨ ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​በእ​ንተ፡
                                 ​ማርያ  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በሥጋ ፨  ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ማኅ​በረ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡
                                ​ዘበ​እን​ግልጋ ፨  ​ክድ​ኑኒ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ​ክሙ፡ ​ሞገ​ሰ፡ ​ወጸጋ ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16380LIT2783RepCh67">
               <fo:inline>X) Fols 63r–65v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Salutations for the Apostles, CAe 2783.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ፫ ​ቅድ​ሜየ፡ ፫
                                ​ድኅ​ሬየ፡ ፫  ​ይም​ንየ፡ ፫ ​ጽግ​ምየ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ተ፡   (fol. 63v) 
                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​አበ​ውየ ፨  ​ንዑ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​በሰ​ይፈ፡ ​ሙስ​ና፡ ​ትጽ​ብዑ፡ ​ጾርየ ፨
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ኰኵ​ሐ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ለኢ​የሩ​ሳሌ​ም፡ ​ድዳ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ <fo:inline>ለክ (!)</fo:inline>  ​ኅሩ​ያን፡ ​አር​ድእ​ት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ጸማዱ ፨  ​አሥ​ሩ፡
                                ወ  ፪ ኤ ፨  ​እለ፡
                                ​ትት  (fol. 65v)  ​ፈቀዱ ፨  ​ፍን​ዋን፡ ​በበ ፩ ፡
                                 ​ሰላ​ም፡ ለ  ​ናሁ፡ ​አይ​ዳእ​ኩ፡ ​ሰላ​መክ​ሙ፡ ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​እክ​ል፡ ​በአ​ቅሙ ፤  ​ለል​ሳን​የ፡ ​በይ​ነ፡ ​ድካሙ ፨ 
                                ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ኄራ​ን፡ ​ተወ​ኪፈ​ክሙ፡ ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌየ፡ ​አዝ​ንሙ ፨  ​አም​ላከ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​አድ​ኅኑ​ኒ፡
                                ​ለገ​ብር​ክሙ ፨ 
                                ​ማኅ​ደ፡  ​ክር ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                              </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16477LIT6561HymlTHEwo">
               <fo:inline>XI) Fols 65v–67r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Salutations for Takla Hāymānot and ʾEwosṭātewos, CAe 6561.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ <fo:inline>ተኤዎስጣቴ (!)</fo:inline> ​አበ​ውየ ፨  ​ሰላ​ሙክ​ሙ፡ ​እት​ሬሰ​ይ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​እፀ​ብዕ፡
                                ​ፀርየ ፨  ​በኵ​ናት፡ ​ወወ​ልታ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡ ​ስምየ ፨  ​ኢይ​ለክ​ፍ፡
                                ​አእ​ዳውየ ፨  ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ  (fol. 66r)  ​ኤዎ​ስጣ 
                                ​ዕን​ቍ፡  ​ተክ​ሌ፡  ​ብሬ​ሌ፡ ​ዘጸ​ሐፈ​ክሙ፡ ​በኢ​ስሳ​ሌ፡ ​ተአ​ሚን​የ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ጽሌ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ኤዎ​ስጣቴ  ​በአ​ጽፍ ፤
                                ​ተክለ  ​በእ​ግር፡ ​እለ፡ ​አደ​ውክ​ሙ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ሐመ​ር፡ ​አበ​ውየ፡ ኖ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ባሕር ፨
                                ​እመቦ  ​ዘሜ​ንን፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>  (fol. 67r)  <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​እም​ኔክ​ሙ፡ ​አሐደ ፨ 
                                ​ምን<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ይር​ከቦ፡ ​ዘኢ​ለመደ ፨  ​ሰይ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፨ 
                                ​እግ​ሩ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ኢፈ​ቀደ ፨  እ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ባዕደ ፨<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16581LIT6562Prayer">
               <fo:inline>XII) Fols 67r–68r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Supplicative Prayer to God and Mary, CAe 6562.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወባ​ርክ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ስተ​ከ፡ ​ኀበ​ነ፡ ​ኀይ​ለ፡ ​ወመ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ለአ​ግብ​ርቲከ ፨  ​ለእ​ለ፡
                                ​ንጼ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​መከ ፤  ​ዕቀ​በነ፡ ​ውሉ​ደ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ጽረ​ነ፡
                                ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ቲከ ፤ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ረ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡
                                ​ሰዓት ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ረድ​አነ፡ ​ወት​ረ፡ ​በሃ​ይለ፡ ​መስ​ቀልከ ፨  ​ኢታ​ስተ​ሐፍ​ረነ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በቅ​ድሜከ ፨ 
                                ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ነጽ​ሪ፡ ​ኀቤነ ፤  ​ጸል​ዪ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ለደ​ቂቅኪ ፨ 
                                ​ወአ​ድኅ​ንነ፡ ​እም  (fol. 68r)  ​ኵሉ፡ ​ምን​ዳቤ፡ ​ወኃ​ዘን ፨  ​መዓ​ልተ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ ፤ 
                                ​ወሌ​ሊተ፡ ​ማዕ​ከሌነ ፤  ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ኢት​ርሐ​ቅ፡ ​እም​ኔነ ፨ 
                                ​ሀሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​ረዳ​ኤ፡ ​ኵነነ ፤  ​ኢት​ግድ​ፈነ፡ ​ወኢ​ተመ​ንነ ፨ 
                                ​አም​ላከ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ተራ​ድአነ ፨  ​ምል​ዕተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​በል ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e16663LIT2951RepCh232">
               <fo:inline>XIII) Fols 68r–73v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Salutations to the Cross, CAe 2951.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ሠና​የ፡ ​መዓ​ዛ፡ ​ወጽ​ጌ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ዕፀ​ዋት፡ ​ወዕፅ ፨  
                                ​ወመ​ንበ​ረ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ግሩ​ም፡ ​ዘኪ​ሩቤ​ል፡ ​ቢጽ ፨ 
                                ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ርቡ​ዓ፡ ​ገጽ ፨ 
                                    ​ሰላ፡  ​እም​ነ፡ ​ፍጡ​ራን፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘት​ጸው​ር፡ ​ፈጠራ ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ሰ ፤  ​ሰር​ጉት፡ ​በቅ​ድስና ፤ 
                                ​ሰ፡ ​ቤዛ​ዊተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ሰፋ​ኒት፡ ​በአ​ርያም ፤  ​ሰ፡
                                ​አስም  (fol. 73v)  ​ዕኒ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​አኃ​ዘን፡ ​ወአ​ስቈቍ ፤  ​ሣህ​ልኪ፡ ​ይብ​ጻሕ፡
                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ሥራቁ ፤ 
                                ​ለእ​ሳተ፡ ​ኀዘ​ን፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ያቁ​ርር፡ ​ሞቁ ፨
                                ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለኃ​ጥእ፡ ​ጽድቁ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 74r: 
                                            Note mentioning
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ንጉ​ስነ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አባ፡ ​ማር​ቆስ፡</fo:inline>, probably to be
                                            identified with <fo:inline id="d1e16926PRS3430DawitII">Dāwit III</fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e16928PRS6777Marqos">Mārqos IV</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘወ​ጽአ፡ ​በዘ​መነ፡ ​ንጉ​ስነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e16933PRS3430DawitII">​ዳዊ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>ወጣጣስነ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e16939PRS6777Marqos">​አባ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ማር​ቆስ፡</fo:inline> ፫ ​እትሮ
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e16945PRS13689GabraD">​ግብረ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ድን​ግል</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Occasionally, omitted characters have been added above the line (e.g. fols 37r, 48v); omitted words are added in
                                            the margins  (e.g. with use of <fo:inline font-style="italic">tamallas</fo:inline>-sign, 56v, 57r); corrections are written over
                                            erasures (e.g. 38r).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 45r, 55r: Note on the liturgical reading in the upper margin.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘመ​ንፈ​ቀ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 57r: Note on the liturgical reading in the upper margin.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘሰ​ርክ፡</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 73v, 74r: Pen trials in black and red.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 37r–74v: 1
                                    column (13 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 37r.The characters per line are 14–18.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            64 × 64 mm (fol. 37r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 8 mm, bottom: 19 mm, right: 11 mm, left: 10 mm (fol. 37r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling is visible; pricking is visible. Primary pricks are visible. Ruling pricks are mostly visible. The upper line is written above the
                                            ruling. The bottom line is written above the
                                            ruling. Ruling pattern (fols 37r–74v): 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 3:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->1700–1716. Mediocre and irregular hand, with cursive script.<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Incipit;  the first word of sentences and stanzas;  the name of <fo:inline id="d1e16834PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:inline> and saints; <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ንሕ​ነሰ፡</fo:inline> or
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ንሕ​ነሰ፡ ​ንቤ፡</fo:inline> in the Treatise on the heresies;
                                        the word <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሠረ​ቀ፡</fo:inline> in the Calendar of saint commemorations;
                                        elements of numerals, punctuation marks and text dividers.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                            ​ስ፡ for ​ስብ​ሐት፡ in fols 49r–54r;
                                        </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                            ​ስብ፡ for ​ስብ​ሐት፡ in fols 54v–56r;
                                        </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">​ሰኪ፡ for ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ and
                                            ​ሰላ፡ for ​ሰላ​ም፡ in fols 54v–56r;
                                        </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                            ​ማር፡ and ​ማር​ያ፡ for ​ማር​ያም፡ in fols 54v–56r.
                                        </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>1700–1716</fo:inline>
               <fo:inline id="d1e17006PRS3430DawitII">Dāwit III</fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e17008PRS6777Marqos">Mārqos IV</fo:inline>,
                                who were active simultaneously in <fo:inline>1716</fo:inline>, are mentioned in Additional note 2.
                                As Unit 3 can be dated palaeographically to the eighteenth century, this points to a time of
                                production in 1700–1716.
                            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg34">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg34</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
