      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethg33"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 33</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 14)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex96×80 mm (weight: 162g), 84 fols, 10 quires, eighteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e17254LIT1099Anapho">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 5r–35v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Anaphora of Our Lady Mary by Cyriacus of Behnesa, CAe 1099.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​አኰ<fo:inline>ተ (!)</fo:inline>​ተ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡  ​አባ፡ ​ሕር​ያቆ​ስ፡ ​ዘሀ​ገረ፡ ​ብህ​ንስ፡  ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                 ​ጐሥ​ዓ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡ ቃ ​ለ፡ ​ሠና​የ፡ ​ጐሥ​ዓ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ሠና​የ፡ ​ጐሥ​ዓ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ሠና​የ። ​ወአ​ነ፡ ​አየ​ድዕ፡ ​ቅዳ​ሴሃ፡ ለ  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                ​አኮ፡ ​በአ​ብዝ​ኆ፡ ​አላ፡ ​በአ​ውሕ​ዶ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                            
                            ​ወይ​እዜ​ኒ፡ ​ንሰ​ብሖ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወምን  (fol. 35v)  ​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን። ።
                          ​ነአ​ኵቶ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ዘወ​ሀባ፡ ​ለእ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ሠል​ጠና፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ቅዳ​ሴ፡ ​ወረ​ስየ​ነ፡ ​ድል​ዋነ፡ ​ንን​ብብ፡ ​ወን​ፈጽ​ም።
                          ​በሥ​ምረ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ጠቢ​ብ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>Musical notation is placed interlineally in small script up to fol. 17r.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e17299LIT1100Anapho">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 36r–44r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Anaphora of Our Lord Jesus Christ’ (​አኰ​ቴተ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ዘእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡), CAe 1100.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ቅዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዐቢ​ይ፡ ​ወክ​ቡር፡ ​ዘእ​ግዚ ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ጸሎ ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት። ​ይህ​ካ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ በ ቅ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                ​ፍጻ​ሜ፡ ​ነፍ​ስነ፡ ​ወሀ​ቤ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት​ነ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይማ​ስን፡ ​ምዝ​ገብ፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡ ​ለዋ​ህድ፡ ​ወል​ድከ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ፡ ​ዘይ​ዜኑ፡ ​ዘዚ​አከ፡ ​ፈቃ​ድ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ፈቀ​ድከ፡
                                ​ከመ፡ ​ንድ​ኃን፡ ​ብከ፡ ​የአ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​ልብ​ነ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ንለ​ቡ፡ ​ለኄ​ር፡ ​ወለ​መፍ​ቀሬ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ፡ ​ሥመ​ራ፡ ​ለነ​ፍሰ፡ ​ዚአ​ነ፡ ​ወሕ​ሊና፡ ​ንጹ​ሐ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይጸ​ንን፡ ​ጸግ​ወነ፡ ​ዘተ​መጦ​ነ፡ ​ዚአ​ከ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ወእ​ንቲ​አከ፡ ​ድም፡ ​ንሕ​ነ፡
                                ​አግ​ብር​ቲአ​ከ፡ ​ትሑ​ታን። ​እስ​መ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ዚአ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​ወስ  (fol. 44r)  ​ቡሕ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡
                                ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e17327LIT6571Cross">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 44r–48v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">On the invention of the Cross (17 Maskaram), CAe 6571.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text includes a number of <fo:inline font-style="italic">ʾasmāt</fo:inline>-names and formulas in abbreviated forms.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                               ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​አመ፡ ​፲ወ፯ ​ለወ​ርኃ፡ ​መስ​ከረ​ም፡ ​ቀደ​ሰ፡ ​ሥጋ​ከ፡ ​በት​እም​ርተ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ክቡ​ር፡ ​አስ​ተር​አያ፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​ለእ​ሙ፡
                               ​በለ​ፌ፡ ​አፌ​ራ፡ ​ጣህ​ካኤ​ል፡ ​ዘመዝ  (fol. 44v)  ​ሙራ​ኤል፡ ​ክቡ​ድ፡ ​ኩዳ​ናኤ​ል፡ ​ኪሩ​ብ፡ ​ዘመ​ዝራ​ኤል፡ ​ዘብ​ድዮ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ትር​ቢት፡ ​አም​ያቲ​ር፡ ​አፍ​ድዮ​ስ፡ ​ዓረ​ር፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ጽ፡ ​ይባ​ር፡ ​እግ፡ ​እም​ጽዮ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይጸ​ል፡ ​ለጽ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኃረ፡ ​እግ፡ ​ለጽ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጠለ፡ ​አር​ሞ፡ ​ዘይ​ወ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​አድ፡ ​ጽ፡ ​ቡሩ፡ ​እግ፡ ​በጽ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ተዘ​ከ፡ ​ለጽ፡
                                 (fol. 48v)  ​አም​ላክ​ኪ፡ ​ጽ፡ ​ለት​ው፡ ​ትው​ልድ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሒ​ዮ፡ ​ለአ​ምላ​ክኪ፡ ​ጽዮ፡ ​ወደ​ቂቀ፡ ​ጽ፡ ​ይት​ሐሠ​ዩ፡ ​ለን​ግሦ​ሙ። ። ። ። ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e17357LIT1104Anapho">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 49r–58r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Anaphora of the Apostles’ (​አኰ​ቴተ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ዘሐ​ዋር​ያት፡), CAe 1104.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​አኰ​ቴተ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ዘአ ​በዊ​ነ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​በረ​ከቶ ​ሙ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ ​ሮሙ፡ ​ሊባ​ርዮ​ስ። ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በል፡
                                ​አዕ​ኵት​ዎ፡ ​በል፡ ​ብነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር። ​ነአ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በፍ​ቁር፡ ​ወል​ድከ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ዘበ​ደኃ​ሪ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል፡ ​ፈኖ​ከ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ወል​ደከ፡ ​መድ​ኅን፡
                             </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወኪ​ያነ​ሂ፡ ​ደም​ር፡ ​ህየ፡ ​ክድ​ን፡ ​ወር​ዳዕ፡ ​አፅ​ንዕ፡ ​ወኃ​ይል፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​ሊቃ​ነ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​እም​ኵሉ፡ ​ምግ​ባረ፡ ​እኩ​ይ፡ ​አግ​ኅስ​ነ። ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡   (fol. 58r)   ​ምግ​ባረ፡
                                ​ሠና​ይ፡ ​ደም​ረነ፡ በ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​ዘቦ​ቱ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​በል።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e17393LIT3180Anapho">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 58r–69r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Anaphora of Dioscorus of Alexandria’ (​አኰ​ቴተ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ዲዮ​ስቆ​ሮስ፡), CAe 3180.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​አኰ​ቴተ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዲዮ​ስቆ​ሮስ፡ ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበረ ​ከቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ሩ፡  ​ሊባ​ርዮ​ስ። ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን። ​እም​ቅድመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወእ​ስከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ሀሎ፡ ​እግ​ዚኣ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥቱ፡ ​እግ​ዚኣ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በት​ሥል​ስቱ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ይዕ​ቀብ​ክሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​መለ​ኮት፡ ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​ደሙ፡ ​ደመ፡ ​ሕግ፡ ​ወሥ​ርዓ​ት፡  ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ፀባ​ዖት፡ ​ወወ​ልደ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ድን​ግል​ናሃ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ኅት​ምት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም። ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ብዝ​የ፡
                                ​ቅዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዲዮ​ስቆ​ሮስ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡   (fol. 69r)   ​ርት​ዕት፡ ​አስ​ናኒ​ሁ፡ ​ውዱ​ቅ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 69r–78v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17436"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Excerpts from the Gospels</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VI-1) Fols 69r–70r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17444"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Reading before the excerpts from the Gospels</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ወን​ጌል። ​እግ ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​መፍ​ቀሬ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​አንተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘፈ​ኖከ፡ ​አር​ዳኢ​ከ፡ ​ወላ​ዕካ​ኒከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​አጽ​ናፈ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ፡ ​ወን​ጌለ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ትከ፡ ​ወይ​ፌው​ሱ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡
                                ድ  (fol. 69v)  ​ካመ፡ ​ዘው​ስተ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ፡ ​ወይ​ዜን​ው፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​አላ፡ ​ንግ​በር፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕነ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይፍ​ረይ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌነ፡ ​ፍሬ፡  ​ሠና​የ፡  ​ህየ​ንተ፡ ​፩፴​ወ፷​፻ተ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትስ​ረይ፡ ​አበ​ሳነ፡
                                ​ለሕ​ዝብከ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወን​ኩን፡ ​ድል​ዋነ፡ ​ለመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VI-2) Fols 70r–71r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17483"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Mt 26:26–29</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወን​ጌል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ።
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ይብ​ልዑ፡ ​ነሥ​ኡ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡  ​ኅብ​ስተ፡ ​ባረ​ከ፡ ​ወፈ​ተተ፡ ​ወወ​ሀቦ​ሙ፡
                                ወ  (fol. 70v)  ​ይቤ​ሎሙ፡ ​አን​ትሙ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ንሥ​ኡ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ወብ​ልዑ፡ ​ኵል​ክሙ፡ ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ​ሥጋ​የ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወእ​ስከ፡ ​እን​ታክ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​አመ፡ ​አሰ​ትዮ፡ ​ሐዲስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት። ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወም​ድር፡
                                ​የኃ​ልፍ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወቃ​ልየ​ሰ፡ ​ኢየ​ኃል​ፍ፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ለአ​ርዳ​ኢሁ። ​ነአ​ም፡ ​አበ፡ ​በል።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VI-3) Fols 71r–72v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17530"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Mk 14:22–25</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወን​ጌል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዘማ​ርቆ​ስ።
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ይበ​ልዑ፡ ​ነሥ​አ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡  ​ኢየ  (fol. 71v)  ​ሱስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ኅብ​ስተ፡ ​ባረ​ከ፡ ​ወፈ​ተተ፡ ​ወወ​ሀቦ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ንሥ​ኡ፡ ​ብል​ዑ፡ ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ​ሥጋ​የ። ​ወነ​ሥአ፡ ​ጽዋ​ዓኒ፡ ​አዕ​ኵቶ፡ ​ወወ​ሀቦ​ሙ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​አማ​ን፡ ​እብ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ኢይ​ሰቲ፡ ​እም​አፂ​ረ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ወይ​ን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​እን​ታክ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​አመ፡ ​አሰ​ትዮ፡ ​ሐዲ​ስ፡ ​ምስ​ሌክ​ሙ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ስተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት። ​እን​ዘ፡
                                ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ይረ​ድእ፡ ​ወቃ​ሎ፡ ​ያጸ​ንዕ፡ ​በት​እም​ርት፡ ​ዘይ​ተሉ፡ ​ዘቦ፡ ​እዝ​ነ፡ ሰ  (fol. 72v)  ​ሚዕ፡ ​ለይ​ሰማ​ዕ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VI-4) Fols 72v–73r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17571"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Lk 22:19–20</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወን​ጌል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዘሉ​ቃስ።
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወነ​ሥአ፡ ​ኅብ​ስተ፡ ​አዕ​ኰተ፡ ​ባረ​ከ፡ ​ወፈ​ተተ፡ ​ወወ​ሀቦ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ​ሥጋ​የ፡ ​ዘይ​ትወ​ሀብ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አክ​ሙ፡ ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​ቤዘ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃን፡ ​ወከ​መዝ፡
                                ​ግበ​ሩ፡ ​ተዝ​ካረ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አየ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ደም​የ፡ ​ዘይ​ትከ​ዓው፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አክሙ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃን። ​ይቀ​ልል፡ ​ኅል​ፈተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወም​ድር፡
                                ​እምት<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ቅ፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​እም​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ወእ​ምነ​ቢያ​ት፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ለአ​ርዳ​ኢሁ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VI-5) Fols 73r–78r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17608"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Jn 6:32–58</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወን​ጌል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ።
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አማ​ን፡   (fol. 73r)   ​አማ​ን፡ ​እብ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​አኮ፡
                                ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘወ​ሀበ​ክሙ፡ ​ውእ​ተ፡ ​ኅብ​ስተ፡ ​እም​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​አላ፡ ​አቡ​የ፡ ​ወሀ​በክ​ሙ፡ ​ጽድ​ቀ፡ ​እም​ሰማ​ይ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ዝኬ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ኅብ  (fol. 78r)  ​ስት፡ ​ዘእ​ምሰ​ማይ፡ ​ወረ​ደ፡ ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​በል​ዑ፡ ​አበ​ክሙ፡ ​ወሞ​ቱ፡ ​ወዘ​በልሰ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ለዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ኅብ​ስት፡ ​የሐ​ዩ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VI-6) Fols 78r–778b: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17652"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Reading after the excerpts from the Gospels</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ድኅ​ረ፡  ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ነአ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ፡ ​አኃ​ዜ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘረ​ሰይ​ከነ፡ ​ንስ​ማዕ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ወን​ጌል​ከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ነአ​ምን፡ ​ወን​ትፈ​ሣሕ፡
                                    ​ቦቱ፡ ​ንስ​እለ​ከ፡ ​ወና​ስተ​በቍ​ዓከ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወተ​ወከ​ፍ፡ ​ስእ​ለተ​ነ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ምሥ​ዋዒ​ከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​መዓ​ዛ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ቦዓ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡   ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ​ፈኑ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌነ፡ ​ወላ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ፡ ​ሣህ​ልከ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ትከ፡ ​በጸ​ጋ፡ ​ወል​ድከ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወኃ​ይል፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡
                                    ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VII) Fols 79r–80r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17683">no title provided</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦዘ​ንስ​እለ​ኪ፡ ​ዳኅ​ና፡ ​ኦቅ​ድስ​ት፡ ​ምል​ዕተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ክብ​ር፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እመ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​አዕ​ርጊ፡
                                ​ጸሎ​ተነ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ምል​ዕል​ት፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኃጣ​ውኢ​ነ። ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦዘ​ወለ​ድኪ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ፡ ​ዘበ​አማን<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ክር​ስቶ​ስሃ፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦዘ​ወለ​ድኪ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለነ፡ ​አማ​ኑኤ​ልሃ፡ ​ንስ​እለ​ከ፡ ​ከመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ተዘ​ከረ​ነ፡ ​ዓራ​ቂተ፡ ​ዘበ​አማ​ን፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡
                                ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኃጣ​ውኢ​ነ። ። ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>VIII) Fols 80r–84r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e17714"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Short biblical excerpts</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ።   (fol. 80v)   ​ነአ​ምን፡ ​አበ፡ ​ዘበ​አማ​ን፡ ​ወነ​አም​ን፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ዘበ​አማ​ን፡ ​ወነ​አም​ን፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሰ፡ ​ዘበ​አማ​ን፡ ​ህል​ወ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴሆ​ሙ፡ ​ነአ​ምን። ​ዘማ​ር። ​እሉ፡ ​ኪሩ​ቤል፡ ​ወሱ​ራፌ​ል፡
                                ​የዓ​ርጉ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብ​ሉ፡ ​ቅ፡ ​ቅ፡ ​ቅ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ። ​ዘሉ​ቃ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወአ​ሮን፡ ​ካህ​ን፡ ​በማ​ዕከ​ለ፡ ​የዓ​ርግ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​ኅሩ​የ፡ ​ሱራ​ፌል፡ ​ይስ​ግዱ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ወኪ​ሩቤ​ል፡ ​ይሴ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ይጸ​ርሑ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብ​ሉ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ቅ፡ ​ቅ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​በኀ​በ፡ ​አእ​ላፍ፡ ወ ክ ​ቡር፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ረበ​ዋት። ​አን​ተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​ኦመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​መጽ​አከ፡ ​ወአ​ድኃ​ንከ​ነ፡ ​ተሣ​ሃለ​ነ። ። ። ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​በል። ። ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1v–4r: ‘You who saved’ (​ዘአ​ድኀ​ንኮ​ሙ፡), CAe 6570..
                                        The hymn is written in black ink in a mediocre hand and is partly illegible due to material loss.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        Incipit:  :
                                            ​ዘአ​ድኃ​ንኮ​ሙ፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ዘአ​ድኃ​ንኮ​ሙ፡ ​እም​እቶ​ነ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ሳት፡ ​ለ፫ ​ፈቂ​ቅ፡
                                            ​አድ​ኃነ​ኒ፡ ​እቶ​ነ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ም፡ ​እቶ​ነ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 4r–4v: , CAe 1693.
                                        The text is written in pale black ink in a hasty hand and is partly illegible due to material loss and faded ink.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">:
                                        Incipit:  
                                            ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​ወይ​ቀው​ማ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ለ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ <fo:inline>ኅእኅታ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                                            ለ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​እን<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፡ ​ቀለ​ዮጳ፡ ​ወማ​ርያ​ም፡ መ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ደላ​ዊት፡
                                            ​ወር​እዮ​ሙ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ለእ​ሙ፡ ​ወለ​ረድ​ኡ፡ ​ዘያ​ፈቅ​ር፡
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 35v: Note written in the main hand in red ink. The note is almost completely erased. Only the first word <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዝመ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡</fo:inline> is legible. The name of the original owner or owning institution most probably followed.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 84v: ‘The hosts of the angels of the Saviour of the World’ (​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ቲሁ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ), CAe 4942.
                                        .
                                        The text is written in black ink in a mediocre and irregular handwriting. It is poorly legible due to faded ink.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​መላ​እክ​ቲሁ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ይቀ​ውሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜሁ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓ፡
                                        ​ወይ​ከል​ልዎ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለመድ<fo:inline>[ኃ]</fo:inline>​ኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ወደ​ሙ፡ ​ለም​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓለ፡
                                        ​ወን​ብጻ​ሕ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ገ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​በአ​ሚነ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡ ​ለክ​ርስ​ቶስ፡ ​ንገ​ኒ።</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block> The name of the original owner, <fo:inline id="d1e18208PRS13691Libaryos">Libāryos</fo:inline>,
                                        is written in the supplication formulas on fols 49r, 58r.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Scribal corrections are rare and mostly consist of letters or words written over erasures (e.g. fols 41v, 70r, 78r),
                                        interlinear additions in small script (e.g. 16v).
                                        The words <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቄር​ሎስ፡ ​ጳጳ<fo:inline>[ስ]</fo:inline>ነ</fo:inline> have been added interlineally in pencil on 8r.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: The title of the first text, which begins on fol. 5r, is poorly written in violet ink: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ስ፡ ​አባ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ሕርያ<fo:inline>[ቆ]</fo:inline>​ስ፡ ​ዘሀ​ገረ፡ ​ብህ​ንሳ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Poorly legible writings in pencil are found in the margins of fols 4v, 31v, 43r, 70r.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>A white sticker is glued on fol. 1r with the signature ‘Ms 14’ printed on it.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                    The book is bound in wooden boards
                                    enclosed in a textile chemise.
                                  
                                    The upper board is narrower than the book block. It is broken and has lost part of the outer edge.
                                  
                                    Chainstitch sewing on two sewing stations (one pair); Z-plied threads are used.
                                    The sewing starts from the first quire where between the pair of sewing stations there is one length of thread,
                                    while in the rest of the quires there are two. To prevent the bifolios from detaching from the bookblock,
                                    they were sewn with thread loops passing through their inner margin, e.g. fols 44–58.
                                    Unused sewing holes may indicate that the bookblock has been resewn or repaired more than once, e.g. 44–58.
                                  
                                    Blue <fo:inline id="d1e18306">leaf tab markers</fo:inline> are inserted in the outer margins of
                                    fols 44, 58, 71, 72, 78, mostly in correspondence of the incipit of several texts.
                                  </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner carried out by the Bodleian Library
                                    in January 2020 (1–84).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm">
                                        An undecorated quire mark is written in the upper inner margin of fol. 59r (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፪</fo:inline>).
                                        There are no other quire marks.
                                    </fo:block>
         <fo:block>10 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (Fols 1r–4v)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 5r–14v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 15r–24v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 25r–34v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (Fols 35r–38v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 39r–48v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 49r–58v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 59r–68v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 69r–78v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (Fols 79r–84v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1v–4v: 1
                                    column (16 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 3r. The characters per line are 10–14The outer margin has been damaged and its original dimension could not be taken from the manuscript anymore.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            61 × 64 mm (fol. 3r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 10 mm, bottom: 23 mm, left: 5 mm (fol. 3r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 5r–84r: 1
                                    column (11 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 59r. The characters per line are 12–14.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            61 × 64 mm (fol. 59r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 8 mm, bottom: 22 mm, right: 9 mm, left: 11 mm (fol. 59r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Primary and ruling pricks are not visible.   The manuscript is unruled. Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling. Ruling pattern: 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Eighteenth century.. 
                                    Mediocre handwriting. Characters are slender.
                                    A change of hand or more probably of nib occurred from fol. 49r onwards: characters are larger in size and thicker.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    One or two lines on the incipit pages, alternating with black lines; first words of sections of texts (e.g. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወን​ጌል፡</fo:inline>);
                                    holy names; directives and refrains in full or in abbreviated form (e.g. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይካ</fo:inline> or <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በእ​ንተ፡</fo:inline>);
                                    elements of the punctuation signs, text dividers, and numerals.
                                    fols 79v–84r are not rubricated.
                                </fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ይዲ or ዲ for ​ይቤ፡ ​ዲያ​ቆን፡ (e.g. on fols 26r, 27v, 29v);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ይካ or ​ይካሕ for ​ይቤ፡ ​ካህ​ን፡ (e.g. on fols 27v, 29v, 31r);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ሕ or ​ይሕ for ​ይቤ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ (e.g. on fols 40v, 53r, 55r);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ቅ for ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ (on fols 80v, 84r);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>5)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ዘማር for ​ዘማ​ርቆ​ስ፡ (on fol. 80v);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>6)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ዘሉቃ for ​ዘሉ​ቃስ፡ (on fol. 80v);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>7)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ዘዮ​ሐን for ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ (on fol. 81v).
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Large holes from the parchment making are found on fols 2, 3.
                                    Another hole is on 75.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is deficient.
                                    The outer margin of the textblock has been damaged probably by rodents, with loss of text on fols 1r–4r and fol. 29v.
                                    The lower margins of many folios are stained with dirt, e.g. on 4v–12r and fol. 36r.
                                    The text is occasionally barely legible due to faded ink, e.g. on 4r, 18r.
                                    The sewing has been repaired but the textblock is still unstable and the single quires are somewhat loose.
                                    The textile chemise has been crudely sewn to the boards
                                    and to the board attachments.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>eighteenth century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the eighteenth century.
                            The name of the original owner, mentioned in supplications, was
                            <fo:inline id="d1e18322PRS13691Libaryos">Libāryos</fo:inline> (see Varia note 1).
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>Unknown provenance.
                            The manuscript came to <fo:inline id="d1e18330PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> under unknown circumstances.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e18335PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg33">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg33</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
