               <fo:inline>I-3-15) Fols 130rb–132va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of St George: A church is built in Bǝbā in
                    Upper Egypt How a chapel was built in Bǝbā in Upper
                    Egypt, CAe 6224.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​፲፬፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡
                                        <fo:inline>(...)</fo:inline>
                                         (c)   ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​በም​ድረ፡ ​ግብ​ፅ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ዐባ​ይ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ስማ፡ ​ብባ፡ ​እመ​ንበ​ረ፡
                                            አ ኅ ​ናስ፡ ​በስ​ዒድ፡ ​ዘግ​ብጽ፡ ​ወበ​አሐ​ቲ፡
                                        ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ተጋ​ብኡ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​በበ​ይና​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​በአ​ፍአ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​በመ​ንፈ​ቀ፡
