               <fo:inline>I-3-16) Fols 132va–133ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of St George: A pagan finds lamps and
                    brings them to the church in Bǝbā Miracles which happened in the chapel of
                    Bǝbā, CAe 6225.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
