               <fo:inline>I-3-17) Fols 133ra–134rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of St George: A Muslim of Bǝbā gets lost in the desert on a pilgrimage to Mecca
                How a Muslim of Bǝbā who lost his way in the desert during a pilgrimage to Mecca was put back on the right road by the saint, CAe 6226.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
