               <fo:inline>I-3-19) Fols 134vc–136rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of St George: George, son of the bishop in Bǝbā, is resurrected Resurrection of George, son of the bishop who was
                    minister in the chapel of Bǝbā, CAe 6228.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​፲ወ​፰። ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡
                                        <fo:inline>(...)</fo:inline> ​ስም​ዑ፡ ​ኦፍ​ቁራ​ንየ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ተአ  (fol. 135ra)  ​ምረ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​አስ​ተርአ<fo:inline>[የ]</fo:inline>​ት፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ንጽ​ሕት፡
                                        ​መር​ጡል። ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ብባ። ​ወአ​መ፡ ​ተሐ​ንጸ​ት፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​መር​ጡል፡ ​ሤሙ፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡
