               <fo:inline>I-3-20) Fols 136rb–138rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (Miracle of St George: St George rides with a man from Bǝbā on his horse so he can celebrate the saint’s feast), CAe 6229.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​፲ወ​፱፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡
                                        <fo:inline>(...)</fo:inline> ​ወሀ​ሎ፡ ፩ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ብባ፡
                                        ​አረ​ሚ፡ ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ሮ፡ ​ለሰ​ማዕ​ት፡ ​ወለ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያኑ።</fo:inline>
