                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e37817LIT6234MGBebaPalm">
               <fo:inline>I-3-21) Fols 138va–139rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of St George: A malicious appointee from
                    Bǝbā, who hates St George, is killed and hung on a palm tree How a man who hated the saint was killed, CAe 6234.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                         (fol. 138va) 
