               <fo:inline>I-3-22) Fols 140ra–141vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of St George: A pagan breaks a lamp in the
                    church of St George in Old Cairo and is killed How a Muslim who broke a lamp in the chapel of St
