      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethf27"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. f. 27 (R)</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 24)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment scroll1895×121–123 mm, 664×123 mm, 676×121 mm, 575×124 mm (weight: 66g),  fols, nineteenth–twenty-first century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42673LIT6781PPAynat">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1ra1–1ra53: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against the evil eye ( ḥǝmāma ʿāyna bāryā 
                    wa-legewon ) with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6781.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡
                            ​ሕማ ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ገሃ​ነ፡ ​አር​ያስ፡ ​ስው​ር፡ ​ሰሙ​ር፡ ​አግ​ናከ​ር፡ ​አግ​ናጠ​ር፡ ​አሙ​ተዳ​ናብ​ኆል​ት፡
                            ​ይሰ​ልብ፡ ​ልበ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ወያ​ጸል​ም፡ ​አእ​ይን​ተ፡ ​ወይ​መጽ​እ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጽላ​ሎት፡ ​በመ​አል​ት፡ ​ወበ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​አመ​ሐል​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ውገ​ዝኩ​ክሙ፡
                            በ ፭  ​ቅን​ዋተ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወመ​ሳነ​ን፡ ​በድ​ንጋ​ፄ፡ ​ወጽ​ጋም፡ ​ወተ​ንኰ​ል፡ ​በመ​ድኀ​ኒት፡ ​ወን​ስና​ሽ፡ ​ወሾ​ተላ​ይ፡ ​ወቆ​ቆላ​ይ፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ወል​ጅ፡ ​ገዳ​ይ፡ ​በመ​ጋኛ፡
                                ​ወቍ​ራኛ፡ ​በአ​ስማ​ተኛ፡ ​ወማ​ርተ​ኛ፡ ​በበ​ደለ​ኛ፡ ​ወበ​ተን​ኰለ​ኛ፡ ​ወቍ​መኛ፡ ​በዝ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​አመ​ሐል​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ውገ​ዝኩ​ክሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡
                                ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e42687PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42697LIT4619Prayer">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 1ra53–1ra89: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Protective prayer against bāryā and legewon’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡), CAe 4619.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                            ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡  ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ርኩ​ስ፡ ​ዘይ​ሰል​ብ፡ ​ልበ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ወያ​ጸል​ም፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ተ፡ ​ወይ​መጽ ​እ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጽላ​ሎት፡
                                ​በመ​ዓል​ት፡ ​ወሕ​ልም፡ ​አም​ሐለ​ከ፡ ​ወአ​ውግ​ዝከ፡ በ ፭  ​ቅን​ዋተ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡
                            ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ሳዶ​ር፡ ​አላ​ዶር፡ ​ዳና​ት፡ ​አዴ​ራ፡ ​ሮዳ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">እ ​ሰሮ​ሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቀረ​ቡ፡ ​ወእ​ለሂ፡ ​ቀር​ቡ፡ ​ይፃ​ዑ፡ ​ዘሀ​ለው፡ ​እመ​ሂ፡ ​በሐ ​ቍ፡
                                ​ወእ​መሂ፡ ​በአ​ቍያ​ጽ፡ ​እመ​ሂ፡ ​በአ​እደ​ው፡ ​ወእ​መሂ፡ ​በአ​እጋ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​አካ​ላት፡ ​ዘይ​ቈረ​ጥሙ፡ ​ወየ​ሐም​ሙ፡ ​ወያ​መጽ​ኡ፡ ​ንዋ​መ፡ ​በመ​ዓል​ት፡
                                ​ወበ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ወያ​ንቀ​ጠቀ​ጡ፡ ​ወኢ​ይቅ​ረቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e42718PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42728LIT6782PPMasaromu">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 1ra90–1ra119: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for the binding of demons 
                    ( māʿsaromu la-ʾagānǝnt ), with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6782.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማዕ​ሠሮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​አክ​ያ፡ ​ሽራ​ህያ፡ ​እል​ሻዳ​ይ፡ ​እል​መክ​ኑን፡ ​አል ​ፋ፡ ​ድል​ጠ፡ ​ቤጠ፡ ​ወየ​ውጠ፡
                                ​ፀባ​ዖት፡ ​ወእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​ሕያ​ው፡ ወ ወ ​ልደ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ሥግ​ው፡ ​ዘበ​መስ​ቀል​ከ፡
                                ​አጽ​ራዕ​ከ፡ ​ግብ​ሮ፡ ​ለዲ​ያብ​ሎስ፡ ​ከመ​ሁ፡
                            ​አጽ​ርዕ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ቍራ​ኛ፡ ​ወተ​ያጅ፡ ​መጋ​ኛ፡ ​ወእ​ሥም​ት፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​ወው​ግዓ​ት፡ ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​ወፍ​ልፀ​ት፡ ​መት​ዓት፡ ​ወጽ​ፍዓ​ት፡ ​ምች፡ ​ወተ​ላዋ​ሽ፡ ​ፌራ፡ ​ወን​ዳድ፡
                            ​ግብ​ጥ፡ ​ወዛ​ር፡ ​መዋ​ቂ፡ ​ወነ​ቀኝ​ቃኝ፡ ​ሾተ​ላይ፡ ​ወት​ግር​ትያ፡ ​ወቍ​ርጥ​ማተ፡ ​እድ፡ ​ወእ​ግር፡ ​ሓቌ፡ ​ወዘ​ባን፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​አባ​ለ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ቡዳ፡ ​ወነ​ሃብ​ት፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ግብ​ር፡ ​ወጠ​በብ​ት፡
                            ​ቸን​ፍር፡ ​ወነ​ገር​ጋር፡ ​ድድ​ቀ፡ ​ወጋ​ኔነ፡ ​ቀት​ር፡ ​ይሰ​ድዱ፡ ​ወይ​ርሐ ​ቁ፡ ​እም​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሀ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e42749PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42757LIT6783MarkFive">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 1ra119–1ra176: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Mark 5:1–13, CAe 6783.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ርቆ​ስ፡ ​ወበ ​ጺሆ፡ ​ማዕ​ዶተ፡ ​ጊር​ጌሴ​ኖን፡ ​ተቀ​በል​ዎ፡ ​ሶቤ​ሃ፡ ​ለብ​እሲ፡ ​እመ​ቃብ​ር፡
                            ​ዘጋ​ኔን፡ ​እኩ​ይ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሁ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ማኅ​ደሩ፡ ​ማዕ​ከለ፡ ​መቃ​ብራ​ት፡ ​ወዓ​ዓቅ​ብዎ፡ ​ደቅ፡ ​ወአ​ልቦ፡ ​ዘክ​ህለ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያጽ​ንዖ፡ ​በሰ​ናስ​ል፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ተፈ​ትሐ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወአ​ብሆ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ ​ሱስ፡ ​ወወ​ዲሶ​ሙ፡ ​ሶቤ​ሃ፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ቦኡ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​አኅ​ርው፡ ​ወአ​ብዱ፡ ​መራ​እየ፡ ​አኅ​ርው፡ ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡
                                ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​መራ​እይ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ኀይ​ቅ፡ ​ወጸ​ድፉ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕ​ር፡ ​ኦእ​ግዚ​እየ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​በዝ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ወን​ጌል​ከ፡ ​ገስ​ጾሙ፡ ​ወአ​ርኅ​ቆሙ፡ ​ለመ​ናፍ​ስተ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​ወአ​ጋን​ንት፡
                                ​ፀዋ​ጋን፡ ​ወት​ግር​ትያ፡ ​እቡ​ያን፡ ​ወሠ​ብእ፡ ​መሠ​ርያ​ን፡ ​እም​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሾ​ተላ​ይ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e42771PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42782LIT2765RepCh49">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 1ra177–1ra255: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Salutations for Phanuel’ (​ሰላ​ምታ፡ ​ዘፋ​ኑኤ​ል፡), CAe 2765.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማዕ​ሠሮ​ሙ፡ 
                            ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ሰዳ​ዴ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​እም​ገፀ፡ ​ፈጣ​ሪ፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢያ​ስተ​ዋድ​ዩ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​በነ​ገር፡ ​ዘኀ​ጕል፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡
                            ​ሰዳ​ዴ፡ ​ሰይ​ጣና​ት፡ ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​እም​ጽር​ሁ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ስክ​ዩ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይኔ​ስሑ፡ ​ለጌ​ጋይ፡
                            ​ዘዘ​ዚአ​ሁ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​አባ​ለ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ቡዳ፡ ​ወነ​ሃብ​ት፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ግብ​ር፡ ​ወጠ​በብ​ት፡ ​ቸን​ፈር፡ ​ወነ​ገር​ጋር፡ ​ድድ​ቅ፡ ​ወጋ​ኔነ፡ ​ቀት​ር፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ወሕ​ማመ፡ ​አመ​ሐል​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ውገ​ዝኩ​ክሙ፡
                                ​ከመ፡ ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e42793PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡
                                  እ ​ግዚ ​እ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42806LIT4007Salotb">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 1ra256–1ra340: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer for undoing charms’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መፍ​ትሔ፡ ​ሥራ​ይ፡), CAe 4007.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text corresponds to the beginning of <fo:inline>“Prayer for undoing charms” (ጸሎት፡ በእንተ፡ መፍትሔ፡ ሥራይ፡), CAe 4007</fo:inline>,
                                as attested in MS London, British Library, Or. 566, fols 1ra–12rb.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእን ​ተ፡
                                ​መፍ​ትሔ፡ ​ሥራ​ይ፡ ​ዘተ​ቀድ​ሐ፡ ​እም ፹ ወ ፬ 
                            ​መጻ​ሕፍ​ት፡ ​ዘወ​ጽአ​ት፡ ​እም​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ዘሞ​ኮሙ፡ ​ለመ​ሠር​ያን፡ ​ወመ​ሐብ​ያን፡ ​ወደ​ጋም​ያነ፡ ​አረ​ሚ፡ ​ወክ​ርስ​ቲያ​ን፡ ​ዘፈ​ትሐ፡ ​ቆጵ​ርያ​ኖስ፡ ​ለጦ​ቢት፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ደጊ​ሞሙ፡ ​ክር​ታስ፡ ​ክር​ቲሶ​ሙ፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ​ገሲ​ሶሙ፡ ​ፈት​ለ፡ ​ቆጺ​ሮሙ፡ ​አዕ​ባነ፡ ​ወቂ​ሮሙ፡ ​በአ​ድግ፡ ​እን​ግዲ​ህ፡ ​ልጅ፡ ​ወበ​ሙጭ​ልጭ​ላ፡ ​አን​ጀት፡
                                ​ፍጌ​ን፡ ​ደጊ​ሞሙ፡ ​ፍታ​ሐ፡ ​ወዝ​ርዚ​ር፡ ​ሠዓ​ር፡ ​ወም​ንዝ​ር፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ሥራ​ያተ፡ ​ወአ​ስማ​ተ፡ ​ዕሙ​ናዝ​ር፡ ​ቤል​ናዝ​ር፡ ​ፍታ​ሕ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​ዘተ​ደግ​መ፡ ​በእ​ስላ​ም፡ ​ወክ​ርስ​ቲያ​ን፡
                                ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e42834PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​እ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42845LIT6784PPQwerdat">
               <fo:inline>VII) Fols 1ra341–1ra368: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against stomachache ( qʷǝrḍat ),
                    with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6784.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ሕ ​ማመ፡
                                ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​በከ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ኮዕ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​በር​ያኖ​ስ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​በጸ​ሔል፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​በአ​ማኑ​ኤል፡ ​ስም​ከ፡
                                ​በክ​ርስ​ቶስ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​በኅ​ቡዕ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ወበ​ክሱ​ት፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ንኩ፡ ​እል​ፍሉ​ል፡ ​እል​ፍሉ​ል፡ ​እል​ፍሉ​ል፡ ​እል​ፍሉ​ል፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​ዘተ​ፈነ​ወ፡
                                ​እም​ኀበ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያር​ዳዕ፡ ​ወይ​ቤዙ፡ ​ውሉ​ደ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ወእ​ንስ​ሳ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይጐ​ጸጕ​ጽ፡ ​ገበ​ዋተ፡ ​ወይ​ራነ​ቅል፡
                                ​ቍልፈ ​ተ፡ ​ወይ​ቈር​ፅ፡ ​ከማ​ዑተ፡ ​ሸገ​ር፡ ​ሸገ​ር፡ ​ሸገ​ር፡ ​ደር፡ ​ደር፡ ​ደር፡ ​በኃ ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡
                                ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e42860PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42870LIT6785PPDengade">
               <fo:inline>VIII) Fols 1ra369–1ra389: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against the fear of demons ( dǝngāḍe ʾagānǝnt 
                za-maʿālt wa-za-lelit ), CAe 6785.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ድን​ጋፄ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ዘመ​ዓል​ት፡ ​ወዘ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ባር​ከኒ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ዕቀ​በኒ፡ ​ወአ​ድኅ​ነኒ፡ ​እም​ድን​ጋፄ፡
                                ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወፍ​ጹም፡ ​በጽ​ልመ​ት፡ ​ፈር​ሃ፡ ​ወደ​ንገ​ፀ፡ ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ፡ ​ርእ​ዮ፡ ​ብሁ​ተ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በሲ​ኦል፡ ​እወ​ግዞ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​እኩ​ያን፡ ​በመ​ለኮ​ተ፡
                                ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዘይ​ወጽ​እ፡ ​እም​አፉ​ሁ፡ ​ሰይ​ፈ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​በአ​ብ፡ ​እት​ዌከ​ል፡ ​ወበ​ወል​ድ፡ ​እት​ኬስ​ል፡ ​በዘ​ቦቱ፡ ​ለሰ​ሐ፡ ​ሕም​ዙ፡
                                ​ለሞ​ት፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e42878PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42888LIT1763Legend">
               <fo:inline>IX) Fols 1rb1–1rb107: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Legend of St Susǝnyos and Wǝrzǝlyā (general record), CAe 1763.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ጋ ​ኔን፡
                            ​ወሾ​ተላ​ይ፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ፈጣ​ሪ፡ ​ነባ​ቢ፡ ​ወተ​ናጋ​ሪ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​አሰ​ስሎ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​እም​ሕፃ​ናት፡ ​ወአ​ንስ​ት፡ ​ወእ​ምኵ​ሉ፡ ​ደዌ​ያት፡
                            ​ወይ​በቍ​ዕ፡ ​ዓዲ፡ ​ለብ​እሲ​ት፡ ​ጽን​ስት፡ ​ዘኢ​የሐ​ይው፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​ታጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ወት​ሰቅ​ሎ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገቦ​ሃ፡ ​ወይ​በቍ​ዓ፡ ​ዓዲ፡ ​ለረ​ድኤ​ት፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ወክ​ቡር፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡
                            ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​ወኃ​ይለ፡ ​ረድ​ኤቱ፡ ​ያድ​ኅና፡ ​እም​ውር​ዝል​ያ፡ ​ወሾ​ተላ​ይ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወት​ግር​ትያ፡ ​ወሠ​ያጥ​ንት፡ ​ወእ​ምኵ​ሉ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ወሕ​ማም፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e42896PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                                ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​ወአ​ውሰ​በ፡ ​ብእ​ሲተ፡ ​ወወ​ልደ፡ ​ተባ​ዕተ፡ ​ወአ​ንስ​ተ፡
                                ​ወበ​ቀዳ​ማይ፡ ​ወል​ዱ፡ ​ቦአ​ት፡ ​ውር​ዝል​ያ።  ​ወቀ​ተለ​ቶ፡ ​ለወ​ልዱ፡ ​ወከ​ልሐ​ት፡ ​እሙ፡ ​ወበ​ከየ​ት፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​አን​ሰ፡ ​ኢየ​ሐው​ር፡ ​ፍኖ ​ተ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ውስ​ቴቱ፡ ​አው፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን​ከ፡ ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ይት​ነበ​ብ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ገድል ​ከ፡ ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ይጸ​ውራ፡ ​ለዛ​ቲ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡
                                ​እመ​ሂ፡ ​ተባ​ዕተ፡ ​ወእ​መሂ፡ ​አን​ስተ፡ ​አው፡ ​ሕፃ​ናት፡ ​ኢየ​ሐው​ር፡ ​ውስ​ቴቱ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                ​ወቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕተ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስመ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኦአ​ምላ​ከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ሾተ​ላይ፡ ​ወት​ግር​ትያ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ቍራ​ጅ፡ ​ወተ​ያድ፡ ​መጋ​ኛ፡ ​ወጕ​ሥም​ት፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡
                                ​ወው​ግዓ​ት፡
                                ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​ወፍ​ልፀ​ት፡ ​ዛር፡ ​ወን​ዳድ፡ ​ፌራ፡ ​ወሥ​ራይ፡ ​ወቍ​ርጥ​ማት፡ ​ወሰ​ቅሰ​ቀት፡ ​ቡዳ፡ ​ወነ​ሃብ​ት፡ ​ቸን​ፈር፡ ​ወነ​ገር​ጋር፡ ​ድድ​ቅ፡ ​ወጋ ​ኔነ፡ ​ቀት​ር፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ደዌ፡
                                    ​ወሕ​ማም፡
                                    ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ወአ​መት​ከ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e42919PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42927LIT6786MatthewEight">
               <fo:inline>X) Fols 1rb107–1rb151: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Matthew 8:28–32, CAe 6786.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡ ​ወበ​ጺሆ፡ ​ማዕ​ዶተ፡ ​ጌር​ጌሴ​ኖን፡ ​ተቀ​በል​ዎ፡ ፪ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወወ​ጺኦ​ሙ፡ ​እማ​ዕዶ​ተ፡ ​እም​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መቃ​ብራ​ት፡ ​እኩ​ያን፡ ​ጥቀ፡ ​ወጸ​ዋግ​ናን፡ ​ወኢ​ያበ​ውኁ፡
                                ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ኢይ​ክሉ፡ ​ኃሊ​ፈ፡ ​መኑ​ሂ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ፍኖ​ት፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ዮ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ፀር​ሁ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወአ​ተው፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ወዜ​ነው፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወና​ሁ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘው​ስተ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ወጽ​ኡ፡ ​ወተ​ቀበ​ልዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ይዎ፡
                                ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ብቍ​ዕዎ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​አሕ​ርው፡ ​ወአ​ብዱ፡ ​መራ​እየ፡ ​አሕ​ርው፡ ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​መራ​እይ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ኀይ​ቅ፡ ​ወጸ​ድፉ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕ​ር፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኦእ​ግዚ​እየ፡
                                ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​በዝ​ቃለ፡ ​ወን​ጌል​ከ፡ ​ገስ​ጾሙ፡ ​ወአ​ርኅ​ቆሙ፡ ​ለመ​ናፍ​ስተ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​ወአ​ጋን​ንት፡  ​ፀዋ​ጋን፡ ​ወት​ግር​ትያ፡ ​እቡ​ያን፡ ​ወሰ​ብእ፡ ​መሠ​ርያ​ን፡
                                    ​እም​ባር​ያ፡
                                    ​ወሾ​ተላ​ይ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለአ ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e42945PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42954LIT4620Prayer">
               <fo:inline>XI) Fols 1rb151–1rb180: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Protective prayer against the diseases of the smiths and the demons’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ነሀ​ብት፡ ​ወአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​አላ​ሁማ፡ ​ወያ​ኑራ፡), CAe 4620.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ወቡ​ዳ፡ ​ወነ​ሃብ​ት፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ግብ​ር፡ ​ወጠ​በብ​ት፡
                            ​አላ​ሁማ፡ ​ወያ​ኑራ፡ ​ተዋ​ቂራ፡ ​ሀድ​ረጅ፡ ​ብሀ​ቃ፡ ​መግ​ኦን፡ ​ወግ​ኑን፡ ​መበ​ሽሽ​ን፡ ​ዘረ​በቦ​ሙ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ስሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​መፍ​ርህ፡ ​ወመ​ደን​ግፅ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​ግሩ​ም፡ ​ነጐ​ድጓ​ድ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ነበ​ልባ​ል፡ ​ነዳ​ዲ፡
                                 ​ኬኒ​ዴን፡ ​ቲቲ​ሬዴ​ን፡ ​ኤፌ​ጼራ​ሆን፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​እም​ሕማ ​መ፡ ​ቡዳ፡ ​ወነ​ሃብ​ት፡ ​ቸን​ፈር፡ ​ወነ​ገር​ጋር፡
                                ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ግብ​ር፡ ​ወጠ​በብ​ት፡ ​ወሠ​ውራ፡ ​እም​ኵሉ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ወሕ​ማም፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e42966PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e42976LIT5186PrayerAsmatAbayt">
               <fo:inline>XII) Fols 1rb181–1rb226: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer of the Great  ʾAsmāt 
                ’ (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡ ​ዓበ​ይት፡), CAe 5186.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዛር፡ ​ወን​ዳድ፡ ​ወት​ብል፡ ​በት​ሁት፡ ​ቃል፡ ​እሎ​ንተ፡ ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​አቢ​ያተ፡ ​አኮ​ሰ፡ ​አሜ​ዕሌ​ኬ፡ ​ኤን​ካ፡ ​ካዜ​ዕ፡ ​ኤር​ናኪ​ም፡
                                ​ከም​ኬዎ​ንኬ​ዎን፡
                            ​ፒካ፡ ​ጊሎ፡ ​ኤሉ​ቅ፡ ​አሶ​ኤለ​ኝ፡ ​አሰ​ሰሙ፡ ​ኤሬ​ም፡ ​ያብ​ሲተ፡ ​ፒሰ​ካር፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወበ​ስእ​ለቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለ፬ ​እን​ስሳ፡ ​ለ፳​ወ፬ ​ካህ​ናተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​በጸ​ሎታ፡ ​ወበ​ስእ​ለታ፡ ​ለእግ ​ዝእ​ትነ፡
                                 ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እመ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ወእ​ግዝ​እተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ፍጥ​ረት፡ ​ይሰ​ደዱ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ፀዋ​ጋን፡
                                ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡
                                ​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​እኩ​ያን፡ ​ወሠ​ራዊ​ተ፡ ​መስ​ቴማ፡ ​ጽል​ሙታ​ን፡ ​ይሰ​ደዱ፡ ​ወይ​ርሐ​ቁ፡ ​እም​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e42994PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e43002LIT5690MagicPrayer">
               <fo:inline>XIII) Fols 1rb226–1rb267: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Protective prayer against eye disease’ (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ነደ​ራ፡), CAe 5690.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ጽላ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​የሐ​ውር፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕ​ረ፡
                                ​ጥብ​ርያ​ዶስ፡ ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡  ፲ ወ ፪ 
                            ​አር​ዳኢ​ሁ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ምን​ት፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዓይ​ን፡ እ ​ኪት፡ ​ወር​ግም​ት፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​የት፡ ​ሐመ​ረ፡
                                    ​ንሥ​እዋ፡ ​ወአ​ውሰ​ይዋ፡ ​ዓፍ​ዓ፡ ​ወክው ​ዕይ​ዋ፡ ​በእ​ሳት፡ ​ወዝ​ርው​ዋ፡ ​በነ​ፋሰ፡ ​ምሥ​ራቀ፡ ​ወም​ዕራ​በ፡ 
                                ​ሰሜ​ነ፡ ​ወደ​ቡበ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትፃ​እ፡ ​ወት​ሰሰ​ል፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​እም​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​አመ​ትከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e43023PRS13863WalattaE"> ​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e43033LIT6787PPAyn">
               <fo:inline>XIV) Fols 1rb267–1rb292: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against the evil eye and headache 
                    ( ḥǝmāma ʿāyn wa-fǝlḍata rǝʾs ), CAe 6787.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ን፡ ​ወፍ​ልፀ​ተ፡ <fo:inline>ርእሰ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡
                                ​ወም​እመ​ን፡ ​ዝበ​ምራ​ቅከ፡ ​ከሠ​ትከ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ተ፡ ​እው​ራን፡ ​ወበ​ቃል​ከ፡ ​ይት​ፌው​ሱ፡ ​ድው​ያን፡ ​ዛቲ፡
                             ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ሕም​ምት፡ ​ወጥ​ውቂ​ት፡ ​ትር​ክብ፡ ​ፈው​ሶ፡ ​ዘይ​ቀጠ​ቀጥ፡ ​ርእ​ሰ፡ ​ወየ​ለ፡ ወ ​ይሰ​ቀሰ​ቀ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ተ፡ ​ወይ​ሐቂ፡ ​አስ​ናን፡ ​ወይ​ጐጸ​ጉጽ፡
                            ​ገበ​ዋተ፡ ​ወይ​ፈነ​ቅል፡ ​ቍል​ፊተ፡ ​ወይ​ቈር​ፅ፡ ​አማ​ዑተ፡ ​ወያ​ደቅ​ቅ፡ ​አእ​ፅም​ተ፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ዘጸ​ሐፈ፡ ​ኤር​ምያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ኰኵ​ሕ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ታቦ​ት፡ ​ማይ፡
                            ​እን​ተ፡ ​ተከ​ድነ​ት፡ ​በደ​መና፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​በይ​እቲ፡ ​ስም፡ ​ይሕ​ልፍ፡ ​ወይ​ሰስ​ል፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​እም​ላዕ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                                ​አመ​ትከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e43050PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e43058LIT6788PPDrowning">
               <fo:inline>XV) Fols 1rb292–1rb381: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for the drowning ( maśṭǝm ) of demons, for Sunday, CAe 6788.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም ​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​መሥ​ጥም፡ ​ዘዕ​ለተ፡ ​እሁ​ድ፡ ​ሰን​በት፡
                            ​ዓቃ​ቢሁ​ኒ፡ ​ሰቁ​ኤል፡ ​ወኮ​ክቡ​ኒ፡ ​ሽመ​ሽ፡ ​አሁ​ማ፡ ​ያች​ናጅ፡ ​አል​መለ​ኪ፡ ​ወያ​ኑራ፡ ​ተዋ​ቂራ፡ ​ሐጅ፡ ​መረ​ጅ፡ ​ሐቅ​ወ፡ ​መግ​ኑን፡ ​ኆቤ፡ ​ወመ​ድኑ​ን፡ ​በሕ​ትሙ​ኪን፡
                            ​ሸይ​ጣን፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ይሠ​ዓር፡ ​ሥራ​ይክ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ልሣ​ሕ፡ ​ሕም​ዝክ​ሙ። ​ወይ​ድክ​ም፡ ​ኃይ​ልክ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ስበ​ር፡ ​ርእ​ሰክ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ትቀ​ጥቀ​ጥ፡ ​አዕ​ፅም​ቲክ​ሙ፡ ​በዝ፡ ​ጠል​ሰም፡ ​ወበ​ዝ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡ ​ኩኑ፡
                                ​ርኡ​ዳነ፡ ​ወድ​ንጉ​ፃነ፡ ​ኢት​ቀረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e43069PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e43077LIT6789HymnRaguel">
               <fo:inline>XVI) Fols 1rb382–1rb419: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     Salām -hymn to Rāguʾel, CAe 6789.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ራጉ​ኤል፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ሊቃ​ናት፡  ፯ ​ቱ፡ ​በገ​ጸ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ትቀ​ውም፡ ​ለለ​ዕለ​ቱ፡ ​ሰዓ​ል፡ ​ለለ​ሰዓ​ቱ፡
                            ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ቅዳ​ሴ፡  ​ራጉ​ኤል፡ ​ዘው​ገ፡ ​ቅዳ​ስያ​ን፡ ​እን​ስሳ፡ ​ሰዓ​ል፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ሰሬ​ቀ፡ ​አበ​ሲ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​ለም​ሕረ​ት፡
                            ​ዘሰ​ብሳ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ምክ​ንያ​ተ፡ ​ጽሂ​ን፡ ​ራጉ​ኤል፡ ​አም​ጣነ፡ ​ተሐሥ ​ሥ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ከመ፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ​ከ፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​ዘሞ​ተ፡ ​ተወ​ኪፈ​ከ፡
                                    ​ማኅሌ ሌ ​ትየ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ጸግ​ወኒ፡ ​ሠና​የ፡ ​ዕሤ​ተ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡
                                ​ዘኃ​ይስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ራጉ​ኤል፡ ​ሊቅ፡  ​መል​አከ፡ ​ኃይ​ል፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡  ​ወር​ቅ፡
                                ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡  <fo:inline id="d1e43095PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወገ​ፁ፡ ​ዘፍ​ጹም፡ ​በጽ​ልመ​ት፡ ​ፈር​ሃ፡ ​ወደ​ንገ​ፀ፡ ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ፡ ​ርእ​ዮ፡ ​ብሁ​ተ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                            ​በሲ​ኦል፡ ​ወሪ​ዶ፡ ​ዘበ​መስ​ቀል​ከ፡ ​አጽ​ራዕ​ከ፡ ​ግብ​ሮ፡ ​ለዲ​ያብ​ሎስ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አጽ​ርዕ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወፍ​ልፀ​ተ፡ ​ርእ​ስ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e43102PRS13863WalattaE">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚእ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The verso is empty.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The manuscript contains no scribal corrections.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The name of the owner, mentioned in supplications throughout, was
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e43333PRS13863WalattaE">Walatta ʾƎgziʾ</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Order of textual units and miniatures: Miniature 1; Column a: Textual
                                        units I–V (beginning), Miniature 2; Textual
                                        units V (end)–VIII; Column b: Textual units
                                        IX–XII (beginning), Miniature 3, Textual units XII
                                        (end)–XVI, Miniature 4.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>The three parchment strips are slightly overlapping and sewn together with a running stitch using a narrow parchment strip each.A textile strip is attached to a hole in the right corner of the lower edge of the scroll.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>2
                                    columns ( written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 12–17.Each column is divided by decorated frames into panels of c. 18–20 written lines.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            754 × 101 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 9–11 mm, left: 9–11 mm, top: 16 mm, bottom: 7 mm, intercolumn: 10–13 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>2
                                    columns ( written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 11–17.Each column is divided by decorated frames into panels of c. 18–20 written lines.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            783 × 100 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 9–11 mm, left: 9–11 mm, top: 16 mm, bottom: 7 mm, intercolumn: 10–13 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Pricking and ruling are not visible. Pricking and ruling are not visible.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Nineteenth–twenty-first century.. Mediocre hand. There are a few changes of nib, but the hand is probably the same one throughout.
                                    Depending on nib, the script alternates between more cursive and bulky shapes.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: The first three lines of each section (regardless of the beginning of the textual units); holy names;
                                    elements of the numerals.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">
                                The scroll is extensively decorated. In addition to the three figurative panels at the top, bottom, and middle,
                                it features horizontal and vertical bands of interlace that frame all of the text portioning it into distinct units. 
                                The horizontal bands are rendered as eye-like elements because of the presence of black dots at their 
                                centre.
                            </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(67) <fo:inline>Chequered pattern featuring alternated faces and x-shaped
                                    elements forming a 6 × 8 grid.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(68) <fo:inline>Unidentified standing angel. These dimensions refer to Miniature 2 and Miniature
                                        3, which are located side by side, together.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(69) <fo:inline>Unidentified standing angel.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(70) <fo:inline>Chequered pattern featuring alternated faces and x-shaped
                                    elements forming a 6 × 5 grid.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.There are a few losses, particularly along the right side of the scroll, possibly caused by insects.
                                In a few places, the ink is smudged.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth–twenty-first century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            nineteenth and the twenty-first century.
                            Its original owner, mentioned in supplications, was <fo:inline id="d1e43366PRS13863WalattaE">Walatta ʾƎgziʾ</fo:inline>.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The provenance of the manuscript is unknown.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e43373PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf27">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf27</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
