      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethf25"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. f. 25</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 27)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex127×88 mm (weight: 241g), 78 fols (4 p. blank), nineteenth–mid-twentieth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47227LIT6489SchoolChants">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 5ra–72ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">School Chants, CAe 6489.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47233LIT2509Weddas">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 5ra–31vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ማር​ያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>The text is furnished with musical notation.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47242LIT2509Weddas#Monday">
               <fo:inline>I-1-1) Fols 5ra–6vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Monday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሰ​ኑይ፡ ​ፈቀ​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ያግ ​ዕዞ፡ ​ለአ​ዳም፡ ​ኅዙ​ነ፡ ​ወት​ኩዘ፡ ​ልብ፡  ​ወያ​ግብ​ኦ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዘት​ካት፡ ​መን​በሩ፡ 
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡  ​ሠረ​ቀ፡  ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​እም​ድን​ግል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ዘር​አ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ወአ​ድኃ​ነነ።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወረ​ሰይ​ካ፡ ​ለሔ​ዋን፡ ​አግ​ዓዚ​ተ፡ ​እም​ፃዕ​ረ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ወወ​ሀብ​ከነ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​ባረ​ክና​ከ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ቲከ፡
                                        ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47268LIT2509Weddas#Tuesday">
               <fo:inline>I-1-2) Fols 6vb–10ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Tuesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሠ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ምክ​ህነ፡ ​ወቀ​ዳሚ​ተ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡ ​ወመ​ሠረ​ተ፡
                                        ​ንጽ​ሕነ፡ ​ኮነ፡ በ ​ማር​ያም  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ወለ​ደት፡ ለ  (fol. 7ra)  ​ነ፡ ​ዘእ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ይሰ​ፍሑ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ብሉ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​መጽ​አ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​በዕ​በየ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ፡
                                        ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47300LIT2509Weddas#Wednesday">
               <fo:inline>I-1-3) Fols 10ra–13va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Wednesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘረቡ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ይብ​ሉ፡ ​ብፅ​ዕት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡
                                        ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ዳግ​ሚት፡ ​ዲበ፡ ም  (b)  ​ድር፡ ​ኆኅ​ተ፡ ​ምሥ​ራቅ፡  ​ማር​ያም  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ከብ​ካብ፡ ​ንጹ​ሕ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ንሶ​ሰወ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​መሐ​ሪ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወመፍ  (fol. 13va)  ​ቀሬ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​አድ​ኃነ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳቲ​ነ፡ ​በም​ጽአ​ቱ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47330LIT2509Weddas#Thursday">
               <fo:inline>I-1-4) Fols 13va–17va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Thursday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>ማርያ (!)</fo:inline> ​ዕፀ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​በነ​ደ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ዕፁ​ቂሃ፡ ​ኢት​ውዒ፡ ​ትመ​ስል፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ርኵ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ከማ​ነ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ባሕ​ቲታ፡ ​ወተ​ወል​ደ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ልሔ​ም፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ሰበ​ኩ፡ ​ነቢያ  (fol. 17va)  ​ት፡ ​አድ​ኃነ​ነ፡ ​ወቤ​ዘወ​ነ፡ ​ወረ​ሰየ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡
                                        ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47359LIT2509Weddas#Friday">
               <fo:inline>I-1-5) Fols 17va–20ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Friday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ፡ ​ዘዓር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ፡ ኦ ​ማር​ያም  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ርኵ​ስ፡ ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​ለነ፡
                                        ​እም​ኔኪ፡ ​ፀሐ​የ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ፡ ​ወአ​ቅረ​በነ፡ ​ታሕ​ተ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሁ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በእ​ንተ​ዝ፡ ​ንዌ​ድስ​ኪ፡   (fol. 20ra)   ​በከ​መ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ንብ​ል፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡  ​ማር​ያም  ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ፡
                                        ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦም​ልዕ​ተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምስ​ሌኪ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47390LIT2509Weddas#Saturday">
               <fo:inline>I-1-6) Fols 20ra–22ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Saturday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ፡ ​ዘቀ​ዳ፡ 
                                        ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ወብ​ርህ​ት፡ ​ወቅ​ድስ​ት፡
                                        ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ሐቀ​ፈቶ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​በእ​ራኅ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ፍጥ​ረት፡ <fo:inline>ይትፌሑ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ምስ​ሌሃ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይጸ​ርሑ፡ ​ወይ​ብሉ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ኄር፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ፡ ​ይም​ሐረ​ነ፡ ወ  (fol. 22ra)  ​ይሠ​ሃለ​ነ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ​ነ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47415LIT2509Weddas#Sunday">
               <fo:inline>I-1-7) Fols 22ra–24ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Sunday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ፡ ​ዘሰ​ንበት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ተሰ​መይ​ኪ፡ ​ፍቅ​ርተ፡ ​ኦቡ​ርክ​ት፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዳግ​ሚት፡ ​ቀመ​ር፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ትሰ​መይ፡ ​ቅድ​ስተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወው​ስቴ​ታ፡ ​ጽላ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳ​ን፡
                                        ፲ ​ቃላ​ት፡ ​እለ፡ ​ተጽ​ሕፋ፡ ​በአ​ፃብ​ዒሁ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                        ​ያጽ​ንዓ​ነ፡ ​በር​ትዕ​ት፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሚ​ነ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡ ​ይጸ​ግወ​ነ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡
                                        ​ወም​ሕረ​ቶ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ​ነ፡ ​በብ​ዝኃ፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ቅ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47444LIT1110Anqasa">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 24ra–26rb, 27ra–31vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Table of Hallelujahs’ (​አን​ቀጸ፡ ​ሃሌ​ታ፡), CAe 1110.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ውዳሴ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ወብ​ፅዕ​ት፡ ​ስብ​ሕት፡ ​ወቡ​ርክ​ት፡ ​ክብ​ርት፡ ​ወል​ዕል​ት፡ ​አን​ቀጸ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​መዓ​ርገ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ወ  (b)  ​ማኅ​ደረ፡ ​መለ​ኮት፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ኦወ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ወክ​ብር፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ይክ​ፍለ​ነ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>The text is furnished with musical notation.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47472LIT5646Mastagabe">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 32ra–41va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Compilation’ (​መሰ​ተጋ​ብእ፡), CAe 5646.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>The text is furnished with musical notation.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47481LIT5646Mastagabe#MondayEzl">
               <fo:inline>III-1) Fols 32ra–32va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: MondayEzl</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​መስ​ተጋ​ብእ፡ ​ዕዝ​ል፡  ​ወለ​ቡ፡ ​ጽራ​ኅየ፡ ​ወአ​ጽም​አኒ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ስእ​ለት​የ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ተለ​ዓል​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ በ  (fol. 32va)  ​ኃይ​ልከ፡ ​ንሴ​ብሕ፡ ​ወን​ዜም​ር፡ ​ለጽ​ንዕ​ከ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47504LIT5646Mastagabe#MondayGez">
               <fo:inline>III-2) Fols 32va–33va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: MondayGez</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ግዕ​ዝ፡  ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ነጽ​ረኒ፡ ​ወለ​ምን​ት፡ ​ኀደ​ገኒ፡ ​ርኁ​ቅ፡ ​ምድ​ጋ፡ ​ኪያ​ከ፡ ​ተወ​ከሉ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ፡ ​ምድ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኃይ​ልየ፡ ​ወፀ​ወን​የ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ምር​ሐኒ፡ ​ወሴ​ስየ​ኒ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47525LIT5646Mastagabe#TuesdayEzl">
               <fo:inline>III-3) Fols 33va–34rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: TuesdayEzl</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዕዝ​ል፡ ​ዘሠ​ሉስ፡  ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሁ፡ ​ወያ​በር​ህ፡ ​ለክ​ሙ። ​ጣዓ​ሙ፡ ​ወታ​እም​ሩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኄር፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሕፅ​በኒ፡ ​ወአ​ንጽ​ሐኒ፡ ​እም​ኃጢ​አት​የ፡ ​ወእ​ምአ​በሳ​የኒ፡ ​አን​ጽሐ​ኒ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47545LIT5646Mastagabe#TuesdayGez">
               <fo:inline>III-4) Fols 34rb–35rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: TuesdayGez</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ግዕ​ዝ፡  ​ለም​ንት፡ ​ይዜ​ሃር፡ ​ኃያ​ል፡ ​በእ​ከዩ፡ ​ምድ​ጋም። ​ወት​ዔም​ፅ፡ ​እም​ትን​ብብ፡ ​ጽድ​ቀ፡ ​ምድ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወከ​ዓዉ፡ ​ልበ​ክሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜሁ፡ ​ወእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ረዳ​ኢነ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47565LIT5646Mastagabe#WednesdayEzl">
               <fo:inline>III-5) Fols 35rb–36ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: WednesdayEzl</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዕዝ​ል፡ ​ዘረ​ቡዕ፡  ​በል​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ግሩ​ም፡ ​ግብ​ርከ። ​ኵላ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ትሰ​ግድ፡ ​ወት​ገኒ፡ ​ለከ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ምላ​ዕ፡ ​አፉ​የ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እሰ​ብሕ፡ ​አኰ​ቴተ​ከ፡ ​ወኵ​ሎ፡ ​አሚ​ረ፡   (fol. 36ra)   ​ዕበ​የ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ከ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47588LIT5646Mastagabe#WednesdayGez">
               <fo:inline>III-6) Fols 36ra–36vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: WednesdayGez</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ግዕ​ዝ፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ኵነ​ኔከ፡ ​ሀቦ፡ ​ለን​ጉሥ፡ ​ኰን​ን፡ ​በጽ​ድቅ፡ ​ነዳ​ያነ፡ ​ሕዝ<fo:inline>በ (!)</fo:inline>​ከ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ፈነ​ወ፡ ​መልአ  (b)  ​ኮ፡ ​ወአ​ድኃ​ኖሙ፡ ​ሠጠ​ቀ፡ ​ባሕ​ረ፡ ​ወአ​ኅለ​ፎሙ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47612LIT5646Mastagabe#ThursdayEzl">
               <fo:inline>III-7) Fols 36vb–37rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: ThursdayEzl</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዕዝ​ል፡ ​ዘሐ​ሙስ፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​ኃያ​ላን፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ። ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ወር​ትዕ፡ ​ተራ​ከባ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ምሕ​ረተ፡ ​ወፍ​ትሐ፡ ​አሐ​ሊ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​እዜ​ምር፡ ​ወእ​ሌቡ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ንጹ​ሐ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47632LIT5646Mastagabe#ThursdayGez">
               <fo:inline>III-8) Fols 37rb–38ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: ThursdayGez</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ግዕ​ዝ።  ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ምድ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኃል​ቀ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጢስ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል​የ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ኢት​ሰደ​ኒ፡ ​በመ​ንፈቀ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዓመ​ትየ፡ ​ለት​ውል​ደ፡ ​ትው​ልድ፡ ​ዓመ​ቲከ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47656LIT5646Mastagabe#FridayEzl">
               <fo:inline>III-9) Fols 38ra–38vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: FridayEzl</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዕዝ​ል፡ ​ዘዓ​ርብ፡  ​ጸዋ​ዕኩ፡ ​ስመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡   (b)   ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ባል​ሐ፡ ​ለነ​ፍስ​የ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​አን​ሣእ​ኩ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ትየ፡ ​መን​ገለ፡ ​አድ​ባር፡ ​ረድ​ኤት​የሰ፡ ​እም​ኀበ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47681LIT5646Mastagabe#FridayGez">
               <fo:inline>III-10) Fols 38vb–39va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: FridayGez</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ግዕ​ዝ፡  ​ተፈ​ሣሕ​ኩ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ይቤ​ሉኒ፡ ​ቤተ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ነሐ​ውር፡ ​ምድ፡
                                    ​ሕዝ​በ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ስም​ዓ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​ምድ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​እም​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ተሰ​ፈው​ኩከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47707LIT5646Mastagabe#SaturdayEzl">
               <fo:inline>III-11) Fols 39va–40rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: SaturdayEzl</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዕዝ​ል፡ ​ዘቀ​ዳም፡  ​ናሁ፡ ​ይባ​ርክ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​አብሔ  (b)  ​ር፡
                                    ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​አግ​ብር​ተ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ጸ  (b)  ​ራኅ​ኩ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​ተወ​ክፈ​ኒ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​በቅ​ድሜ​ከ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47737LIT5646Mastagabe#SaturdayGez">
               <fo:inline>III-12) Fols 40rb–41va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Compilation: SaturdayGez</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ግዕ​ዝ፡  ​ቃል​የ፡ ​ኀበ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ጸራ​ኅኩ፡ ​ምድ። ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ተአ​ምር፡ ​ፍኖ​ትየ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወረ​ሰየ፡ ​ሰላ​መ፡ ​ለበ​ሐው​ርት​ኪ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሒ​ዮ፡ ​ለአ​ምላ​ክኪ፡ ​ጽዮ​ን፡ ​አድ​ኃነ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቦ፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ሠረ​ቀ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47760LIT6720collections">
               <fo:inline>III-13) Fols 41va–72ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Collections of melodic models for ʾarbāʿt antiphons, śalast antiphons, and ʾaryām antiphons, CAe 6720.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>The text is furnished with musical notation.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47770LIT6720collections#Arbat">
               <fo:inline>III-14) Fols 41va–48ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Collections of melodic models for ʾarbāʿt antiphons, śalast antiphons, and ʾaryām antiphons: ʾArbāʿt</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​አር​ባዕ​ት፡ ​ቃል​የ፡  ​አጽ​ምዕ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ወለ​ቡ፡ ​ጽራ​ኅየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡
                                    ​ወአ​ጽም​ዓኒ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ስእ​ለት​የ፡ ​ንጉ  (b)  ​ሥየ​ኒ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ኪየ​ኒ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አጥ​መቀ፡ ​ወተ​ጠመ​ቀ፡ ​ለሊ​ከ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ፈነ​ወከ፡ ​ነቢ​የ፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ተሰ​መይ​ከ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​አጽ​ምዕ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​እዝ​ነከ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ወስ​ምዓ​ኒ፡
                                    ​ሃሌ፡  (b)   ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ነዳ​ይ፡ ​ወም​ስኪ​ን፡ ​አነ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ዕቀ​ባ፡ ​ለነ​ፍስ​የ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​የዋ​ህ፡ ​አነ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡
                                    ​አድ​ኅኖ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ዘተ​ወከ​ለ፡ ​ኪያ​ከ፡ ​ተሠ​ሃለ​ኒ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​እጸ​ርኅ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​አሚ​ረ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡
                                    ​ወአ​ስተ​ፍሥ​ሓ፡ ​ለነ​ፍሰ፡ ​ገብ​ርከ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ሐነ​ፃ፡ ​በጽ​ድቁ፡ ​ሐወ​ጻ፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​ፀሐ​ዩ፡
                                    ​ይበ​ርህ፡   (fol. 48ra)   ​ገጻ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47803LIT6720collections#Salast">
               <fo:inline>III-15) Fols 48ra–62va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Collections of melodic models for ʾarbāʿt antiphons, śalast antiphons, and ʾaryām antiphons: Śalast</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡  ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ወይ​ብጻ​ሕ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜከ፡ ​ገዓ​ርየ፡
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ወኢ​ትሚ​ጥ፡ ​ገጸ​ከ፡ ​እም​ኔየ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ምን​ዳቤ​የ፡ ​አጽ​ምዕ፡ ​እዝ​ነከ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​እጼ​ውዓ​ከ፡ ​ፍጡ​ነ፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለዓ  (b)  ​ለም፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ተሐ​ውር፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትጺ​ሕ፡ ​ፍኖ​ቶ፡ ​ወት​ስብ​ክ፡ ​በስ​ሙ፡
                                    ​ይመ​ልእ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሁ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​አን​ሰ፡ ​ኢኮ​ንኩ፡
                                    ​ኪያ​ሁ፡ ​ተፈ​ኖኩ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜሁ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አጥ​ምቅ፡ ​በማ​ይ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ስም​ዓኒ፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ወይ​ብጻ​ሕ፡ ​ቅ፡ ​ገ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡
                                    ​ወኢ​ትሚ​ጥ፡ ​ገጸ​ከ፡ ​እም​ኔየ፡ ​በዕ፡ ​ምን​ዳቤ​የ፡ ​አ፡ ​እዝ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ዕ፡ ​እጼ፡   (fol. 62va)  
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ነያ፡ ​ደብ​ተራ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ርእ​ያ፡
                                     ​ዕዝራ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ይሔ​ውጽ​ዋ፡ ​በሰ​ማይ፡ ​ሐራ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47842LIT6720collections#TarafaSalast">
               <fo:inline>III-16) Fols 62va–64va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Collections of melodic models for ʾarbāʿt antiphons, śalast antiphons, and ʾaryām antiphons: Tarafa śalast</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተረ​ፈ፡ ​ሠ፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡  ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡  ​ሉያ፡ ​ወይ​ብጻ​ሕ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜከ፡ ​ገዓ​ርየ፡
                                    ​ወኢ​ትሚ​ጥ፡ ​ገጸ​ከ፡ ​እም​ኔየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ምን​ዳቤ​የ፡ ​አጽ​ምዕ፡ ​እዝ​ነከ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡
                                    አ  (b)  ​መ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​እጼ​ውዓ​ከ፡ ​ፍጡ​ነ፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።
                                    ​ኃይ​ል፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለሰ​ማዕ​ት፡ ​አክ​ሊል፡ ​ንጺ​ሕ፡ ​ለካ​ህና​ት።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ስም​ዓኒ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ወይ​ብጻ​ሕ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜከ፡ ​ገዓ​ርየ፡
                                    ​ወኢ​ትሚ​ጥ፡ ​ገጸ​ከ፡ ​እም​ኔየ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ምን​ዳቤ​የ፡ ​አጽ​ምዕ፡ ​እዝ​ነከ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​እጼ​ውዓ​ከ፡ ​ፍጡ​ነ፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።
                                    ​አዋል  (fol. 64va)  ​ደ፡ ​ንግ​ሥት፡ ​ለክ​ብር​ከ፡ ​ወት​ቀው​ም፡ ​ንግ​ሥት፡ ​በየ​ማን​ከ፡ ​በአ​ልባ​ሰ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ዑፅ​ፍት፡ ​ወኁ​ብር​ት።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47875LIT6720collections#Aryam">
               <fo:inline>III-17) Fols 64va–72ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Collections of melodic models for ʾarbāʿt antiphons, śalast antiphons, and ʾaryām antiphons: ʾAryām</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​አር​ያም፡  ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ወለ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                        ​ዮሐ​ንስ​ኒ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ያጠ​ምቅ፡ ​በሄ​ኖን፡ ​በቅ​ሩበ፡ ​ሳሊ​ም፡ ​በማ​ዕዶ​ተ፡ ​ዮር​ዳኖ​ስ፡ ​ወብ​ርሃ​ነ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅሰ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ብር​ሃን፡  ​ትእ​ዛዝ​ከ፡ ​ወጽ​ድቅ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ዘበ​ትእ​ዛዝ​ከ፡ ​ተሠ​ርዓ፡ ​ጎህ፡   (fol. 72ra)   ​ወጽ​ባሕ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ወጸ​ብሐ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e47903LIT1110Anqasa">
               <fo:inline>III-18) Fols 72ra–74r, 75r–76r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Table of Hallelujahs’ (​አን​ቀጸ፡ ​ሃሌ​ታ፡), CAe 1110.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    በ ፩ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ይት​ፌሣ፡
                                     በ ፩ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ዴግ​ንዋ፡
                                     በ ፩ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ይሠ​ጠዎ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    በ ፲ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ሃ
                                     ​ሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ዕዝ​ራኒ፡ ​ርእ​ያ፡ ​ወተ​ናገ
                                     ​ራ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ያ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ብእ​ሲተ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                  <fo:inline>The text is furnished with musical notation.</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 2r: Prayer against  Bāryā  and  Legewon 
                , CAe 6856.
                                        The prayer is partly in Gəʿəz and partly in Amharic. It has been written in a spiral and surrounded by a double circle and
                                        Brillenbuchstaben.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus"/>
                                    Incipit:  :
                                        ​በስመ <fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አብ፡
                                            ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡
                                            ​ወለ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ጌዎ​ን፡  አ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ላሁ፡
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​ማቴ፡ ​አል​መላ​ክያ​ው፡ ​ኑራ​ተዊ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ቁራ፡
                                                ​ስስ​ምረ​ጅ፡ ​ወመ​ርመ፡ ​የፉ​ሕሙ፡ ​የሽ​ፋቴ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ... 
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 3v–4r: Undecipherable text, originally written in red ink and erased to illegibility.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 26va: Short prayer mentioning lightning, CAe 6855.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ። ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ያኢ​በያ​ላሂ​ሂን፡ ​አህ​ቢሱ፡
                                            ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ ​እገ​ሊት። ​ሃሱ፡ ​ለሃ​ሱ፡ ​ለም​ሃ፡ ​ሸር​ሪ፡ ​ይት​ባረ​ጹ፡ ​መባ​ርቅ​ት፡ ​ወነ​ጐድ፡ ​ዘወ​ጽአ​ት፡
                                            ​ትግ​ባእ፡ ​ወዘ​ርሕ​ቀት፡ ​ትቅ​ረብ፡ ​ሰማ​ይኒ፡ ​የኢ​ያጽ​ልላ፡
                                            ​አዝ​ዊረ​ከ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​አዘ​ዋዊ​ረከ፡ ​አግ​ብአ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 26vb: Short prayer with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6857.
                                        The prayer includes abbreviations and interlineal additions.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                            ​አል​ሐጢ​ን፡ ​አል​ሐጢ​ን፡ ​አል​ሐን፡ ​በካ​ዝዮ​ን፡ ​ካፌ​ር፡ ​ሰለ​ባዊ፡ ​በዝ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡
                                            ​ዘአ​ሰር​ኮ፡ ​ለብ​ርያ​ል፡ ​በ፭​፻፡ ​፼፡ ​ሰና​ስለ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ስብ​ጉጥ​ር፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡
                                            ​እስ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢት፡ ​እም፡ ​ቤታ በ ፡
                                            ሕ ይ ​ወታ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሐለ​ት፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​በሞ​ት። ​፯፡ ​፯፡ ​ድግ​ምለ​ወሐ፡ ​ሎማ፡
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 74v: Prayer against snake bites, CAe 6858.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመን ፡  ​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፨
                                        ​አክ​ዮስ፡ ​አክ​ዮስ፡ ​አክየ<fo:inline>፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ሳዊ፡ ​ዶል፡ ​መር<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፡ ​ጌዎ​ን፡ 
                                        ​ለቅ​ሌማ​ድ፡ ​መል​አኩ፡ ​ለአ​ርዌ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡
                                        ​አኀ​ዝኩ​ከ፡ ​ቀረ​ጽ፡ ​በቀ​ረጽ፡ ​አግ​አዚ፡ ​አር​ግዘ​ና፡ ​ዘም​ሳና፡ ​ሙለ​ዱ፡ ​ለከ​ይሲ፡
                                        ​ፈው​ሰ፡ ​ኩን፡ ​ለተ​መን፡ ​ፈው​ሰ፡ ​ኩን፡ ​ለአ​ፍኦ​ት፡ ​ፈው​ሰ፡ ​ኩን፡
                                        ​በማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡ ​ፈው​ሰ፡ ​ኩን፡ በ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ማር​ቆስ፡ ​ፈው​ሰ፡ ​ኩን፡ ​በሉ<fo:inline>ቂ (!)</fo:inline>​ስ፡
                                        ​ፈው​ሰ፡ ​ኩን፡ ​በዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​በ፬ወ ን ​ጌላ​ውያ​ን፡
                                        ​ኅድ​ግ፡ ​ይቤ​ሉከ፡ አ<fo:inline>ቡ (!)</fo:inline>፡ ​ወወ​ልድ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                        ​ከመ፡ ​ይፃ​እ፡ ​ሕም​ዙ፡ ​ለከ​ይሲ፡ ​በሐ ይ ​ለ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​ኢነ፡
                                        ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ኀደ​ጉሐ​ዋር​ያት።
                                        ​ለእ​መ፡ ​ርሁ​ቅ፡ ​ኣስ​ትዮ፡ ​ላክ​ደጊ​መከ​ማይ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 76v: Prayer about giving birth, CAe 6859.
                                        The prayer is partly in Gəʿəz and partly in Amharic.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus"/>
                                            ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ወሊ​ያ፡ ​በዘ፡ ​ቂል​ያስ፡ ​ተራ​ትሰ፡ ​ዘኖ​ምያ፡ ​ፍታ​ሕ፡
                                            ​ማሕ​ፀና፡ ​ለእ​መት​ከ፡ ​እገ​ሊ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ይጻ​እ፡
                                                ​ልጅ፡ ​ወእ​ንግ​ህ፡ ​ልጅ፡ ​በይ​ማ፡ ​ድግ​ም፡
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>7)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 76v: Short prayer in Amharic, CAe 6860.
                                        The prayer is in Amharic. </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">
                                            ​ቀን​ጠፋ፡ ​የቁ​መኛ፡ ​ነው፡ ​ምስ​ሪች ፤  ​ጊንዳ ፤ 
                                            ​የቁ​ራ፡ ​ስር ፤  ​አን​ዴል ፨ 
                                            ​የም​ድር፡ ​ኵሂላ ፨  ​ሱር፡ ​በትሪ ፨ 
                                            ​ደማ​ይቶ ፨  ​ጥር​ጊና ​ፍን ፨ 
                                            ዕ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ፀ፡ ​ምናሄ ፤ 
                                            ​አጋ​ም፡ ​ስር ፨  ​አየ፡ ​ስር ፨ 
                                            ​ኀቢ​ጸሊም ፤  ​ገመሮ ፨  ​እን​ሰ፡ ​ላል ፨ 
                                            ​ሰምዛ ፨  ​ነጭ ፨ 
                                            ​ሽን​ጉርቲ ፨  ​ኦል​ቲት ፨  ​ይህ​ነን ፨ 
                                            ​ጨምሮ ፨ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ይዳ፡ ​በብር ፨ 
                                            ​ቀለ​በት። ​ይም​ሶዋል ፨ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>8)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 77r: Short prayer, CAe 6861.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ዝሀ​ወት ፨  ​ዘአ​በረ፡ ​አጋዘ ፨ 
                                            ​ለአ​በወሀ ፨  ወ=​ሰሐበ ፨ 
                                            ​ሙሐ​ዘት ፨  ​አየ​አላፈ ፨ 
                                            ​ወፀ​በላ​ነ።  ​የመ​ጦሪ ፨ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>9)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 77v–78r: Short prayer for a scribe, CAe 6862.
                                        The text has been written on top of an illegible text written in pencil.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                                ​ሰሐ​ል፡ ​ሰሐ​ል፡ ​ሰሐ​ል፡ ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ​ጸጸ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​እዴ​የ፡
                                                ​ሰሐ​ል፡ ​ወየ​ማን​የ፡ ​አሕ​መላ​ምል፡ ​ለጺ​ሒፈ፡ ​ብር​ዕ፡ ​ወቀ​ለም፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ ​አፍ​ጌት፡
                                                ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ደቡ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ርኃ፡ ​ደመ​ና፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                                                ​መን​ጥሔ​ል፡ ​ድሜ​ሄላ​ዊ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​የሐ​ውሩ፡ ​ፀሐ​ይ፡ ​ወወ​ርኅ፡ ​በፍ​ጥረ​ተ፡
                                                ​ትእ​ዛዝ​ከ፡ ​ከማ​ሆሙ፡ ​አሩ​ፅ፡ ​የማ​ነ፡ ​እዴ​የ፡ ​ለጋ፡ ​በስ​መ፡
                                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ሎኤ፡ ​ኢላ​ኤ፡ ​ኢላ​ሄ፡ ​አሩ​ፅ፡ ​እዴ​የ፡
                                                ​ለገቢ  (fol. 78r)  ​ረ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ተግ​ባር፡ ​በሩ​ፋኤ​ል፡ ​ብር​ናዊ፡
                                                ​በክ​ሳብ​ኤል፡ ዘ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ያረ​ውፃ፡ ​ለፀ​ሐይ፡
                                                ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አሩ​ፅ፡ ​እዴ​የ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይጠ​ንቅ​ቅ፡ ​ለአ​ኂዘ፡ ​ብር​ዕ፡ ​ወእ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡
                                                ​እበ​ያቲ​ከ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ሐኬ​ት፡ ​ኦእ​ግዚ​እየ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                                ​አስተ ፡  ​ፋጥን<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                                ወ አ ​ስተ ፡ 
                                                ​ቃን​ዕ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ ​በቀ​ይ፡ ​ቀለ​ም፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​በወ​ረቀ​ት፡
                                                ​ጸሐ​ፍዕ​ስር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                                        Omitted word(s) have been added in the upper margin, almost invariably marked with a
                                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">tamallas</fo:inline>-sign
                                        (e.g. fols 19ra, 30rb, 57rb),
                                        in the margin (e.g. fols 50vb, 60rb) or interlineally (e.g. fols 39ra).
                                        As for deletions, there are examples of erasures with the subsequent addition of a new word in the erased space
                                        (e.g. fols 23va, 62rb, 65va) and the marking for deletion through strokes above and under words
                                        (e.g. fol. 7va).
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 74r: Pen trial in black ink.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፈቲ​ነ፡</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 77r: Pen trial in red ink.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​መጸ​ፈፈ​ቲን፡ ​ብር​ዕ፡ ​ወሐ​ልይ​ዋ፡ ​እም​ከር​ሠ፡ ​እሙ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: Note written above the drawing of a cross <!--or reference to cross description?-->, in which the ‘N’ has been written mirrored.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">INRI</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: Note in Latin, hardly understandable, probably indicating the names of person and places.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">
                                            Haleca G<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                                            re ab Aedi Bar<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>itari Adibara
                                            <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>leca S G G<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>A white sticker is glued to the inner side of the front board, on the top. The name of <fo:inline id="d1e48700PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> is printed on it
                                        (‘<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡ ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>’) and the signature ‘MS. Aeth. f. 25’ is written in pencil.
                                        Two additional stickers, forming the signature ‘Ms 27’ on it, are glued on the bottom of the same side.
                                        The shelfmark and textual content of the book (‘ MS Aeth. J-J. 27<!--<lb/>-->
                                        Widassie Maryan’),
                                        are indicated in pencil on the upper outer corner of fol. 1r.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
            <fo:inline id="d1e48719">Quarter cover</fo:inline>. The book is bound in wooden boards partially covered with reddish-brown leather.
                                
                                  The boards are flush with the bookblock and have external shallow bevels. The grain runs vertically.
                                
                                  The boards and the spine are partially covered with plain reddish-brown leather.
                                  The upper board is almost entirely covered, while only half of the lower board is. The turn-ins are not well adhered and are partially detached from the boards.
                                
                                  Brown <fo:inline id="d1e48737">slit-braid</fo:inline> endbands are present.
                                
                                  Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern. Two Z-plied threads are used.
                                  The sewing starts from the first quire where, for each pair of sewing stations, there is one length of thread,
                                  while in the rest of the quires there are two. The threads are knotted in the last quire.
                                
                                  Horizontal short stitches pierce the leather on the spine in two points (at the head and tail), thus fixing the endbands to the cover.
                                </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Foliation in pencil in the upper right corner (1–78/79). The folio
                                    numbers ‘28’ and ‘42’ have been given twice.
                                    The folio number ‘46’ has been skipped. The last folio has the
                                    folio numbers ‘78’ and ‘79’.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>10 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (Fols 1r–4v)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 5r–14v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 15r–24v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">2 (Fols 25r–26v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 27r–35v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 36r–44v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 45r–54v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 55r–64v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 65r–74v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (Fols 75r–78v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 5ra–72vb1–45–72: 2
                                    columns (15 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 33r. The characters per line are 17–21.The vertical ruled lines end at the upper and lower vertical pricks.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            125 × 88 mm (fol. 33r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            87 × 72 mm (fol. 33r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 8 mm, bottom: 28 mm, right: 7 mm, left: 8 mm, intercolumn: 10 mm (fol. 33r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 73r–76r73–7475–78: 1
                                    column (15 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 73r. The characters per line are 3–23.The vertical ruled lines end at the upper and lower vertical pricks.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            125 × 88 mm (fol. 33r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            93 × 73 mm (fol. 73r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 9 mm, bottom: 23 mm, right: 8 mm, left: 7 mm (fol. 73r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling pattern: 0/0/0/0  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0/0/C  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0/0/C  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A/0/0/C</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->19th or 20th century. 
                                    Fine handwriting. Occasional use of a ligature for ​ሌሉ in
                                    the word ​ሃሌ​ሉያ፡ (e.g. on fols 72v, 75r).
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    Holy names; several groups of lines on the incipit page, alternating with black lines;
                                    metatextual elements marking weekday sections and abbreviated
                                    refrains in ms_i1.1;
                                    abbreviated refrains in ms_i1.2;
                                    metatextual elements marking weekday sections and sections for
                                    the musical modes in ms_i1.3;
                                    metatextual elements marking antiphon types, the incipits of each model antiphon, and
                                    on a few occasions musical mode in ms_i1.4;
                                    numerals and musical modes ms_i1.5;
                                    occasionally elements of punctuation marks and numerals.
                                    Several of the additions (a2 #a9 #e4) have been written completely in red ink.
                                </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">The manuscript contains some interlace trials in ink
                                (fol. 1v) and pencil (fol. 3r) that were probably added 
                                later to the production unit, as well as a drawing and a diagram of uncertain date.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(1) Fol. 1r: <fo:inline>A quadrate monochrome cross filled with a pattern of interlaced strings.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(2) Fol. 2r: <fo:inline>A protective circle topped by a headband.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Holes resulting from parchment making are found on several folios, e.g. fols 13, 20, 25.
                                    Tears have been repaired at the moment of parchment production by sewing, e.g. on 1, 4, 65.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.
                                  The manuscript does not show evident traces of use.
                                  It is slightly damaged by humidity in the upper external corners. The ink is smudged on fols 18, 26
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth–mid-twentieth century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            nineteenth and the mid-twentieth century.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>Varia note 3 provides the only geographical name in
                          the manuscript (‘Adibara’), which,
                          however, could refer to various places (e.g. <fo:inline id="d1e48766LOC1079AdBarr">ʿĀd Barrāḥ</fo:inline>,
                          <fo:inline id="d1e48768LOC1129AddiBa">ʿĀddi Bāro</fo:inline>, and, less likely, <fo:inline id="d1e48770LOC1128AddiBa">ʿĀddi Barʿǝd</fo:inline>). It is possible
                          that the spelling ‘Haleca’ in the same note points to a Tigrinya-speaking context. The manuscript was purchased by <fo:inline id="d1e48772PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> 
                          through the bookseller <fo:inline id="d1e48774PRS13559Thomas">Alan G. Thomas</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                       bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e48779PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf25">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf25</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
