      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethb5"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. b. 5</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 32)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex379×315 mm, 216 fols (8 p. blank), 24 quires, 1712–1714.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e52492LIT4035SenkessarDL#FirstHalf">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 4ra–212rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: First half of the year</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">All proper names are given in the version of their first occurrence in the manuscript, except for very common Biblical
                                figures, whose English name is given. Hymns are designated as
                                ‘salām-hymn’ when starting with <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰላ​ም፡</fo:inline> and as ‘ʿārke-hymn’ when starting
                            with other words.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e52506LIT4035SenkessarDL#MaskIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 4ra–4rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Introduction for the first half of the year</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     (fol. 4ra) 
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ አ ​ሐዱ፡ ​አም​ላክ።
                                     ​ዘቀ​ድሕ​ዎ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ፡
                                    ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​መም​ህራ​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨  ​አብ፡ ​ክቡ​ር፡ ​አባ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡
                                    ​ቆጶ​ስ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​አት​ሪብ፡ ​ወመ​ሊግ ፨  ​ወአ​ብ፡ ​ክቡ​ር፡ ​አባ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡
                                    ​ቆጶ​ስ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ቡር​ልስ ፤
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​ዘጻ​ድቃ​ን፡ ​ወዘ​ሰማ​ዕታ​ት፡ ​ወዘ​ሊቃ​ነ፡ ጳ ​ጳሳ​ት፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወዘ​ገዳ​ማው​ያን፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ት፡  ​ከመ፡ ​ይግ​በሩ፡
                                        ​ተዝ​ካሮሙ ። 
                                    ​ወያ​ንብ​ቡ፡ ​ገድ​ሎሙ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​አሚ​ረ፡ ​እም​ሠር​ቀ፡ ​አሚ​ሩ፡ ለ  (b)  ​መስ​ከረ​ም፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ተ ​ፍጻ​ሜተ፡ ​ዓመት ፨  ወ ​ኮነ፡
                                        ​አስ​ተጋ​ብአ​ቶሙ፡  ​ለዝ​ንቱ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፍ፡ በ ​፱፻፡ ​፷፡ ​ወ፫፡
                                        ​ዓመ​ተ፡  ​ሰማ​ዕታ​ት፡ ​ንጹ​ሓን ፨
                                    ​ጸሎ​ቶሙ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቶሙ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ራኒ​ሆሙ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e52571PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡
                                                ​ማር​ያም፡
                                        </fo:inline> ወ<fo:inline id="d1e52576PRS13078NewayaM">​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡
                                        ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ልጋ​ት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e52590LIT4035SenkessarDL#Maskaram">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 4rb–46va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                     Maskaram
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e52596LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask1">
               <fo:inline>I-2-1) Fols 4rb–7rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Maskaram
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e52602LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask1Beginning">
               <fo:inline>I-2-1-1) Fols 4rb–4va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Beginning of the year</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​መስ​ከረ​ም፡ ​ቡሩክ ፨ 
                                            ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ርእ​ሰ፡ ​ዓመ​ታት፡ ​ዘግ​ብጽ፡ ​ወዘ​ኢት​ዮጵ​ያ፡ ​መዓ​ልቱ፡ ​ወሌ​ሊቱ፡ ​ለዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ወር​ኅ፡
                                            ​ዕሩ​ይ፡  ​፲፡  ወ ፪ ፡ ​ሰዓቱ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​የሐ​ፅፅ፡ ​እም​አሚ​ሩ፡ ​ለወ​ርኃ፡ ​መስ​ከረም ። 
                                            ​ወይ​እቲ፡ ​ርእ​ሰ፡ ​ዓው​ደ፡ ​ዓመ​ት፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​ዘግብ ​ጽ፡
                                                ​ወዘ​ኢት​ዮጵ​ያ። ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ይደ​ልወ​ነ፡ ​ከመ፡  ​ንግ​በር፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​ዓበ​የ፡
                                            ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ንጽ​ሕና ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​ወዕ​ውራ​ን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይር​አዩ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ወ ​እሱ​ራን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይት​ፈት​ሑ፡ ​ወእ​ስብ​ክ፡ ​ለዓ​መተ፡ 
                                            ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ኅሪት ፨  ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ወት​ባር​ክ፡ ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ዓመ​ት፡ ​በም​ሕረ​ትከ ፨ 
                                            ​ወይ​ጸግ​ቡ፡   (fol. 4va)   ​ጠላ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​እም​በረ​ከትከ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
