                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54508LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29SalJohn">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-6) Fol. 45rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to John the Baptist</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54516LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29SalJohn2">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-7) Fol. 45rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to John the Baptist</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54524LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29SalChrist">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-8) Fols 45rc–45va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Christ (?)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54533LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30) Fols 45va–46vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Mask30</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54539LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30Athanasius">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-1) Fols 45va–46ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the miracle of the salvation of Athanasius.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54547LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30Gorgoryos">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-2) Fol. 46ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Gorgoryos.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54555LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30John">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-3) Fol. 46ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of John and James.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54564LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30Salusi">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-4) Fols 46rb–46rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Śālusi.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡  ​አባ፡ ​ሣሉሲ ፨  ​ዝን​ቱ፡
                                            ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​መስ​ተጋ​ድል፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ረሰ​የ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​ዓብደ ፨  ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ጾሙ፡ ​ወጸ​ሎቱ፡
                                            ​በኅ​ቡእ፡ ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ኢይ​ጼሊ፡ ​ወኢ​ይጸ​ውም ፤  ​ወለ​ለ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ጽባ​ሕ፡
                                            ​ይገ​ብር፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ሲሲ​ተ፡ ​ንስ​ቲተ፡ ​ሣዕ​ረ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​ወበ​ጊዜ፡ ​ሰርክ<fo:inline>፡
                                             (!)</fo:inline>​ኒ፡ ​ይበ​ልዕ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አኃው ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዓ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ፈቀ​ደ፡ ​ይን​ሥአ፡
                                            ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ቆብ​ዕ፡ ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እም​ኔሃ ፨  ​ወለ​ለ፡ ​ይወ​ስድ​ዋ፡ ​ትት​መየ​ጥ፡
                                            ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ደብ​ር፡ ​ወከ​መዝ፡ ​ኮነ፡  ፫ ​ጊዜ ፨  ​ዝኩ​ኒ፡ ​መነ​ኮስ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡
                                            ​ብዙ​ኅ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፤  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይም​ሕሮ​ሙ፡ ​በጸ​ሎቱ፡ ​ለፍ​ቁሩ፡
                                                  <fo:inline id="d1e54606PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ወእ​ኁሁ፡
                                                  <fo:inline id="d1e54611PRS13078NewayaM"> ​ንዋ​የ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                                  ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54625LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30SalSalusi">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-5) Fol. 46rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾabbā Śālusi.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54633LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30SalJohn">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-6) Fols 46rc–46va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to John and James.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54641LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30SalDabra">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-7) Fols 46va–46vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the scholars of Dabra Māryām ʾAbsādi.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54649LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30SalAthanasius">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-8) Fols 46vb–46vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Athanasius.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                                እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡  ​ሠር​ዓ፡ ​ወዓ​ቀመ፡ ​ተዝ​ካሮ ፤  ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ለአ​ትና​ቴዎ​ስ፡   (c)   ​ዘያ​ፈቅሮ ፨  ​አመ፡
                                                ​አብ​እዎ፡ ​ባሕ​ረ፡ ​ለሕ​ማም፡ ​ወለ​ተፅ​ዕሮ ፨ 
                                                ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይኤ​ዝዝ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ቲሁ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይጹ​ሩ፡ ​ሐመሮ ፨  ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ያዓ​ድው​ዎ፡ ​ለበ​ጺሕ፡ ​ሀገሮ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54689LIT4035SenkessarDL#MaskSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-2-31) Fol. 46vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Maskaram.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ምን​ባብ፡ ​ዘወ​ርኃ፡ ​መስ​ከረ​ም፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡  ​ወላ​ዕሌ​ነ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                                ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54714LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqemt">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 46va–78vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Teqemt</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54720LIT4035SenkessarDL#TeqeIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-3-1) Fol. 46va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: TeqeIntroduction</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ወ ​ርኃ፡ ጥ ​ቅም ​ት፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ መ ​ዓል​ቱ፡  ፲ ወ ፩ ፡ ​ሰዓት ፨  ​ወእም ​ዝ፡ ​የሐ​ፅፅ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54763LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2) Fols 46va–47rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Teqe1</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54769LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1Anestasya">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-1) Fols 46va–47ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAnǝsṭāsyā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​አመ፡ ፩ ​ለጥ​ቅም​ት፡  ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ኮነ​ት፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                            ​አን​ስጣ​ስያ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕተ ፨  ​ዛቲ፡ ​መስ​ትጋድ ል ​ት፡ ​ኮነ​ት፡
                                            ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ሮሜ፡ ​ወኮ​ኑ፡ ​አበ​ዊሃ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያነ ፨  ​ወሐ​ፀን​ዋ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ክብ​ር፡
                                            ​ወበ​ሠና​ይ፡ ​ሥር​ዓት፡ ​ወበ​ትም ህ ​ርት፡ ​በቋ​ዒት፡
                                            ​ለነ​ፍስ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋ፡ ​ወበ​ትም​ህር​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ኢተ​መይ​ጠት፡ ​እም​ሃይ​ማኖ​ታ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሀለ​ወት፡
                                            ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​ዓቢ​ይ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረዝ፡ ​አዘ​ዘ፡ ​መኰ​ንን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይም​ትሩ፡ ​ርእ​ሳ፡ ​በሰ​ይፍ፡
                                            ​ወአ​ንከ​ሩ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ነበ​ሩ፡ ​ህየ፡ ​እም​ጽን​ዓ፡ ​ነፍሳ ፤  ​ወጸ​ለየ​ት፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ነዋ​ኃ፡
                                            ​ወአ​ድነ​ነት፡ ​ርእ​ሳ፡ ​ለሰ​ይፍ፡ ​ወመ​ተራ፡ ​ርእ​ሳ፡ ​በሰ​ይፍ፡ ​ለቅ​ድስ​ት፡ ​አን​ስጣ​ስያ፡
                                            ​ወነ​ሥአ​ት፡ ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                            ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                                  <fo:inline id="d1e54808PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54821LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1Heriton">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-2) Fols 47ra–47rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Ḫǝriṭon</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54829LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1SalAnestasya">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-3) Fol. 47rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAnǝsṭāsyā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54838LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1SalMary">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-4) Fol. 47rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Mary</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54847LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3) Fols 47rb–47vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        2nd Ṭǝqǝmt
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54853LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2Sawiros">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3-1) Fols 47rb–47vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Sāwiros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54861LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2Tekla">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3-2) Fol. 47vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Tekalā and Hǝryāqos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54869LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2SalSawiros">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3-3) Fol. 47vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Sāwiros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54879LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe3">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4) Fols 47vc–48rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        3rd Ṭǝqǝmt
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54885LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe3Semon">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4-1) Fols 47vc–48rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Simeon
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54893LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe3Giyorgis">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4-2) Fol. 48rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Giyorgis
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54901LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe3SalTaodra">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4-3) Fols 48rb–48rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Tāʾodrā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54910LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe3SalSemon">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4-4) Fol. 48rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Simeon
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e54919LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe4">
               <fo:inline>I-3-5) Fols 48rc–49ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        4th Ṭǝqǝmt
                        
                     </fo:inline>
