               <fo:inline>I-3-31) Fols 78va–78vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        30th Ṭǝqǝmt
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56524LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe30Abreham">
               <fo:inline>I-3-31-1) Fols 78va–78vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAbrǝhām bāḥtāwi</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56532LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe30Falibuna">
               <fo:inline>I-3-31-2) Fol. 78vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Fālibunā and other saints</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ተዝካ ​ሮሙ፡ ​ለፋ​ሊቡ​ና፡ ​ወኮ​ይና፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ርእ​ዮተ፡ ​ርእ​ሱ፡
                                            ​ለዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​መጥ​ምቅ፡ ​ወመ​ርቴ​ስ፡ ​ወማ​ርሳ ፤
                                            ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይም​ሐሮ፡ ​በጸ​ሎቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለፍ​ቁሮ​ሙ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e56549PRS13078NewayaM">​ንዋ​የ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56563LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe30SalAbreham">
               <fo:inline>I-3-31-3) Fol. 78vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAbrǝhām</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ሰላ​ም፡  ለ ​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡ ​ነዳይ ፤  ​እም​ነ፡ ​ጥሪ​ት፡ ​ማሳ​ኒ፡ ​ወእ​ምኃ​ላፊ፡
                                            ​ንዋይ ፨  ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይሴ​ፎ፡ ​ረኪ​በ፡
                                            ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማይ ፤  ​ይከ​ድን፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡
                                            ​በጸ​ርቅ፡ ​ብሉይ ፨  ​ወኅ​ፍነ፡ ​ዓተ​ር፡
                                            ​ይሴ​ሰይ፡ ​ርኁ​ሰ፡ ​በማይ ፨ 
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56601LIT4035SenkessarDL#TeqeSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-3-32) Fol. 78vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Ṭǝqǝmt
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ጥቅ​ምት፡ ​በረ​ድኤ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ት፡
                                        ​ወአ​ኰቴ​ት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ሜን ፨
                                        ​ለዘ​ጸሐ​ፎ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e56617PRS13094GabraKr">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ወለ​ዘአ​ጽሐ​ፎ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e56623PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ወእ​ኁሁ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e56626PRS13078NewayaM">​ንዋ​የ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ኅቡ​ረ፡ ​ይም​ሐሮ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማያ<fo:inline>ተ (!)</fo:inline>፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                            ​ወአ​ሜን ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56645LIT4035SenkessarDL#Hedar">
               <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 79ra–108vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Hedar</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56651LIT4035SenkessarDL#HedaIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-4-1) Fol. 79ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: HedaIntroduction</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመን ​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወር​ኃ፡  ​ኅዳ​ር፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​መዓ​ልቱ፡
                                                ​፲፡ ​ሰዓ​ት፤  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​የሐ​ፅፅ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56677LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda1">
               <fo:inline>I-4-2) Fols 79ra–79rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Ḫǝdar
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e56683LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda1Maksimos">
               <fo:inline>I-4-2-1) Fols 79ra–79rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Maksimos, Numanfyos, Fiqṭor and Filǝṗṗos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​አመ፡  ፩ ፡ ​ለኅዳ ​ር፡ ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ኮኑ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ መ ​ስተ​ጋድ​ላን፡
                                            ​ሰማ​ዕታ​ት፡ ​መክ​ሲሞ​ስ፡ ​ወመ​ንፍ​ዮስ፡ ​ወፊ​ቅጦ​ርዮ​ስ፡ ​ወፊ​ልጶስ ፨  ​እሉ፡ ​መስ​ተጋ​ድላ​ን፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡
                                            ​ኮኑ፡ ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​አፍ​ራቅ​ያ፡ ​ወእሙ ​ንቱ ​ሰ፡
                                            ​አኃ​ው፡ ​በመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​በሥጋ ፨  ​ወተ​ጋብ​ኡ፡ ​ኅቡ​ረ፡
                                            ​በበ​ይና​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ፍቅ​ሩ፡ ​ለክ​ርስ​ቶስ። </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወገ​ብሩ፡ ​ቦሙ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዘ፡ ​ወብ​ዙኃ​ን፡ ​እለ፡
                                            ​ነበ​ሩ፡ ​ህየ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​ትዕ​ግሥ​ቶሙ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱሳ​ን፡ ​ሰማ​ዕታት ፨  ​ወአ​ምኑ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት ፤  ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​አዘ​ዘ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡
                                            ​ከመ፡ ​ይም​ትሩ፡ ​አር​እስ​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ግም​ድዎ​ሙ፡ ​በበ፡ ​መን​ፈቆ​ሙ፡ ​በአ​ስይ​ፍት፡ ​በበ፡ ​ምታ​ር፡
                                            ​ወበ​እን​ተዝ፡ ​ነሥ​ኡ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ፡
                                                  <fo:inline id="d1e56722PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                                  ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
