               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ኮነ፡ አ ​ናን​ዮስ፡ ​ዘዓ​ምድ፡ ​ወጴ​ጥሮ​ስ፡  ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e58533PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                                                ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ኵል​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨  ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                                ፨
                                                ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58556LIT4035SenkessarDL#HedaSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-4-30-5) Fol. 108rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Ḫǝdār</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​በዝ​የ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​በወ​ርኃ፡ ​ኅዳር ፨  ​በሰ​ላመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ስቡ​ሕ፡
                                            ​ወል​ዑል፡ ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​ስሙ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​እም​ኀቤ​ነ፡ ​ወለ​ነ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡ ​እም​ኀቤሁ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ይሴ​ፎ፡ ​ኪያሁ ፨  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወጣ​ኒ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ፈጻሚ ፨  ​ወቦ​ቱ፡ ​ይሠ​ለጥ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ግብር ፨  ​ኪያ​ሁ፡ ​ናመ​ልክ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ረድ​ኤት​ነ፡
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58590LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda30SalMartyrs">
               <fo:inline>I-4-30-6) Fol. 108rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the martyrs under Diocletian</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58598LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda30SalGabraM">
               <fo:inline>I-4-30-7) Fol. 108rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Gabra Masqal</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58606LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda30Sal">
               <fo:inline>I-4-30-8) Fols 108rc–108va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58614LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda30SalAkayyeyos">
               <fo:inline>I-4-30-9) Fols 108va–108vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAkāyyǝyos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58623LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda30SalGabraM2">
               <fo:inline>I-4-30-10) Fol. 108vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Gabra Masqal</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለከ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​ክቡ​ር፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ትት​ፌሣ​ሕ፡ ​በኃ​ይሉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨  ​ገብ​ረ፡  ​መስ​ቀል፡  ​መዋ​ዒ፡ ​ወመግ<fo:inline>[ረ]</fo:inline>​ሬ፡ ​ፀር ፨  ​በመ​ዋዕ​ሊከ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ወፍ​ቅር ፨  ​ማኅ​ሌተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​መዝ​ሙር፡  ​ተከ​ሥተ፡ ​በም​ድር።
                                            <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58663LIT4035SenkessarDL#HedaSupplication">
               <fo:inline>I-4-31) Fols 108vb–108vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Supplication for Ḫǝdār</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ለዘ​ጸሐ​ፎ፡ ​ወለ​ዘ፡ ​አጽ​ሐፎ፡ ​ወለ​ዘ፡ ​አን​በቦ፡ ​ወለ​ዘተ​ርጐ​ሞ፡ ​ወለ​ዘሰ​ምዓ፡ ​ቃላ​ቲሁ፡ ​ኅቡ  (c)  ​ረ፡ ​ይም​ሐረ​ነ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​በጸ​ሎተ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ሙጻ​የ፡ ​ስእ​ለታት ፨  ​ወጸ​ሎተ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን ፨  ​ወሰ​ማዕ​ታት፡ ​ወበ​ትን​ብል​ናሆ​ሙ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ለት​ጉሃ​ን፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ<fo:inline>ኔ (!)</fo:inline>። 
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58694LIT4035SenkessarDL#HedaSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-4-32) Fol. 108vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Ḫǝdār</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​ይዕ​ቀቦ፡ ​ለኃ​ጥእ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e58708PRS13094GabraKr">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                            ​ወአ​ሜን።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58719LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahsas">
               <fo:inline>I-5) Fols 109ra–143vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Tahsas</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58725LIT4035SenkessarDL#TahsIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-5-1) Fol. 109ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Introduction for Tāḫśāś
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                         ፩ ፡ ​አማ​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ወ ​ርኃ፡ ​ታኅ​ሣሥ፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​መዓ ​ልቱ፡  ፱ ፡
                                        ​ሰዓት ፤  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡
                                        ​ይት ​ዌሰ​ክ።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58761LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2) Fols 109ra–110ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Tāḫśāś
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58767LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1Elyas">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-1) Fols 109ra–109rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾElyās</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​አመ፡ ​፩፡ ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ 
                                            ​አስ​ተር​እዮ​ተ፡ ​ኤል​ያስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡
                                            ​እስ​ራኤል ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ኤል​ያስ፡ ​ቀና​ኢ፡ ​እም​ዘመ​ደ፡
                                            ​ሌዊ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወስ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ቡሁ፡ ​ኢያ​ሴን​ዩ፡ ​ወስ​ማ፡ ​ለእ​ሙ፡
                                            ​ቶና ፤  ​ወተ​ብህ​ለ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አሁ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ተወ​ልደ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡
                                             ፪ ፡ ​ዕደ​ው፡ ​ብር​ሃና​ውያ​ነ፡ ​ይሰ​ግዱ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ወጠ​ብለ​ልዎ፡ ​በእ​ሳት፡
                                            ​ህየ​ንተ፡ ​አጽ​ርቅ​ት፡ ​ዘይ​ጠበ​ልሉ፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​ሕፃ​ናተ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ይመ ​ጽእ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ ​ር፡ ​ወይ​በው​እ፡ ​ውስ​ቴቶ​ሙ፡
                                             ​ወይ​ትነ​ሥኡ፡ ​ሕያ​ዋኒ​ሆሙ፡  ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ይከ​ውን፡ ​ፍር​ሃተ፡
                                            ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘይ​ሬእ​ዮሙ ፨ 
                                            ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ጸው​ዖሙ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​የዓ​ርጉ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​በደ​መና ፨ 
                                            ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ይከ​ውን፡ ​ዓቢ​ይ፡ ​ድል​ቅል​ቅ፡ ​ወይ​መው​ቱ፡
                                             ​፸፻ ፡ ​ነፍስ ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e58816PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ደቂ​ቀ፡
                                            ​ቂር​ቆስ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58830LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1Nabute">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-2) Fols 109rb–109rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Nābute</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58838LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1Petros">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-3) Fols 109rc–109vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Ṗeṭros, the bishop of Gazā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58847LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1Yohannes">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-4) Fols 109vb–109vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Yoḥannǝs the patriarch</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58855LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1Atnsayos">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-5) Fols 109vc–110ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā  ʾAtnāsyos the patriarch</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58863LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1SalMary">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-6) Fol. 110ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the birth of Mary</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58871LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1SalElyas">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-7) Fol. 110ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾElyās</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58879LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1SalPetros">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-8) Fol. 110ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Ṗeṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58887LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1SalYohannes">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-9) Fol. 110ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Yoḥannǝs</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58896LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs2">
               <fo:inline>I-5-3) Fols 110ra–110vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        2nd Tāḫśāś
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58902LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs2ThreeYouths">
               <fo:inline>I-5-3-1) Fols 110ra–110rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the Three Youths</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58910LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs2ServantsFasiladas">
               <fo:inline>I-5-3-2) Fols 110rb–110rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the servants of Fāsiladas</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58918LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs2Hor">
               <fo:inline>I-5-3-3) Fols 110rc–110va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Hor</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58927LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs2Abkeften">
               <fo:inline>I-5-3-4) Fol. 110va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAbkǝftǝn and other saints</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58938LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs2SalYouths">
               <fo:inline>I-5-3-5) Fol. 110va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the Three Youths</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58946LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs2SalHor">
               <fo:inline>I-5-3-6) Fols 110va–110vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Hor</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58956LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs3">
               <fo:inline>I-5-4) Fols 110vb–111rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        3rd Tāḫśāś
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58962LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs3Mary">
               <fo:inline>I-5-4-1) Fols 110vb–111rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the presentation of Mary to the temple</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58970LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs3Fanuel">
               <fo:inline>I-5-4-2) Fol. 111rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Fānuʾel</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e58978LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs3SalMary">
               <fo:inline>I-5-4-3) Fol. 111rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the entry of Mary to the temple</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
