               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ይገ​ብሩ፡  ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ኢት​ዮጵያ ፤ 
                                            ​ተዝ​ካረ፡ ​ሕፃ​ናት፡ ​ዘቤ​ተ፡ ​ልሔ​ም፡ ​ዘቀ​ተሎ​ሙ፡ ​ሄሮ​ድስ፡ ​ዓላዊ ፨ 
                                            ​ወዜ​ናሆ​ሙሰ፡ ​ናሁ፡ ​ጽሑ​ፍ፡ ​አመ፡  ፫ ፡ ​ለጥር ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኵል​ነ፡ ​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​ቂር​ቆስ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                                ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e60875LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs30SalChrist">
               <fo:inline>I-5-31-6) Fol. 143va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the birth of Christ</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e60883LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs30SalYohannes">
               <fo:inline>I-5-31-7) Fols 143va–143vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Yoḥannǝs</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e60891LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs30SalYohannes2">
               <fo:inline>I-5-31-8) Fols 143vb–143vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Yoḥannǝs</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e60900LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs30SalZakaryas">
               <fo:inline>I-5-31-9) Fol. 143vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Zakāryās</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለዘ​ካር​ያስ፡ ​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ነገ​ደ፡ ​ይጻ​ሙ፡
                                            ​አመ፡ ​ይር​አይ፡ <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline> ​ወይ​ነጽ​ር፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ጾሙ ፨ 
                                            ​ተመ​ናት፡  ፫ <fo:inline>ዘይሴስሙ (!)</fo:inline>፨  ​ሶበ፡ ​ጸው​ዕዎ፡ ​ለአ​በ፡ ​ምኔ​ት፡ 
                                             ​በስሙ ፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​መን​ክሩ፡ ​ደን​ገፁ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​መድ​ምሙ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e60938LIT4035SenkessarDL#SubscriptionTahs">
               <fo:inline>I-5-32) Fol. 143vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                       Subscription for Tāḫśāś
                        
                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ታኅ​ሣሥ፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​በሥ​ምረ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ፈቃ​ደ፡ ​ወልዱ ፤ 
                                        ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወበ​ፍቅ​ረ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ጰራ​ቅሊ​ጦስ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        ​ወኢ​ትር​ሥዑ​ኒ፡ ​ለጸ​ሐፊ​ሃ፡ ​ኃጥ​እ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e60955PRS13094GabraKr">​ገብ​ረ፡  ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e60967LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr">
               <fo:inline>I-6) Fols 143va–183vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Terr</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e60973LIT4035SenkessarDL#TerrIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-6-1) Fol. 143va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Introduction for Ṭǝrr
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                         ፩ ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​ወር ​ኃ፡ ​ጥር፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​፲፡ ​ሰዓ​ቱ፡ ወ ​እም​ዝ፡ ​ይት​ዌሰክ ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e61003LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr1">
               <fo:inline>I-6-2) Fols 143va–145rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Ṭǝrr
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e61009LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr1Estifanos">
               <fo:inline>I-6-2-1) Fols 143va–144ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of St Stephen the Protomartyr
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​አመ፡ ​አሚ ​ሩ፡ ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ፡ 
                                            ​እስ​ጢፋ​ኖስ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕተ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ዲያ​ቆና​ት፡ ​ወቀ​ዳሜ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕት ፨ 
                                            ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ስም​ዓ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አሁ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ምሉ​አ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ወኃ​ይል፡ ​ወይ​ገብ​ር፡
                                            ​ተአ​ምራ​ተ፡ ​ወመ​ንክ​ራተ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​አሕ​ዛብ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ወሰ​ገደ፡ ​በብ​ረኪ​ሁ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ተወ​ከፋ፡ ​ለነ​ፍስ​የ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ኢት​ኈል​ቍ፡ ​ሎሙ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ ፤ 
                                            ​ወተ​መሰ​ለ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እግ​ዚኡ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​መሃ​ይም​ናን፡ ​ወጾ​ሩ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ወላ​ሀዉ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሁ፡
                                            ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ወቀ​በርዎ ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቱ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሩ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e61038PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
