               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ስም​ዓ፡  ​ኮኑ፡ ​፲ወ​፫፡ ​፻፻፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ማኅ​በራ​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ኦርኒ ፨ 
                                            ​ወተ​ዝካ​ረ፡ ​ዕረ​ፍቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለጻ​ድቃ​ን፡ ​ዘዴ​ጔ፡ ​ዘባ​ረኮ​ሙ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሀለ​ዉ፡ ​ኅቡ​ረ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡
                                            ​ማኅ​በር ፨
                                            ​ጸሎ​ቶሙ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቶሙ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ደቂ​ቁ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ቂር​ቆስ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕት፡
                                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63185LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30SalMinas">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-8) Fol. 183rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Minās</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63193LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30SalAkrestros">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-9) Fol. 183rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAkrǝsṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63204LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30SalTeqala">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-10) Fol. 183rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Mārtā, Māryā and Ṭeqalā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63212LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30SalOrni">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-11) Fol. 183rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾOrni</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63220LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30SalComOrni">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-12) Fol. 183va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the companions of ʾOrni</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​እብ​ል፡ ​ብዙ​ኃን፡ ​አእ​ላፋት ፨ 
                                            ​እለ፡ ​ነጺ​ሮሙ፡ ​አም​ኑ፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ፡ ​ኦር​ኒ፡ ​እሞት ፨ 
                                            ​እሉ፡ ​አኃ​ው፡ ​ዘእ​ምአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ጥም​ቀት ፨ 
                                            ​ይሰ​ውሩ​ኒ፡ ​በጽ​ድቆ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ጌጋ​ይየ፡ ​ክሡት ፨ 
                                            ​ኃፍ​ረተ፡ ​ባዕ​ሉ፡ ​ፍጹ​መ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይሤ​ውር፡ ​ቤት ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63255LIT4035SenkessarDL#SubscriptionTerr">
               <fo:inline>I-6-32) Fol. 183vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Ṭǝrr</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በዝ​የ፡ ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​በወ​ርኃ፡ ​ጥር፡ ​በሰ​ላሙ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወበ​ሥም​ረቱ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ፡
                                        ​ወበ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨ 
                                        ​ዘሎ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወክ​ብር፡ ​እም​አፈ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ፍጡ​ር፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63276LIT4035SenkessarDL#SupplicationTerr">
               <fo:inline>I-6-33) Fol. 183vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Supplication for Ṭǝrr</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ለዘ​ጸሐ​ፎ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e63285PRS13094GabraKr">​ገብ​ረ፡  ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ወለ​ዘ፡
                                        ​አጽ​ሐፍ​ዎ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e63290PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ወ<fo:inline id="d1e63295PRS13078NewayaM">​ንዋ​የ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ወለ​ዘ፡ ​አን​በቦ፡ ​ወለ​ዘ፡
                                        ​ሰም​ዖ፡ ​ወለ​ዘተ​ርጐሞ ፤ 
                                        ​ኅቡ​ረ፡ ​ይምሐ<fo:inline>ረ (!)</fo:inline>፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63320LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakkatit">
               <fo:inline>I-7) Fols 184ra–212rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Yakkatit</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63326LIT4035SenkessarDL#YakkIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-7-1) Fol. 184ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Introduction for Yakkātit
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                         ፩ ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                         ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​የካ​ቲት፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ መ ​ዓል​ቱ፡
                                         ፲ ወ ፩ ፡
                                        ​ሰዓት ፨ 
                                        ​ወእም ​ዝ፡ ​ይት​ዌሰ​ክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63362LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2) Fols 184ra–185ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Yakkātit
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63368LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1Council">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-1) Fols 184ra–184vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the council of Constantinople</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​አመ፡ ​፩፡ ለ ​የካ​ቲት፡ ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ጉባ​ኤ፡ ​ማኅ​በረ፡ ​አበ​ው፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡
                                      ፻ ወ ፶ ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ሳት፡
                                     ​እለ፡ ​ተጋ​ብኡ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፤ ​ቍስ​ጥን​ጥንያ ፤  ​በመ​ዋዕ​ለ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ቱ፡ ​ለን​ጉሥ፡
                                     ​ቴዎ​ዶስ​ዮስ፡ ​ዘየ​ዓቢ ፨ 
                                     ​ወኮ​ነ፡ <fo:inline>ተጋአቶሙ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መቅ​ዶን​ዮስ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ቍስ​ጥን​ጥን​ያ፡ ​ወክ​ሕዶ፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡
                                     ​በእ​ከየ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ፍጡ​ር፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ፍጡ​ራን ፨
                                 </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ሠር​ዑ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ማኅ​በር፡ ​ጉባ​ኤ፡ ​ቀነ​ኖና፡ <fo:inline>ው (!)</fo:inline>​እሙ​ንቱ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​እደ​ዊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ለኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ይእ​ዜ፡ ​ይገ​ብሩ፡
                                            ​ሕጎ​ሙ። ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ተጋ​ብአ​ቶሙ፡ ​ለእ​ሉ፡ ​አበ​ው፡
                                             ፻ ወ ፶ ፡
                                            ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ሳት፡ ​በዓ​መተ፡  ​፶፻ ፡
                                            ወ ​፰፻ ፡
                                             ፹ ወ ፪ ፡
                                            ​ለፍ​ጥረ​ተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።
                                             ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሮሙ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e63426PRS13077TaklaM">​ተክ​ለ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ኵል​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63440LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1ConsecrationPetros">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-2) Fols 184vb–184vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the consecration of the church of Ṗeṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63448LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1Asokanafer">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-3) Fol. 184vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAsokānāfǝr and his wife</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63460LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1SalMary">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-4) Fol. 184vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the birth of Mary</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63468LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1SalCouncil">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-5) Fols 184vc–185ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the participants of the council of Constantinople</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63476LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1SalConsecrationPetros">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-6) Fol. 185ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the consecration of the church of Ṗeṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63485LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3) Fols 185ra–187vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        2nd Yakkātit
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63491LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2Langinos">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-1) Fols 185ra–185va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Langinos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63499LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2Pawli">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-2) Fols 185va–187rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Ṗawli</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63507LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2Tomas">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-3) Fols 187rb–187vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of a miracle of Thomas</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63516LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2SalTomas">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-4) Fol. 187vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Thomas</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63524LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2SalPawli">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-5) Fol. 187vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Ṗāwli</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63532LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2SalLanginos">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-6) Fol. 187vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Langinos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63542LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4) Fols 187vb–189ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        3rd Yakkātit
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63548LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3Yaqob">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4-1) Fols 187vb–188rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Yāʿqob</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63556LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3TranslatioEfrem">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4-2) Fols 188rb–188rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the translatio of St Ephrem the Syrian
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63564LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3Ebloy">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4-3) Fols 188rc–188vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā ʿƎbloy</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e63575LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3Zaynun">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4-4) Fols 188vb–188vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Zaynun</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
