      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethg45"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 45 (R)</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 33)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment scroll1858×112 mm, 950×112 mm, 920×112 mm (weight: 93g),  fols, nineteenth–twenty-first century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67090LIT6714PPIllness">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r1–1r17: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against all illness, containing  ʾasmāt  and supplications to Christ, CAe 6714.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​ወው​ዱስ፡ ​ዘሣ​ረረ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                በ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​ኦ፡ ​መሐ​ረነ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​ኦ፡ ​መሐ​ከነ፡
                                እ ​ግዚ ​ኦ፡ ​ተሠ​ሃለ​ነ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለወ​ልድ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                ​ቅዱ ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አማ​ልክ​ት፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወእ​ምኵ​ሉ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ወሕ​ማም፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ ​ወለ​ተ፡ <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67123LIT7363WaGassu">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 1r17–1r21: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘And the face of (?) the Perfect One in the darkness – the Devil feared and was afraid…’ (​ወገ​ጹ፡ ​ዘፍ​ጹም፡ ​በጽ​ልመ​ት፡ ​ፈር​ሃ፡ ​ወደ​ንገ​ጸ፡ ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ፡), CAe 7363.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወገ​ጽ፡ ​ዘፍ​ፁም፡ ​በጽ​ልመ​ት፡ ​ፈር​ሃ፡ ​ወደ​ንገ​ፀ፡  ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ፡ ​ርእ​ዮ፡ ​ብሁ​ተ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በሲ​ኦል፡ ​በዝ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​መለ​ኮት​ከ፡
                                ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e67134PRS13850WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሰን​በት፡ ​ትበ​ርህ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67145LIT6715PPQwerdat">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 1r21–1r30: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against stomach ache ( qʷǝrḍat ), 
                    containing ʾasmāt, CAe 6715.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​ኪስ፡ ​ኪስ፡ ​ኪስ፡ ​አራ​ኪስ፡ ​ስር​ንኪ​ስ፡ ​ስር​ዋጽ፡
                            ​ምር​ዋጽ፡ ​ስር፡ ​ነኬ​ር፡ ​ሲቃ፡ ​ወጼ​ቃ፡ ​ወቤ​ቓ፡ ​ድማ​ኄል፡ ​አዶ​ናይ፡ ​ቄጼ​ቤ፡ ​ቄጼ​ቤ፡ ​ቄጼ​ቤ፡
                         ​ቄፌ​ኑ፡ ​ቄፌ​ኑ፡ ​ቄፌ​ኑ፡ ​ቡያ​ክ፡ ​ቡያ​ክ፡ ​ሞሊ፡ ​ሞሊ፡ ​ሞሊ፡ ​ኪያ​ሞሌ፡ ​ኪያ​ሞሌ፡ ​ኪያ​ሞሌ፡ ​ዘአ​ርጋ​እክ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡
                                ​በረ​ድ፡ ​ወነ​ፋስ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አር​ግዕ፡ ​ወአ​ቁም፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቁር​ፀት፡ ​እም​ላእ​ለ፡ ​አመ​ትከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e67155PRS13850WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሰን​በት፡ ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ትበ​ርሂ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67166LIT6716PPWegat">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 1r30–1r39: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against stomach ache ( wǝgʿāt ), containing  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6716.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ውግ​ዓት፡ ​እል​መክ​ኩን፡ ​እል​መክ​ኩን፡ ​እል​መክ​ኩን፡
                            ​አዝ​ቤ፡ ​ረቤ፡ ​ታኦ​ስ፡ ​ብር​ስባ​ሔል፡ ​አል​ፋ፡ ​ወዕ፡ ​ቤጣ፡ ​ምድ​ምያ​ስ፡ ​ምድ​ምያ፡ ​ምድ​ምያ​ስ፡ ​የሐ​ቄ፡ ​የሐ​ቄ፡ ​የሐ​ቄ፡
                            ​የኃ​ብራ​ስቄ፡ ​የኃ​ብራ​ስቄ፡ ​የኃ​ብራ​ስቄ፡ ​ክር​ስት​ቂ፡ ​ክር​ስቂ፡ ​ክር​ስቄ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃን​ከ፡ ​ለወ​ለተ፡ ​ከራ​ስቄ፡ ​ከማ​ሃ፡
                            ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ውግ​ዓት፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e67176PRS13850WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሰን​በት፡ ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ትበ​ርሄ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67187LIT6717PPFelsat">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 1r39–1r49: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against headache ( mǝtāt  and  fǝlṣata rǝʾs ), containing  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6717.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ፍል​ፀት፡ ​ያጣ​ውጢ፡ ​ያጣ​ውጢ፡ ​ያጣ​ውጢ፡ ​ያሽ​ላክ​ፊ፡ ​ያሽ​ላክ​ፊ፡ ​ያሽ​ላክ​ፊ፡
                            ​ያበ​ጋር፡ ​ሽሩ​ራን፡ ​ሽኃ​ል፡ ​መጃ​ል፡ ​ካፍ፡ ​ላፍ፡ ​አፈ​ና፡ ​ጋዲ​ን፡ ​ታኦ​ስ፡ ​አብ​ኖዲ፡ ​ብር​ስባ​ኄል፡ ​አዶ​ናይ፡ ​አማ​ኑኤ​ል፡ ​እም​ንስ​ቲት፡ ​ሙኬ​ርያ፡
                            ​መዓ​ግያ፡ ​ሙዳ​ሱጣ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ። ​ወል​ደ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ዘኢ​ይመ​ውት፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡
                                ​አር​ኅቆ​ሙ፡ ​ለም​ታት፡ <fo:inline>ወለፍፀተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ርክ​ስ፡ ​እም​ላእ​ለ፡ ​አመ​ትከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e67202PRS13850WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሰን​በት፡ ​ትበ​ርሄ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67212LIT1878Marbab">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 1r50–1r148: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Solomon’s net’ (​መር​በብ​ተ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡), CAe 1878.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The version of the work attested here is close to that attested in
                                MS EMIP 616 (Mekane Yesus Seminary 16)
                                (fols 51r–53v) and MS EMIP 292 (Shover Codex 1) (fols 7v–9v).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡ 
                            ​ዘረ​በቦሙ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>ለአንንት፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወለ​ነሃ​ብት፡ ​ከመ፡ ​መር​በብ​ተ፡ ​አሣ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብ​ል፡ ​ሰዳ​ቃኤ​ል፡ ​አዳ​ናኤ​ል፡ ​አዳ​ዳኤ​ል፡ ​ኤል፡
                                ​ርሜ​ል፡ ​ስር​ማ፡ ​ሩባ፡ ​ዕፍ፡ ​በዕ​ፍ፡ ​ጸል​ለኒ፡ ​በክ​ንፍ​ከ፡
                            እ ​ግዚ ​ኦ፡ ​እም​ፀር​የ፡ ​ወአ​ድኅ​ነኒ፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ፀላ​ኢ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አድ​ኅነኒ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እም​ፀር​የ፡ ​ወነ​ገር​ጋር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ንበ​ሩ፡ ​በት​ርአ​ስየ፡ ​ወኢ​በት​ርጋ​ጽየ፡
                                ​ወኢ​ይብ​ቡኒ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​እኵ​ይ፡ ​ላእ​ሌየ፡ ​ወእ​ምኵ​ሎሙ፡
                                ​መና​ፍስ​ት፡ ​ርኵ​ሳን፡ ​ወሰ​ብዕ፡ ​መሠ​ርያ​ን፡ ​ሠር​ከ፡ ​ወነ​ግሃ፡ <fo:inline>ወዓልተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወሌ​ሊተ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢያ​ህሶ​ም፡ ​ላእ​ሌየ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ገበ​ርተ፡ ​አመ​ፃ፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e67247PRS13850WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡
                             ​ሰን​በት፡ ​ትበ​ርሄ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67257LIT6718PPAqweyasat">
               <fo:inline>VII) Fols 1r148–1r261: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against  ʾaqʷǝyāṣāt  (shinbone?) and magicians, CAe 6718.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The version of the work attested here is close to that attested in MS EMIP 616 (Mekane Yesus Seminary 16)
                                (fols 53v–61v) and MS EMIP 292 (Shover Codex 1) (fols 3v–7v).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡  ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​አቍ​ያጻ​ት፡ ​ወአ​ቃብ​ያነ፡
                            ​ሥራ​ይ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይቀ​ትሉ፡ ​ነፍ​ሰ፡ ​ሰብ​ዕ፡ ​እን​በለ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወስ​ውረ፡ ​ወእ​ለ፡ ​ይት​ሜሰ​ሉ፡ ​በሕ​ልመ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ወበ​ራእ​የ፡  ​ን፡ ​ወበ​ራእ​የ፡  ​መዓ​ልት፡ ​እለ፡ ​የሃ​ውሩ፡ ​በሞ​ችኃ​ት፡
                            ​ወእ​ለ፡ ​ይት​ሜሰ​ሉ፡ ​ዝእ​በ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ማዑ​ኒ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​አቃ​ብያ​ነ፡ ​ሥራ​ይ፡ ​ወገ​በር​ተ፡ ​አመ​ፃ፡ ​እለ፡ ​የሐ​ውሩ፡ ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሰብ​ዕ፡ ​ይደ​ምስ​ሱ፡
                            ​ወይ​ዘረ​ው፡ <fo:inline>ሠራዊትሙ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሠአ​ት፡ ​ዘመ​ዓል​ት፡ ​ወዘ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​በቀ​ትር፡ ​ወበ​ሠአ​ት፡ ​ለአ​ለመ፡ ​አለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e67286PRS13850WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሰን​በት፡</fo:inline> ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ስእ​ኖ፡
                                ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ኮነ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The verso is empty.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>There are no corrections or other scribal interventions in the text.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The name of the owner, mentioned in supplications throughout, was
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e67477PRS13850WalattaS">Walatta Sanbat Tǝbarrǝh</fo:inline>. The last part of the name is spelled with variation
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ትበ​ርህ፡</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ትበ​ርሂ፡</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ትበ​ርሄ፡</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>In the bottom margin of the scroll, following the end of the last text, four
                                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Brillenbuchstaben</fo:inline> are
                                        drawn. Between them, the characters <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ሽ</fo:inline> or  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፳</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ሐ</fo:inline>,
                                        and <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ሩ</fo:inline> are written.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Order of textual units and miniatures: Miniature 1,
                                        Textual units I–VI (beginning),
                                        Miniature 2, Textual units VI (end)–VII.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>The strips are sewn together with small parchment strips.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (115 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 20–25.The outer margins are delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            645 × 105 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 3 mm, left: 3 mm, top: 3 mm, bottom: 5 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (146 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 22–27.The outer margins are delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            745 × 105 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 3 mm, left: 3 mm, top: 1 mm, bottom: 13 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are not visible. Ruling and pricking are not visible.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Nineteenth–twenty-first century.. Mediocre but regular hand, cursive script.<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Incipits of the texts; part of the name of the owner.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">
                                The illustrations on this scroll may date to the late nineteenth or early twentieth centuries. 
                                A preliminary inspection of the scroll does not yield conclusive evidence as to whether the 
                                colours were or were not added at a later date. Bands filled with finely drawn composite 
                                elements (flowers, crosses, and various combinations of lines) mark the upper and lower 
                                margins of the images. A third image may originally have been located at the end of the scroll,
                                as evidenced by the abrupt cutoff of the thin border line surrounding the text.
                            </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(73) <fo:inline>An unidentified standing angel with an unsheathed sword.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(74) <fo:inline>A cross with foliated arms connected to each other by
                                    curvilinear elements to form a rounded square.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.The verso side which is exposed
                                when the scroll is rolled up is darkened.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth–twenty-first century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            nineteenth and the twenty-first century.
                            Its original owner was <fo:inline id="d1e67535PRS13850WalattaS">Walatta Sanbat Tǝbarrǝh</fo:inline> (see Varia note 3).
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The provenance of the manuscript is unknown.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e67545PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg45">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg45</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
