      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethg39"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 39 (R)</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 34, Phillipps 22401)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment scroll1535×93 mm, 640×93 mm, 574×93 mm, 342×80–93 mm (weight: 54g),  fols, late
                                eighteenth–nineteenth  century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67888LIT6791PPAsmat">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r1–1r28: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against demons, with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6791.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ተሰ​ደ፡ ​አጋን ​ንት፡ ​ሺማ​ዳን፡ ​ሺማ​ዳን፡
                            ​ሺማ​ዳና​ኤል፡ ​ጉጉ​ስን፡ ​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ሺር​ታን፡ ​ያሆ​ን፡ ​ያሼ​ሺን፡ በ ዝ ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኖባ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥክ​ሙ፡
                                ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ወለ ​ተ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ንግ​ሥት​ክሙ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​አሰ​ሮ፡ ​ለብ​ርያ​ል፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​እሰ​ሮሙ፡ <fo:inline>ለመናፍስተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​ድማ​ሔር፡ ​አብ​ርሮ፡ ​ፈሮ​ኪ፡ ​ሰራ​ሒ፡
                            ​ሰጥ​ርና​ሃ፡ ​መስ​ፍኑ፡ ​አድ​ክም፡ ​ሃይ​ሎሙ፡ ​ለመ​ናፍ​ስት፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​ረሰ​ዮሙ፡ ​ቅጥ​ቁጣ​ኒ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​በኀ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡
                            ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​አድ​ኅኖ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ። <fo:inline id="d1e67906PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67915LIT6792PPBinding">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 1r29–1r41: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for the binding of demons, with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6792.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡  ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ኢተ​ዮጵ​ያ፡
                            ​ባኖ፡ ​በኖ​ባ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥክ​ሙ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ፈር​ስ፡ ​ማእ​ስሮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ፋር​ስ፡ ​በሹ​ማዳ​ን፡ ​በሹ​ማዳ​ን፡ ​በሹ​ማዳ​ኤል፡ ​በጉ​ላጅ​ን፡ ​በተ​ክለ፡ ​ሺር​ታን፡ ​እለ፡ ​ሰማ​ያው​ያን፡
                            ​ቃሹ​ን፡ ​ጥቅ​ማሹ​ን፡ ​አቅ​ማሀ​ሹን፡ ​ዘነ​በረ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ህል​ቀቱ፡ ​ለሰ​ሎሞ​ን፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞና​ዊ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​እሰ​ሮሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞ፡ ​ፎሐ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞ፡ ​ከሀ​ማ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞና​ዊ፡
                            ​አድ​ኅኖ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e67925PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67934LIT5920JohnBeg">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 1r42–1r53: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Beginning of the Gospel of John, CAe 5920.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቀዳ​ሚሁ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ወከ​ማሁ፡ ​ቀዳ​ሚሁ፡ ​እም​ቀዲ​ሙ፡ ​ኀበ፡
                                ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወቦ​ቱ፡ ​ኵሉ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኮነ፡ ​ወዘ​እን​በሌ​ሆሰ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ወኢ​ምን​ትኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ሂ፡
                                ​ኮነ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አሁ፡ ​ቦቱ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት​ሰ፡ ​ብር​ሃኑ፡ ​ለእ​ጓለ፡ ​እመ​ህያ​ው፡ ​ወብ​ርሃ​ኑሰ፡ ​ለዘ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ስተ፡
                                ​ጽል​መት፡ ​ያበ​ርህ፡ ​ወያ​ርኢ፡ ​ወጽ​ልመ​ትኒ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቦ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡኒ፡ ​ደስ​ክ፡ ​ወጉ​ዳሌ፡
                                ​ለገ​ብርከ ፨
                                <fo:inline id="d1e67950PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67959LIT6793PPAsmat">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 1r54–1r66: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6793.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጢድ​ናኤ​ል፡ ​ሺሺ​ርታ​ን፡ ​ጌር፡ ​ያግ​ርር፡ ​ጢር፡ ​ያቅ​ልል፡ ​ህቡ​ዕ፡ ​ስሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ጰነ​ነ፡ ​ቁና​ጤር፡ ​ጵሥ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​ቀል​ኤል፡ ​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ሽት፡ ​አው​ሽዣ​ምሮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡
                                ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​መል​ዕል​ቴሁ፡ ​ወም​ድር፡ ​ወታ​ህቴ​ሁ፡ ​ከመ፡ <fo:inline>ይትመስው፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ሰም​ዕ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ገጸ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ <fo:inline>ይትመስው፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡
                                ​ህድ​ግ፡ ​አስ​ተህ​ድ፡ ​ወሰ​ዊት​ከ፡ ​ይቤ​ለከ፡ ​ወለ​ዘቦ​ቱ፡ ​ትእ​ዛዝ​የ፡ ​የአ​ቅቦ፡ ​ወዘ​ያፈ​ቅረ​ኑ፡ ​አፈ​ቅር፡ ​ወአ​ርዕ​ዮ፡ ​ርዕ​ሶ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e67971PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e67981LIT6794PPBarya">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 1r67–1r80: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against  bāryā 
                , CAe 6794.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ቅ ​ዱስ፡  ፩  ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡
                                ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​በዜ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ባዜ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ በ ፯  ​ንጉ​ሠ፡
                                ​ክር​ስት​ና፡ በ ፯  ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ትብ​ልና፡ በ ፯ 
                                ​ጵጵ​ስና፡ በ ፯  ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ቅስ​ስና፡ በ ፯  ​ብህ​ርይ፡
                                ​በገ​ጸር፡ በ ፯  ​ዘፈ​ር፡ በ ፯  ​ነገ​ሥት፡
                                በ ፯  ​አፈ፡ ​ነገ​ሥት፡ በ ፯  ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡
                                በ ፯  ​ሊቃ​ነ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ በ ፯ 
                                ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ዘተ​ውህ​በ፡ ​አር​ድዕ​ት፡ ​ወአ​ርድ​ዕት፡ ​ከዕ​ትኩ፡ ​ለው​ሉደ፡ ​ጥም​ቀት፡ ​በዘ​ተአ​ስሩ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​እስ​ሮሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ሀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሱ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሁ፡
                                ​ለገ​ብርከ ፨
                                <fo:inline id="d1e68033PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e68042LIT6795PPApellon">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 1r81–1r100: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer, CAe 6795.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​አጵ​ሎን፡ ​በገ​ነው​ተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​በአ​ብ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​በጸ​ሎቱ፡ ​በጸ​ሎቱ፡ ​በበ​ለው፡ ​ለአ​ቂቦ​ታቱ፡
                                ​አወ​ግዘ​ከ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​በእ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ንግ​ሥት፡ በ ፲ ወ ፪ 
                                ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ወበ ፲ ወ ፭  ​ነቢ​ያት፡
                                በ ፸ ወ ፪  ​አር​ድዕ​ት፡
                                በ ​፫፻ ፡  ፲ ወ ፰ 
                                ​ርቱ​አነ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አወ​ግዘ​ከ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ዘት​ነብ​ር፡ ​ሀበ፡ ​ጸላ​ዕት፡ ​አወ​ግዘ​ከ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ዘት​ነብ​ር፡ ​ታህ​ተ፡ ​እብ​ነ፡ ​መሰ​ህት፡ ​ባር​ያ፡
                                ​ዘት​ትሜ​ሰል፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​አም​ሳል፡ ​አወ​ግዘ​ከ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትባ​ዕ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዱዱ​ር፡ ​ወከ​መ፡ ​ትባ​ዕ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕ​ር፡ ​ወከ​መ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ጸዕ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጢስ፡ ​ወነ​ፋስ፡ ​ወነ​ፋስ፡
                            <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e68095LIT6796PPIllnesses">
               <fo:inline>VII) Fols 1r101–1r118: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against various illnesses, containing the names of the nails of the cross, CAe 6796.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ቅ ​ዱስ፡  ፩  ​አም​ላክ፡
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ለጌ​ዎን፡ ​ርኩ​ስ፡ ​ዘይ​ሰል​ብ፡ ​ልበ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ወያ​ደቅ​ቅ፡
                                ​አዕ​ጽም​ት፡ ​ወያ​ጸል​ም፡ አ ​ዕይን<fo:inline>ት (!)</fo:inline>፡ ​ወይ​መጽ​ዕ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጽላ ​ሎት፡ ​ወህ​ልም፡ ​አም​ሕለ​ከ፡ ​ወአ​ወግ​ዘከ፡ ​በ፭ ​ቅን​ዋተ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ<fo:inline>[እ]</fo:inline>​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​በስ​መ፡
                            ​ሳዶ​ር፡ ​አላ​ዶር፡ ​ዳና​ት፡ ​አዴ​ራ፡ ​ሮዳ​ስ፡ ​በሃ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​አድ​ኅነ​ኒ፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወለ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ደስ​ከ፡ ​ወገ​ዳሌ፡ ​ለው​ግአ​ት፡ ​ወለ​ቈር​ጥማ​ት፡ ​ለዓ​ይነ​ት፡ ​ወለ​መጋ​ኛ፡ ​ለው​ግአ​ት፡ ​ወለ​ቍር​ጥማ​ት፡
                            ​ለቍ​ርፀ​ት፡ ​ወለ​ፍል​ፀት፡ ​ለፌ​ራ፡ ​ወለ​ትን​ር፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሱ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሁ፡ ​ለገ​ብርከ ፨
                                <fo:inline id="d1e68121PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e68130LIT6797PPStomachache">
               <fo:inline>VIII) Fols 1r119–1r133: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against stomach ache ( wǝgʾat ), CAe 6797.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈስ  ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡
                            ​ውግ​አት፡ ​በለ​ምለ​ም፡ ​ይፈ ​ቅአ፡ ​በጸ​ም፡ ​ዘፈ​ቅአ፡ ​በም​ን፡ ዕ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                                ​እሳት ​ነፋ​ስ፡ ​እም ፯ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡ ​ሥረ፡ ​ውግ​አት፡ ​ሥረ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ሥረ፡ ​ጉዳ​ሌ፡ ​ሥረ፡ ​መጋ​ኛ፡ ​አድ​ኅን፡ ​ይቤ​ለከ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አብ፡ ​አድ​ኅን፡ ​ትቤ​ለከ፡
                            ​ጽዮ​ን፡ ​ሰማ​ያዊ​ት፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ሰን​በተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አድ​ኅኖ፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ውግ​አት፡
                                ​ለገ​ብርከ ፨ <fo:inline id="d1e68160PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e68169LIT5133MagicFormula">
               <fo:inline>IX) Fols 1r134–1r144: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective formula against stomach ache, CAe 5133.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡  ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡  ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​ቄፄ​ቤ፡ ​ቄፄ ​ቤ፡ ​ቄፄ​ቤ፡ ​ቄፌ​ኩ፡ ​ቡያ​ክ፡ ​ቄፌ​ኑ፡ ​ቡያ​ክ፡ ​ሞሌ፡ ​ሞሌ፡ ​አር​ጋዔ፡ ​በረ​ድ፡
                                ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አር​ግዕ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ፀት ፤  ​ዘይ​ጠዊ፡
                                ​አን​ዣተ ፤  ​ወዓ​ማዑተ ፤ 
                                ​ወያ​ደቅቅ ፤  ​አዕ​ጽምተ ፤ 
                                ​ወይ​ፈነ​ቅል፡ ​ገበ​ዋተ፡ ​አድ​ኅኖ፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e68201PRS13862GabraY">​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e68210LIT4704MagicPr">
               <fo:inline>X) Fols 1r145–1r172: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Protective prayer for the binding of demons’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማዕ​ሥሮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ), CAe 4704.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡  ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​አህ​ያ፡ ​ሺራ​ህያ፡ ​አል​ሸዳ​ይ፡ ​እል​መክ​ኑን፡ ​አል​ፋ፡ ​ወአ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ህያ​ው፡ ​ወልደ ፨
                                ​ማር​ያም፡   ​ሥግ​ው፡ ​ዘበ​መስ​ቀል​ከ፡ ​አጽ​ራዕ​ከ፡ ​ግብ​ሮ፡ ​ለዲ​ያብ​ሎስ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አጽ​ርእ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በመ​ስቀ​ልከ፡ ​አድ​ኀነ​ኒ፡ ​እም​ፀር፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ኀይ​ልነ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ጽን​እነ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ቤዛ​ነ፡ ​አይ​ሁድ፡ ​ክህ​ዱ፡ ​ንሕ​ነ፡ ​ንህ​ነ፡ ​አመ​ነ፡ ​በመ​ስቀ​ልከ፡
                                ​ርድ​አነ፡ ​በመ​ስቀ​ልከ፡ ​ቤዝ​ወኒ፡ ​ለገ​ብርከ ፨
                                <fo:inline id="d1e68233PRS13862GabraY">ገ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​በፍ​ፁም፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ፈ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e68249LIT6798PPAsmat">
               <fo:inline>XI) Fols 1r173–1r207: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer with  ʾasmāt 
                , CAe 6798.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​አብ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                              ​እሳ​ት፡  ፩  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​መለ​ኮት፡ ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡ ​አ፡ ​ይሰ​ደዱ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡
                              <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ወይ​ጸኡ፡ ​ሰይ​ጣና​ት፡ ​እለ፡ ​ያጸር ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እሰ​ሮሙ፡ ​ለመ​ናፍ​ስት፡ ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ለ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ባር​ያ፡ ​ቀይ​ሐን፡ ​ወለ​ባር​ያ፡
                            ​ጸሊ​ማን፡ ​ወለ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​እኩ​ያን፡ ​ወእ​ደ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​መሠ​ርያ​ን፡ ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​መና​ፍስ​ት፡ ​ርኵ​ሳን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሱ፡
                            ​ወሥ​ጋሁ ፨  ​ለገ​ብርከ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>XII) Fol. 1r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e68281">Unidentified texts</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Traces of erased writing are visible between Miniature 3 and the bottom of the recto.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The verso of the scroll is empty.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>An omitted character has been added interlineally (fol. 1r4)
                                        and a few erroneous characters have been under- and overlined and then erased (e.g. fol. 1r16).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The name of the owner <fo:inline id="d1e68585PRS13862GabraY">Gabra Yonās</fo:inline> has been inserted in space left empty at
                                        the end of each prayer,
                                        written with a different nib and different red ink than the other rubrications, but
                                        possibly by the main hand.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block> A white sticker, with the number ‘22401’ printed on it, is glued onto the
                                        upper part of the verso.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Order of textual units and miniatures: Miniature 1,
                                          Textual units I–VII, Miniature 2, Textual units VIII–XI,
                                          Miniature 3, Textual unit XII.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>The three strips are slightly overlapped and sewn together with a
                                    running stitch using two narrow parchment strips and, in the first joining, white thread.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (118 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 19–20.The left margin is delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            637 × 82 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 6 mm, left: 5 mm, top: 20 mm, bottom: 8 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (89 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 16–19.The left margin is delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            495 × 83 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 6 mm, left: 5 mm, bottom: 2 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column ( written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">The left margin is delimited by a black line.The width of the text are cannot be discerned due to faded writing.The bottom margin is not visible due to faded writing.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            47 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 5 mm, left: 4 mm, top: 10 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column ( written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">The left margin is delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            613 × 84 mm ()</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column ( written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">The left margin is delimited by a black line.The bottom margin is not visible due to faded writing.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            84 mm ()</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Pricking and ruling are not visible. Pricking and ruling are not visible. Pricking and ruling are not visible. Pricking and ruling are not visible. Pricking and ruling are not visible.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Nineteenth–twenty-first century.. Untrained hand. Characters are bulky and broadly spaced.<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Groups of lines at the beginning of textual units, alternating with black lines; the name of the owner;
                                    holy names; elements of numerals and punctuation marks. Traces of rubrication are also visible on the verso.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">The illustrations of the scroll, outlined in black and suffusedly coloured with a palette of dark 
                                browns, terracotta red, and pale ochre, are executed in a style that has been linked to a manner of painting
                                defined by Chojnacki 1983,  469–524, especially figs
                                226–27, and the ‘Shewa’ style. <!--@Jacopo, could you check if the
                                bibliography part is correct?-->
                                Accordingly, the images, which appear to be coeval with the text,
                                can be dated to the late eighteenth or
                                nineteenth century. There are three illustrations that
                                feature similar-looking figures, 
                                likely angels with highly stylized wings. Unusually, they appear to be seated on thrones and to have a 
                                shawl draped over their heads and have stylized Greek crosses at their sides. </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(75) Fol. 1r: <fo:inline>The Archangel Michael, identified by the caption <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሊመ ሚ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ኤል</fo:inline>, with an unsheathed sword.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(76) Fol. 1r: <fo:inline>The archangel Gabriel, identified by the caption 
                                    <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline> with an unsheathed sword.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(77) Fol. 1r: <fo:inline>The archangel Raphael, identified by the caption <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሩፋ​ኤል</fo:inline>, with an unsheathed sword.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.The parchment has been damaged by humidity becoming very stiff.
                                    Consequently, the content on the recto is visible through the verso.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>late
                                eighteenth–nineteenth  century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically and by the style of the
                            miniatures to the period between the
                            late eighteenth and nineteenth centuries.
                            The name of the original or a secondary owner was <fo:inline id="d1e68618PRS13862GabraY">Gabra Yonās</fo:inline>
                            (see Varia note 3).
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
                            The manuscript was acquired by the collector <fo:inline id="d1e68626PRS13883PhillippsT">Thomas Phillipps</fo:inline> in 1870. It was then
                            assigned ‘22401’ as an inventory number and is described under this number
                            in [Phillipps] 1837,  417. <!--according to the Phillipps'
                                    catalogue "with 3 paintings of God, the Virgin & Christ" https://archive.org/details/gri_33125009352721/page/418/mode/2up-->
                            It was sold to the bookseller Maggs at auction on 27 November
                                1974 (Sotheby’s sale ‘Bibliotheca Philippica’, lot 645), and purchased by <fo:inline id="d1e68641PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline>
                            in 1975.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e68649PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Bibliography</fo:block>[Phillipps] 1837.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg39">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg39</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
