      <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator">
         <fo:block space-before="5mm" space-after="5mm">
            <fo:leader leader-length="30%" rule-thickness="0pt"/>
         </fo:block>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethd16"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. d. 16</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 36, H. Kevorkian collection 623, EMIP 03459)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex280×250 mm (weight: 1665g), 60 fols (2 p. blank), 9 quires, eighteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e69181LIT6192Saqoqa">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1ra–1va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Lamentation of the Soul’ (​ሰቆ​ቃወ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡), incomplete, CAe 6192.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The first folio contains the beginning of the main text, with all
                                spaces left for rubrication unfilled. The text begins anew with Textual Unit II.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዘነ​በበ። ​በነ​ቢያ​ት፡  <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>
                                ​እወ​ጥን፡ ​አን​ሰ፡ ​ሰቆ​ቃወ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ዕፁ​በ። ​ኵሎ፡ ​ሌሊ​ተ፡ ​በአ​ንብ​ዕ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​አር​ሕስ፡ ​ምስ​ካበ። ​ከመ፡ ​በአ​ንብ​ዑ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ዓራ​ቶ፡ ​ሐፀ​በ።
                                <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline> ​ለነ​ፍስ፡ ​ወና​ዛዚ​ሃ፡ ​በሕ​ቁ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline> ​ተመ​የጢ፡ ​ለፍ​ትወ​ተ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​እም​ዕበ​ዱ። ​መን​ገለ፡ ​ንስ​ሐ፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ትፃ​ኢ፡
                                ​እም​ዓፀ​ዱ። ​አመ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ደይ​ንሰ፡ ​እም​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​አምላ<fo:inline>[​ክ፡]</fo:inline> ​አሐ​ዱ። ​ኢይ​ትመ​የጥ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ለአ​ድኅ​ኖ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሰ፡
                                ​ኃጥ​እ፡ ​ወል​ዱ። ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ይት​ፈደ​ይ፡ ​በዘ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​እዱ፡ <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline> ​አኃ​ውየ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ጌጋ​ይየ፡
                                ​እብ​ኪ። ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​መላ​ኪ። ​እስ​መ፡ ​መሐ​ሪ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወመ​ፍቀ​ሬ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​መሐ​ኪ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e69220LIT6192Saqoqa">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 2ra–7rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Lamentation of the Soul’ (​ሰቆ​ቃወ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡), CAe 6192.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ቅ ​ዱስ፡ ​ዘነ​በበ። ​በነ​ቢያ​ት፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ወበ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ። ​እዌ​ጥን፡
                                    ​አን​ሰ፡ ​ሰቆ ​ቃወ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ዕፁ​በ። ​ኵሎ፡ ​ሌሊ​ተ፡ ​በአ ​ንብ​ዕ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​አር​ሕስ፡ ​ምስ​ካበ። ​ከመ፡  ​በአ​ንብ​ዑ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ዓራ​ቶ፡
                                ​ሐፀ​በ።  ​ሐዋ​ፂሃ፡  ​ለነ​ፍስ፡ ​ወና​ዛዚ​ሃ፡ ​በሕ​ቁ። ​እም​ነ፡ ​ኀዘ​ናት፡ ​አእ​ላፍ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይት​ኌለ​ቁ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ወበ​ጸጋ፡ ​ጥም​ቀት፡ ​አቡ​የ። ​እመ፡ ​አድ​ኀን​ከ፡ ​እም​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ለኃ​ጥእ​ት፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ።  ​በኍ​ልቈ፡  ​ደቂ​ቁ፡
                                ​ለያ​ዕቆ​ብ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ወረ​ዱ፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ። ​ሰቆ​ቃወ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ስብ​ኪ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​አን​ቀጽ። ​ወኢ​ትፃ​ኢ፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ፡ ​እም​ቤተ፡ ​ንስ​ሐ፡ ​ሕን​ጹ።
                                ​ራት​ዕ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ዘኢ​ያደ​ሉ፡ ​ለገ​ጽ። ​እስ​መ፡ ​ይነ​ሥአ​ኪ፡ ​ግብ​ተ፡ ​በዘ​መን፡ ​ሕፁ​ፅ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e69257LIT2393tabiba">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 8ra–56vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘The Wisest among the Wise’ (​ጠቢ​በ፡ ​ጠቢ​ባን፡), CAe 2393.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ኦእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ጠቢ​በ፡ ​ጠቢባ ​ን፡ ​ከሀ​ሊ። ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​እምጥ ​ንት፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ኢት​በሊ። ​ድኩ​መ፡ 
                                ​ሕሊ​ና፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ ​ወፈ​ራሀ፡ ​ልብ፡   (b)  ​ኢተ​ሐባ​ሊ። ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ እ ​ግዚ​ኦ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​አድ​ኅኖ፡
                                ​እጼ ​ሊ። ​አድ​ኅነ​ኒ፡ ​አድ​ኅነ​ኒ፡ ​እም ​ኵሉ፡ ​ቀታ​ሊ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ዘገ​ደፍ​ኮሙ፡ ​ለሰ​ማዕ​ታት፡ ​በብ​ዝኃ፡ ​ሥቃ​ያት፡ ​ይሕ​ምሙ።  ​እግ ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፡  ​ተባ​ረክ፡ ​ለኂ​ሩት፡
                                ​ማኅ​ተሙ።   (fol. 56va)  ​አኮ፡  ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​በል​ሳነ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ተና​ጋሪ። ​ወኢ​በዝ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ሕን​ፃ፡ ​መሬ​ት፡ ​ተመ​ዝባ​ሪ።
                                ​አላ፡   (b)   ​በዝ​ኩ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ነባ​ሪ። ​በዝ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አአ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​ፈጣ​ሪ። ​በዘ​ይመ​ጽእ​ኒ፡ ​በዓ​ለም፡ ​ደኃ​ሪ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e69305LIT3001RepCh281">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 57ra–60rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Image of Walatta Ṗeṭros’ (​መል​ክአ፡ ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡), CAe 3001.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዘሀ​ሎ፡  ​ወአ​መ፡ ​ኢሀ​ሎ፡ ​ዘመ​ን። ​ወኢ​ቀደ ​ሞ፡ ​ሰአ​ት፡ ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​ቅጽ​በታ፡ ​ለዓይ ​ን።
                                ​እሰ​ንቁ፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​አው​ታረ፡ ​ነባ​ቢ፡ ​ድር​ሳን። ​ያበ​ርህ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡  ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ምእ​መን፡ ​ፀዳ​ለ፡  ​አእ​ምሮ፡ ​ንስ​ቲተ፡
                                ​ሲኖ​ዳ፡ ​ካህ​ን። <!--<hi rend="rubric">ሰላም፡</hi> ለዝክረ፡ ስምኪ፡ ዘቀጸላ፡ ሞገስ፡ ትርሲቱ። ወለሥዕርትኪ፡ ስውጥ፡ ዘቅብዓ፡ ቅዳሴ፡ ውስቴቱ፡-->
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                               <!--<hi rend="rubric">ወለተ፡ ጴጥሮስ፡</hi> አኮኑ፡ በእንተ፡ ዝንቱ፡ ነገር። ይትፌሣሕ፡ ሰማይ፡ ወትትሐሠይ፡ ምድር። ወይወውዑ፡ አድባር፡ ወአውግር።-->
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለፍ​ልሰ​ተ፡ ​ሥጋ​ኪ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​አር​አየ፡ ​መን​ክረ። ​እም​ፍል​ሰተ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​አዕ​ላፍ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ከሠ​ቱ፡ ​ምስ​ጢረ።
                                 ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡  ​ሐመ​ር፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ታነ​ጽሒ፡ ​ነው​ረ። ​ሰው​ርኒ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሕፅ​ንኪ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ርአ​የኒ፡ ​ምዕ​ረ። ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ጽኑ​ዕ፡ ​ዘያ​የብ​ስ፡ ​ባሕ​ር።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                                        Fol. 2r
                                        Ownership note written in brownish ink in the
                                        upper margin, stating that the manuscript belonged to
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e73085INS0101MadhaneAlam">Madḫāne ʿĀlam</fo:inline>.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጠቢ​በ፡ ​ጠቢ​ባን፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡ ​መድ​ኃኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                                        The incipits of stanzas 8 and 9 of the Lamentation of the Soul (<fo:inline font-style="italic">Saqoqāwa nafs</fo:inline>) are indicated with Ethiopic numbers on the left margin
                                        of fols 1va.
                                        Rubrication has not been executed on fols 1ra–1va, leading to textual lacunas.
                                        Cues for the rubricator are found on the left margin of fols 2ra–4ra.
                                        Corrections are scarce. They mostly consist of interlinear additions (e.g. fols 12va, 12vb, 14va), erasures (e.g. fols 11ra),
                                        or are made by encircling the word (fol. 26rb).
                                        Pen trial in red and black ink on fol. 1vb.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                                        The name of the original owner or patron, <fo:inline id="d1e73123PRS13954TaklaMa">Takla Māryām</fo:inline>, is inserted
                                        in the main hand on fols 29rb, 54vb,  as well as in the supplication formula on the upper margin of fol. 8r, here
                                        indicated as <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገብ​ርከ፡</fo:inline>, ‘your servant’.
                                        The name of a later owner, <fo:inline id="d1e73132PRS13955WalattaS">Walatta Ṣǝyon</fo:inline>, is indicated on fol. 2ra on a previously erased name.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Several white stickers are glued on the inner side of the front cover.
                                        On the rightmost is printed ‘H. Kevorkian collection’, with the number ‘623’ added in pencil.
                                        On the following sticker are written in blue pen the numbers ‘1977’ and ‘18’, above a previous signature ‘MS Et 16’ in black ink.
                                        On the leftmost is printed the name of <fo:inline id="d1e73143PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡ ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>),
                                        with the signature ‘MS. Aeth. d. 16’ added in pencil. Below, a further sticker is glued with the shelfmark ‘Ms 36’ printed on it.
                                        The inner side of the front cover and of the front board also bear three barely legible black stamps.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Two white stickers are glued on the inner side of the back board.
                                        On the right one is written ‘489’ in black pen, on the left one is printed the number ‘1067’.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                The book is bound in wooden boards, fully covered with reddish-brown blind-tooled leather.
                              
                                The boards are slightly larger than the bookblock.
                              
                                Full reddish-brown blind-tooled leather cover. The turn-ins have been trimmed out, and they form butt mitres at the corners.
                                The external surfaces of the cover show a fine blind-tooled decoration.
                                The decoration consists of seven concentric frames surrounding a central rectangular panel featuring a Latin cross.
                                Frames composed by the repetition of single tools, enclosed between <fo:inline id="d1e73175">triple straight lines</fo:inline>,
                                alternate with empty ones.
                                Proceeding from the outer to the inner frame, the repeating decoration motifs are <fo:inline id="d1e73178">criss-crosses</fo:inline>, <fo:inline id="d1e73181">double X-forms</fo:inline>,
                                <fo:inline id="d1e73184">wavy lines</fo:inline>, and <fo:inline id="d1e73187">curve strapwork</fo:inline> elements.
                                <fo:inline id="d1e73191">straight strapwork</fo:inline> elements.
                                The cross is formed by <fo:inline id="d1e73194">X-form</fo:inline> motifs between triple straight lines.
                                At the ends of the arms of the cross there are pairs of <fo:inline id="d1e73197">crescents</fo:inline> disposed to resemble a corniform motif
                                and three <fo:inline id="d1e73200">double circles</fo:inline>. Triple straight lines divide the area around the cross in four panels,
                                outlining the shape of the cross.
                                Double circles are also stamped at the intersection of the triple straight lines.
                                On the spine, triple straight lines intersect, forming a diamond pattern.
                              
                                Brown <fo:inline id="d1e73206">slit-braid</fo:inline> endbands.
                              
                                Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern; Z-plied threads.
                                Between each pair of sewing stations, there are two thread lengths.
                              
                                The spine is formed by two overlapping layers of leather. The endbands are sewn through the first layer so that
                                the tiedowns are hidden under the second layer.
                              </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner (1–60).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>9 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (Fols 1r–1v)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (Fols 2r–7v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 8r–15v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 16r–23v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 24r–31v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 32r–41v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 42r–49v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+1 (Fols 50r–56v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (Fols 57r–60v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 2ra–7rb: 2
                                    columns (21 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 2r.The characters per line are 16–17</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            275 × 247 mm (fol. 28r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            177 × 185 mm (fol. 2r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 35 mm, bottom: 57 mm, right: 38 mm, left: 15 mm, intercolumn: 15 mm (fol. 2r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 8ra–56vb: 2
                                    columns (4 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">
                                        Each page accommodates 3 or 4 written lines per column, starting from the top.
                                        The rest of the page invariably contains a miniature, each depicting a biblical scene. All miniatures reach the bottom of the page.
                                        Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 28r.The characters per line are 11–14</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            275 × 247 mm (fol. 28r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            32 × 193 mm (fol. 28r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 34 mm, right: 33 mm, left: 21 mm, intercolumn: 12 mm (fol. 28r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 57ra–60rb: 2
                                    columns (21–22 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 59r.The characters per line are 12–15. The end of lines is very irregular.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            275 × 247 mm (fol. 28r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            182 × 199 mm (fol. 59r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 35 mm, bottom: 55 mm, right: 35 mm, left: 22 mm, intercolumn: 14 mm (fol. 59r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling. Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling. Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling. Ruling pattern: 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Fols 1ra–1va. Eighteenth century.. Decent handwriting.<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 2:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Fols 1vb–56vb. First half of the eighteenth century.. 
                                    Elegant and uniform handwriting. Characters are slanted and regularly spaced.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    Few lines on the incipit pages on fols 2ra, 8r, alternating with black lines; holy names; the name of the individual involved in the production or
                                    commissioning of the manuscript;
                                    the first word of each stanza of the Lamentation of the Soul (<fo:inline font-style="italic">Saqoqāwa nafs</fo:inline>) and of
                                    The Wisest among the Wise (<fo:inline font-style="italic">Ṭabiba ṭabibān</fo:inline>);
                                    captions of the miniatures on the upper margin of 8r–56v and next to the characters of each miniature;
                                    elements of the punctuation signs, numerals, and text dividers.
                                </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 3:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Fols 57ra–60rb. Eighteenth century.. 
                                    Decent handwriting. Characters are executed with a thin nib and are uniformly spaced.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    Few lines on the incipit page, alternating with black lines; holy names, included that of Walatta Ṗeṭros;
                                    the word <fo:inline font-style="italic">salām</fo:inline>; elements of the punctuation signs, of the numerals, and of the text dividers.
                                </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Almost every page in this lavishly decorated manuscript features an illumination. In most of them, God the Father is shown intervening in episodes from the Old and New Testaments arranged in loose chronological order.                               
                               The images found in this volume bear comparison with those found in another illustrated copy of the same text kept at the British Library (MS London, British Library, Or. 590). The two manuscripts were painted by different hands, but many of the images are almost identical in terms of layout and iconography, though there are a number of exceptions. For instance, the giants that appear on fol. 13r appear to be female in this copy and male in the British Library copy; and in this manuscript the scene of the Binding of Isaac (fols 18r) is less detailed than in the British Library example, where Abraham is shown riding a donkey. Likewise, the tent on fol. 18v is closed in this manuscript, but open in the one from the British Library. At times the images in the Bodleian Libraries manuscript have more details, whereas in other cases it is the opposite. In the Bodleian example, a donor is present beneath a representation of the Trinity, whereas in the British Library example there is no donor and God is represented alone. The number of images also varies: the British Library copy features representations of the Crucifixion and Descent into Hell that are not present in the Bodleian copy. Finally, the images in the latter manuscript do not have captions, whereas in this piece they are numerous and added next to the figures by the main hand that wrote titles in red ink on the upper margin of each folio. It is unclear if these rubricated lines of text in the upper margin of the folio refer to the illuminations, the text, or both, but they have been systematically transcribed here alongside those other captions that are clearly associated with the images.
                               God the Father appears in almost all of the miniatures. As shown by  Mercier 2000,  174–177, 
                               several images in these manuscripts were inspired by European prints or paintings. Many other details evoke local customs and material traditions, such as the prayer stick on fols 17r, , the drum on fol. 22r, the warriors wearing leopard skins and headbands on fol. 25v, the king riding a caparisoned mule with bells on its bridle and accompanied by a page bearing an umbrella on fols 26r, , the butchering of animals on fols 35r, , the presence of what appears to be a mottled cow hide on a tent on fol. 43r, and the bread basket on fols 46v.
                               Particularly interesting is the representation of the miraculous sleep of Ebed-Melech (Abimelech) the Ethiopian on fol. 36r, which offers a reference to 4 Baruch that is only canonical in the Ethiopic tradition, since the episode is not mentioned in the text that the image accompanies and to Ethiopian Maccabees on fols 45v–46r. This scene is absent in the British Library copy. On fol. 45r, we see a reference to the translation of the Bible into Greek mentioned in the Ethiopian Synaxarion; the artist showcases his familiarity with the story and expands on the text of the Wisest of the Wise by including a reference to the angel that stops Simeon from changing the words of the Bible. 
                               In another instance, on  fol. 36r, both text and image rely on non-biblical sources when they refer to Alexander the Great as presenting offerings to the High Priest of the Israelites. Alexander is shown presenting a chest, a detail possibly inspired by the Josippon (Budge 1896,  409–410). Noteworthy is also the decision of the artists to represent King <fo:inline id="d1e69764PRS11373Nebuc"> Nebuchadnezzar</fo:inline> as a wild boar when he is transformed into a beast by God, a detail that is not mentioned in the Bible and recalls the transformation of Tiridates III of Armenia.
                               Some motifs on the clothes of prominent figures in the illustrations may provide evidence of the circulation of particular patterns on textiles. The ones that appear on fols 26r, for example, seem to be inspired by contemporary Indian woven silks, as a sign of their prestige, whereas the fabric that covers the altar behind them could have been inspired by a block-printed Gujarati textile. Relatedly, the attire of Goliath on fol. 28v may have been inspired by chainmail armour and a pointed helmet in use in the Islamicate world. Many scenes feature details inspired by the biblical texts that inspired the verses.
                           </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(78) Fol. 8r: <fo:inline>God the Father, identified by the caption <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>.                            
                            The donor <fo:inline id="d1e69781PRS13954TaklaMa">Takla Māryām</fo:inline> is mentioned in the main legend.
                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አብ፡ ​አኀ​ዜ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለ​ም። ​አድ​ኅኖ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e69786PRS13954TaklaMa">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(79) Fol. 8v: <fo:inline>
                                   God creates life and the elements of the world (fire, water, earth, air) as angels praise him. Captions:
                                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰማ​ይ።</fo:inline>,
                                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እሳ​ት።</fo:inline>,
                                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ነፍ​ስ።</fo:inline>,
                                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መሬ​ት።</fo:inline>, and
                                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማይ።</fo:inline>.
                                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈጠ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ፍጥ​ረታ​ተ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​እኁ​ድ፡ ​በአ​ርም​ሞ፡ ​ወነ​ቢብ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(80) Fol. 9r: <fo:inline>
                                   God the Father, flanked by Michael and Gabriel, casts the <fo:inline id="d1e69827PRS11330Devil">devil</fo:inline>
                                   out of heaven and binds him. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69834PRS7049Michael">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69838PRS4377Gabriel">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69842PRS11330Devil">​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወድ​ቀ፡ ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(81) Fol. 9v: <fo:inline>God the Father binds the angels in Hell. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ንስ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​አን​በሳ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ላህ​ም።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አጋ​ንንት</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወድ​ቁ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(82) Fol. 10r: <fo:inline>
                                   God the Father creates <fo:inline id="d1e69888PRS1386Adam">Adam</fo:inline> in his likeness. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69895PRS1386Adam">​አዳ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እሳት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ነፋስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መሬ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማይ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈጠ​ሮ፡ ​ለአ​ዳም። ​እም​፬ቱ፡ ​ጠባ​ይዓ​ት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(83) Fol. : <fo:inline>
                                   God the Father creates <fo:inline id="d1e69926PRS3926Eve">Eve</fo:inline> from
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e69929PRS1386Adam">Adam</fo:inline>’s rib in a garden with flowers. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69933PRS1386Adam">​አዳ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69937PRS3926Eve">​ሔዋ​ን፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወፅ​አት፡ ​ሔዋ​ን፡ ​እም​ገቦ​ሁ፡ ​ለአ​ዳም።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(84) Fol. 11r: <fo:inline>Two scenes:
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e69955PRS3926Eve">Eve</fo:inline> and
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e69958PRS1386Adam">Adam</fo:inline> share the forbidden fruit taken from a fig tree with the serpent coiled around it (left); 
                                   the pair are cast out of Eden by an angel (right). Captions:                                
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ከይ​ሲ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69965PRS1386Adam">​አዳ​ም።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e69969PRS3926Eve">​ሔዋ​ን፤</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አስ​ሐቶ​ሙ፡ ​ከይ​ሲ፡ ​ለአ​ዳም፡ ​ወለ​ሔዋ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(85) Fol. 11v: <fo:inline> God the Father looks down upon <fo:inline id="d1e69987PRS1386Adam">Adam</fo:inline> and
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e69990PRS3926Eve">Eve</fo:inline>, who are shown ashamed of their nakedness to the left and clothed to the right. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተዓ​ርቁ፡ ​እም​ልብ​ስ፡
                                       <fo:inline id="d1e69995PRS1386Adam">​አዳ​ም፡</fo:inline> ወ<fo:inline id="d1e69998PRS3926Eve">​ሔዋ​ን።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70002PRS1386Adam">​አዳ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70006PRS3926Eve">​ሔዋ​ን።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ናዘ​ዞሙ፡ ​ለአ​ዳም፡ ​ወለ​ሔዋ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(86) Fol. 12r: <fo:inline>Three episodes from top left to bottom right:
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e70021PRS2984Cain">Cain</fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e70024PRS1230Abel">Abel</fo:inline> offer gifts to God (above);
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e70027PRS2984Cain">Cain</fo:inline> kills
                                   his brother (bottom left); he encounters a crow while wandering (bottom right). Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70031PRS1230Abel">​አቤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መሥ​ዋዕ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እሳ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70042PRS2984Cain">​ቃየል</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀተ​ሎ፡ ​ቃየ​ል፡ ​ለአ​ቤል።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70049PRS1230Abel">​አቤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70053PRS2984Cain">​ቃየል</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቋዕ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተወ​ክፈ፡ ​ቍር​ባነ፡ ​አቤ​ል።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(87) Fol. 12v: <fo:inline>God instructs <fo:inline id="d1e70071PRS3814Enoch">Enoch</fo:inline> on how to invoke his name as
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e70074PRS8782Seth">Seth</fo:inline> looks at the recumbent body of his dead brother
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e70077PRS1230Abel">Abel</fo:inline>. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70084PRS3814Enoch">​ሄኖ​ክ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70089PRS8782Seth">​ሴት፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70093PRS1230Abel">​አቤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተወ​ልደ፡ ​ሴት፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ሞተ፡ ​አቤ​ል።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(88) Fol. 13r: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e70107PRS14025Jared">Jared</fo:inline> and his children are shown above, while below the children of Seth descend
                                   from the Mount of the Treasures to meet the wives of Cain, one of whom is a giant. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70111PRS14025Jared">​ያሬ​ድ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወረ​ዱ፡ ​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​ሴት፡ ​እም​ደብ​ር።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዓቀ​ቦ፡ ​ለያ​ሬድ፡ ​በደ​ብረ፡ ​መዛ​ግብ​ት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(89) Fol. 13v: <fo:inline>God, who sits on a cloak that symbolizes his blessing,
                                   addresses <fo:inline id="d1e70131PRS3814Enoch">Enoch</fo:inline> in a garden with trees and flowers. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70135PRS3814Enoch">​ሄኖ​ክ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አፍ​ለሶ፡ ​ለሄ​ኖክ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ብሔ​ረ፡ ​ሕያ​ዋን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(90) Fol. 14r: <fo:inline>God, who holds a gold orb, grants a long life to Methuselah who prays towards him with a group of elders, presumably his children. 
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማቱ​ሳላ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መላ​እክ​ት፤</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አበ​ው፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>.                                  
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ቦ፡ ​ኑኃ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል፡ ​ለማ​ቱሳ​ላ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(91) Fol. 14v: <fo:inline>The Ark of <fo:inline id="d1e70178PRS7594Noah">Noah</fo:inline> described as a <fo:inline font-style="italic">tābot</fo:inline>
                                   and filled with humans, cattle, horses, domesticated animals, and wild beasts. A second group of people are drowning. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70185PRS7594Noah">​ኖኅ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ታቦ​ት፤</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​እ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እን​ስሳ። ​አራ​ዊት፤</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማየ፡ ​አይ​ኅ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ኀብ​አ፡ ​ለኖ​ኅ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ከር​ሠ፡ ​ታቦ​ት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(92) Fol. 15r: <fo:inline>God decides to dwell in the house of <fo:inline id="d1e70218PRS8819Shem">Shem</fo:inline>, which is represented like a tent,
                                   rather than in that of <fo:inline id="d1e70221PRS5673Japheth">Japhet</fo:inline> or
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e70224PRS5038Ham">Ham</fo:inline>. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70228PRS5038Ham">​ካም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70232PRS5673Japheth">​ያፌ​ት፤</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ብእ​ሲቱ <fo:inline id="d1e70238PRS8819Shem">​ሴም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐይ​መት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኃደ​ረ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሐይ​መቱ፡ ​ለሴ​ም።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(93) Fol. 15v: <fo:inline>God entrusts Adam’s tomb to <fo:inline id="d1e70258PRS6988Melchize">Melchizedek</fo:inline> and appoints him as a priest. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70263PRS6988Melchize">​መል​ከ፡ ​ጼዴ​ቅ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መቃ​ብረ፡ ​አዳ​ም።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዓቀ​በ፡ ​መል​ከ፡ ​ጼዴ​ቅ፡ ​መቃ​ብረ፡ ​አዳ​ም።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(94) Fol. 16r: <fo:inline>God readies himself to scatter the people who are building the Tower of Babel. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጥቅ​መ፡ ​ስና​ዖር።</fo:inline> and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዘረ​ወ፡  ​ልሳ​ነ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​አን​ጋድ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(95) Fol. 16v: <fo:inline>God calls <fo:inline id="d1e70303PRS1267Abraham">Abraham</fo:inline>, who is accompanied by his wife <fo:inline id="d1e70305PRS8533Sarah">Sarah</fo:inline>,
                                   to the land of <fo:inline id="d1e70307LOC2109Canaan">Canaan</fo:inline>, which is populated with trees and located between two rivers. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70310PRS8533Sarah">​ሳራ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70314PRS1267Abraham">​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​፪ቱ፡ ​አፍ​ላግ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አው​ፅኦ፡ ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​እም​ከላ​ውዴ​ዎን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(96) Fol. 17r: <fo:inline>God, placed between the two columns of text, looks at
                                   the five cities of the plain engulfed by fires (above); <fo:inline id="d1e70335PRS6357Lot">Lot</fo:inline> and his daughters and wife, who turns back, 
                                   are guided away by the two angels (below). Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70342PRS6357Lot">​ሎጥ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኮነ​ት፡ ​ብእ​ሲቱ፡ ​ሐው​ልተ፡ ​ፄው፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ተመ​ይጠ​ት፡ ​ድኅ​ሬሃ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70349PRS6357Lot">​ሎጥ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​፪ኤ፡ ​አዋ​ልዲ​ሁ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​መር​ህዎ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አዝ​ነመ፡ ​እሳ​ተ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ሰዶ​ም፡ ​ወገ​ሞራ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(97) Fol. 17v: <fo:inline>Two scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e70370PRS8533Sarah">Sarah</fo:inline> gives one of her slaves to <fo:inline id="d1e70372PRS1267Abraham">Abraham</fo:inline> (left);
                                   the pair look at the newly born <fo:inline id="d1e70374PRS5578Isaac">Isaac</fo:inline> (right). Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70381PRS8533Sarah">​ሳራ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70386PRS1267Abraham">​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70390PRS8533Sarah">​ሳራ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70394PRS5578Isaac">​ይስ​ሐቅ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70398PRS1267Abraham">​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ንብ​ቲራ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ባ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ለሳ​ራ፡ ​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ኃለ​ፈ፡ ​መዋ​ዕሊ​ሃ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(98) Fol. 18r: <fo:inline>The Binding of <fo:inline id="d1e70415PRS5578Isaac">Isaac</fo:inline>. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>m
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70422PRS1267Abraham">​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70426PRS5578Isaac">​ይስ​ሐቅ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በግ​ዕ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዕፀ፡ ​ሳቤ​ቅ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70437PRS1267Abraham">​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70441PRS5578Isaac">​ይስ​ሐቅ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቤዘ​ዎ፡ ​ለይ​ስሐ​ቅ፡ ​በመ​ሥዋ​ዕተ፡ ​በግ​ዕ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(99) Fol. 18v: <fo:inline>Through the intervention of <fo:inline id="d1e70455PRS7049Michael">Michael the Archangel</fo:inline>
                                   neither <fo:inline id="d1e70458PRS3863Esau">Esau</fo:inline> nor <fo:inline id="d1e70461PRS6122Laban">Laban</fo:inline>
                                   harm <fo:inline id="d1e70464PRS5650Jacob">Jacob</fo:inline>, who is depicted in front of a tent, together with his
                                   two wives and his large flock of animals. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e70469PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70474PRS3863Esau">​ኤሳ​ው።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70478PRS6122Laban">​ላባ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐይ​መት።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ራሔል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70490PRS5650Jacob">​ያዕ​ቆብ</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ለያ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አፍ​ራስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አግ​ማል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አባ​ግዕ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዕድ​ግት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ፡ ​ለያ​ዕቆ​ብ፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​ኤሳ​ው፡ ​እኁ​ሁ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(100) Fol. : <fo:inline>The devil tests <fo:inline id="d1e70527PRS5691Job">Job</fo:inline>. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70534PRS11330Devil">​ሰይ​ጣን፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline> (twice),
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ብእ​ሲቱ፡ ​ለኢ​ዮብ፤</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሕማ​ሙ፡ ​ለኢ​ዮብ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሳፍ​ር፡ ​ኤል​ፋዝ፡ ​በል​ዳዶ​ስ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሐመ፡ ​ኢዮ​ብ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(101) Fol. 19v: <fo:inline>Three episodes: <fo:inline id="d1e70558PRS5763Joseph">Joseph</fo:inline> is sold by his brothers (above);
                                   his brothers depart with grain in their sacks as well as the objects placed there by his men and are chased by one of his stewards (bottom left);
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e70561PRS5763Joseph">Joseph</fo:inline> confronts his brothers. Captions:   
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሤጥ​ዎ፡ ​ለዮ​ሴፍ፡ ​አኃ​ዊሁ፡</fo:inline>,	
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አግ​ማል፡</fo:inline>,	
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዕድ​ግት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70578PRS5763Joseph">​ዮሴ​ፍ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አን​ገሦ፡ ​ለዮ​ሴፍ፡ ​በብ​ሔረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(102) Fol. 20r: <fo:inline>To the left God encounters <fo:inline id="d1e70592PRS7181MosesM">Moses</fo:inline> on a mountain with his flock of sheep. To the right the latter sets off towards Egypt. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፤</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70599PRS7181MosesM">​ሙሴ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline> (twice), and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አባ​ግዕ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈነ​ዎ፡ ​ለሙ​ሴ፡ ​እም​ብሔ​ረ፡ ​ምድ​ያም። ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(103) Fol. 20v: <fo:inline>God observers the suffering of the Israelites and listens to their pleas. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline> and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፤</fo:inline>.                          
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወረ​ደ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያድ​ኅኖ​ሙ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝቡ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(104) Fol. 21r: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e70632PRS7181MosesM">Moses</fo:inline> confronts the Pharaoh and his officials. 
                                   His staff has become a snake that swallows the snake conjured from a staff by two magicians. 
                                   In the bottom right corner, the livestock of the Egyptians are dead because of the fifth plague. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፤</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፈር​ዖን</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70645PRS7181MosesM">​ሙሴ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ግብ​ጻው​ያን።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ከይ​ሲ፡</fo:inline>.                               
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀሠ​ፎሙ፡ ​ለግ​ብጻ​ውያ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(105) Fol. 21v: <fo:inline>The Crossing of the Red Sea. Captions:                           
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አስ​ጠሞ፡ ​ለፈ​ርዖ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሠራ​ዊቱ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፈር​ዖን</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኤር​ትራ፡</fo:inline>.                                   
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ከፈ​ለ፡ ​ባሕ​ረ፡ ​ኤር​ትራ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(106) Fol. 22r: <fo:inline>The people of Israel celebrate the Pharaoh’s defeat by singing while <fo:inline id="d1e70694PRS11610Miriam">Miriam</fo:inline> beats a drum before her brothers. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70698PRS7181MosesM">​ሙሴ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70702PRS7049Michael">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ከበ​ሮ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እኅ​ተ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e70717PRS7181MosesM">​ሙሴ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሰብ​ሕዎ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​በጽ​ንፈ፡ ​ባሕ​ር።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(107) Fol. 22v: <fo:inline>God creates clouds to shield the Israelites from the heat of the sun. Captions:                                 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ደመ​ና፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70741PRS7181MosesM">​ሙሴ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70745PRS7049Michael">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ጸለ​ሎሙ፡ ​ደመ​ና፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(108) Fol. 23r: <fo:inline>The Israelites eat manna and drink the water that miraculously pours out from two mountains. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70761PRS7181MosesM">​ሙሴ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኰኵ​ሐ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70771PRS7181MosesM">​ሙሴ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማይ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አው​ኀዘ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​እም​ኰኵ​ሕ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(109) Fol. 23v: <fo:inline>A priest holding a torch and <fo:inline id="d1e70792PRS1002Aaron">Aaron</fo:inline> holding the budded staff and a censer stand before God while 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e70795PRS6053Korah">Korah</fo:inline> and his followers burn in an underground fire. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70799PRS1002Aaron">​አሮ​ን፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​አው​ዓዮ፡ ​ለቆ​ራ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቡ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀደ​ሰ፡ ​ክህ​ነቶ፡ ​ለአ​ሮን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(110) Fol. 24r: <fo:inline>An unidentified individual, probably <fo:inline id="d1e70820PRS5773Joshua">Joshua</fo:inline>, guides the leaders of the Israelites across the Promised Land.   
                                   Captions: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ቦሙ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝቡ፡ ​አህ​ጉረ፡ ፴ ​ነገ​ሥት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(111) Fol. 24v: <fo:inline>The crossing of the <fo:inline id="d1e70840LOC3959Jordan">Jordan</fo:inline> River. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70850LOC3959Jordan">​ዮር​ዳኖ​ስ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70854PRS5773Joshua">
                        <fo:inline>ኤያሱ። (!)</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.                                
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዓቀ​መ፡ ​ተከ​ዜ፡ ​ዮር​ዳኖ​ስ፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(112) Fol. 25r: <fo:inline>The fall of <fo:inline id="d1e70870LOC3956Jerich">Jericho</fo:inline>. Captions:                                 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e70881LOC3956Jerich">
                        <fo:inline>ኤሪኮ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   ‘Fall of <fo:inline id="d1e70884LOC3956Jerich">Jericho</fo:inline>’ (the latter in English).
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​አን​ሐለ፡ ​ጥቅ​መ፡ ኢ<fo:inline>[ያ]</fo:inline>​ሪኮ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(113) Fol. 25v: <fo:inline>The prostitute Rahab looks at the Israelites killing the men and rulers of Jericho. Captions:                                
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ራአ​ብ፡ ​ዘማ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e70913LOC3956Jerich">​ኢያ​ሪኮ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃና፡ ​ለረ​አብ፡ ​ዘማ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ተሐ​ጕሉ፡ ​ዓላ​ውያ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(114) Fol. 26r: <fo:inline>Two scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e70929PRS5773Joshua">Joshua</fo:inline> makes peace with the people of Gibeon (above); 
                                   and the sun stands still for him and his army (below). Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​ቆመ፡ ​ፀሐ​ይ፡ ለ<fo:inline id="d1e70937PRS5773Joshua">​ኢያ​ሱ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አብ​ኦሙ፡ ​ለኢ​ያሱ፡ ​ወለ​ካሌ​ብ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(115) Fol. 26v: <fo:inline>Two scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e70954PRS2394Balaam">Balaam</fo:inline> and the angel (left); 
                                   and Phinehas raises his spear to kill an Israelite man who is copulating with a Midianite woman before a golden idol, while another one performs a sacrifice below (right). Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e70964PRS2394Balaam">​በለ​ዓም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e70969PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዕድ​ግት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፊን​ሐስ፡ ​ዘም​ሪ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ከስ​ቢ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጣዖ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and	
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መሥ​ዋዕ​ተ፡ ​ጣዖ​ት፡</fo:inline>.	
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ፊን​ሐስ፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ብድ​ብድ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(116) Fol. 27r: <fo:inline>Jael drives a peg through the head of Sisera. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዲቦ​ራ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐይ​መት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሕዝ​በ፡ ​ሲሳ​ራ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኢያ​ዔል፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሲሳ​ራ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀተ​ለቶ፡ ​ኢያ​ኤል፡ ​ለሲ​ሳራ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(117) Fol. 27v: <fo:inline>Three scenes showing military leaders: Jephthah sacrifices his daughter who had come out to meet him (upper left); 
                                   Gideon defeats the Midianites (bottom left); and <fo:inline id="d1e71032PRS8469Samson">Samson</fo:inline> defeats the Philistines brandishing the donkey jaw.  
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዮፍ​ታሔ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መን​ከሰ፡ ​ዓድ​ግ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጌዴ​ዎን፡</fo:inline>, 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ጌዴ​ዎን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ምድ​ያም፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71055PRS8469Samson">​ሶም​ሶን፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ኢሎ​ፍሊ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዓቀ​ቦሙ፡ ​እም​ፀር፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ጌዴ​ዎን፡ ​ወዮ​ፍታ​ሔ፤ ​ወሶ​ምሶ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(118) Fol. 28r: <fo:inline>Four scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e71073PRS8478Samuel">Samuel</fo:inline> addresses the Israelites after the death of Eli (upper left); 
                                   the five Philistine kings send the Ark of the Covenant back to Israel (bottom left); 
                                   king <fo:inline id="d1e71076PRS8567Saul">Saul</fo:inline> addresses an armed man, probably his son (upper right); 
                                   and the Israelites defeat the Philistines (bottom right). Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71083PRS8478Samuel">​ሳሙ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኤሊ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሳኦ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ታቦ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አፍ​ኒን፡ ​ፊን​ሐስ፡</fo:inline>, and                             
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ኢሎ​ፍሊ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል፡ ​እም​ኢሎ​ፍሊ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(119) Fol. 28v: <fo:inline>Three scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e71116PRS3417David">David</fo:inline> plays for King <fo:inline id="d1e71119PRS8567Saul">Saul</fo:inline> who hurls a spear at him (upper left);
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e71122PRS3417David">David</fo:inline> defeats <fo:inline id="d1e71125PRS11293Goliath">Goliath</fo:inline> who is wearing a chainmail and pointed helmet and the
                                   Philistines flee (bottom); Joab hurls his spear at Absalom who is hanging from a tree. Captions:                        
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ፡ ​ለዳ​ዊት፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​ሳኦ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71139PRS3417David">​ዳዊ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኢሎ​ፍሊ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጎል​ያድ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኢዮ​አብ፡</fo:inline>, and 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አቤ​ሴሎ​ም፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ፡ ​ለዳ​ዊት፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​ጎል​ያድ፡ ​ወእ​ምአ​ቤሴ​ሎም፡ ​ወል​ዱ፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(120) Fol. 29r: <fo:inline>Five scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e71166PRS3417David">David</fo:inline> interacts with two unidentified men (his courtiers or soldiers); Uriah dies in battle; 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e71169PRS3417David">David</fo:inline> marries <fo:inline id="d1e71172PRS2558Bathsheb">Batsheba</fo:inline>; 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e71175PRS13685Nathan">Nathan</fo:inline> reproaches the king for his behaviour; 
                                   and <fo:inline id="d1e71178PRS3417David">David</fo:inline> lies on the ground to seek forgiveness. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71183PRS3417David">​ዳዊ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኦር​ዮ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71193PRS2558Bathsheb">​ቤር​ሳቤ​ሕ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71197PRS3417David">​ዳዊ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71201PRS3417David">​ዳዊ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71206PRS13685Nathan">​ናታ​ን፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወድ​ቀ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሰረ​የ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(121) Fol. 29v: <fo:inline> Solomon is appointed king over the kings of the world. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71227PRS8925Solomon">​ሰሎ​ሞን፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ነገ​ሥተ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡</fo:inline>.                                   
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​ረሰ​ዮ፡ ​መክ​ብበ፡ ​ነገ​ሥት፡ ​ለሰ​ሎሞ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(122) Fol. 30r: <fo:inline>The Kings of Israel pray to God. Captions: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline> and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ነገ​ሥታ​ት።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሰም​ዓ፡ ​ጸሎ​ቶሙ፡ ​ለነ​ገሥ​ተ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​በበ​ጊዜ​ሁ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(123) Fol. 30v: <fo:inline>The Prophets of Israel have visions with the just in Paradise and the sinners in Hell. Captions: 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ነቢ​ያት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጻድ​ቃን፤</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኃጥ​አን፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገሃ​ነመ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኃረ​ዮሙ፡ ​ለነ​ቢያ​ት፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይር​አዩ፡ ​ዕሤ​ተ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​ወፍ​ዳ፡ ​ለኃ​ጥአ​ን፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(124) Fol. 31r: <fo:inline>Three scenes: King Ahab asks for Naboth’s vineyard; the latter is killed; and dogs devour the decapitated body of the king’s wife Jezebel. 
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አክ​ዓብ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኤል​ዛቤ​ል፡</fo:inline> (twice), and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ናቡ​ቴ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተበ​ቀለ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​አክ​ዓብ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ግፍ​ዓ፡ ​ናቡ​ቴ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(125) Fol. 31v: <fo:inline>Three scenes: God instructs <fo:inline id="d1e71312PRS3721Elijah">Elijah </fo:inline>; the prophet confronts King Ahab; 
                                   the king, who has now aged, sits afraid outside the city walls. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71319PRS3721Elijah">​ኤል​ያስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አክ​ዓብ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ኤል​ያስ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ደን​ገፀ፡ ​ከዓ​ብ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ነገ​ሮ፡ ​ለኤ​ልያ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ደን​ገፀ፡ ​አክ​ዓብ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(126) Fol. 32r: <fo:inline>Three scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e71342PRS3721Elijah">Elijah </fo:inline> in the wilderness speaks to God and is aided by an angel;
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e71345PRS3721Elijah">Elijah</fo:inline> appoints <fo:inline id="d1e71348PRS3723Elisha">Elisha</fo:inline> as his disciple; 
                                   the Aramean soldiers are unable to seize <fo:inline id="d1e71351PRS3723Elisha">Elisha</fo:inline>. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ኤ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ፡ ​ለኤ​ልያ​ስ፡ ​እም​እደ፡ አ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(127) Fol. 32v: <fo:inline>Three scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e71377PRS5754Jonah">Jonah</fo:inline> and the big fish; God instructs <fo:inline id="d1e71380PRS5754Jonah">Jonah</fo:inline>; 
                                   and a naked <fo:inline id="d1e71383PRS5754Jonah">Jonah</fo:inline> confronts the Ninevites before the leafy plant. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐመ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71390PRS5754Jonah">​ዮና​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አን​በሪ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ነነ​ዌ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እሳ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አው​ፅኦ፡ ​እም​ከር​ሠ፡ ​አን​በሪ፡ ​ለዮ​ናስ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(128) Fol. 33r: <fo:inline>God addresses the Two Tribes of Israel that are left after the other Ten Tribes are deported by the Assyrian King Shalmaneser. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፪ ​አን​ጋደ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ስል​ምና​ሶር፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፄዋ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ባል​ሖሙ፡ ​ለ፪ ​አን​ጋድ። ​አመ፡ ​ፄወ​ዎሙ፡ ​ስል​ምና​ሶር፡ ​ለ፲ ​አን​ጋደ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(129) Fol. 33v: <fo:inline>King <fo:inline id="d1e71440PRS5330Hezekiah">Hezekiah</fo:inline>
                                   prays to God who sends an angel to kill the men of the Assyrian ruler <fo:inline id="d1e71443 PRS8762Sennache">Sennacherib</fo:inline>
                                   in their encampment who is later beheaded by two of his sons while praying to an idol. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ጸለ​የ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71448PRS5330Hezekiah">​ሕዝ​ቅያ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ወኢ​ሳይ​ያስ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀተ​ልዎ፡ ​ደቂ​ቁ፡ ​ለሰ​ናክ​ሬም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ጣዖ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71467 PRS8762Sennache">​ሰና​ክሬም</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀተ​ለ፡ ት ዕ ​ይን​ተ፡ ​ሰና​ክሬ​ም፡ ​በሰ​ይፈ፡ ​መል​አክ። ​ሶበ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ት ፡ ​ዕይ​ርቶ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(130) Fol. 34r: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e71486PRS6644Manasseh">Manasseh</fo:inline> prays to God and is restored to his kingdom. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ጸለ​የ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71491PRS6644Manasseh">​ምና​ሴ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተሞ​ቅሐ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተመ​ይጠ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ቱ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈት​ሖ፡ ​ለም​ናሴ፡ ​እሙ​ቃሔ​ሁ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(131) Fol. 34v: <fo:inline>An angel sent by God cleanses <fo:inline id="d1e71514PRS5584Isaiah">Isaiah</fo:inline> of leprosy by touching his mouth with a hot piece of coal held with thongs. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጒጠ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71524PRS5584Isaiah"> ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አን​ጽሖ፡ ​ለኢ​ሳይ​ያስ፡ ​እም​ለም​ጹ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(132) Fol. 35r: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e71541PRS5774Josiah"> Josiah</fo:inline> celebrates the Passover by having lambs and cattle sacrificed and by burning offerings to God.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71548PRS5774Josiah">​ኢዮ​ስያ​ስ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እሳ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መሥ​ዋዕ​ተ፡ ​አባ​ግዕ፡ ​ወአ​ልህ​ምት።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተወ​ክፈ፡ ​መሥ​ዋዕ​ተ፡ ​ኢዮ​ስያ​ስ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(133) Fol. 35v: <fo:inline>God saves <fo:inline id="d1e71568PRS5680Jeremiah">Jeremiah</fo:inline> from the mud cistern in which he was thrown by officials of King Zedekiah. 
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71573PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71581PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሴዴ​ቅያ​ስ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወፅ​አ፡ ​እም​ዓዘ​ቅት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተወ​ድየ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዓዘ​ቅት።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አው​ፅኦ፡ ​ለኤ​ርም​ያስ፡ ​እም​ግበ፡ ​ዓም​ዓም፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ወደ​ዮ፡ ​ሴዴ​ቅያ​ስ፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(134) Fol. 36r: <fo:inline>Three scenes: the miraculous sleep of Ebed-Melech (Abimelech) the Ethiopian; God speaks to <fo:inline id="d1e71605PRS2516Baruch">Baruch</fo:inline> through 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e71608PRS5680Jeremiah">Jeremiah</fo:inline>; and the Israelites, along with their blind and shackled king, are taken captive by King 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e71611PRS11373Nebuc">Nebuchadnezzar</fo:inline> who rides among his armed men who are shown holding guns, shields, and spears.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አቤ​ሜሌ​ክ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መላ​እክ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71625PRS2516Baruch">​ባሮክ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71631PRS5680Jeremiah">​ኤር​ምያ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71638PRS11373Nebuc">​ናቡ​ከደ​ነ፡ ​ጻር፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተዓ​ወረ፡ ​ሴዴ​ቅያ​ስ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተፄ​ወዉ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ናቡ​ከደ​ነ፡ ​ጾር።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(135) Fol. 36v: <fo:inline>A miniature showing the Three Youths in the fiery Furnace.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71661PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71669PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71673PRS11373Nebuc">​ናቡ​ከደ​ነ፡ ​ጻር፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71678PRS11288AnAzMi">፫ ​ደቂ​ቅ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እቶ​ነ፡ <fo:inline>[እ]</fo:inline>​ሳት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71689PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ​ሙ፡ ​ለ፫ ​ደቂ​ቅ፡ ​እም​እቶ​ነ፡ ​እሳ​ት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(136) Fol. 37r: <fo:inline>God transforms King <fo:inline id="d1e71704PRS11373Nebuc">Nebuchadnezzar</fo:inline> into a wild boar.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71711PRS11373Nebuc">​ናቡ​ከደ​ነ፡ ​ጻር፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ሐራ​ውያ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ናቡ​ከደ​ነ፡ ​ጾር፡ ​አር​ዌ፡ ​ምድ​ር።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(137) Fol. 37v: <fo:inline>Two scenes: God turns King <fo:inline id="d1e71734PRS11373Nebuc">Nebuchadnezzar</fo:inline> back into a human being; and the king is crowned and enthroned and
                                   attended by several courtiers including <fo:inline id="d1e71737PRS3337Daniel">Daniel</fo:inline> and the <fo:inline id="d1e71740PRS11288AnAzMi">Three Youths</fo:inline>.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71744PRS11373Nebuc">​ናቡ​ከደ​ነ፡ ​ጻር፡</fo:inline> ​ዘይ​ቤ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ቱ፡ ​ዘለ​ዓለ​ም። ​ወም​ኵና​ኑኒ፡ ​ለት​ውል​ደ፡ ​ትው​ልድ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71753PRS3337Daniel">​ዳን​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71757PRS11373Nebuc">​ናቡ​ከደ​ነጻ​ር፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71761PRS11288AnAzMi">፫ ​ደቂ​ቅ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሜጦ፡ ​ለና​ቡከ​ደነ፡ ​ጾር፡ ​እም​ግዕ​ዘ፡ ​አር​ዌ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዘቀ​ዳሚ፡ ​ግዕ​ዙ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(138) Fol. 38r: <fo:inline>Two scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e71775PRS3337Daniel">Daniel</fo:inline> listens to the accounts of <fo:inline id="d1e71778PRS11599Susanna">Susanna</fo:inline> and the two elders;
                                   and the two elders are stoned to death for their lies.                      
                                   Captions:            
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71782PRS3337Daniel">​ዳን​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ረበ​ናት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71789PRS11599Susanna">​ሶስ​ና፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወገ​ርዎ​ሙ፡ ​ለረ​በናት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃና፡ ​ለሶ​ስና፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​ረበ​ናት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(139) Fol. 38v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e71811PRS3337Daniel">Daniel</fo:inline> in the lion’s den.        
                                   Captions:               
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71816PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71824PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወደ​ይዎ፡ ለ<fo:inline id="d1e71829PRS3337Daniel">​ዳን​ኤል፡</fo:inline> ​ውስ​ተ፡  ​ግበ፡  ​አና​ብስ​ት።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71838PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ግብ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አና​ብስ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ፡ ​ለዳ​ንኤ​ል፡ ​እም​አፈ፡ ​አና<fo:inline>[ብ]</fo:inline>​ስት፡ ​ርኁ​ባን፡ ​ሐራ፡ ​ዳር​ዮስ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ወደ​ይዎ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(140) Fol. 39r: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e71861PRS4914Habakkuk">Habakkuk</fo:inline> brings bread in a basket to <fo:inline id="d1e71864PRS3337Daniel">Daniel</fo:inline>.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71869PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71877PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71885PRS4914Habakkuk">​ዕን​ባቆ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቦአ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71890PRS3337Daniel">​ዳን​ኤል፡</fo:inline> ​ወስ​ተ፡ ​ግበ፡ ​አና​ብስ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መሶ​ብ፡ ​ወርቅ</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አጾ​ሮ፡ ​ለዕ​ንባ​ቆም፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ምሳ​ሐ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(141) Fol. 39v: <fo:inline>Two scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e71908PRS3942Ezekiel">Ezekiel</fo:inline> has a vision of God surrounded by the tetramorph; 
                                   and <fo:inline id="d1e71911PRS3942Ezekiel">Ezekiel</fo:inline> dreams of the Valley of Dry Bones.                              
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ሰብ​እ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ንስ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71925PRS3942Ezekiel">​ሕዝ​ቅኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​አን​በሳ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ላህ​ም፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71935PRS3942Ezekiel">​ሕዝ​ቅኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ምው​ታን፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አን​ሥአ፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቅኤ​ል፡ ​አዕ​ፅም​ተ፡ ​ምው​ታን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(142) Fol. 40r: <fo:inline>Two scenes: a group of three prophets, including <fo:inline id="d1e71953PRS3814Enoch">Enoch</fo:inline>, 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e71956PRS3721Elijah">Elijah</fo:inline>, and <fo:inline id="d1e71959PRS3943Ezra">Ezra</fo:inline>, converses before God; 
                                   Ezra writes his book, an additional empty sheet of parchment at his side is represented as an empty rectangle.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71963PRS7049Michael">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71971PRS4377Gabriel">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71975PRS3814Enoch">​ሄኖ​ክ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71979PRS3721Elijah">​ኤል​ያስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e71983PRS3943Ezra">​እዝ​ራ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ጸሐ​ፈ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e71988PRS3943Ezra">​እዝ​ራ፡</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>መጽሕፍተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ነቢ​ያት። ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​አው​ዓይ​ዎሙ ​በእ​ሳት።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አል​ዓሎ፡ ​ለእ​ዝራ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሀለ​ዉ፡ ​ሄኖ​ክ፡ ​ወኤ​ልያ​ስ፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(143) Fol. 40v: <fo:inline>Jeconiah is freed from prison during the reign of Amel-Marduk and after the death of the latter’s father, 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e72005PRS11373Nebuc">Nebuchadnezzar</fo:inline>.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ባቢ​ሎን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኢኮ​ንያ​ን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኤዎ​ልማ​ሮዴ​ቅ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሞተ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ከደ​ነ፡ ​ጾር፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈት​ሖ፡ ​ለኢ​ኮን​ያን፡ ​እማ​እሰ​ሩ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(144) Fol. 41r: <fo:inline>Five scenes: the hand of the angel of god writes a prophecy about the imminent death of Belshazzar during the banquet at the later’s court;
                                   Belshazzar’s dignitaries and wives participate in the banquet; the cup of God is brought to the banquet; Belshazzar’s beheaded body;
                                   Belshazzar’s head is shown to the people of Israel.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ጸሐ​ፈ፡ ​እደ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ማኔ፡ ​ቴቄ​ል፡ ​ፋሬ​ስ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ብላ​ጣሶ​ር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ብእ​ሲቱ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አኀ​ዘተ፡ ​ጽዋ​ዓ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ቦሙ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ወዓ​ለሁ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አም​ስሐ፡ ​መኳ​ንን​ቲሁ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​መጠ​ዋ፡ ​ጽዋ​ዓ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈከ​ረ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል፡ ​ሕል​ማ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​መተ​ረ፡ ​ርእ​ሰ፡ ​ብል​ጣሶ​ር፡ ​በሰ​ይፈ፡ ​ርእ​ሱ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(145) Fol. 41v: <fo:inline>King <fo:inline id="d1e72076PRS3264CyrusII">Cyrus</fo:inline> announces to the Israelites that they may return home; one of his officers plays a drum.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72086PRS3264CyrusII">​ቂሮስ</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዜነ​ወ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ዓዋ​ዲ፡ ​ሚጠ​ቶሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አስ​ተጋ​ብኦ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ፄዋ​ዌ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(146) Fol. 42r: <fo:inline>Zorobabel leads the Jews back from captivity. Captions: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ትሩ​ፋነ፡ ​ባቢ​ሎን፡</fo:inline>, and <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72114PRS5773Joshua">​ዮሴ​ዕ፡</fo:inline> ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ዮሴ​ዴቅ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሜጦ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​እም​ፄዋ​ዌ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(147) Fol. 42v: <fo:inline>Two scenes: the Israelites return to Jerusalem led by Joshua, Zorobabel, and a third unidentified leader; and a battle between the Israelites and the people of Gog. Captions: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72130PRS5773Joshua">​ዮሴ​ዕ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘሩ​ባቤ​ል፡</fo:inline>, and <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ጎግ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ቦሙ፡ ​ምህ​ርካ፡ ​ነኪ​ራን፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ጎግ፡ ​ለዘ​ሩባ​ቤል፡ ​ወዮ​ሴዕ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(148) Fol. 43r: <fo:inline>Three scenes: Judith meets Holofernes in his camp; she beheads him; and her slave brings his head back to the town in the food bag.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዮዲ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሆሎ​ፎር​ኒስ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀተ​ለቶ፡ ​ዮዲ​ት፡ ​ለሆ​ሎፎ​ርኒ​ስ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐይ​መት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀተ​ሎ፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ዮዲ​ት፡ ​ለሆ​ሎፎ​ርኒ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(149) Fol. 43v: <fo:inline>Three scenes: an unidentified man, possibly Haman, and two attendants, among whom possibly Mordecai refusing to bow before him; 
                                   Mordecai tells Queen Esther about a plot to kill the Israelites; Haman is hung on a forked pole;
                                   and King Ahasuerus praises Mordecai. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አስ​ቴር።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መር​ዶክ​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተሰ​ቅለ፡ ሐ<fo:inline>[ማ]</fo:inline>፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አር​ጤከ​ስስ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መር​ዶክ​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ወለ​መር​ዶክ​ዮስ፡ ​በቀ​ቲለ፡ ​ፀሮ​ሙ፡ ​ሐማ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(150) Fol. 44r: <fo:inline>The Israelites rebuild the walls of Jerusalem in spite of the opposition of Sanballat and his soldiers. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰን​በላጥ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ ​ሰን​በላ​ጥ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ​ሙ፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​ሰን​በላ​ጥ፡ ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ወጠ​ኑ፡ ​ሐኒ​ፀ፡ ​ማኅ​ደር፡ ​ካል​እ፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(151) Fol. 44v: <fo:inline>Two scenes: Alexander the Great has a vision of a sword-bearing angel; and he pays tribute with a gift to the high priest and his entourage.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ክን​ድር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሰገ​ደ፡ ​እስክ<fo:inline>[ን]</fo:inline>​ድር፡ ​ለሊ​ቀ፡ ​ካህና<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አም​ኃ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ካህ​ናት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አደ​ንገ​ፆ፡ ​ለእ​ስክ​ንድ​ር፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​በር​እየ​ተ፡ ​ሰይ​ፉ፡ ​ለመ​ልአ​ክ፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(152) Fol. 45r: <fo:inline>Two scenes: <fo:inline id="d1e72277PRS7984Ptolemy">Ptolemy II</fo:inline> is inspired by God to commission the translation of the Bible into Greek;
                                   an angel stops <fo:inline id="d1e72280PRS8854Simeon">Simeon</fo:inline> from changing the text of Isaiah that claims a Virgin will bear a son.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72284PRS7984Ptolemy">​በጥ​ሊሞ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ካል​አኒሁ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ጸሐ​ፍት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72301PRS8854Simeon">​ስም​ዖን፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐይ​መት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ቦ፡ ​ለስ​ምዖ​ን፡ ​ብዙ​ኃ፡ ​ዘመ​ነ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ትወ​ልድ፡ ​ድን​ግል።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(153) Fol. 45v: <fo:inline>Antiochus IV puts the Israelites to death and has a wild board sacrificed in the Temple to desecrate it. 
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሥዕ​ለ፡ ​ፀሐ​ይ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አን​ጥያ​ኮስ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዞሙ፡ ​ይሡ​ዑ፡ <fo:inline>[መ]</fo:inline>​ሥዋ​ዕተ፡ ​ጣዖ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ​ሙ፡ ​ለመ​ቃብ​ያን፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​አን​ጥያ​ኮስ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(154) Fol. 46r: <fo:inline>Antiochus IV puts Lazarus and his children to death. 
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​አል​ዓዛ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አል​ዓዛ​ር፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መስ​ብር፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተወ​ክፉ፡ ​ሥቃ​ያተ፡ ​አል​ዓዛ​ር፡ ​ወደ​ቂቁ፡ ​ወብ​እሲ​ቱ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥቱ፡ ​ለአ​ንጥ​ያኮ​ስ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(155) Fol. 46v: <fo:inline>An angel brings heavenly bread to <fo:inline id="d1e72372PRS6819Mary">Mary</fo:inline> in a basket. 
                                   Captions:  
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤተ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ባ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ኅብ​ስተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያዌ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኃረ​ያ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​እም​አን​ስተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(156) Fol. 47r: <fo:inline>The Annunciation of <fo:inline id="d1e72395PRS4377Gabriel">Gabriel</fo:inline>to <fo:inline id="d1e72398PRS6819Mary">Mary</fo:inline> 
                                   who is reading the Book of Isaiah. Captions: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72403PRS6819Mary">​ማር​ያም።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72408PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈነ​ወ፡ ​ለወ​ልዱ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይል​በስ፡ ​ሥጋ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(157) Fol. 47v: <fo:inline>A Nativity scene with shepherds playing the Ethiopian game of gannā and a donor in proskynesis. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተወ​ልደ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጎል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72437PRS6819Mary">​ማር​ያም።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ነት፡ ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ጽዮ​ን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዮሴ​ፍ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ላህ<fo:inline>[​ም፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰሎ​ሜ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዕድ​ግት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኖሎ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አር​አዮ​ሙ፡ ​ለኖ​ሎት፡ ​ልደ​ተ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ልሔ​ም።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(158) Fol. 48r: <fo:inline>The circumcision of <fo:inline id="d1e72476PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline>. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72481PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72489PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72493PRS8417Salome">​ሰሎ​ሜ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72499PRS6819Mary">​ማር​ያም።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72503PRS5684JesusCh">​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተገ​ዝረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(159) Fol. 48v: <fo:inline>The adoration of the Magi. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72522PRS6819Mary">​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወሀ​ብዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​አም​ኃ፡ ​ነገ​ሥተ፡ ​ፋር​ስ። ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይሰ​ግዱ፡ ​ሎቱ።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​መር​ሖሙ፡ ​ለሰ​ብአ፡ ​ሰገ​ል፡ ​በት​እም​ርተ፡ ​ኮከ​ብ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(160) Fol. 49r: <fo:inline>The Flight into Egypt. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዜነ​ዎ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​በሕ​ልም፡ ለ<fo:inline id="d1e72545PRS5764Joseph">​ዮሴ​ፍ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72549PRS8417Salome">​ሰሎሜ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72555PRS5764Joseph">​ዮሴ​ፍ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72560PRS6819Mary">​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72563PRS5684JesusCh">​ወል​ዳ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዘ፡ ​ለዮ​ሴፍ፡ ​በአ​ፈ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይን​ሣእ፡ ​ሕፃ​ነ፡ ​ወእ​ሞ፡ ​ወይ​ጕየ​ይ፡ ​ብሔ​ረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(161) Fol. 49v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e72577PRS5299Herod">Herod</fo:inline> commands the Massacre of the Innocents and the beheading of 
                                   <fo:inline id="d1e72580PRS10691Zechari">Zechariah</fo:inline> in the Temple, while <fo:inline id="d1e72583PRS3725Elizabet">Elizabeth</fo:inline> is able to escape.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72587PRS5299Herod">​ሄሮ​ድስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀተ​ልዎ፡ ​ለዘ​ካር​ያስ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72598PRS3725Elizabet">​ኤል​ሳቤ​ጥ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተቀ​ትሉ፡ ​ሕፃ​ናት።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ፡ ​ለዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​ሄሮ​ድስ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(162) Fol. 50r: <fo:inline>The Baptism of <fo:inline id="d1e72615PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline> in the Jordan.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወረ​ደ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​በአ​ምሳ​ለ፡ ​ርግ​ብ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72625PRS5684JesusCh">​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72629PRS5741Johnthe">​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​መጥ​ምቅ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዮር​ዳኖ​ስ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተጠ​ምቀ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​መጥ​ምቅ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(163) Fol. 50v: <fo:inline>The Temptation of <fo:inline id="d1e72647PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline>.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰይ​ጣን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72657PRS5684JesusCh">​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰይ​ጣን።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ሞኦ፡ ​ለሰ​ይጣ​ን፡ ​በገ​ዳም።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(164) Fol. 51r: <fo:inline>The Last Supper. Captions: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72676PRS5684JesusCh">​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline> and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​አር​አዮ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ለአ​ርዳ​ኢሁ፡ ​ሥር​ዓተ፡ ​ቍር​ባን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(165) Fol. 51v: <fo:inline>The Agony in the Garden. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡ ​ዘወ​ሀቦ፡ ​መስ​ቀለ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ጽዋ​ዕ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72700PRS5684JesusCh">​እግ​ዚእነ</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">"&gt;<fo:inline id="d1e72705PRS5695John">​ዮሐ​ንስ፡</fo:inline> ​ፍቁ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72710PRS5662James">​ያዕ​ቆብ፡</fo:inline> ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ዘብ​ዴዎ​ስ።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72717PRS7805Peter">​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈነ​ወ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሁ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ኃያ​ል፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(166) Fol. 52r: <fo:inline>A combination of the Anastasis and Resurrection of <fo:inline id="d1e72732PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline>.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መላ​እክ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72739PRS5684JesusCh">​እግ​ዚእነ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መላ​እክ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዓቀ​ብተ፡ ​መቃ​ብር።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተን​ሥአ፡ ​እም​ውታ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(167) Fol. 52v: <fo:inline>The Ascension of <fo:inline id="d1e72762PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline>.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72766PRS5684JesusCh">​እግ​ዚእነ</fo:inline>፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72775PRS6819Mary">​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት። ​እለ፡ ​ነጸ​ሩ፡ ​ዕር​ገተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ዓር​ገ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(168) Fol. 53r: <fo:inline>Pentecost.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ርደ​ተ፡ ​ጰራ​ቅሊ​ጦስ፡ ​በአ​ምሳ​ለ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72801PRS6819Mary">​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ፈነ​ወ፡ ​መን​ፈሶ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሰ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​አር​ዳኢ​ሁ፡ ​በአ​ምሳ​ለ፡ ​እሳ​ት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(169) Fol. 53v: <fo:inline>The Second Coming of <fo:inline id="d1e72815PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline>.
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጻድ​ቃን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ትእ​ምር​ተ፡ ​ኵና​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72825PRS5684JesusCh">​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ትእ​ምር​ተ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጻድ​ቃን፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኃጥ​አን።</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[ዘ]</fo:inline>​ከመ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ያር​ኢ፡ ​ትእ​ምር<fo:inline>[ተ]</fo:inline>፡ ​ርግ​ዘቱ፡ ​ወስ​ቅለ​ቱ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(170) Fol. 54r: <fo:inline>The Last Judgment. In this miniature Christ is identified with the caption <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline> that is elsewhere reserved for the Father). Other captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መላ​እክ​ት፡</fo:inline> (twice),        
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጻድ​ቃን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኃጥ​አን፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገሃ​ነመ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[ዘ]</fo:inline>​ከመ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ለኰ​ንኖ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(171) Fol. 54v: <fo:inline>The Trinity and a donor in proskynesis. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሥላ​ሴ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ።</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ንስ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​አን​በሳ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ላህ​ም፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">በ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e72903PRS13954TaklaMa">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   The last caption has been partially erased. 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አስ​ተር​አዩ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​መን​በር፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ሥሉ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አኀ​ዝያ​ነ፡ ​ፍጥ​ረት፤</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(172) Fol. 55r: <fo:inline>The Martyrdom of <fo:inline id="d1e72920PRS7805Peter">Peter</fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e72923PRS7743Paul">Paul</fo:inline>. 
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተሰ​ቅለ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72931PRS7805Peter">​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ቊል​ቊሊ​ተ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መል​አክ፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተመ​ትረ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በሰ​ይፍ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72949PRS7743Paul">​ጳው​ሎስ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አጽ​ንዖ​ሙ፡ ​በገ​ድል፡ ​ለጴ​ጥሮ​ስ፡ ​ወለ​ጳው​ሎስ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(173) Fol. 55v: <fo:inline>A group of unidentified martyrs and saints with Gabra Manfas Qǝddus and St George. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጻድ​ቃን፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አቡ​ነ፡ ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰማ​ዕታ​ት፡</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ጊዮ​ርጊ​ስ፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኃደ​ጎሙ፡ ​ለጻ​ድቃ​ን፡ ​ወሰ​ማዕ​ት፡ ​አም​ሳለ፡ ​ብሩ​ር፡ ​ይት​ፈተ​ኑ፡ ​በእ​ሳት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(174) Fol. 56r: <fo:inline>God saves a group of martyrs from lions and flames. Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e72992PRS7049Michael">​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e73000PRS4377Gabriel">​ገብ​ርኤ​ል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አና​ብስ​ት፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰማ​ዕት፡ ​ወጻ​ድቃ​ን።</fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እሳ​ት፡</fo:inline>.
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[ዘ]</fo:inline>​ከመ፡ ​አድ​ኃኖ​ሙ፡ ​እም​አፈ፡ ​አን​በሳ፡ ​ወእ​ሳት፡ ​ለፍ​ቁራ​ኒሁ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​ወሰ​ማዕ​ት።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(175) Fol. 56v: <fo:inline>God the Father flanked by <fo:inline id="d1e73026PRS15405Zamalakot">
                     <fo:inline font-style="italic">ʾAbuna</fo:inline>
                                   Zamalakot</fo:inline> and enthroned above the donor, <fo:inline id="d1e73031PRS13954TaklaMa">Takla Māryām</fo:inline>, in proskynesis. 
                                   Captions:
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ንስ​ር፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​አን​በሳ፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገጸ፡ ​ላህ​ም፡</fo:inline>,
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ ​ከሠ​ተ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ድር​ሳነ፡ ​ለአ​ቡነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e73052PRS15405Zamalakot">​ዘመ​ለኮ​ት።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>, and
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በከ​መ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e73059PRS13954TaklaMa">​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>.
                                   The last caption has been partially erased. 
                                   <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አስ​ተር​አየ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በዋ​ሕድ​ናሁ።</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is deficient.
                                  The bookblock has been damaged by humidity, especially in the lower outer margins,
                                  causing the deformation of the parchment support in correspondence of the outer corners and the formation of dark spots, possibly mould (e.g. fols 37, 104v)
                                  Stains of various origins are present both on the leather cover and the bookblock (e.g. fols 33v, 34r, 35v).
                                  The sewing is broken and so are the headband tiedowns. fol. 1 is becoming detached from the bookblock.
                                  The leather cover is abraded in several points.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>eighteenth century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the eighteenth century.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
                               The manuscript was primarily owned or commissioned by a certain <fo:inline id="d1e73233PRS13954TaklaMa">Takla Māryām</fo:inline>, whose name is inserted
                               in the main hand on fols 8r, 29rb, 54vb. It was then owned by a certain <fo:inline id="d1e73237PRS13955WalattaS">Walatta Ṣǝyon</fo:inline>, whose name
                               is written on fol. 2ra on a previously erased name.
                               The involvement of a certain <fo:inline id="d1e73241PRS15405Zamalakot">
                  <fo:inline font-style="italic">ʾAbuna</fo:inline>
                                   Zamalakot</fo:inline> is evidenced by the mention of his name, written in the main hand in the miniature on fol. 56v. 
                               The latter is possibly identical to <fo:inline font-style="italic">Mamhǝr</fo:inline> Zamalakot, who was the abbot of the monastery of 
                               <fo:inline id="d1e73252INS0329DE">Dāgā ʾƎsṭifānos</fo:inline> in the early eighteenth century 
                               (cp. Dombrowski 1983,  256, 307). 
                               This suggests that the manuscript has some connections to <fo:inline id="d1e73260INS0329DE">Dāgā ʾƎsṭifānos</fo:inline>. 
                               At a certain time in its history, the manuscript came into the possession of the church of <fo:inline id="d1e73263INS0101MadhaneAlam">Maqdala Madḫāne ʿĀlam</fo:inline> (see Additional note 1).
                               The manuscript was then brought to <fo:inline id="d1e73270wd:Q21">England</fo:inline> after the 1868 expedition by <fo:inline id="d1e73273PRS7484Napier">Napier</fo:inline>. The subsequent owners are unknown in detail.
                               At some time the book entered <fo:inline id="d1e73276PRS13956Kevork">Hagop Kevorkian</fo:inline>’s private collection, as indicated on one of the white stickers glued
                               on the inner side of the front cover (‘H. Kevorkian collection 623’). 
                               The book was bought <fo:inline id="d1e73278PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> at an
                               auction at Sotheby’s on 20 June 1983
                               (lot 171) through the bookseller
                               <fo:inline id="d1e73284INS0525Quaritch">Bernard Quaritch Ltd</fo:inline>.
                           </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                               bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e73289PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Bibliography</fo:block>Thomas 1990.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd16">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd16</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
