      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethf34"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. f. 34</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 39)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex145×130 mm (weight: 452g), 86 fols, 11 quires, Eighteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 2ra–85vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e75320"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Psalms of the Night</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​መዝ​ሙር፡ ​ዘሌ​ሊት፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e75337LIT3994Hymn">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 2ra–5vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Hallelujah, I make the sign of the cross and rise up’ (​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አዐ​ትብ፡ ​ወእ​ትነ​ሣእ፡), CAe 3994.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በ፭ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ሉ ​ያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አአ​ትብ፡ ​ወእ​ትነ​ሣእ፡  ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ ስ ፨
                                ፫  ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​ነሢ​እየ፡ ​እት​መረ​ጐዝ፡ ​እመ​ኒ፡ ​ወደ​ቁ፡ ​እት​ነሣ​እ፡ ​ወእ​መኒ፡ ​ሖር​ኩ፡ 
                                 ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ያበር ​ህ፡ ​ሊተ፡
                                ​በእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ተወ​ከልኩ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እግ​ዚኦ፡  ​መሐ​ረነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ፲ ወ ፪  ​ጊዜ፡ ​በል፡ ​ነአ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡
                                ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​በል፡ ​መስ​ተብ​ቍዕ፡ ​በል ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e75395LIT5932PrayerBE">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 5vb–6va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ተዘ​ከር፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​አግ​ብር​ቲከ፡ ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡), CAe 5932.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ተዘ​ከር፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ኪ ​ዳነ፡ ​አግ​ብር​ቲከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ኪዳ​ን፡ ​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡ ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ ​ወያ  (fol. 6ra)  ​ዕቆ​ብ፡ 
                                ​ምእ​መና​ኒከ፡ ​ዘአ​ሰፈ​ውኮ​ሙ፡
                                ​ተስ​ፋ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ፡ ​ወሕ​ይወ​ት፡ ​ወመ​ሐል​ከ፡ ​ሎሙ፡ ​በር​እስከ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ኢሰ​ማዕ​ነ፡  ​ወኢ​ርኢ​ነ፡ ​ወኢ​ነገ​ሩነ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ፡ ​ከመ​ቦ፡ ​ባዕ​ድ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ሌከ ፨
                                ​ይት​ኃፈሩ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይሰ​ግዱ፡ ​ለግ​ልፎ፡ ​ወእ​ለ፡ ​ይት​ሜክ​ሁ፡ ​በአ​ማል​ክቲ​ሆሙ፡  ​ነፍ​ስነ​ሰ፡  ​ትሴ​ፈዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ረዳ​ኢነ፡ ​ወም​ስካ​ይነ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                ​ለዓ​ለም ፨ ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e75450LIT6281Neihabeya">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 6va–8rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Come to me, o virgin, with your beloved son’ (​ንዒ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ኦድ​ንግ​ል፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ፍቁ​ርኪ፡), CAe 6281.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ንዒ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ኦድ​ንግ​ል፡ ም ​ስለ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ፍቁ​ርኪ፡   (b)   ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትባ​ርኪ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌነ ፨
                                ​ንዒ፡  ​ኀቤ​የ፡
                                ​ኦድ​ንግ​ል፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አዳ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ቤል፡ ​ሴት፡ ​ወሄ​ኖስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​አበ​ዊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ለቀ​ደም​ት፡ ​እደ​ው፡ ​ስሙ​ያን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡  ​ኦሙ​ሐዘ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ ፤  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​መሐ​ረነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ፲ ወ ፪ ፡ ​በል ፤  ​ባር​ከነ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አም  (b)  ​ኅክ​ነ፡
                                ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኑኃ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ተወ​ከፍ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተነ፡ ​መሐ​ረነ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ወተ​ሠሃ​ለነ። ​ነዓ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​ወጸ​ሎተ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​በል፡ ​ወድ​ኅሬ​ሁ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​በል፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e75505LIT6282Nesebbeho">
               <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 8rb–10ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Let us praise God’ (​ንሴ​ብሖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡), CAe 6282.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ንሴ​ብሖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ ​ሔር፡ ​ለዘ​በስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ይሴ​ባሕ፡ ​ዘኪ​ያሁ፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ፡ ​ማኅ​በረ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ፍሡ​ሓን። ​ወሎ​ቱ፡ ​ይት​ቀነ​ዩ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳተ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን።
                                ​ወሎ​ቱ፡ ​ትሰ​ግድ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲያ  (fol. 8va)  ​ን፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትብ​ል።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ገነ​ይነ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> {​ለኪ፡ ​ገነ፡} 
                                ​ለኪ፡ ​ኦወ​ለተ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ገነ​ት፡ ​ዕፁ​ት፡ ​አዘ​ቅት፡ ​ኅት​ምት፡ ​ወለ​ቶሙ፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ለነቢ  (fol. 10ra)  ​ያት ፨ ​ገነ​ይነ፡  ​ገነ፡ ለ<fo:inline>[ኪ]</fo:inline>፡
                                ​ገነ፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ኦወ​ለተ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት። ​ሐዳ​ስ፡ ​ቀመ​ር፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ​ምሥ​ጢር፡ ​ኰስ​ኰሰ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ዘብ​ሩር ፨  ​ገነ፡ ​ለኪ ፤ 
                                ገ ፤  ለ ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e75567LIT6283SaaliLana">
               <fo:inline>I-5) Fols 10ra–11rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Pray for us Mary, our mother and mother of our Lord’ (​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​ወእ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡), CAe 6283.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እም​ነ፡ ​ወእ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ሞገ​ስነ፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ወክ​ብርነ ፨
                                ፫  ​ጊዜ፡ ​በል ፨
                                ​ሰአ​ሉ፡ ​ለነ፡  ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​ስኩ​ራነ፡
                                ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ምሉ​አነ፡ ​ሞገ​ስ፡ ​አቅ​ርን {​ቲሁ፡}  ​ለሥ​ሉስ፡   (b) 
                                ​ሰአ​ሉ፡  ​ለነ ፤  ​አስ ፤ 
                                ​ለነ ፤  ​ሰአ ፤  ​ለነ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አስ ፤ 
                                ለ ፤  ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ ፤  ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​መን​ፈሳ​ዊት፡ ​ዓው​ድ፡ ​መዝ​ገበ፡ ​ሥር​ናይ፡
                                ​እን​በለ፡ ​ክር {ዳ} ​ድ፡ ​ምስ​አል፡ ​ወም​ስጋ​ድ፡ ​ምጥ​ባሐ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ።
                                ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘኢ​ያፈ​ቅሮ፡ ​በል ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e75648LIT3522Epistle">
               <fo:inline>I-6) Fols 11rb–13ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ቀዳ​ማዊ​ት፡ ​መል​እክ​ተ፡ ​ጳው​ሎስ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ተሰ​ሎን​ቄ፡), CAe 3522.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጳው​ሎስ፡  {ለ} ​ተሰ​ሎንቄ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ንነ​ግረ​ክሙ፡  ​በቃ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ንሕ​ነ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ሕያዋ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ን፡ ​እለ፡ ​ንተ​ርፍ፡
                                ​አመ፡ ​ምጽ​አተ፡ ​እግ  (fol. 11va)  ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ኢን​በጽ​ሖሙ፡ ​ለም​ውታ​ን፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ይኤ​ዝዝ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​መላ​እክት ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​ጥዑ​መ፡ ​ስም፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ትም​ህር​ቱ፡ ​ለጳ​ውሎ​ስ፡ ​ጽል​መተ፡ ​ሕሊ​ናነ፡ ​አብ​ርህ፡ በ  (fol. 13ra)  ​ስን​ከ።
                                 ​ለከ፡  ​ይደ​ሉ፡ ​ክብ​ር፡ ​ወስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ወስ​ግደ​ት፡ ​እም​ኀበ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡
                                ​ወመ​ላእ​ክት ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-7) Fols 13ra–14ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e75707"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">1 Pet. 5:5–5:11</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ዘጴ​ጥሮ​ስ፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወአ​ንትሙ {​ኒ፡ ​ወራ​ዙት፡ ​ተኰ​ነኑ፡ ​ለእ​ለ፡}  ​ይል​ሕቁ​ክሙ፡
                                ​ወኵ​ልክ​ሙ፡ ​ተመ​ሐር​ዋ፡ ​ለአ​ትሕ​ቶ፡ ​ርእ​ስክ​ሙ፡ ​አት​ሕቱ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ርእ​ሰክ​ሙ፡ ​ታሕ​ተ፡ ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ጽን​ዕት፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​በከ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዚአ​ከ፡ ​መለ​ኮቱ፡ ​ወኃ​ይሉ፡ ​ወአ​ምል​ኮቱ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ተው​ህበ​ት፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ባር​ክ፡ ​መር​ዔተ​ከ፡ ​ኦሊ​ቀ፡ ​ኖሎ​ት፡ ​ወባ​ርክ፡ ​ርስ​ተከ፡ ​መክ​ብበ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​አብ​ያተ፡
                                ​ክር​ስቲ​ያና​ት፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ይቤ​ለከ፡ ​ረዓ​ይኬ፡ ​አባ​ግዕየ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-8) Fols 14ra–15rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e75748"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Acts 16:25–34</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወጊ​ዜ፡ መ ​ንፈ​ቀ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡  ​ጸለ​ዩ፡ ​ጳውሎ  (b)  ​ስ፡ ​ወሲ​ላስ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡
                                ​ወሙ​ቁሐ​ን፡ ​ይሰ​ምዕ​ዎሙ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​አድ​ለቅ​ለቀ​ት፡ ​ዓቢ​ይ፡ ​ድል​ቅል​ቅ፡ ​ወአ​ንቀ​ልቀ​ሉ፡ ​መሠ​ራታ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ሞቅ​ሕ፡ ​ወተ​ርኅወ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​አን​ሥኡ፡ ​በል ፤  ​መን​ፈቀ፡ ​ሌል​ት፡ ​እት​ነሣ​እ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እግ​ነይ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅከ፡ ​ከማ​ሆሙ፡ 
                                 ​አን<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                                ​ለኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይፈ​ርሁ​ከ። ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ቁሙ፡ ​ወአ​ጽም​ኡ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-9) Fols 15va–17vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e75796"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Matt. 25:1–13</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​አሜ​ሃ፡ ​ትመ​ስል፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ዓሥ​ሮን፡ ​ደና​ግል፡ ​እለ፡ ​ነሥ​አ፡ ​መሐ​ትዊ​ሆን፡ ​ወወ​ፅአ፡ ​ለቀ​በላሆ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​መር​ዓዊ።
                                ​ወኃ​ምስ፡  {​እም} ​ውስ​ቴቶ​ን፡ ​አብ​ዳት፡
                                ወ ኃ ​ምስ፡ ​ጠባ​ባት፡ ​ወአ​ብዳ​ትሰ፡ ​ነሢ​ኦን፡ ​መሐ​ትዊ​ሆን፡ ​ኢነ​ሥአ፡ ​ቅብ​ዓ፡ ​ወጠ​ባባ​ትሰ፡ ​ነሥ​አ፡ ​ቅብ​ዓ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሆን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጥዑ​መ፡  ​ልሳ​ን፡ ​ምዑ​ዝ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​ጳው​ሎስ፡ ​መር​ሐ፡ ​ዕው​ራን፡ ​ዘበ​ጽን​ፈ፡ ​ልብ​ስከ፡ ​የሐ​ይዉ፡ ​ዱያ​ን፡ ​ስፋ​ሕ፡ ​እዴ​ከ፡
                                ​ዘየ​ማን፡ ​ትባ​ርከ​ነ፡ ​ለጉ​ቡአ​ን፡ ​መም​ሕር፡ ​ዘበ​አማን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-10) Fols 17vb–19vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e75846"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">1 John 1:1–7</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​መል​እክ​ተ፡  ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​ሐዋ  (fol. 18ra)  ​ርያ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ዘብ​ዴዎ​ስ፡ ​ቀዳ​ማዊ፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ንዜ​ንወ​ክሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘሀ​ሎ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​ም፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘሰ​ማዕ​ናሁ፡ ​በእ​ዘኒነ ፤  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘር​ኢና​ሁ፡ ​በአ​ዕይ​ንቲ​ነ፡ ​ወዘ​ጠየ​ቅና​ሁ፡ ​ወዘ​ገሠ​ሣሁ፡ ​እደ​ቂነ፡
                                ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ሕይ {​ተ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ሕይወ} ​ት፡ ​ተዓ​ውቀ​ት፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ወስ​ምዓ፡ ​ኮነ ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሠር​ፀ፡  ​አሐ​ዱ፡ ​ጕን​ድ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ቲሁ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ ፨  
                                ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​እሁ​ድ፡ ​ይባ​ርኩ​ነ፡ ​በሰ​ፊሀ፡ ​እድ ፨  ​እለ፡ ​የማኖ  (b)  ​ሙ፡
                                ​አዕ​ማድ። ​ተን​ሥኡ፡ ​በል፡ ​ምስ​ባክ፡ ​አሜሃ ፤  ​በል ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-11) Fols 19vb–22ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e75908"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">John 3:1–21</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​ፈሪ​ሳው​ያን፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ኒቆ​ዲሞ​ስ፡ ​መል​አኮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ይሁ​ድ፡ ​ወው​እቱ​ሰ፡ ​መጽ​አ፡ 
                                ​ኀቤ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ ፨  ​ሌሊ​ተ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡
                                ​ረቢ፡ ​ነአ​ምን፡ ​ብከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እም​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ መ  (fol. 20ra)  ​ጻእ​ከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​መም​ህረ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​እስ​መ፡ ​እኩ​ይ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወዘ​ሰ፡ ​ጽድ​ቀ፡ ​ይገ​ብር፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያስ​ተር​ኢ፡ ​ምግ​ባሩ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡
                                ​እግ  (fol. 22ra)  ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይገ​ብር ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e75956LIT6284Kokaba">
               <fo:inline>I-12) Fols 22ra–25rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Hallelujah, 'star' we called you’ (​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ኮከ​በ፡ ​ሰመ​ይና​ከ፡), CAe 6284.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ሃ ​ሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ኮከ​በ፡ ​ሰመ​ይናከ ፨ 
                                ​ፀሐ​የ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ፡ ​ዘሐ​ፀነ​ከ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሕፅ​ኑ፡ ​ዘአ​ርፋ​ቀከ፡ ​ኮከ​በ፡
                                ​ሰመ​ይናከ ፨  ​በአ​ፉሁ፡ ​ዘሰ​አመ​ከ፡ ​ወበ​ቅና​ቱ፡ ​ዘአ​ቅነ​ተከ፡ ​ኮከ​በ፡ ​ሰመ​ይናከ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ሰጊ​ድ፡ ​ለአ​ቡከ፡ ​ዕበ​ይ፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስከ፡ ​ወም  (b)  ​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፈኑ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-13) Fols 25rb–25va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e75995"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Lev. 23:1–3</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ኦሪ​ት፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም።
                                <fo:footnote>
                        <fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">293</fo:inline>
                        <fo:footnote-body text-align="justify" text-indent="0">
                           <fo:list-block>
                              <fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:block>
                                       <fo:inline vertical-align="text-top" font-size="9pt">293</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-label>
                                 <fo:list-item-body>
                                    <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                                              space-before="0.45cm"
                                              font-size="9pt"
                                              line-height="11pt"
                                              margin-left="0.45cm">The excerpt is erroneously attributed to the Deuteronomy.</fo:block>
                                 </fo:list-item-body>
                              </fo:list-item>
                           </fo:list-block>
                        </fo:footnote-body>
                     </fo:footnote>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወነበ ​ቦ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ለሙ​ሴ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ንግ​ሮሙ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​ወበ​ሎሙ፡ ​በዓ​ላቲ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡
                                ​ዘሰ​መይ​ኮሙ፡ ​በቅ​ዱስ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡ ​ዘው​እቶ​ሙ፡ ​በዓ​ላት​የ፡ ​ሰዱ​ሰ፡ ​ዕለተ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እስ​መ፡  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘወ​ሀበ፡ ​ሕገ፡ ​ለሙ​ሴ፡ ​ሰን​በታ​ቲሁ፡ ​ረሰ​የ፡ ​ለክ​ብር፡ ​ወለ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ለመ​ለኮ​ተ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ይደ​ሉ፡
                                ​ውዳ​ሴ። ​ህየ​ንተ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-14) Fols 25va–26ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e76040"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Jer. 17:26–27</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The name of an individual, probably the owner of the
                                    manuscript, is mentioned in the supplication formula (fol. 25va) and partially effaced.
                                Only ‘Walda’ is legible.
                                </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ዘኤ​ርም​ያስ፡  ​ነቢ​ይ፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​አም​ላኩ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሩ፡  ​ወል​ደ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ 
                                ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወያ​መጽ​ኡ፡ ​መሥ​ዋዕ​ተ፡ ​ወቍ​ርባ​ነ፡ ​መሐ​ና፡ ​ወስ  (b)  ​ሂነ፡ ​ወያ​መጽ​ኡ፡ ​አም​ኃ፡ ​በአ​ኰቴ​ት፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወእ​መሰ፡ ​ኢሰ​ማዕ​ክሙ፡
                                ​ወአ​ቅደ​ምክ​ሙ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ሰን​በት፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እስ​መ፡  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘበ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​አስ  (fol. 26ra)  ​ተን​ፈሰ፡ ​ሰን​በታ​ቲሁ፡ ​ቀደ​ሰ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይኩ​ነነ፡ ​መር​ሳ። ​ወዘ​በል​የ፡
                                ​ሐደ​ሶ፡ ​ዘበ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​ረከ​ብነ፡ ​ሞገሰ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-15) Fols 26ra–26va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e76098"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">Acts 19:8–10</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ግብ ረ ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወቦ​አ፡ ​ጳው​ሎስ፡ ​ምኵ​ራበ፡ ​ወነ​ገረ፡ ​ገዓደ ፨ 
                                ​ወነ​በረ፡  ፫  ​አው​ራኃ፡ ​ይት​ዋቀ​ሶሙ፡ ​ወየ​አም​ኖሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ 
                                ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፤  ​ወቦ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ክህ​ዱ፡
                                ወ  (b)  ​ተን​ሥኡ፡ ​ወአ​ሕሰ​ሙ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ዘእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሒር፡ ​ትም​ሕርት ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ልዑ​ል፡  ​እም​ልዑ​ላን፡ ​እኩ​ት፡ ​በቅ​ዱሳ​ን፡ ​ዘለ​ከ፡ ​ይት​ቄረ​ብ፡ ​መዓ​ዛ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​እም​ትጉ​ሃን፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ​ከ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ተቀ​ይሱ፡
                                ​በሥ​ርዓ​ትከ፡ ​ተንሥ ፤  በ ፤ 
                                ስ ፤  ለ ፤  ም ፤  መ ፤  ​በሌ​ሊት፡ 
                                ​አን​ሥኡ ፤  ​በል ፤  ​ቁሙ፡ ​አ፡ ​በል፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-16) Fols 26va–28vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e76174"
                                font-family="Ludolfus"
                                letter-spacing="0.5pt"
                                font-size="0.9em">John 5:1–18</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወእ​ምድኅ<fo:inline>[ረ]</fo:inline>​ዝ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​በበ​ዐሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ይሁ​ድ፡ ​ዓር​ገ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡
                                 ​ወበ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ምጥ​ማቃ​ት፡ ​ዘጵ​ሩ፡ ​ጳጥቄ ፨  ​ቅል​ንብ​ትራ፡ ​ስማ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​በዕ​ብራ​ይስ​ጥ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ሳይ​ዳ፡ ​ዘው​እቱ፡ ​ቀላ​የ፡ ​አባ​ግዕ፡ ​ብሂ​ል፡ ​ወባ​ቲ፡ ​ኃም​ስቱ፡ ​ሕዋ​ራት ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ረስ​የነ፡  ​ድል​ዋነ፡ ​ንባ​እ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰን​በተ፡ ​ሰን​በታ​ቲከ። ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡   (b)   ​ቅዱ​ሳኒ​ከ፡ ​ንኩ​ን፡
                                ​ስጽ​ውዓ​ነ፡ ​ለበ​ዓል​ከ፡ ​ተመ​ርጕ​ዘነ፡ ​ንሕ​ነ፡ ​መስ​ቀለ​ከ፡ ​ጸቂ​ረነ፡ ​ናን​ሶሱ፡ ​ወን​ጌለከ ፤ 
                                ​መስ​ተብ​ቍዕ፡ ​በል ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76231LIT6285Mogasna">
               <fo:inline>I-17) Fols 28vb–30ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Our grace and our glory, horn of our salvation’ (​ሞገ​ስነ፡ ​ወክ​ብር​ነ፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መድ​ኀኒ​ትነ፡), CAe 6285.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሞገ​ስነ፡ ​ወክ​ብር​ነ፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒት ​ነ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​ትም​ህር​ተ፡ ​ሰላ​ምነ፡
                                ​ዘኪ​ያሁ፡ ​ንት​አመ​ን፡ ​አረ​ፍተ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡ ​በዘቦ  (fol. 29ra)  ​ቱ፡ ​ናሰ​ምክ፡ ​ዕብ​ኑ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ርእ​ሰ፡ ​ማዕ​ዘን​ት፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                 ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ፨
                                <!-- The same text is also found in BAVet64#i3.11 -->
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ቦቱ፡ ​አመ​ነ፡ ​ወእ​ለ፡ ​ኪያ​ሁ፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፤ ​ወሣ​ህል፡ ​እም​ኀበ፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡ ​ይር​ከበ​ነ። ​እግዚ  (fol. 30ra)  ​ኦ፡ ​መሐ​ረነ፡
                                ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ፲ ወ ፪  ​በል ፨  ​ነዓ​ኵተ​ከ፡ ​በል፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​በል ፨ 
                                ​መስ​ተብ​ቍዕ፡ ​በል ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76289LIT6286Prayer">
               <fo:inline>I-18) Fols 30ra–32ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘O Michael archangel, intercede for us’ (​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ሰአ​ል፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አነ፡), CAe 6286.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ሊቀ፡  ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ሰአ​ል፡ <fo:inline>በእንቲአከሃ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                                    ወ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​አዕ​ርግ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተነ ፨
                                ፬  ​እን​ስሳ፡ ​መን​ፈሳ​ውያ​ን፡ ​ሰባ​ሕያ​ን፡ ​ወመ​ዘም​ራን፡ ​ሰአ​ሉ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አነ፡
                                 ፳  ​ወር​ብዕ፡   (b)   ​ካህ​ናተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይኒ፡ ​አስ​ተም​ህሩ፡ ​ለነ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ሃሌ ፤  ​ሉያ፡ ​ለአብ ፤ 
                                ​ሃሌ ፤  ​ሉያ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ ፤ 
                                ​ሃሌ ፤  ​ሉያ ፤ 
                                ​ወለ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ  (fol. 32ra)  ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይት​ነከ​ር፡
                                ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ይት​ነከ​ር፡ ​ፈረ​ሰ፡ ​ወዘ​ይፄ​ዓን፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሁ፡ ​ወረ​ወ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕር ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76361LIT6287Mahtota">
               <fo:inline>I-19) Fols 32ra–34rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Pray for us Mary, lamp of the world, praised in the heights’ (​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ማኅ​ቶተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ስብ​ሕት፡ ​በአ​ርያ​ም፡), CAe 6287.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ማኅ​ቶተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ስብ​ሕት፡ ​በአ​ርያም ፤ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡  ​ለነ፡
                                 ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ምዕ​ዳው፡ ​ወእ​ምሰ​ርም፡ ​ዘጽ​ድቅ፡ ​ተን​ከተም ፨ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡  ​ለነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ለከ፡ ​ይደ​ሉ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​በጽ​ዮን፡ ​ወለ​ከ፡ ​ይት​ፌና፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በኢ​የሩ​ሳሌ​ም። ​ስማ​ዕ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘሥ​ጋ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡
                                 (b)   ​ምል​ዕተ፡ ​ጸጋ። ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76414LIT3108RepCh388">
               <fo:inline>I-20) Fols 34rb–35vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘The angels are praising Mary...’ (​ይዌ​ድስ​ዋ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ለማ​ርያ​ም፡), CAe 3108.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ይዌ​ድስ​ዋ፡ ​መላ​እክ ​ት፡ ለ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ውሣ​ጤ፡ ​መን​ጦላ​ዕት፡ ​ወይ​ብል​ዋ፡ ​በሐ​ኪ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                ​ሐዳ​ስዩ፡ ​ጣዕዋ ፨  ​ይቤ​ላ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ለ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ <fo:inline>ተወከፊዮ (!)</fo:inline>፡ ​ለቃ​ል፡ ​ኀቤ​ኪ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​ወበ​ማኅ​ፀነ፡ ​የኀ​ድር ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ወና​ሁ፡ ​ሳድ​ስ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ወር​ኅ፡ ​ለእ​ንተ፡ ​ይብ​ልዋ፡ ​መካ​ን፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ሰዓ​ኖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨ 
                                ​ትቤ​ሎ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለመ​ልአ​ክ፡
                                ​ነየ፡ ​አመ​ቁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ነየ፡ ​አመቱ ፨  ​ይኩ​ነኒ፡ በ  (b)  ​ከመ፡ ​ትቤ​ለኒ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76465LIT4272Salam">
               <fo:inline>I-21) Fols 35vb–36vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Salām-hymn to Our Lady Mary, CAe 4272.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ይቤ​ላ፡ ​መል​አክ፡  {ሰ} ​ላም፡ ​ለኪ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ይቤ​ላ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡  ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡  ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡  ​ሰላ​ም፡
                                    ​ለኪ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ቅድ​ስት፡  ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ውስ​ድት፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ያቁ​መነ፡ ​በየ​ማኑ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​እስ​ጢፋኖ  (b)  ​ስ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕት፡ ​ወዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​መጥ​ምቅ፡ ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወሰ​ማዕ​ት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-22) Fols 36vb–37rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e76508">Liturgical directives on the reading of the Miracles of Mary</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ይ፡ ​ዲ፡  ​ቁሙ፡ ​ወአ​ጽም​ኡ፡ ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዜና​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒት​ነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡
                                 ​ይ፡ ​ካ፡  ​ተአ​ምር፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዘሰ​በከ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​ክብ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​መ፡ ​ንጉ  (fol. 37ra)  ሥ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይቀ​ውሙ፡ ​ወይ​ቤላ፡ ​ለእ​ሙ፡ ​ብእ​ሲቶ፡ ​ነዋ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ለው​እቱ​ኒ፡ ​ረድ​እ፡ ​ነያ፡
                                ​እም​ከ፡ ​ወእ​ምይ​እቲ፡ ​ሰአ​ት፡ ​ነሥ​አ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ረድ​አ፡ ​ወአ​እተ​ዋ፡ ​ቤቶ ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76550LIT2804RepCh88">
               <fo:inline>I-23) Fols 37rb–43vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘The Ark of Noah’ (​ለኖ​ኅ፡ ​ሐመ​ሩ፡), CAe 2804.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለኪ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለኖ​ኅ፡ ​ሐመሩ ፨
                                    ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለኪ፡ ​ለአ​ሮን፡ ​በትሩ ፨
                                    ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለኪ፡ ​ለጌ​ዴዎ​ን፡ ​ፀምሩ ፨
                                    ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለኪ፡ ​ለዳ​ዊት፡ ​መሰ​ንቆ፡ ​መዝ  (fol. 37va)  ​ሙሩ ፨
                                    ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለኪ፡ ​ለሰ​ሎሞ​ን፡ ​መን​በረ፡ ​ክብሩ ፨ ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለኪ፡ ​ለፍ​ሬ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​መፆ​ሩ፡  ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ንሴ​ፈዎ፡ ​ለበ​ረከ​ትኪ፡ ​ዘም​ስለ፡  ​አም​ኃ፡  ​ንስ​ግድ፡ ​ለኪ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ፈጸ​ምኩ፡  ​በዝ​የ፡ ​ስብ​ሐተ፡ ​መል​ክእ​ከ፡ ​በሰ​ጊድ፡ ​ፈኑ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ጰራ​ቅሊ​ጦስ፡ ​ነድ፡ ​አር  (fol. 43va)  ​አያ፡
                                    ​አን​በቦ​ሙ፡ ​በገ​ሃድ፡ ​ለሐ​ዋር​ያት፡ ​ኄራ​ን፡ ን  (b)  ​ቡራ​ነ፡ ​እድ፡ ​አን​ትሙ፡ ​አን​በሩ​ነ፡ ​በስ​ሩስ​ተ፡ ወ ​ሜድ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76629LIT3023RepCh303">
               <fo:inline>I-24) Fols 43va–46vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Rejoice Mary’ (​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡), CAe 3023.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል​ተ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ወሕ​ሊና ፨ 
                                ​ተፈሥ ​ሒ፡ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ወለ​ተ፡ <fo:inline>ኢያቂም፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወሐና ፨  ​ጳጦ​ስ፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ዘአ​ስተ​ርአ​ይኪ፡ ​በደ​ብረ፡ ​ሲና ፨ 
                                ​ጎሞ​ራ፡ ​ወር​ቅየ፡ ​መስ​ፈር​ቱ፡ ​ለመና ፨ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለዕ​በይ​ኪ፡ 
                                ​ይደ​ሉ፡
                                መ  (b)  ​ሐና ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በሰ​ላመ፡ <fo:inline>ገብሬል፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​መል​አክ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትየ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ ፨  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በሕ​ሊና​ኪ፡ ​ወድ​ንግ​ል፡ ​ወሥ​ጋኪ ፨ 
                                ​እመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ፀባ​ኦት፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ ፨ 
                                ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡   (b)  ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ ፤ 
                                ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሕት፡ ​ኦም​ልዕ​ተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምስ​ሌኪ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76708LIT3022RepCh302">
               <fo:inline>I-25) Fols 46vb–50vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Rejoice Mary, the Pascha of Adam’ (​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ለአ​ዳም፡ ​ፋሲ​ካሁ፡), CAe 3022.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለአ​ዳም፡ ​ፋሲ​ካሁ ፤  ​ወማ​ዕዶ​ታ፡ ​ለሄ​ዋን፡ ​እን​ተ፡
                                    ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​አፅ​መ፡ ​ገቦሁ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ግዕ​ዛኖ​ሙ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ​ኪ፡
                                    ​በት<fo:inline>[ን]</fo:inline>ሣ  (fol. 47ra)  ​ኤሁ ፤  ​በወ​ርኃ፡ ​ዕብ​ሬት​ኪ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትየ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይት​ረከ​ብ፡ ​ከማሁ ፨ 
                                    ​መኑ፡ ​ዘይ​ቴክ​ዝ፡ ​ወመ​ኑ፡ ​ይላሁ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወእ​ሰግ​ድ፡ ​ስል​ሠ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለሥ​ዕል​ኪ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ጉባኤ ፨ 
                                    ​ዘኢ​ሰገ​ደሰ፡ ​ለሥ​ዕል​ኪ፡ ​አሥ​ሪፆ፡ ​ምማዒ ፨  ​በሥ​ጋሁ፡ ​ወበ  (b)  ​ነፍ​ሱ፡
                                    ​ኢይ​ርከ​ብ፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ ፨  ​በሰ​ላመ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​በል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76771LIT6288Prayer">
               <fo:inline>I-26) Fols 50vb–51vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Let us supplicate the queen of all of us Mary, our mother and mother of our Lord’ (​ናስ​ተበ​ቍዓ፡ ​ለን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ኵል​ነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​ወእ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡), CAe 6288.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወካ​ዕበ፡ ​ናስ​ተበ​ቍዓ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እተ፡ ​ኵል​ነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እም​ነ፡ ​ወእ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ንስ​እል፡ ​ወነ​ኃሥ​ሥ፡
                                ​ናስ​ተበ​ፅዕ፡ ​ወን​ዌድ​ስ፡ ​ዕበ​የ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ለ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እመ፡ ​ጸባ​ዖት፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ፫  ​ጊዜ፡ ​በል፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ምሕ​ረተ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​የሐ​ውፀ​ነ፡ ​እም​አር​ያም፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለለ​ሰዓ​ቱ፡
                                ​ተግ​ባረ፡ ​እደ​ዊሁ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ​ኪ፡ ​ኢን​ጥፋ​እ፡ ​በከ​ንቱ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76811LIT6290Tafassehi">
               <fo:inline>I-27) Fols 51vb–52rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘The angel came to her and told her 'Rejoice'’ (​ቦአ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሃ፡ ​ወይ​ቤላ፡ ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡), CAe 6290.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለአብ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ሃሌ ፤  ​ሉያ ፤ 
                                    ​ለወ​ልድ ፤  ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ቦአ፡ ​መል​አክ፡   (fol. 52ra)   ​ኀቤ​ሃ፡ ​ወይ​ቤላ፡
                                    ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ኦ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦማ​ርያ​ም፡ ም ​ልዕ​ተ፡ ​ፀጋ፡ ​ተፈሥ  (b)  ​ሒ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ረከ​ብኪ፡ ​ሞገ​ሰ፡ ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                    ​ምስ​ሌኪ፡  ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡  ​ድን​ግል፡   ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ምል​ዕተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ይደ​ልወ​ኪ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​እን​በለ፡ ​ሕፀ​ፅ፡
                                    ​ወን​ትጋ። ​አም​ላከ፡ ​ሰማ​ያዊ፡ ​ዘወ​ልድ​ኪ፡ ​በሥጋ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76868LIT3088RepCh368">
               <fo:inline>I-28) Fols 52rb–52va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘O merciful of mind’ (​ኦር​ኅር​ኅተ፡ ​ኅሊ​ና፡), CAe 3088.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ኦር​ኅር​ኅተ፡ ​ሕሊ​ና፡  ​አፍ​ቅሮ​ተ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ልማዳ ፨  ​ሰአ​ሊተ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ሐፁ​ረ፡
                                    ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ዘየ​ዓውዳ ፨  ​ንት​ቀበ​ላ፡   (fol. 52va)   
                                    ​ንዑ፡ ​ለወ​ለተ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡
                                    ​ዘይ​ሁዳ ፨  ​መጽ​አት፡ ​ነያ፡ ​ኅቡ​ረ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ወልዳ ፨  ​ናን​ፈር​ዕፅ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ስዕ​ላ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ንሁ​ብ፡ ​ገጻ፡
                                    ​ለለ​ጌሠ​ሙ፡ ​ትመ​ስል፡ ​እን​ግዳ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እሰ​ግድ፡  ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ሥዕ​ልኪ፡ ​ወለ​ሥዕ​ለ፡   (fol. 53ra)   ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​እገኒ ፨ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እመ፡ ​አዶኒ ፨  ​ማዕ​በለ፡ ​ጌጋ​ይ፡ ​ጽኑ​ዕ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ለአ​ሥጥ​ሞ፡ ​በጽ​ሐኒ ፨  ​ሐመ​ርየ​ኒ፡ ​ማዕ​ዶት​የኒ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ትየ​ኒ፡
                                    ​ዘእ​ንበ​ሌኪ፡ ​አል​ብየ፡ ​ምን​ትኒ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e76934LIT1864Malkea">
               <fo:inline>I-29) Fols 53ra–55va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Malkǝʾ-hymn of the Icon (of Mary)’ (​መል​ክአ፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡), CAe 1864.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሰላም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለሥ​ዕል​ኪ፡ ​ዘይ​ኤድ​ም፡ ​ለን​ጻሬ ፨ 
                                    ​ዓዲ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለሥ​ዕለ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​በኁ​ባሬ ፨ 
                                    ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ሢመ​ቱ፡ ​ለጴ  (b)  ​ጥሮ​ስ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እን​ተ፡
                                    ​ትጸ​ድሊ፡ ​እም​ወራ​ውሬ ፨ 
                                    ​ለተ​አም​ርኪ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​እቄ​ርብ፡ ​ዝማሬ ፨  ​ክድ​ንኒ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ኪ፡ ​ሣህ​ለኪ፡ ​ጶዲሬ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እሰ​ግድ፡  ​ቅድ​መ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ለዝ​ክረ፡ ​ስም​ኪ፡ ​በጽ​ዋዔ ፨  ​ወእ​ሰግ​ድ፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ 
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለድ​ንግ​ልና​ኪ፡   (fol. 55va)   ​ክልኤ ፨ 
                                    ​ወእ​ሰግ​ድ፡ ​ሥል​ሰ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለሥ​ዕል​ኪ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ጉባዔ ፤  ​ዘኢ​ሰገ​ደሰ፡ ​ለሥ​ዕል​ኪ፡ ​አሥ​ሪፆ፡ ​ምማ​ዔ፡ ​በሥ​ጋሁ፡ ​ወበ​ነፍ​ሱ፡ ​ኢይ​ርከ​ብ፡
                                    ​ትን​ሣኤ ፨ ​ስብ​ሐት፡  ​ወክ​ብር፡ ​ወሰ​ጊድ፡ ​ለመ​ንግ​ሥት​ኪ፡ ​ይደሉ ፨ 
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዓባ​ልኪ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ዓባ​ሉ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​በረ​ከት​ኪ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​የሃሉ ፤
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e77020LIT3064RepCh344">
               <fo:inline>I-30) Fols 55vb–57va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘I praise your grace, O Full of Grace...’ (​እሴ​ብሕ፡ ​ጸጋ​ኪ፡ ​ኦም​ልእ​ተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡), CAe 3064.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እሴ​ብሕ፡ ​ጸጋ​ኪ፡ ​ኦም​ልእ​ተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡  ​ወእ​ትጋ​ነይ፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ኦም​ልእ​ተ፡ ​ውዳሴ ፨ 
                                ​ተዘ​ከር​ኩ፡ ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ንጽ​ሐ፡ ​ድን​ግል​ናኪ፡ ​ዘኢ​ማሰ​ነ፡ ​በወ​ሊድ፡
                                ​ወኢ​ረስ​ሐ፡ ​በሐ​ሪስ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ቅድ​ስተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​አንቲ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ስፍ​ሒ፡ ​እዴ​ኪ፡ ​ወባ​ርክ​ኒ፡ ​ለገ​ብርኪ ፨  ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ዚአ​ኪ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ወጸ​ጋ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ 
                                 ​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ሃይም ​ኖት፡ 
                                ​መስ​ሕኪ፡ ​ወላ​ዕለ፡ ​ኵል​ነ፡ አ  (fol. 57va)  ​ግብ​ርት​ኪ፡ ​ወአ​ዕማ​ትኪ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                ​አሜን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e77065LIT6289Semani">
               <fo:inline>I-31) Fols 57va–85vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Listen to me, o Lord, my prayer’ ( ​ስም​ዐኒ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡), incomplete, CAe 6289.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text concludes abruptly. The end is apparently missing.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡  ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡  ​ሉያ፡ ​ወይ​ብጻ​ሕ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜከ፡  ​ገዓ​ርየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ወኢ​ትሚ​ጥ፡
                                ​ገጸ​ከ፡ ​እም​ኔየ። ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ሃሌ፡   (b)   ​ሉያ፡ ​ወይ​ብጻ​ሕ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜከ፡ ​ገዓ​ርየ፡ ​ወኢ​ትሚ​ጥ፡ ​ገጸ​ከ፡ ​እም​ኔየ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ምን​ዳቤ​የ፡ ​አጽ​ምእ፡
                                ​እዝ​ነከ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​አኃ​ዙ፡ ​ይም​ትሩ፡  ​ኵለ​ንታ​ሁ፡ <fo:inline>በበመለያልሁ (!)</fo:inline>፨  ​ለያ​ዕቆ​ብ፡ ​ግሙድ ፨  ​ጸለ​የ፡
                                ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​መን​ፈቀ፡ ​ሥጋ​የ፡ ​ሞተ ፨  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ቁ፡ ​ይጼ​ሊ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ።
                                 ​ሰማ​ዕት፡ ​ሰማ​ዕት፡  ​ሰማ​ዕተ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ያዕ​ቆብ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​የ፡ ​አባ​ላቲ​ከ፡ ​ግሙድ ​መኑ፡ ​ከማ​ከ፡ ​ዕጉ​ሠ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: Short protective formula written in a poor hand in dark brownish ink.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ክር​ክም​ና፡ ​ክም​ና፡ ​ኵል​ኩል​ና፡ ​ቀር​ቃና፡ ​ሜሎ​ስ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ዴን፡ ​ቆቁ​ና፡ ​ፌወ​ቆቁ​ሬሁ፡ ​ቁሽ፡
                                        ​ቃለ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ዘተ​ሰወ​ረኒ፡ ​ክሰ​ት፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​አባ፡</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 3ra: Ownership note crudely written in black ink and encircled in a frame. Although mostly erased, the name of
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e77537PRS13275HaylaGi">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">ʾAbbā</fo:inline> Ḫayla Giyorgis</fo:inline>, possibly a later owner of the
                                        manuscript, is still legible.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘሰ​አታ​ተ፡ ​ዘአ​ባ። ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ጊ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ወዘ​ፈሀ​ቆ፡ ​በስ​ልጣ​ነ፡
                                        ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ወጳ​ውሎ​ስ፡ <fo:inline>ዉጉዝ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ለይ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 84v: Protective prayer written in a crude and untrained hand in the upper margin.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማር​ያም፡ ​ማር​ዲኒ​ስ፡ ​ኅቱ​ስ፡ ​ናዳ​ስ፡ ​ዘሰ​ማዕ​ኩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አጽ​ንዕ፡ ​ወዘ​አጽና<fo:inline>[ዕ]</fo:inline>​ኩ፡
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ግድ​ፍ፡ ​ክሥ​ት፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ ​እገ​ሌ፡ ​ግበ​ር፡ ​ዘ፫​፯፡ ​ዘቢ​ብ፡ ​፯፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ድግ​ም፡ ​ዘእ​ብነ​ት፡ ​ዘደ​ብተ​ራ፡ ​ጌታ​ሁን፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 85r: The same protective prayer also found in Additional note 3 is written in pale ink around the outer
                                        edge of the folio, starting from the upper margin up to the inner margin.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ማር​ዲኒ​ስ፡ ​ኅቱ​ስ፡ ​ናዳ​ስ፡ ​ዘሰ​ማዕ​ኩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አጽ​ንዕ፡ ​ወዘ​አጽ​ናዕ​ኩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ግድ​ፍ፡ ​ክሥ​ት፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ ​እገ​ሌ፡ ​ግበ​ር፡
                                        ​ዘ፫​፯፡ ​ዘቢ​ብ፡ ​፯፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ድግ​ም፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 86r: Calendaric note written in pale black ink and partly encircled in two frames. The name of
                                        the owner <fo:inline id="d1e77594PRS13275HaylaGi">Ḫayla Giyorgis</fo:inline> is mentioned at the end of the text.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        Incipit:  :
                                            ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​መስ​ከረ​ም፡ ​በ፩ ​በር​ተሎ​መዎ​ስ፡ ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ጥ {​ቅምት} ፡
                                            ​በ፲​ወ፪ ​ማቴ​ዎስ፡
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 86r–86v: Protective prayer against the evil eye and headache 
                    ( ḥǝmāma ʿāyn wa-fǝlḍata rǝʾs ), incomplete, CAe 6787..
                                        The text is written in black ink in a untrained hand. It breaks off abruptly.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        Incipit:  :
                                            ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​ወር​እሰ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ምእ​መን፡  ወ ​ጻድ​ቅ፡ ​ዘበ​ምራቅ ከ ፡
                                            ​ከሰ​ትከ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ተ፡ ​ዕው​ራን፡
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Many corrections executed over erasure (e.g. on fols 3rb, 3vb, 18ra), over effaced text (e.g. on 13ra, 28va, 32va),
                                        or interlineally (e.g. on 14ra, 24vb). Few words are erased (e.g. on 18vb, 27rb).
                                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Tamallas</fo:inline>-signs in the shape of two perpendicular lines indicate the omission of a portion of text,
                                        which is written in the upper or lower margin (24ra, 24vb, 32va).
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>An aid for a Saturday reading, <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘቀ​ዳሚ​ት፡ ​ሰን​በት፡</fo:inline>, is inserted in the upper margin of fol. 25rb.
                                        Another aid for a Sunday reading, <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘዕ​ሁድ፡</fo:inline>, is written in the left margin of 17ra.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>A note indicating the main content of the book is written in black ink on fol. 1v.
                                        The note was written by <fo:inline id="d1e77690PRS13276Thyne">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Captain</fo:inline>
                                            W.K. Thyne</fo:inline> on 4 March 1864, in <fo:inline id="d1e77698LOC1253Aden">Aden</fo:inline>.
                                        The text also mentions the previous owner of the manuscript, <fo:inline id="d1e77701PRS8943Speedy">Tristram Speedy</fo:inline>.
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">‘Ethiopic Mazmoor or Abyssinian Prayer Book. <fo:inline id="d1e77707PRS13276Thyne">J.W.K. Thyne</fo:inline>
                                            from his sincere friend <fo:inline id="d1e77710PRS8943Speedy">T.C.S.S</fo:inline>. <fo:inline id="d1e77713LOC1253Aden">Aden</fo:inline>
                                        4.3.64’.</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>A white sticker is glued to the inner side of the front board. The name of <fo:inline id="d1e77723PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> is printed on it
                                        (‘<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡ ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>’) and the signature ‘MS. Aeth. f. 34’ is written in pencil.
                                        An additional sticker, with the signature ‘Ms 39’ on it, is glued below it.
                                        A white sticker is also glued to the inner side of the back board, with the signature ‘T 12’ on it.
                                        The textual content, shelfmark and provenance of the book  ‘Begins with Hymn of the Negus.’,
                                        ‘Ms Aethiop. 39’,  ‘Belonged to the picturesque <fo:inline id="d1e77728PRS8943Speedy">
                           <fo:inline font-style="italic">Captain</fo:inline> Speedy</fo:inline>
                                        who was in <fo:inline id="d1e77733PRS7484Napier">Napier</fo:inline>’s campaign’),
                                        are indicated in pencil by <fo:inline id="d1e77736PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> on fol. 1r.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
            <fo:inline id="d1e77751">Quarter cover</fo:inline>. The book is bound in wooden boards with a blind-tooled leather which covers only the spine and the back edge of the boards.
                              
                                The boards are flush with the bookblock and have external shallow bevels. The grain runs vertically. The back board is
                                separated vertically in two halves which are held together with a thread passing through holes drilled on both sides of the fracture.
                                A crack opening in the back board has been repaired with thread.
                              
                                The boards and the spine are partially covered with a reddish-brown leather featuring a blind-tooled decoration.
                                On the surface of the boards and on the back, <fo:inline id="d1e77766">triple straight lines</fo:inline> intersect
                                  forming juxtaposed panels. Within each panel, the lines cross each
                                  other forming a <fo:inline font-style="italic">crux decussata</fo:inline>. The turn-ins are also
                                decorated with a panel, while the edges show a simple <fo:inline id="d1e77772">single straight line</fo:inline> running parallel
                                to the margin.
                                The cover is made of two pieces of leather sewn together.
                              
                                Brown <fo:inline id="d1e77778">slit-braid</fo:inline> endbands were present. Today, only fragments of the tailband and the extensions of the headband
                                between the bookblock and the boards are preserved.
                              
                                Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern. Four Z-plied threads are used.
                                The threads are knotted between each pair of sewing stations in the first and last quire.
                                In the quires, between each pair of sewing stations, there are two lengths of thread.
                              
                                Horizontal short stitches used to pierce the leather on the spine in two points (at the head and tail), thus fixing the endbands to the cover.
                              
                                The manuscript is provided with a leather one-piece single-walled satchel with the remnant of a hanging strap.
                                The satchel is equipped with a main pointed flap extending from the back to the front panel to cover the opening of the book compartment.
                                The flap slides under a belt which is secured to the side panels.
                                The belt holds in position also the fragments the narrow leather hanging strap.
                              
                                Threads of various colours are inserted in one the ruling pricks in the outer margins for navigating the text.
                                More specifically, a red <fo:inline id="d1e77797">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted  in fol. 18 and an
                                uncoloured <fo:inline id="d1e77802">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted in fols 11, 25, 33.
                              </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner (1–86).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>11 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (Fols 1r–1v)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 2r–11v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 12r–21v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 22r–31v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 32r–41v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 42r–51v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 52r–61v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 62r–69v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 70r–77v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 78r–85v)</fo:inline> – B<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (Fols 86r–86v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 2ra–57va: 2
                                    columns (14 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 22r. The characters per line are 8–12.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            147 × 132 mm (fol. 22r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            92 × 104 mm (fol. 22r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 16 mm, bottom: 36 mm, right: 17 mm, left: 13 mm, intercolumn: 10 mm (fol. 22r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 57va–85vb: 2
                                    columns (14–15 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 62r. The characters per line are 7–10.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            147 × 132 mm (fol. 22r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            104 × 106 mm (fol. 62r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 17 mm, bottom: 29 mm, left: 12 mm, right: 18 mm, intercolumn: 10 mm (fol. 62r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are mostly visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling. Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->eighteenth century. Fine handwriting.
                                    It is possible that several hands were involved in the writing.
                                    Changes of nib can be identified on fols 26ra, 57va.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    Few lines on the incipit page of Textual unit I, alternating with black lines; first words of texts and sections of texts; titles of the New Testament excerpts;
                                    holy names; directives and refrains in full or in abbreviated form (e.g. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅ፡ ​ቅ፡ ​ቅ፡</fo:inline> or <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡</fo:inline>);
                                    elements of the punctuation signs, text dividers, and numerals.
                                    Rubrication was possibly executed in a different hand.
                                </fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 2va, 9rb, 31ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገ፡ ​ለ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገነ​ይነ፡ ​ለኪ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fol. 10ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅ፡ ​እ፡ ​ጸ፡ ​አ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ጸባ​ዖት፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ፡</fo:inline> (fols 31ra–31va);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሃ፡ ​ሉ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡</fo:inline> (fols 32va–33ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>5)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይ፡ ​ሕ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይቤ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 33ra, 37ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>6)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይ፡ ​ካ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይቤ፡ ​ካህ​ን፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 33vb, 36vb);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>7)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይ፡ ​ዲ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይቤ፡ ​ዲያ​ቆን፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 33vb, 36vb);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>8)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በ፡ ​ሰ፡</fo:inline> or <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በሰ፡ ​ሰ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በሰ​ጊድ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡</fo:inline> (fols 37vb–41vb).
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
                                Threads of various colours are inserted in one the ruling pricks in the outer margins for navigating the text.
                                More specifically, a red <fo:inline id="d1e77797">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted  in fol. 18 and an
                                uncoloured <fo:inline id="d1e77802">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted in fols 11, 25, 33.
                              <fo:block>Holes from parchment making have been crudely repaired by sewing on fols 16, 19.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.
                                    Fols 14v–19r are stained with dirt at the lower outer corners.
                                    The back board has two cracks along the vertical axis which have been repaired with threads passing through pairs of holes.
                                    The leather cover lacks of the spine at the head and tail. The headband is missing and the tail band is fragmentary.
                                    The sewing is broken at the uppermost sewing station between the first and second quires.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>Eighteenth century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the eighteenth century.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
                            The name of the original owner, written in red ink in the supplication formula on fol. 25va, has been partially effaced (only
                             the first part of his name, Walda, is legible).
                            The manuscript probably belonged to a certain <fo:inline id="d1e77823PRS13275HaylaGi">
                  <fo:inline font-style="italic">ʾAbbā</fo:inline> Ḫayla
                                Giyorgis</fo:inline>, whose name appears in Additional notes 2 and 5.
                            According to Varia notes 3 and 4, the manuscript was owned by <fo:inline id="d1e77834PRS8943Speedy">Tristram Speedy</fo:inline>, who sojourned
                            in <fo:inline id="d1e77838LOC3010Ethiop">Ethiopia</fo:inline> in the early 1860s. According to Varia note 3,
                            the manuscript had already passed into the hands of <fo:inline id="d1e77846PRS13276Thyne">
                  <fo:inline font-style="italic">Captain</fo:inline> W.K. Thyne</fo:inline> by
                            March 1864, probably as a gift of <fo:inline id="d1e77854PRS8943Speedy">Tristram Charles Sawyer Speedy</fo:inline> himself in <fo:inline id="d1e77857LOC1253Aden">Aden</fo:inline>.
                            The subsequent owners are unknown,
                            but the manuscript was eventually purchased by <fo:inline id="d1e77860PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> at Sotheby’s on 2 July 1984
                            (‘Sotheby’s Oriental Miniatures and 
                            Manuscripts’, lot
                            79) through the bookseller <fo:inline id="d1e77864PRS13559Thomas">Alan G. Thomas</fo:inline>.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e77869PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf34">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf34</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
