      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethd19"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. d. 19</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Arch. O. d. 43, Juel-Jensen 40)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex, composite280×200 mm, 165 fols.  Unit 1: , mid-fifteenth–early sixteenth century. Unit 2: , mid-fifteenth–early sixteenth century. </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
            <fo:inline id="d1e79065">Quarter cover</fo:inline>. The book is bound in wooden boards with a blind-tooled leather which covers only the spine and the back edge of the boards.
                              
                                The boards are flush with the bookblock and have external shallow bevels. The grain runs vertically.
                                The outer surface and the edges of the boards are polished and a layer of dark-coloured finish has been added, while the inner surface exhibits signs of the working tool.
                                The lower board is separated vertically in two halves which are held together with various threads passing through pairs of holes drilled in the board.
                                On the inner surface of the upper board, in the middle, remnants of a grayish substance are present, which perhaps was used to glue a <fo:inline id="d1e79077">mirror</fo:inline>.
                              
                                The boards and the spine are partially covered with a reddish-brown leather featuring a blind-tooled decoration.
                                On the surface of the boards and on the back, bands of two <fo:inline id="d1e79083">single straight lines</fo:inline> intersect
                                  forming two columns of juxtaposed panels. Within each panel, the
                                  lines cross each other forming a <fo:inline font-style="italic">crux decussata</fo:inline>. Within a panel
                                on the back board the lines also form a 4-pointed star.
                                The turn-ins and the edges are not decorated. On the inner side of the boards, between the turn-ins, <fo:inline id="d1e79089">additional leather patches</fo:inline>
                                have been added. On the one on the front board, an angel holding a spear in his hand, perhaps St Michael, is drawn in pencil.
                              
                                The endbands are missing.
                              
                                Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern; Z-plied threads.
                                In the quires, between each pair of sewing stations, there are two lengths of thread.
                              
                                At the head are preserved the horizontal short stitches used to pierce the leather on the spine in two points (at the head and tail), thus fixing the endbands to the cover.
                              
                                Threads of various colours are inserted in the outer margins for navigating the text.
                                More specifically, a black <fo:inline id="d1e79108">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted in fol. 28 and a
                                purple <fo:inline id="d1e79113">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted in fol. 113.
                              </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner (1–165).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>mid-fifteenth–early sixteenth century</fo:inline>
                                                       The
                            date of production of both units can
                            be set to the second half of the fifteenth to the early sixteenth
                            century based on the style of the miniatures. This is supported by the
                            handwriting.
                        <fo:block xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">It appears that the manuscript consists of two production units: Part 1 and Part 2, both
                            written by the same hand.
                            Part 1 contains
                            <fo:inline>Psalms of David (መዝሙረ፡ ዳዊት፡), CAe 2000</fo:inline>
                            and some of the texts that regularly
                            accompany it (<fo:inline>“” (ግጻዌ፡ ሥርዐት፡ ዘአውሴቢስ፡ ፍልስጥናዊ፡ ዘመጽሐፈ፡ መዝሙር፡), CAe 6719</fo:inline>, <fo:inline>Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828</fo:inline>, and
                            <fo:inline>“” (መሓልየ፡ መሓልይ፡), CAe 2362</fo:inline>), but lacks
                            <fo:inline>“Praise of Mary” (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509</fo:inline>. This
                            latter point may have been the reason why Part 2 was added to Part 1.
                            Part 2, apparently originating from another manuscript, contains at its core
                            <fo:inline>“Praise of Mary” (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509</fo:inline>. Preceding
                            <fo:inline>“Praise of Mary” (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509</fo:inline> is the incomplete end of
                            <fo:inline>Gospel of John (ብስራተ፡ ዮሐንስ፡), CAe 2715</fo:inline>,
                            and following it is the incomplete beginning of
                            <fo:inline>Introduction to  
                , CAe 6763</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true" text-indent="0.43cm">
                        An additional indication that Part 2 was originally part of another manuscript is the presence of
                            quire marks only in Part 2. Quire 20 is materially made up of elements belonging both
                            to Part 1 and Part 2: while its core (fols 148–153) originally made
                            up the three outer bifolios of a quire with the quire mark <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፮</fo:inline> (‘6’) in
                            Part 2, its first folio (fol. 147) clearly belongs to Part 1 (it contains
                            illuminations belonging to the series of illuminations that runs all through Part 1) and was
                            added as an outermost single leaf (with a stub after fol. 153) to Quire 20. (As text
                            appears to be missing between fol. 149v and fol. 150r, one can further hypothesise
                            that a single leaf has disappeared from this position.)
                        </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
                            The manuscript was bought by <fo:inline id="d1e79218PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> at
                            Christie’s  on 30 May 1984 (lot
                            212) through the bookseller <fo:inline id="d1e79222PRS13559Thomas">Alan G. Thomas</fo:inline>.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e79227PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm">
                                        Two of the three quires that originally belonged to Part 2 have quire marks: Quire 20 has
                                        the quire mark <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፮</fo:inline> on fols 148r,  (fol. 147 belongs
                                            to Part 1) and on fol. 153v; Quire 21 has the quire mark
                                                <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፯</fo:inline> on fol. 154r.
                                        No quire marks can be detected on Quire 22, but this may be due to dirt in the upper inner margin.
                                    </fo:block>
         <fo:block>22 quires. I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">5+1 (Fols 1r–6v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 7r–14v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 15r–22v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 23r–30v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 31r–38v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 39r–46v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 47r–54v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 55r–62v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 63r–70v)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 71r–78v)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 79r–86v)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 87r–94v)</fo:inline> – XIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 95r–102v)</fo:inline> – XIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 103r–110v)</fo:inline> – XV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 111r–118v)</fo:inline> – XVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 119r–126v)</fo:inline> – XVII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 127r–134v)</fo:inline> – XVIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 135r–142v)</fo:inline> – XIX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (Fols 143r–146v)</fo:inline> – XX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+1 (Fols 147r–153v)</fo:inline> – XXI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 154r–161v)</fo:inline> – XXII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+4 (Fols 162r–165v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Bibliography</fo:block>Gnisci 2020; Juel-Jensen 1987; Juel-Jensen 1989; Juel-Jensen 1994; Thomas 1990.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 1</fo:block>
         <fo:block>Parchment, 147 fols (fols 1r–147v fol. 5r).</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79285LIT6719prologue">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r–4v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ግጻ​ዌ፡ ​ሥር​ዐት፡ ​ዘአ​ውሴ​ቢስ፡ ​ፍል​ስጥ​ናዊ፡ ​ዘመ​ጽሐ​ፈ፡ ​መዝ​ሙር፡), CAe 6719.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ሥር<fo:inline>[አ]</fo:inline>​ት፡  ​ዘአው ሰ ​ብስ፡  ና ​ስጥ​ናዊ፡ ​መጽ
                                    <fo:inline>[ሐ]</fo:inline>​ፈ፡ ​መዝ​ሙር፡ ​ወግጻ ዌ ​ሁ፡  ዘ ​በበ፡ ​ህል​ው፡ ​ዘከ
                                    <fo:inline>[​መ፡]</fo:inline> ​ተጽ​ሕፈ፡ ​ዘበ​ዕብ​ራይ​ስጥ፡ ​ወዘ​ከመ፡ ​አዕ​ለውዎ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​እለ፡ ​ኢኮ​ኑ፡ ​ጽሑ​ፋን ፨
                                ​ወጽ​ሑፋን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወሕ​ጉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​እም
                                 ​ድር፡ ​ወእ​ምሰ​ማይ፡ ​ኪያ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ነአ​ኵት፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡
                                 ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ወማ​እሰ​ረ፡ ​ተፍ​ጻሜ
                                 ​ቱ፡ ​ፍቅ​ር፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79355LIT2000Mazmur">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 7r–125v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Psalms of David, CAe 2000.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ፍካ​ሬ፡ ​ዘጻ​ድቃ​ን፡ ​ወኀ​ጥአ​ን።
                                ​፩፡  ​ብፁ​ዕ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘኢ​ሖረ፡ ​በም​ክረ፡ ​ረሲ​ዓን ፨
                                ​ወኢ​ቆመ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ኃጥ​አን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወረ​ገሙ​ኒ፡ ​በአ​ማል​ክቲ​ሆሙ ፨
                                ​ወአ​ንሰ፡ ​ነሣ​እኩ፡ ​ዘእ​ምላ​ዕሌ​ሁ፡ ​ሰይፈ ፨
                                ​ወመ​ተር​ኩ፡ ​ርእሶ ፨
                                ​ወአ​ሰሰ​ልኩ፡ ​ፅእ​ለተ፡ ​እም​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤል ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79410LIT1828Mahale">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 126r–138r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes, CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79416LIT1828Mahale#Moses1">
               <fo:inline>III-1) Fols 126r–127r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: First Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ለሙ​ሴ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ማኅ​ሌተ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​ዘፀ​አት፡ ​ወጸ​ሎቱ፡ ​ለሙሴ ፨
                                    ​፩፡  ​ንሴ​ብሖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​ዘተ​ሰብሐ ፨
                                    ​ፈረ​ሰ፡ ​ወመ​ስተ​ጽዕ​ነ፡ ​ወረ​ወ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወአ​ስተ​ጋብ​አ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​ባሕ​ር።
                                     ​ወደ​ቂቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ልሰ፡ ​ኀለ​ፉ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​የብ​ስ፡ ​ማእ​ከለ፡ ​ባሕ​ር።
                                     ​ወማ​ይሰ፡  ​ኮነ፡  ​ሎመ፡ ​አረ​ፍት፡ ​በይ​ምን፡ ​ወአ​ረፍ​ት፡ ​በጽ​ግም።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79461LIT1828Mahale#Moses2">
               <fo:inline>III-2) Fols 127r–128v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Second Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም፡ ​ሕግ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዘሙ​ሴ፡ ​ማኅ​ሌት፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም ፨
                                    ​፪፡  ​አጽ​ምእ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወእ​ንግ​ርከ ፨
                                    ​ወት​ስማ​ዕ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​አፉየ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወአ​ምዕ​ዑኒ፡ ​በአ​ማል​ክቲ​ሆሙ ፨
                                    ​ወአ​ነ፡ ​አቀ​ንዖ​ሙ፡ ​በዘ፡ ​ኢኮ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝብ ፨
                                    ​ወአ​ምዖ​ሙ፡ ​በሕ​ዝብ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይሌ​ብዉ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79513LIT1828Mahale#Moses3">
               <fo:inline>III-3) Fols 128v–130r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Third Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘሣ​ልስ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ሣል​ሳይ ፨
                                    ​፫፡  ​እስ​መ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ትነ​ድድ፡ ​እመ​ዐትየ ፨
                                    ​ወታ​ውዒ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ታሕተ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወይ​ትቤ​ቀል፡ ​ወይ​ትፈ​ደዮ​ሙ፡ ​በቀ​ለ፡ ​ለፀሩ ፨
                                    ​ወይ​ትቤ​ቀሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለጸ​ላእቱ ፨
                                    ​ወያ​ነጽ​ሕ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝቡ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79566LIT1828Mahale#Hannah">
               <fo:inline>III-4) Fols 130r–131r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Hannah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሓና፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሐና፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል ፨
                                    ​፬፡  ​ጸን​ዐ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                    ​ወተ​ለዐ​ለ፡ ​ቀር​ንየ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​ወመ​ድኀ​ኒየ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ጻድ​ቅ፡ ​ይኴ​ንን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​አጽ​ናፈ፡ ​ምድር ፨
                                    ​ወይ​ሁቦ​ሙ፡ ​ኀይ​ለ፡ ​ለነ​ገሥ​ትነ ፨
                                    ​ወያ​ሌዕ​ል፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መሲሁ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79618LIT1828Mahale#Hezekiah">
               <fo:inline>III-5) Fols 131r–131v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Prayer of Hezekiah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቅያ​ስ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቅያ​ስ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ይሁዳ ፨
                                    ​፭፡  ​አን​ሰ፡ ​እቤ፡ ​በኑ​ኀ፡ ​መዋ​ዕልየ ፨
                                    ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አና​ቅጸ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ኀደ​ጉ፡ ​ዘተ​ረፈ፡ ​ዓመ​ትየ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እነ​ግር፡ ​ጽድ​ቀከ፡ ​በዳ​ኅናየ ፨
                                    ​ወት​ረ፡ ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​ወእ​ዜም​ር፡ ​ለከ ፨
                                    ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወትየ ፨
                                    ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79675LIT1828Mahale#Manasseh">
               <fo:inline>III-6) Fols 131v–132v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Prayer of Manasseh (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ምና​ሴ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ምናሴ ፨
                                    ​፮፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አኀ​ዜ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                                    ​አም​ላኮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊነ ፨
                                    ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ ​ወለ​ያዕ​ቆብ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሐይ​ወት
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኪያ​ከ፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ኀይ​ለ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                    ​ወለ​ከ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79734LIT1828Mahale#Jonah">
               <fo:inline>III-7) Fols 132v–133r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Jonah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡ ​ነቢይ ፨
                                    ​፯፡  ​ጸራ​ኅኩ፡ ​በም​ንዳ​ቤየ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ አ
                                    ​ወሰ​ምዐ​ኒ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ከር​ሠ፡ ​ሲኦል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወእ​ለሰ፡ ​ዐቀ​ቡ፡ ​ከን​ቶ፡ ​ወሐ​ሰተ፡ ​ገደ​ፉ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎሙ ፨
                                    ​ወአ​ንሰ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወተ​ጋን​ዮ፡ ​እሠ​ውዕ፡ ​ለከ ፨
                                    ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​ጸለ​ይኩ፡ ​በሕ​ይወ​ትየ፡ ​አዐ​ስዮ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79788LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths1">
               <fo:inline>III-8) Fols 133r–134r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: First Song of the Three Youths in the Furnace (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ዘእ​ምኣ​ዛር​ያ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል፡ ​ወስ​ብሐ​ተ፡ ​አዛ​ርያ ፨
                                    ​፰፡  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ ፨
                                     ​እኩ​ት፡ ​ወስ​ቡሕ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​ወይ​ትኀ​ፈሩ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ትእ​ግል​ቶሙ፡ ​ወይ​ትቀ​ጥቀ​ጥ፡ ​ኀይ​ሎሙ ፨
                                     ​ወያ​እም​ሩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ባሕ​ቲት
                                     ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79842LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths2">
               <fo:inline>III-9) Fol. 134r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Second Song of the Three Youths (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሠለ​ስቱ፡ ​ደቂ​ቅ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሠለ​ስቱ፡ ​ደቂቅ ፨
                                    ​፱፡  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ ፨
                                     ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ​ኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                    ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​በመ​ልዕ​ልተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                    ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ወ<fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>​ቡር<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79903LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths3">
               <fo:inline>III-10) Fols 134r–135r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Third Song of the Three Youths (​ኀበ፡ ​ባረ​ኩ፡ ​ኣና​ንያ፡ ​ወኣ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ኀበ፡ ​ባረ​ኩ፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤል ፨
                                    ​፲፡ ይ ባ ር ክ ​ዎ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                     ስ ቡ ሕ ​ኒ፡  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ይ ባ ር ክ ዎ ፤  ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨  ስ ፨
                                    ን ባ ር ​ኮ፡  ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨  ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e79980LIT1828Mahale#Habakkuk">
               <fo:inline>III-11) Fols 135r–136r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Habakkuk (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዕን​ባቆ​ም፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እን​ባቆ​ም፡ ​ነቢይ ፨
                                    ​፲፩፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕኩ፡ ​ድም​ፀከ፡ ​ወፈ​ራህኩ ፨
                                    ​ርኢ​ኩ፡ ​ግብ​ረከ፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ርኩ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ወኀ​ይልየ ፨
                                    ​ዘይ​ሠር​ዖን፡ ​ለእ​ገሪ​የ፡ ​ለፍ​ጻሜ ፨
                                    ​ወዲ​በ፡ ​ልዑ​ላት፡ ​ያጼ​ዕነኒ ፨
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​እማ​ዕ፡ ​በማ​ኀል​ይሁ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80037LIT1828Mahale#Isaiah">
               <fo:inline>III-12) Fols 136r–137r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Isaiah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢይ ፨
                                    ​፲፪፡  ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ትገ​ይስ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አም​ላኪ
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ትእ​ዛዝ​ከ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​ምድር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሖር፡ ​ሕዝ​ብየ፡ ​ወባ​እ፡ ​ቤተከ ፨
                                    ​ወዕ​ፁ፡ ​ኆኅ​ተከ ፨
                                    ​ወተ​ኀባ​እ፡ ​ኅዳ​ጠ፡ ​ምዕረ ፨
                                    ​እስ​ከ፡ ​የኀ​ልፍ፡ ​መዐ​ቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80096LIT1828Mahale#Mary">
               <fo:inline>III-13) Fols 137r–137v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Our Lady Mary (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡) or Magnificat</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ማር​ያም ፨
                                    ​፲፫፡  ​ተዐ​ቢዮ፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                    ​ወት​ትሐ​ሠይ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​ወመ​ድኀኒ
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወተ​ወክ​ፎ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ቍል​ዔሁ ፨
                                    ​ወተ​ዘከ​ረ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊነ ፨
                                    ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ዘር​ኡ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80150LIT1828Mahale#Zachariah">
               <fo:inline>III-14) Fols 137v–138r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Zachariah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ካህ​ን፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢይ ፨
                                    ​፲፬፡  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​እስ​ራኤል ፨
                                    ​ዘተ​ሠሀ​ለነ፡ ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​መድ​ኀኒ​ተ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝበ፡ ​ዚአሁ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወሠ​ረቀ፡ ​ያር​እዮ​ሙ፡ ​ብር​ሃኖ ፨
                                    ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ይነ​ብሩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ​ወጽ​ላሎ​ተ፡ ​ሞት ፨
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​ያር​ትዕ፡ ​እገ​ሪነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ሰላም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80202LIT1828Mahale#Simeon">
               <fo:inline>III-15) Fol. 138r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Simeon, or Nunc Dimittis (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢይ ፨
                                    ​፲፭፡  ​ይእ​ዜ፡ ​ትስ​ዕሮ፡ ​ለገ​ብርከ ፨
                                    ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዝከ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ዘአ​ስተ​ዳሎ​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ ፨
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​ትክ​ሥት፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ለአ​ሕዛብ ፨
                                    ​ወክ​ብረ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ​ከ፡ ​እስ​ራኤል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80255LIT2362Songof">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 139r–146v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​መሓ​ልየ፡ ​መሓ​ልይ፡), CAe 2362.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                                Each section of <fo:inline>“” (መሓልየ፡ መሓልይ፡), CAe 2362</fo:inline> begins with a rubricated title and summary,
                                and ends with a doxology.
                            </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ቀዳ​ሚ፡ ​ማኃ​ልይ፡ ​ዘይ​ነግ​ር፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መር​ዓዊ፡ ​ወመ​ርዓ​ት፡ ለ
                                ​፩፡  ​ማኃ​ልየ፡ ​ማኀ​ልይ፡ ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ​ዘሰ​ሎሞን ፨
                                ​ይስ​ዕመ​ኒ፡ ​በስ​ዕመ​ተ፡ ​አፉሁ ፨
                                ​አዳ​ም፡ ​አጥ​ባት​ኪ፡ ​እም​ወይን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይነ​ብር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገነት ፨
                                ​ካል​አን፡ ​ርእ​ይዎ ፨  (fol. 146v) 
                                ​ቃለ​ከ፡ ​አስ​መዐኒ ፨
                                ​ጕይ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​እኁየ ፨
                                ​ወተ​መሰ​ላ፡ ​ለወ​ይጠል ፨
                                ​ወእ​መአ​ኮ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ወሬ​ዛ፡ ​ሀየል ፨
                                ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አድ​ባረ፡ ​ድኁ​ኃን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
