         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 2</fo:block>
         <fo:block>Parchment, 18 fols (fols 148–165).</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80778LIT2715John">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 148ra–149vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John, incomplete, CAe 2715.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text is incomplete and contains John 20:20–21:21, ending abruptly in the middle of the last verse.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em"> <!--I would prefer not to have lbs here, since we
                                don't usually indicate line breaks in two-column layouts DR-->
                                ​እገ​ሪሁ፡ ​ወገ​ቦሁ ፨  ወ
                                 ​ተፈ​ሥሑ፡ ​አር​ዳኢ​ሁ፡ ሶ
                                 ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ይዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ ፨
                                ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ እ
                                 ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ድእ፡ ​ዘያ​ፈቅ​ሮ፡ ​እግዚ
                                 ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይተ
                                 ​ሉ፡ ​ዘረ​ፈቀ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​እንግ
                                 ​ድአ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ
                                 ​ሱስ ፨  ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ይዴ​ረሩ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80830LIT2509Weddas">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 150ra–165ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ማር​ያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80837LIT2509Weddas#Sunday">
               <fo:inline>II-1) Fols 150ra–151rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Sunday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡
                                         ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡
                                     ​ንጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​ውዳ​ሴሃ፡ ለ
                                     ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                         ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​እም​ንጹ​ሐን፡
                                     ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወስ​እለ​ታ፡ የ
                                     ​ሀሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​በሰ​ንበ​ተ፡ ክ
                                    ​ርስ​ቲያን ፨  ​ተሠ​መይ
                                     ​ኪ፡ ​ፍቅ​ርት፡ ​ኦቡ​ርክ
                                     ​ት፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡
                                     ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ዳግ​ሚት፡ ​ቀመ
                                     ​ር፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ትሠ​መይ፡ መ
                                     ​ቅደ​ሰ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ዘውስ
                                     ​ቴታ፡ ​ጽላ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳ​ን፡  ​፲፡  ቃ
                                     ​ላት፡ ​እለ፡ ​ተጽ​ሕፈ፡ በ
                                     ​አጻ​ብዒ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚአ
                                     ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡
                                     ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ያጽ
                                     ​ንዐ​ነ፡ ​በር​ትዕ​ት፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ
                                     ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሚ​ነ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡
                                     ​ይጸ​ግወ​ነ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ወም
                                     ​ሕረ​ቶ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኀጢአ
                                     ​ተነ፡ ​በብ​ዝኀ፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡
                                     ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨
                                    ​ወበ​እን​ተዝ፡ ​ነዐ​ብየ​ኪ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e80940LIT1113Anqasa">
               <fo:inline>II-2) Fols 151va–156ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gate of Light’ (​አን​ቀጸ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡), CAe 1113.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​አው​ሎግ​ሶን፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ክ
                                    ​ርስ​ቶስ፡ ​ለይ​ኩን፡ ​ብርሃ
                                     ​ኑ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ አ
                                    ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌነ፡ ​ወይሠ
                                     ​ርሕ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ተግ​ባረ፡ ​እደዊ
                                    ነ ፨  ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ወብ​ፅዕ​ት፡
                                     ​ስብ​ሕት፡ ​ወቡ​ርክ​ት፡ ክ
                                     ​ብር​ት፡ ​ወል​ዕል​ት፡ ​አንቀ
                                     ​ጸ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ወማ​ዕረ​ገ፡ ሕ
                                     ​ይወ​ት፡ ​ማኅ​ደረ፡ ​መለኮ
                                     ​ት፡ ​ቅድ​ስተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኀጢ​አተ
                                     ​ነ፡ ​ወብ​ዝኀ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም
                                     ​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለኪ፡
                                     ​ኦወ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ኵ
                                     ሉ ፨  ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ወክ​ብር፡  (fol. 156ra) 
                                    ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ
                                     ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡
                                     ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ዓ
                                     ​ለም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ሜን፡ ወ
                                     ​ልድ​ኪ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ይክ​ፍለ
                                     ​ነ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨ ​ወ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e81029LIT2509Weddas#Monday">
               <fo:inline>II-3) Fols 156ra–156vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Monday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​በሰ​ኑይ ፨ ​ፈቀ
                                     ​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ያግ​እዞ፡ ለ
                                     ​አዳ​ም፡ ​ሕዙ​ነ፡ ​ወት​ኩዘ፡
                                     ​ልብ፡ ​ወያ​ግብ​ኦ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዘት
                                     ​ካት፡ ​መን​በሩ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨ ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​በሥ
                                         ​ጋ፡ ​እም​ድን​ግል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡
                                         ​ዘር​አ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​መጽ​አ፡ ​ወአ
                                         ​ድኀ​ነነ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወረ​ሰይ​ካ፡ ​ለሔ​ዋን፡ <fo:inline>አግ
                                        ዐተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​እም​ፃዕ​ረ፡ ​ሞት፡ ወ
                                     ​ወሀ​ብከ​ነ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ትን
                                     ​ቢት፡ ​ባረ​ክና​ከ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                     ​መላ​እክ​ቲከ ፤  ሰ ፨
                                    ​ሠረ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e81101LIT2509Weddas#Tuesday">
               <fo:inline>II-4) Fols 156vb–158va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Tuesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​በሠ​ሉስ ፨  ​አክሊ  (fol. 157ra) 
                                    ​ለ፡ ​ምክ​ሕነ፡ ​ወቀ​ዳሚ​ተ፡
                                     ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡ ​ወመ​ሰረ​ተ፡
                                     ​ንጽ​ሕነ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​በማ​ርያ​ም፡ ድ
                                     ​ንግ​ል፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ወለ​ደት፡ ለ
                                     ​ነ፡ ​ዘእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ቃ
                                     ​ል፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡
                                     ​መድ​ኀኒ​ትነ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ይሰ​ፍሑ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሆ
                                     ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ብሉ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ው
                                     ​እቱ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ መ
                                     ​ጽአ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኀጢ​አተ፡
                                     ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​በዕ​በየ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ፡
                                     ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፨ ፨ ​እስ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e81159LIT2509Weddas#Wednesday">
               <fo:inline>II-5) Fols 158va–160rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Wednesday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​በረ​ቡዕ ፨  ​ኵሉ፡
                                     ​ሰራ​ዊተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ይብ​ሉ፡
                                     ​ብፅ​ዕት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ሰማይ {፡ ​ዳግ}
                                    ​ሚት፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ኆኅ​ተ፡
                                     ​ምሥ​ራቅ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ድንግ
                                     ​ል፡ ​ከብ​ካብ፡ ​ንጹ​ሕ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወአ​ንሶ​ሰወ፡ 
                                     ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ 
                                     ​መሐ​ሪ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወመፍ
                                     ​ቀሬ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​አድ​ኀነ፡ ​ነፍ
                                     ​ሳቲ​ነ፡ ​በም​ጽአ​ቱ፡  ​ቅዱ
                                     ​ስ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፤ ​ኵ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e81215LIT2509Weddas#Thursday">
               <fo:inline>II-6) Fols 160rb–162va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Thursday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​በኃ​ሙስ ፨  ​ዕፀ፡ እ
                                     ​ንተ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​በነ​ደ፡
                                     ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡
                                     ​ወአ​ዕፁ​ቂሃ፡ ​ኢት​ውዒ፡
                                     ​ትመ​ስል፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ድን
                                     ​ግል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ርኵ​ስ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ከማ​ነ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ
                                     ​ለ፡ ​ኀጢ​አት፡ ​ባሕ​ቲታ ፨
                                    ​ወተ​ወል​ደ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ል
                                     ​ሔም፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ሰበ​ኩ፡
                                     ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​አድ​ኃነ​ነ፡ ​ወቤዘ
                                     ​ወነ፡ ​ወረ​ሰየ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡ ዚ
                                     ​አሁ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ ፨ ​ነዐ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e81271LIT2509Weddas#Friday">
               <fo:inline>II-7) Fols 162va–164ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Friday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​በዐ​ርብ ፨  ​ቡርክ
                                     ​ት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡
                                     ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ፡
                                     ​ኦማ​ርያ​ም፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ወ
                                     ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ
                                     ​ለ፡ ​ርኵ​ስ፡ ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​ለነ፡ እ
                                     ​ምኔ​ኪ፡ ​ፀሐ​የ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ፡ ወ
                                     ​አቅ​ረበ​ነ፡ ​ታሕ​ተ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሁ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    በ  (fol. 164ra)  ​እን​ተዝ፡ ​ንዌ​ድሰ​ኪ፡ በ
                                     ​ከመ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​መልአ
                                     ​ክ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ንብ​ል፡ ​ቡርክ
                                     ​ት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወቡ
                                     ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ ፨  ተ
                                     ​ፈሥ​ሒ፡ ​ኦም​ልዕ​ተ፡ ጸ
                                     ​ጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚኣ​ብሔ​ር፡ ም
                                     ​ስሌ​ኪ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ
                                     ​ስት ፨ ​ለኪ፡ ​ለባ​ሕቲ​ትኪ ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e81341LIT2509Weddas#Saturday">
               <fo:inline>II-8) Fols 164ra–165ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Praise of Mary: Saturday</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​በቀ​ዳሚ​ት፡ ​ሰን​በት፡
                                    ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ወብ​ርህ​ት፡ ወ
                                     ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​እን​ተ፡
                                     ​ኀቀ​ፈቶ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​በእ
                                     ​ራኃ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ፍጥ​ረት፡
                                     ​ይት​ፌሥ​ሑ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሃ፡
                                     ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይጸ​ርሑ፡ ​ወይብ
                                     ​ሉ፡ ​ሰአ​ሉ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሰአ
                                     ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡
                                     ​ኄር፡ ​መድ​ኀኒ​ነ፡ ​ይምሐ
                                     ​ረነ፡ ​ወይ​ሠሀ​ለነ፡ ​ወይስ
                                     ​ረይ፡ ​ኀጢ​አተ​ነ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡
                                     ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨ ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ለ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ስእለ
                                     ​ታ፡ ​ያድ​ኅነ​ነ፡ ​እመ​ዐተ፡
                                     ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአሜ
                                     ​ን፡ ​ለይ​ኩን፡ ​ለይ​ኩን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 150r: Barely legible note written with
                                        red ink, most probably by <fo:inline/>,
                                        in the blank spaces of the headpiece decorating the beginning of the
                                        <fo:inline>“Praise of Mary” (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509</fo:inline>.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                           <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ያም<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ሊተ፡ ለ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ተዝ​ካር፡ ​ፍቅ​ረ፡ ​ዘማ​እከሌ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ወሰ​ላም፡ ​ለከ
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 165ra–165vb: The beginning of <fo:inline>Introduction to  
                , CAe 6763</fo:inline>. The addition is
                                        written in hand different from that of the main text but of approximately the same age.
                                    </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        Incipit: 
                                            ​በስ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዚኣ​ብሔ​ር፡ ስ
                                            ​ሉስ፡ ​ኅቡ​ረ፡ ​ሀል​ዎ፡ ​ልዑ
                                             ​ል፡ ​ዘኢ​ይረ​ክብ​ዎ፡ መ
                                            ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ዚኢ​ገስ​ስዎ፡
                                             ​ክቡ​ት፡ ​ዘኢ​ይሬ​እይ​ዎ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ዘኢ​ይለ​ክፍ​ዎ፡
                                            ​ኃይ​ል፡ <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>​ኢይ​ሌብው
                                             ​ዎ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​ኢይ​ሰይም
                                             ​ዎ፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ፡ ​በመለ<fo:inline>[ኮ]</fo:inline>
                                            ​ቱ፡ ​ወአ​ቡነ፡ ​በኂ​ሩቱ፡  ዘ አ
                                             ​ሐደ፡ ​ይሰ​ገድ፡  ወ ​አሐ​ደ፡ ​ይሴ
                                             ​ባሕ፡  ወ ​አሐ​ደ፡ ​ይጼ​ለይ፡ ሎ
                                             ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ዓ
                                             ​ለም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                            ​እጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​መጽሐ
                                             ​ፈ፡ ​ተጋ​ንዮ፡ ​ዘይ​ሰመ​ይ፡ እ
                                             ​ግዚ​ኣብ​ሔር፡ ​ነግ​ሠ፡ ወ
                                             ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ​ትር​ጓሜ​ሁ፡ ለ
                                             ​እግ​ዚኣ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ነግ​ሠ፡
                                             ​ነግ​ሠ፡ ​እግ​ዚኣ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                             ​ዘእ​ምቅ​ድመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ወ
                                             ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ዘር​እዮ፡ ​ለህ​ላዌ
                                             ​ሁ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​አሜ​ሃ፡ ​ጽን​ዐ፡
                                             ​ሰማ​ያት፡
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>fol. 152rafol. 151vb: </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 148ra–165ra: 2
                                    columns (23–24 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 149r.The characters per line are 9–11.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            285 × 210 mm (fol. 149r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            210 × 155 mm (fol. 149r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 25 mm, bottom: 50 mm, left: 15 mm, right: 40 mm, intercolumn: 13 mm (fol. 149r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The vertical lines sometimes end around the pricks in the lower part of the folio, sometimes continue
                                        to the lower margin of the folio, and their
                                        upper end is frequently difficult to trace. The lineation frequently reaches slightly beyond the outer line of justification.
                                     The upper line seems to be written above the ruling, although it is frequently difficult to
                                        determine with certainty. The bottom line is written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling pattern: 1-1-11:D!/0/0/C and 1-1-11:E!/0/0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd19">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd19</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
