      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethf33"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. f. 33</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 43)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex162×155 mm (weight: 803g), 92 fols (3 p. blank), 14 quires, mid-eighteenth–mid-nineteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e85533LIT1931Mashaf">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 2ra–71vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Book of the Funeral Ritual’ (​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ግን​ዘት፡), CAe 1931.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ወ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ዱ፡ ​አም​ላክ።  አ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እስ​ተ፡
                                ​ምን​ባብ፡ ​ዘያ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ምዉ​ታን፡ ​በሰ​ላመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ግን​ዘት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ኖሙ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ትወ​ጽእ፡ ​መን​ፈሱ፡ ​በኀ​በ፡ ​ማኅ​ደሩ፡
                                ​ወይ​ትበ​ሀል፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ወጸ​ሎተ፡ ​ዕጣን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 3rb–18va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e85566">Biblical readings and supplications</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                                    This section includes the following biblical quotations and prayers:
                                    Luke 20:27–38 (fols 3va–3vb, , fols 5ra–5vb),
                                    Prayer of the incense (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡</fo:inline>, fols 4ra–4rb),
                                    1 Cor. 15:1–22 (fols 4rb–4vb, , fols 6ra–6vb),
                                    1 Pet.
                                        1:3–9 (fols 6vb–7va),
                                    Acts 
                                        23:1–11 (fols 7va–8va),
                                    John 5:19–29 (fols 8va–9va),
                                    Matt.
                                        22:23–32 (fols 9vb–10va),
                                    Prayer for the dead (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ኖሙ፡</fo:inline>, fols 10va–11ra),
                                    Luke 16:19–31
                                    (fols 12ra–13va);
                                    then follow another prayer for the dead (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ኖሙ፡</fo:inline>), supplications and exhortations (fols 13va–18va).
                                </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ትብ​ል፡ ​አሌ​ፍ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ላማ​ድ፡ ​ወፈ​ጺመ​ከ፡  ​ትብ​ል፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ታወ​ፅእ፡ ​ግኑ​ዝ፡ ​እማ​ኅደ​ሩል ​ሜሞ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሳም​ኬት፡ ​ወተ​አር​ፍ፡
                                    ​በፍ  (fol. 3va)  ​ኖት፡  ፩  ​ምዕ​ራፍ፡ ​ወት​ብል፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ወን​ጌል፡ 
                                    ዘ ፶ ፬ ፨ 
                                    ​ወመ​ጽአ​ኒ፡ ​ድን​ጋፄ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​ፍር​ሃት፡ ​ወረ​ዓድ፡ ​አኃ​ዘኒ፡
                                    ​ወደ​ፈነ​ኒ፡ ​ጽል​መት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ዘያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለነ​ፍሱ፡ ​ለይ​ግድ​ፉ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አየ፡ ​ይረ​ክባ።   ​ጸሎ​ተ፡  ​ምና​ሴ፡ ​ወይ​እዜ​ኒ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​አም​ላኮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊ​ነ፡ ​ያስ​ተር​ኢ፡
                                    ​ኂሩ​ትከ፡ ​በላ​ዕሌ​የ፡ ​አም​ኮሙ፡ ​ለጻ​ድቃን ፨ 
                                    ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅሬ​ሁ፡  ​ታነ​ብብ፡ ​ድር​ሳነ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ለእ​መ፡ ​ኮነ፡
                                     ​ኮነ፡  ​ቀሲ​ስ፡ ​አው፡ ​ዲአ​ቆን፡ ​ወት​ብል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e85678LIT1629Homily">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 18va–25vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Homily on Priests and Deacons who have Fallen Asleep, CAe 1629.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አሐ​ዱ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                    ​ድርሳ  (b)  ​ን፡ ​ዘብ​ፁዕ፡ ​ወቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ያዕ​ቆብ፡ ​ዘሥ​ሩግ፡ ​ዘደ​ረሰ፡
                                    ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ኖሙ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ወዲ​ያቆ​ናት፡ ​እለ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                    ​ስም​ዑ፡ ​ኦፍ​ቁራ​ንየ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​ምዉ​ታን፡ ​ወሕ​ያዋ​ን፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ንስ​እለ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ፡
                                    ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትጸ​ውዖ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ግብ​ርቲ​ከ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​እሙ​ስና፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዘኢ  (fol. 19ra)  ​ይማ​ስን፡ ​ወታ​ወሥ​ኦሙ፡ ​ወለ​ዲያ​ቆና​ት፡
                                        ​እም​ነ፡
                                        ​መቃ​ብር፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ጸለ​ሎሙ፡ ​ጽላ​ሎተ፡ ​ሞት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ወክ​ብር፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዘረ​ሰዮ​ሙ፡ ​ማኅ​ደረ፡ ​ለመ ለ ​ኮተ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ፡ ​አሐ​ዱ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዕሪ​ና፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡ ​ሎቱ፡   (b)  
                                    ​ይደ​ሉ፡ ​ክብ​ር፡ ​ወስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ወኃ​ይል፡ ​ወመ​ንግ​ሥት፡ ​ወሰ​ጊድ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡  ​ወወ ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡
                                    ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ሜን። ​ለይ​ኩን፡ ​ለይ​ኩን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e85726LIT1931Mashaf#Exhortation">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 25vb–34rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Exhortation</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩  ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ተግ​ሣጽ፡ 
                                    ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ምዉ​ታን፡ ​በጊ​ዜ፡ ​ግን​ዘት፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ለ  (fol. 26ra)  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ፈጣ​ሪ፡ ​ወመ​ንሥ​ኢ፡ ​ኃያ​ል፡ ​መሐ​ሪ፡ ​ዘው​እቱ፡ ​ዘው​ስተ፡ ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ሥል​ጣነ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ወሕ​ይወ​ት፡
                                    ​ወት​ፍሥ​ሕት፡ ​ወገ​ሀናም ፨ 
                                    ​ዘይ​ብል፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ተጋ​ብኡ፡ ​አው፡ ​በስ​ምየ፡ ​እሄ​ሉ፡ ​አነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ማእ​ከሎ​ሙ፡ ​ወኵ​ሎ፡ ​ዘሰ​አል​ክም​ዎ፡ ​በስ​ምየ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አሁ፡
                                    ​እገ​ብር፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እም​ድኅ​ሬሁ፡ ​በአ​ስተ​ብቍ​ዖተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታተ፡   (b)   ​እለ፡ ​ምግ​ባራ​ት፡ ​ወሥ​ምረ​ታት፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ብቍ​ዖታ​ተ፡
                                    ​ለዘ​ተወ​ክፈት ፨  ​ወአ​ስተ​ብቍ​ዖቶ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ሰማ​ዕት፡ ​ወቅ​ዱሳ​ን፡ ​ወዘ​አሥ​መሮ፡ ​ወዘ​ያሠ​ምሮ፡ 
                                    ​አሜን ፨  ​ወስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወላ​ዕሌ​ነ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡
                                    ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e85771LIT1931Mashaf#Order">
               <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 34va–38va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Order to be read for the dead after the burial</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>​፩፤  ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ሥር​ዓት፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ምዉ​ታን፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ግን​ዘት፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ስፉ​ሐ፡ ​ሀብ​ት፡ ​ውዱ​ስ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ቲሁ፡ ​ዘአ​ስማ​ቲሁ ፨ 
                                    ​ስን፡ ​ዘአ​ዘዘ፡ ​ወፈ​ትሐ፡ ​ወፈ​ጠረ፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ዳለ​ወ፡
                                     ​ወሥ​ሉሠ፡ ​በህ​ላዌ​ሁ፡ ​ማኅ​የዊ​ት፡ ​ብሑ​ት፡ ​ርእ​ሱ፡ ​ባሕ​ራዊ​ት፡ ​ዘአ​ጸገ​ወ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​አም​ልኮ​ቱ፡ ​ወአ​ገበ​ሮሙ፡   (b)  
                                    ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቱ፡ ​ወረ​ሰዮ​ሙ፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ​መን​ፈሳ​ዊት፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ይፈ​ትዉ፡ ​ለተ​መይ​ጦት​ከ፡ ​ወአ​ኃዊ​ከ፡ ​ወአ​ግብ​ርቲ​ከ፡ ​ይጸ​ንሕ፡ ​በጽ​ሕትከ ፨ 
                                    ​ኮኑ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ሬከ፡ ​እጓ​ለ፡ ​ማው​ታ፡ ​ወረ​ቦሙ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡
                                    ​ወም​ንዳቤ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>  (fol. 38va)   ​ወኀ​ሳር፡ ​አይ​ቴ፡ ​ስን​ከ፡ ​መዓ​ድም፡ ​ወል​ብከ፡ ​ብሩ​ህ፡ ​ወራ​እይ​ከ፡
                                    ​መፍ​ርህ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-5) Fols 38va –39va : <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e85814">Directive for the burial of priests and
                                    others</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወለ​እመ፡ ​ኮነ፡  ​ካህ​ነ፡ ​ትብ​ል፡ ​ወቅ​ዳስ​ያቲ​ከ፡ ​ጥዕ​ምት፡ ​ወዜ​ማከ፡
                                    ​ብር​ህት።  ​ወለ​እመ​ሰ፡  ​ኢኮ​ነ፡ ​ካህ​ነ፡ ​ተዓ​ዱ፡ ​ወት​ብል፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ትካ​ዝ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ዘተ​ዓቢ፡ ​እም​ትካ​ዛት፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወይ​ረስ​ዮ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ድኁ​ናን፡ ​ወያ​ኅድ​ሮ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገነ​ተ፡ ​ትፍ​ሥሕ​ት፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኅሩ​ያኒ​ሁ፡ ​ወጻ​ድቃ​ኒሁ ፨  ​ወያ​ቅሞ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​በየ​ማኑ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳኒ​ሁ፡ ​ወይ​ዕቀ​ብ፡ ​ማኅ​ደራ​ኒነ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ህል​ዋን፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-6) Fols 39va –40rb : <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e85840">Directive for the deacon (Lk 7:11–16)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡  ​ይሰ​ብክ፡ ​ዲያ​ቆን፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ወን​ጌል፡ ዘ ፻ ወ ፵ ወ ፩ ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ትወ​ፅእ፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ፡ ​በላ​ዕሌ​የ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ሉ  (b)  ​ያ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ታአ​ምር፡ ​ፍኖ​ት፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ሖር​ኩ፡ ​ኀብ​ኡ፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​መሥ​ገርተ ፨ 
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወፈ​ርሁ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ዓቢ​ይ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ተን​ሥአ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ወተ​ሠሃ​ሎሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ለሕ​ዝቡ፡ ​በር​ትዕ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-7) Fols 40rb –42vb : <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e85875">Further directives for the burial</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡  ​ያስ​ተበ​ቍዑ፡ ፬ ​ቀሳ​ውስ​ት፡ ወ ፬  ​ጸሎ​ታተ፡ ​በል​ዑል፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ዘማ​ኅበ​ር፡ ​ወዘ​ጳጳ​ስ፡ ​ወዘ​እለ፡ ​ኖሙ፡ ​ወሰ​ላም፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማኅ​በር ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወኵ​ሎ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ፀሮ፡ ​ዘያ​ስተ​ርኢ፡ ​ወዘ​ኢያ​ስተ​ርኢ፡ ​አግ​ርር፡ <fo:inline>ወቀጥቀጥ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ታሕ​ተ፡ ​እገ​ሪሁ፡ ​ፍጡ​ነ፡ ​ወኪ​ያሁ​ሰ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ዕቀ​ቦ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​በስ​ብሐት ፨  ወ ​፩፡  ​ወል​ድከ፡ ​በል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e85908LIT1644Homily">
               <fo:inline>I-8) Fols 43ra–47ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Homily on the Deceased, CAe 1644.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ​፩፤ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ድር​ሳን፡ ​ዘአ ​ባ፡ ​ሰላ​ማ፡ ​ጳጳ​ስ፡
                                    ​ዘኢት ዮ ​ጵያ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ሙታ​ን፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ዘለ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ዝማ​ን፡ ​ዘየ​አም​ር፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ወኢ​ያገ​ምሮ፡ ​መካን ፨ 
                                    ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ምል​ክና፡ ​ወብ​ሑተ፡
                                    ​ህሉ​ና፡ ​ፈጣ​ሬ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወም​ድር፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ጻማ፡   (b)   ​ዘየ​አም​ር፡ ​ኑኃ፡ ​ወግ​ድማ፡ ​እም​ኀበ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​ዘይ​ሰግ​ዱ፡ ​ሎቱ፡
                                    ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ሱራ​ፌል፡ ​ወኪ​ሩቤ​ል፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                     ​ወያ​ስም​ዐነ፡ ​ለኵ​ልነ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ዘም​ሉእ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ዘይ​ብል፡ ​ንዑ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ቡሩ​ካኑ፡ ​ለአ​ቡየ፡ ​ትረ​ሱ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ሰ  (fol. 47ra)  ​ማያ​ት፡
                                    ​ዘድ​ልው፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ይት​ፈጠ​ር፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወን​በል፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​መሐ​ሪነ፡ ​ወይ​በል፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​መሐ​ረነ፡ ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅሬ​ሁ፡ ​ይሁ​ብ፡ ​ካህ​ን፡
                                    ​ቡራኬ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-9) Fols 47ra–48vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e85954">Quotations</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">This section begins with a free quotation from Eccles. 12:6–7 and
                                    follows with other unidentified quotations.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በከ​መ፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን ፡ ​ተቀ​ጥቀ​ጠ፡ ​መሶብ ​ከ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዐዘ​ቅት፡  ​ወተ​ወለ​ጠ፡ ​ኅብ​ሩ፡ ​ለብ​ሩር፡
                                    ​ወተ​ገፍ​ዓ፡ ​ርእ​የቱ፡ ​ለወ​ርቅ፡ ወ  (b)  ​ተጸ​ርዓ፡ ​ማኅ​ሌተ፡ ​አዋ​ልድ፡ ​ወኦ​ደ፡ ​ጹጐ፡ ​እለ፡ ​የሐ​ብሉ ፨ 
                                    ​ወተ​ጸር​ዓ፡ ​እለ፡ ​የሐ​ርፃ፡ ​መሬ​ተ፡ ​ወገ​ብአ፡
                                    ​ወስ​ተ፡ ​መሬ​ት፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​ትፍ​ድዮ​ሙ፡ ​ለኵ​ሉ፡ ​ፍጥ​ረት፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ምግ​ባሮ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ርእ​ዮተ፡ ​መሲ​ሕከ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ከነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ዘቦ​ቱ፡
                                    ​ለከ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሁ፡ ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወእ​ኂዝ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ወ  (b)  ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e85996LIT1931Mashaf#Penance3">
               <fo:inline>I-10) Fols 48vb–52va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Other prayer of penance</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡  ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ንስ​ሐ፡  ​ካል​እ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አኃ​ዜ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ብሑ​ተ፡ ​ሥል​ጣን፡ ​ወስ​ም፡ ​ቀዳ​ማዊ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ጥን​ት፡ ​ወዳ​ኅራ​ዊ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ፍጽ​ም፡
                                    ​ዘት<fo:inline>[ነ]</fo:inline>​ብር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አር​ያም፡ ​መን​በረ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ከ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይተ​ረጐ​ም፡ ​ዘል​ብሰ​ትከ፡ ​አፍ​ሐም፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወአ​ናሕ​ሲ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ዘሞ​ተ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ባሕ​ቲት​ከ፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​እም​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ወን​ጹሕ፡
                                    ​እም​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ወለ​ከ፡ ​ይደ​ሉ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወከ​ብር፡ ​ኦሥ​ሉስ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ደኃ​ሪት፡ ​ወላ​ዕሌ​ነ፡
                                    ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ት፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86030LIT1931Mashaf#Penance2">
               <fo:inline>I-11) Fols 52vb–54rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Prayer of penance</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ንስ​ሐ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                 ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​አኃ​ዜ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘት​ፌው​ስ፡ ​ቍስ​ለ፡ ​ነፍ​ስነ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋነ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስነ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘት​ቤ፡ ​በአ​ፈ፡
                                 ​ወል​ድከ፡ ​ዋሕ​ድ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ለአ​ቡነ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ኰኵ​ሕ፡ ​ወዲ​በ፡  ​ዛቲ፡ 
                                 ​ኵኵ​ሕ፡ ​አሐ​ንጻ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሀበ​ነ፡ ​ንግ​በር፡ ​ሥም​ረት​ከ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወጸ​ሐፍ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ነ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወሰ​ማዕ​ት፡ ​በኢ​የሱ​ስ፡
                                    ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ዘቦ​ቱ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሁ፡ ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወእ​ኂዝ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86061LIT1931Mashaf#Tazkar">
               <fo:inline>I-12) Fols 54va–57va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Tazkar</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ንግ​በር፡ ​ተዝ​ካሮሙ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለሙ​ታን።
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በዕ​ጣን፡ ወ ​በቍ​ርባ​ን፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ይ ​በቍ​ዖሙ፡ ​ወይ​ከው​ን፡ ​ዕረ​ፍተ፡ ​ለነ​ፍሳ​ቲሆሙ ፨ 
                                    ​በከ​መ፡ ​ትቤ​ሎ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለብ​ፁዕ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ተስ​እለቶ ፨ 
                                    ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብ​ላ፡ ​መሥ​ዋዕ​ተ፡ ​ወቍ​ርባ​ን፡ ​ዘይ​ትገ​በር፡
                                    ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ምን​ተ፡ ​ይበ​ቍዖ​ሙ፡ ​ለሙ​ታን፡ ​ወአ​ውሥ​አት፡ ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​እም​ጼና፡ ​ገነት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሐየ​ውነ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ማቱ​ሳላ፡ ​ዘሐ​ይወ፡ ዘ ፻ ወ ፰ ፡ ​ዓመ​ት፡ ​አው፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኖኃ፡ ​ዘሐ​የወ፡  ​፺፡ ​፻፡ ​፶፡  ​ዓመ​ት፡ ​አል​ብነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ናመ​ስጥ፡
                                     ​እም​ኔሁ፡ ​ወን​ስአ​ሎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ያድ​ኅብ፡ ​እም​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ዘሎ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት ፨ 
                                    ​ወዕ​በይ፡ ​ወአ​ኰቴ​ት፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡   (fol. 57va)  
                                    ​ኄር፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86123LIT1931Mashaf#FirstBlessing">
               <fo:inline>I-13) Fols 57va–59rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: First Blessing of ʾabbā Sāmuʾel</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡  ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                    ​ቡራ​ኬ፡ ​ዘአ​ቡነ፡ ​አባ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል፡ ​ዘአ​ዕረ​ፈ፡ ​ይም​ሐሮ፡
                                    ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ይሠ​ሃሎ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በብ​ሩህ፡ ​ገጽ፡ ​ይት​ቀበ​ሎ፡ ​በቃ​ለ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ወኀ​ሤት፡ ​ያሰ​ምዖ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በጸ​ሎታ፡ ለ  (b)  ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ይም​ሐሮ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ማኅ​ፀን​ትየ ፨ 
                                    ​ወም​ዕቅ​ብና​የ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ነዳ​ይ፡ ​ዘዓ​ቀበ​ኒ፡ <fo:inline>ዘንዘ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                                    ​ብሂ​ል፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በጸ​ሎቶ​ሙ፡ ለ ፬  ​ወን​ጌላ​ውያ​ን፡ ​ማኅ​በረ፡ ​በኵ​ር፡ ​ፍሡ​ሐን፡ ​ይም​ሐሮ፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                    ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ጽዮ​ን፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡
                                    ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይት​ፌሥ​ሁ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ያብ​ኦ፡   (b)   ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​በብ​ዝኀ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86178LIT1931Mashaf#Matthew">
               <fo:inline>I-14) Fols 59rb–61va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Prayer of Matthew the Apostle over deceased men and women (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ማቴ​ዎስ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ኀም​ስ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡  ​ሐዋ​ርያ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​እባ​ርከ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​የ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይበ​ሊ፡ ​ማኅ​ደሩ፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​መል​ዕል፡ ​እሴ​ብሕ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኢ​የኀ​ብእ፡ ​ርእ​ሰ፡ ​ዳእ​ሙ፡ ​አግ​ብአ፡
                                       ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኃጣ​ውኢ​ነ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያው​ፅአ​ነ፡ ​እም​ስሐ​ተት።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ምብ​ድብ​ድ፡ ​ዘኢ​ይት​ከሀ​ል፡ ​ለግ​ንዘ​ት፡ ​ወታ​ተሉ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌነ ፨  ​ሞት፡ ​ወመ​ቅሠ​ፍት፡ 
                                        ​ዘያ​ስተ​ፋጥ​ን፡ ​ለለ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ወቍ​ርባ​ን፡ ​በር​ትዕ​ት፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖት ፨ 
                                        ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ደኃ​ሪት፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወሰ​ጊድ፡ ​ስሉ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                          (fol. 61va)   ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86219LIT4346Prayer">
               <fo:inline>I-15) Fols 61va–62vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer for those who fell asleep’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ኖሙ፡), CAe 4346.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡  ​ኖሙ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>ወከዕበ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ናስተ ፡ ​በቍ​ዕ፡ ​ዘኵ​ሎ፡ ​ይእ​ኅዝ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አብ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨ 
                                            ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​ሕያዋ ያ ​ን፡ ​ሕይ​ወተ፡ ​ሙታ​ን፡ ​ተስ​ፋ፡ ​ቅቡ​ጻን፡ ​ረዳ​ኤ፡ ​ምን​ዱባ​ን፡ ​ወመ​ንጽ​ኤ፡ ​ኃጥ​አን፡ ​ዘሞ​ተ፡ ​አፅ​ራእ​ከ፡
                                            ​ወማ​እሰ​ረ፡ ​ሰይ​ጣን፡ ​በቲ​ከከ፡ ​ሕይ​ወተ፡ ​ለት​ዝም​ደ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ንጹ​ሕ፡ ​እም​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​በቅ​ድሜ​ከ፡ ​ወለ​እመ​ኒ፡ <fo:inline>አሐተ፡ ሰዓት፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ሐይ​ወ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ማኅ​ለፍ​ታተ፡
                                              (b)   ​ነፍ​ሶሙ፡ ​ግዑ​ዘ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ከል​አት፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ጸጉ ፨ 
                                            ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ናዛ​ዜ፡ ​ወመ​ናህ​የ፡ ​ለሰ​ብኦ​ሙ፡ ​ፈኑ፡ ​ናዝ​ዞሙ፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ፍሥ​ሖሙ፡
                                            ​በክ​ርስ​ቶስ ፨ 
                                            በ ​፩፡  ​ወል​ድከ፡ ​ዘቦ​ቱ፡ ​ለከ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-16) Fols 62vb–63rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e86273">Untitled prayer</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​መና​ፍስ​ት፡  ​ወለ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘሥ​ጋ፡ ​ዘኬ​ድኮ፡ ​ለሞ​ት፡ ​ወረ​ገም​ኮ፡ ​ለዲ​ያብ​ሎስ፡ ​ወወ​ሀብ​ከነ፡ ​ሕይ​ወተ፡ ​ዘለ​ዓለም ፨ 
                                            ​አዕ​ርፍ፡ ​ነፍ​ሶሙ፡ ​በመ​ካን፡ ​ዘአ​ልቦ፡ ​ጻማ፡ ​ወአል  (fol. 63ra)  ​ቦ፡ ​ኀዘ​ን፡ ​ለእ​መ፡ ​አበሳ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ዘሐ​ይወ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ባሕ​ቲት​ከ፡ ​ዘአ​ልቦ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ወጻ​ድቅ፡ ​ስም​ዕከ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወሥ​ርዓ​ትከ፡ ​እሙ​ን፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ወተ​አር​ፎሙ፡ ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ኖሙ፡ ​አግ​ብር​ቲከ፡ ​በክ​ርስ​ቶስ፡ ​አም  (b)  ​ላክ​ነ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ናቄ​ርብ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡
                                    ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86314LIT1931Mashaf#Blessings">
               <fo:inline>I-17) Fols 63rb–68rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Eight Blessings of ʾabbā Sāmuʾel</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The individual blessings are unmarked. The first blessing 
                                    corresponds to the same text on fols 57va–59rb with some minor textual variants.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86328LIT1931Mashaf#FirstBlessing">
               <fo:inline>I-17-1) Fols 63rb–65ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: First Blessing of ʾabbā Sāmuʾel</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ቡራ​ኬ፡ ​ዘአ​ቡነ፡ ​አባ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል። ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ወ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ​፩፡  ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ለዘ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​ይም​ሐሮ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በብ​ሩህ፡ ​ገጽ፡ ​ይት​ቀበ​ሎ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜን ፨  ​ቃለ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ያሰ​ምዖ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ  (fol. 63va)  ​ር፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​በጸ​ሎታ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ይም​ሐሮ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ማኅ​ፀን​ትየ፡ ​ወም​ዕቅ​ብና​የ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ነዳ​ይ፡ ​ዘአ​ዕቀ​በኒ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ብሂ​ል፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ጽዮ​ን፡ ​ወበ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡
                                        ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይት​ፌሥ​ሑ፡ ​ወይ​ትኃ​ሠዩ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ያብ​ኦ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​በብ​ዝኃ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለም ፨  ​አሜ​ን፡
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86381LIT1931Mashaf#SecondBlessing">
               <fo:inline>I-17-2) Fols 65ra–66rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Second Blessing of ʾabbā Sāmuʾel</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ቡራ​ኬ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ማ  (b)  ​ኅበ​ረ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ጽዉ​ያን፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>ወለከሙኒ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ኦአ​በው​የ፡ ​ወአ​ኃው​የ፡ ​ያክ​ህል​ክሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ለገ​ቢረ፡ ​ፈቃ​ዱ፡
                                        <fo:inline>ወሥመረቱ (!)</fo:inline> 
                                        ​ወያ​ኅድ​ር፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌክ​ሙ።  አ ​ሜን ፡ ​ወይ ኅ ​ጽር​ክሙ፡ ​በኃ​ጹረ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​ሰው​ርክ​ሙ፡
                                        ​በጽ​ላሎ​ተ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሁ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​አ፡ ​ወይ​እቲ፡ ​ትዕ  (b)  ​ቀብ​ክሙ፡ ​ወይ ት ​ስአ​ል፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አክሙ ፨ 
                                        አ ፨  ​ከመ፡
                                        ​ይዕ​ቀብ​ክሙ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​እም​ኵሉ፡ ​መከ​ራት፡ ​ዘአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​መስ​ኅታን ፨ 
                                        ​አ፡ ​ወበ​ሰማ​ያት​ኒ፡ ​እም​በላ​ዒ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ታድ​ኅን​ኮሙ፡ ​ስኢ​ላ፡ ​ኀበ፡
                                        ​ወልዳ ፨  ​መሐ​ሪ።
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86447LIT1931Mashaf#ThirdBlessing">
               <fo:inline>I-17-3) Fols 66rb–67va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Third Blessing of ʾabbā Sāmuʾel</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                       ​ኦአ​በው​የ፡ ​ወአ​ኃው​የ፡ ​ወደ​ቂቅ​የ፡ ​ቡሩ​ካን፡ ​ወጽ​ዉዓ​ን፡ ​ዘጸ​ውዓ​ክሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውስ​ተዝ፡ ​ብሔ​ረ፡ ​በድ​ቅ፡ ​ወያ​ክህ​ልክ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚብ​ሔር፡
                                       ​ለገ​ቢረ፡ ​ፈቃ​ዱ፡ ​ወለ​ሥም​ረተ፡ ​ዚአሁ ፨ 
                                        ​አ፡ ​ወያ​ኅድ​ር፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡   (fol. 66va)   ​ላዕ​ሌክ​ሙ፡ ​አ፡ ​ወይ​ቀድ​ስክ​ሙ፡ ​እን​ተ፡
                                        ​ውስ​ጥ፡ ​ወአ​ፍአ​ክሙ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        አ ፤  ​ኩኑ፡ ​ምሉ​አነ፡ ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​ንቱ​ሃነ፡ ​ኩኑ፡ ​ምሉ​አነ፡ ​ወአ​ኮ፡ 
                                        <fo:inline>ኅፀበነ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወኩ​ኑ፡ ​የዋ​ሃነ፡ ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​ነኪ​ራነ፡ ​ኩኑ፡ ​ኄራ​ነ፡ ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​መስ​ተቀ​ይማ​ነ፡
                                        ​ኩኑ፡ ​ፍሡ​ሐነ፡ ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​ጸዋ​ጋነ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሰ​ላመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ወት​ረ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኵል​ክሙ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለም ፨  አ ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86488LIT1931Mashaf#FourthBlessing">
               <fo:inline>I-17-4) Fols 67va–68rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Fourth Blessing of ʾabbā Sāmuʾel</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ቡራ​ኬ፡ ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ተል​እኩ፡ ​ወአ​ልዐሉ ፨  ​ወለ​ክሙ​ኒ፡ ​ያል​ዕክ​ሙ፡ 
                                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨  ​በከ​መ፡ ​ቃሉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                        ​ዘኢ  (b)  ​ይሔ​ሱ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤ፡ ​በወ​ንጌ​ል፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወለ​ዛቲ​ኒ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ያጽ​ንዓ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ዳግ​ም፡ ​ምጽ​አቱ ፨ 
                                    ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ገበ​ር፡ ​በው​ስቴ​ታ፡ ​ሕግ፡ ​ወሥ​ርዓት ፨ 
                                    ​አሜ​ን፡ ​በከ​መ፡   (b)   ​መፍ​ትው፡ ​አሜን ፨  ​ወለ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ት፡ ​ያው​ርድ፡
                                    ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ስረ​ዩ፡ ​ወባ​ርኩ​ኒ፡ ​ለጸ​ሐፊ​ሃ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​አቡ​ነ፡ ​ዘበ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ወሰ​ላመ፡ ​ገር​በኤል ፨ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                                    ​ዘወ​ሀብ​ኩ፡ ​ለመ​ቅድ​ሰ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ወቀ​ይሰ፡ ​ገበ​ዝሂ፡ ​ዘተ​ግሃ፡ ​ለአ​ጽሕ​ፎታ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>።
                                    ​ተሰ​ፊዎ​ሙ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨  ​ኢት​ርስ​ዑነ፡ ​አቡ​ነ፡ ​ዘበ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-18) Fols 68va–70vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e86557">Fǝtḥat za-wald</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The incipit corresponds to the seventh prayer of penance
                                    contained in MS Vatican, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth. 115
                                    .</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ፍት​ሐት፡ ​ዘወ​ልድ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​ዋሕ​ድ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አብ፡ ​ዘበ​ተከ፡ ​እም​ኔነ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ማእ​ሰረ፡ ​ኃጣ​ውኢነ ፨ 
                                    ​በሕ​ማማ​ቲከ፡
                                    ​ማሕ​የዊ​ት፡ ​ወመድ<fo:inline>[ኀ]</fo:inline>​ኒት፡ ​ዘነ​ፋከ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ገጸ፡ ​አር​ዳኢ​ከ፡ ​ንጹ​ሐን፡ ​ወላ​እካ​ኒከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጽኑ​ዕ፡ ​ወቅ​ዱስ፡ ​አባ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ወ ፵ ወ ፱ ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕታ​ት፡ ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ለባ​ስያ​ነ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​ወኄ​ራን፡ ​ወመ​አል​ከ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                    ​ወቡ​ርክ​ት፡ ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ወጸ​ጋ፡ ​ረድ​ኤቶ​ሙ፡ ​ወፍ​ቅረ፡ ​አም​ላኮ​ሙ፡ ​ወገ​ድለ፡ ​ጻማ​ሆሙ፡ ​ወት​ንብ​ልና፡ ​ሣህ​ሎሙ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሮሙ፡
                                    <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>  ​ዘወ​ልደ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86610LIT1931Mashaf#PrayerBlessing">
               <fo:inline>I-19) Fols 70vb–71vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of the Funeral Ritual: Prayer of blessing 'O holy Trinity, Father, Son and Holy Spirit, one God, bless your people'</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ቡራ​ኬ።
                                </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ኦሥ​ሉስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ። ​አብ​ርክ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ፡ ​ፍቁ​ራን፡ ​ክር​ስቶሳ  (fol. 71ra)  ​ዊያ​ን፡ ​በበ​ረከ​ት፡
                                    ​መን​ፈሳ​ዊት፡ ​ወፈ​ኑ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌነ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ። ​ወረ​ሲ፡ ​ኃዋ​ኅወ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ርኅ​ወ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​በአ​ሚን፡ ​ወበ​ምሕ​ረት።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወለ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እለ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ዙነ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ንዘ​ክሮ​ሙ፡ ​በም​ሕረ​ትከ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ምን​ግሥ​ትከ፡ ​ሰማ​ያዊ​ት፡
                                    ​ወሊ​ተኒ፡ ለ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እ፡ ​ገብ​ርከ፡ ​ተዘ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ኦእ​ግዚ​ኦ፡ ​አድኅ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ዝበ​ከ፡
                                    ​ወባ​ረክ፡ ር<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ከ፡ ​ረአ​ዮሙ፡ ወ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ሎሙ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e86649LIT1940Mashaf">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 72ra–91vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Book of Christening’ (​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ክር​ስት​ና፡), CAe 1940.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡  ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ጥ ​ምቀ​ት።
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡  ​ንብ​ረተ፡ ​እድ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​እሙ፡ ​ለሕ​ፃን ፨ 
                                ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ፡ ​ነጽ​ሐት፡ በ ፵ ፡
                                ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ተባ​ዕት፡ ​ወበ ፹ ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​አን​ስት፡
                                ​ትበ​ውእ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወያ​ንብ​ቡ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ወጸ​ሎተ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅሬ​ሁ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ጸሎተ ፨ 
                                ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላክ​ነ፡ ​አኃ​ዜ፡
                                ​ኵሉ፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​አለ​ብዎ​ሙ፡ ፈ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ሆተ​ከ፡ ​አብ​ጽሖ​ሙ፡ ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​አካ​ል፡ ​ጸግ​ዎሙ፡ ​አእ​ምሮ፡ ​አም​ላካ​ዊ፡ ​ዕቀ​ቦሙ፡ ​በሃ​ይማ​ኖት፡
                                ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ነውር ፨  ​በት​ንብ​ልና​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እተ፡ ​ኵል​ነ፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ወን​ጽሕ​ት፡ 
                                 ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወቃ​ለ፡ ​አዋ​ዲ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡
                                ​መጥ​ምቅ፡ ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ጉባ​ኤ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ሜን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ዘይ​ደሉ፡ ​ለአ​ንብ​ቦቱ፡ ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ይጠ​መቁ፡ ​በረ​ድኤ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዘሎ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Many erasures (e.g. on fols 10rb, 37va, 64va). The last three lines of 15vb,  have been erased; several
                                        lines have been erased discontinuously on 68rb
                                        Erasures are often marked with thin lines in red ink (e.g. on 12rb, 16va, 70ra), more rarely in black ink (88va, 90va).
                                        Corrections over erasure are rare (e.g. on 52ra, 85rb), so are those placed interlineally (e.g. on 35rb, 86vb).
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Cues for the rubricator have been added in the main hand in black ink or pale black ink on the upper margin of several folios:
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡</fo:inline> (fols 73vb, 74r), <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ</fo:inline> (fol. 83vb),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወእ</fo:inline> (e.g. fols 75r, 77ra, 79ra), <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወይ​ጼሊ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 84vb), <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወይ​ነሥ​እ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 88rb),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወይ​ብል፡</fo:inline> (fol. 89va), <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 91ra).
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>A white sticker is glued to the inner side of the front board. The name of <fo:inline id="d1e87295PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> is printed on it
                                        (‘<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡ ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>’) and the signature ‘MS. Aeth. f. 33’ is written in pencil.
                                        An additional sticker, with the signature ‘Ms 43’ printed on it, is glued below it.
                                        Above the stickers is written the shelfmark ‘MS. Aeth. J.J. 43’ in pencil.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                  The book is bound in wooden boards.
                                
                                  The boards are flush with the bookblock and have shallow external bevels. The grain runs vertically.
                                  The external surface and the edges of the boards are polished and a finishing layer of dark colour has been added.
                                  The upper board is fractured vertically in two halves, which are held together by a thread passing in two of the three pairs of holes
                                  that have been drilled on both sides of the fracture.
                                
                                  Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern; Z-plied thread.
                                  In the first quire, between the sewing stations, there are two lengths of thread.
                                  The sewing is closed by knotting the ends of the threads to the chains that the sewing forms on the spine.
                                  The bookblock has been resewn, as is evident by the presence of unused sewing holes close to the ones used by the current sewing.
                                
                                  The small holes close to the head of the quires are probably what remains of quire tackets.
                                
                                  Threads of various colours are inserted in the outer margins for navigating the text.
                                  More specifically, a blue <fo:inline id="d1e87331">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted in the upper ruling prick on fol. 12, a
                                  red <fo:inline id="d1e87336">leaf tab marker</fo:inline> is inserted in a ruling prick in the outer margin of fols 48, , in the upper margin of fol. 54, and in
                                  the upper ruling prick of fol. 63.
                                </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner carried out by the Bodleian Library in January 2020 (1–92).
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>14 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (Fols 1r–1v)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 2r–9v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 10r–17v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 18r–25v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 26r–33v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 34r–43v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 44r–51v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 52r–59v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (Fols 60r–65v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">1+4 (Fols 66r–70v)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (Fols 71r–71v)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+4 (Fols 72r–81v)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols 82r–91v)</fo:inline> – B<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (Fols 92r–92v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 2ra–65v: 2
                                    columns (15–17 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 18r. The characters per line are 7–10.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            160 × 154 mm (fol. 18r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            96 × 115 mm (fol. 18r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 23 mm, bottom: 41 mm, right: 29 mm, left: 11 mm, intercolumn: 11 mm (fol. 18r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 66r–91vb: 2
                                    columns (18–19 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 84r. The characters per line are 9–11.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            160 × 154 mm (fol. 18r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            103 × 120 mm (fol. 84r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 20 mm, bottom: 34 mm, right: 19 mm, left: 11 mm, intercolumn: 8 mm (fol. 84r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling and pricking are visible. Both primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling.
                                     Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.  Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Fols 2ra–65v. Mid-eighteenth–mid-nineteenth century.. 
                                 Decent and mostly uniform handwriting; characters are broadly spaced; sometimes the lower part of the characters is written below the ruled line.
                                 The scribe wrote the last line of fol. 63va under the last ruled line.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    Two lines on the incipit pages, alternating with black lines; first lines and incipit formulas of the individual sections (sometimes alternating with a black line);
                                    the titles of the biblical passages and of the prayers; liturgical exhortations (e.g. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ንስ​እለ​ከ፡</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸል​ዩ፡</fo:inline>)
                                    and directives (e.g. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይበ​ል፡ ​ዲያ​ቆን</fo:inline>); the name of <fo:inline id="d1e87070PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:inline> and of the Archangels; the word <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እገ​ሌ፡</fo:inline>;
                                    numerals in full or in part; elements of the punctuation signs and of the text dividers.
                                    The rubrication has not been executed on the last lines of fol. 34rb.
                                 </fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">አ</fo:inline> for
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አሜ​ን፡</fo:inline> (fols 65rb–67va).
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 2:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Fols 66r–91vb. Mid-eighteenth–mid-nineteenth century.. 
                                    Mediocre handwriting; characters are relatively thick, perhaps due to a change of nib.
                                    The grapheme ጵ has the pre-modern shape, with the vowel marker of the sixth order placed on the top of the letter, towards the left
                                    (e.g. on fols 80va).
                                    The last ruled line has not been written on fol. 86ra.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    First lines and incipit formulas of the individual sections, sometimes alternating with a black line;
                                    the titles of the single prayers; liturgical directives in full or in abbreviation (e.g. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይካ</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይዲ</fo:inline>);
                                    the name of <fo:inline id="d1e87138PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:inline>; elements of the punctuation signs, text dividers, and numerals.
                                </fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይካ</fo:inline> or ካ for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይበ​ል፡ ​ካህ​ን፡</fo:inline> (e.g. fols 73rb, 75rb, 83rb);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይዲ</fo:inline> or ዲ for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይበ​ል፡ ​ዲያ​ቆን፡</fo:inline> (e.g. fols 73rb, 73vb, 87rb);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ጸ</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸል​ዩ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. fol. 73vb);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ሕ</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይበ​ል፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. fol. 86ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>5)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ቅ</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. fol. 86ra).
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
                                  Threads of various colours are inserted in the outer margins for navigating the text.
                                  More specifically, a blue <fo:inline id="d1e87331">leaf string marker</fo:inline> is inserted in the upper ruling prick on fol. 12, a
                                  red <fo:inline id="d1e87336">leaf tab marker</fo:inline> is inserted in a ruling prick in the outer margin of fols 48, , in the upper margin of fol. 54, and in
                                  the upper ruling prick of fol. 63.
                                <fo:block>Holes resulting from parchment making process are found on fols 1, 25.
                                       A tear on 1 has been repaired at the moment of parchment production by sewing.
                                    2 is cut in half.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is deficient.
                                    The manuscript has been resewn and an additional pair of holes have been made close to the original sewing stations (e.g.
                                    fols 63v–64r); nevertheless, the new sewing is broken at the third and fourth sewing stations, between the
                                    third and the fifth quires. Many bifolios are torn along the fold and some are completely separated. Most of the disjoint
                                    bifolios have been stitched together, even if out of their original place.
                                    The structure of the second quire is reconstructed and cannot anymore be observed in the manuscript,
                                    as many folios have become loose and
                                    been placed out of their original place. In particular, fols 2–4 are single folios which have been detached and were partly sewn
                                    together at a later point; fol. 5 and fol. 10 are loose single folios.
                                    The original sequence was the following:
                                    2, , 4, , 6, , 7, , 8, ,
                                    9, , 5, , 3.
                                    92 is hastily attached to the board. 15 is cut diagonally along the upper outer margin.
                                    The text is occasionally barely legible, e.g. on 2vb, 59vb, 73rb.
                                    Traces of intensive use: the parchment is darker in the lower margin and in correspondence of the lower outer corners of
                                    several folios (fols 6r–9r). Stains of unknown origin and wax stains are visible on many folios, e.g. on
                                    fols 2r, 59r, 62vb.
                                    The front board is fractured vertically in two halves kept together by means of a thread
                                    passing through two pairs of holes made along the inner edges of the two pieces. A third pair of holes close to the upper
                                    margin of the wooden pieces has not been used. The board also shows signs of damage by insects. The back board displays
                                    fractures and a large hole close to the upper margin.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>mid-eighteenth–mid-nineteenth century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            mid-eighteenth and the mid-nineteenth century.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>Its provenance is unknown. Part of the end note on fol. 68rb, containing information on the scribe, the patron, and the owning
                            institution of the book, has been carefully erased. The manuscript was purchased by <fo:inline id="d1e87362PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline>
                            at auction on 24 June
                                1974, according to the Sotheby’s sale receipt (‘Sotheby’s
                            Western Manuscripts’, lot 146), through the bookseller <fo:inline id="d1e87366PRS13559Thomas">Alan G. Thomas</fo:inline>.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                      bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e87371PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf33">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethf33</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
