               <fo:inline>I-2-29) Fols 30rb–30vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Mask29</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92897LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29BirthChrist">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-1) Fol. 30rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Monthly commemoration of the birth of Christ</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92905LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29SalBirthChrist">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-2) Fol. 30rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the birth of Christ</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92913LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29TranslatioJohn">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-3) Fol. 30rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Translatio of John.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92922LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29SalJohn">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-4) Fol. 30rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to John the Baptist</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92930LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29Arsima">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-5) Fols 30rc–30vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾArsimā and ʾAgātā.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92938LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask29SalArsima">
               <fo:inline>I-2-29-6) Fol. 30vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾArsimā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92947LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30) Fols 30vc–31vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Mask30</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92953LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30Athanasius">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-1) Fols 30vc–31rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the miracle of the salvation of Athanasius.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92961LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30SalAthanasius">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-2) Fol. 31rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Athanasius.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92969LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30Gorgoryos">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-3) Fol. 31rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Gorgoryos.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92978LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30John">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-4) Fol. 31rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of John and James.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92986LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30SalJohn">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-5) Fol. 31va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to John and James.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e92994LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30Salusi">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-6) Fols 31va–31vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Śālusi.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​አባ፡  ​ሳሉሲ ፨  ​ወዝ​ንቱ፡
                                            ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​መስ​ተጋ​ድል፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ረሰ​የ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​አብ​ደ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ጾሙ፡ ​ወጸ​ሎቱ፡
                                            ​በኅ​ቡእ፡ ​ወበ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ኢይ​ጼሊ፡ ​ወኢ​ይጸ​ውም ፨  ​ወለ​ለ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ጽባ​ሕ፡
                                            ​ይገ​ብር፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ሲሲ​ተ፡ ​ንስ​ቲተ፡ ​ሣዕ​ረ፡ ​ገዳም ፨  ​ወበ​ጊዜ፡ ​ሰር​ክኒ፡ ​ይበ​ልዕ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አኃው ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዓ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ፈቀ​ደ፡ ​ይን​ሥአ፡
                                            ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ቆብ​ዕ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እም​ኔሃ፡ ​ወለ​ለ፡ ​ይወ​ስድ​ዋ፡ ​ትት​መየ​ጥ፡
                                            ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ደብ​ር፡ ​ወከ​መዝ፡ ​ኮነ፡  ፫ ​ጊዜ ፨  ​ዝኩ​ኒ፡ ​መነ​ኮስ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡
                                            ​ብዙ​ኅ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳም ፨ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይም​ሐሮ፡ ​በጸ​ሎቱ፡ ​ለፍ​ቁሩ፡  {​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወልድ ፡​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወልድ}   ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                                  ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93057LIT4035SenkessarDL#Mask30SalSalusi">
               <fo:inline>I-2-30-7) Fol. 31vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾabbā Śālusi.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለአ​ባ፡ ​ሳሉ​ሲ፡ ​ጥበ​ቦ፡ ​ዘሠ​ወረ ፨ 
                                            ​መሲ​ሖ፡ ​በነ​ግህ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይጸ​ውም፡ ​ድራረ ፤ 
                                            ​አኅ​ድጎ​ተዝ፡ ​ልማ​ዱ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​አበ፡ ​ምኔ​ት፡ ​መከረ ፨ 
                                            ​ዘቢ​ጦ፡ ​በቆ​ብዑ፡ ​አረ​ፍተ፡  ​መቅደ ​ስ፡ ​ስቁረ ፨ 
                                            ​ወእ​ንተ፡ ​ውስ​ቴታ፡ ​ወፂ​ኦ፡ ​እም​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ሖረ ፨
                                            ​መም​ህር​ነ፡ ፨
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e93094PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን ፨ ​ግል</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93113LIT4035SenkessarDL#MaskSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-2-31) Fol. 31vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Maskaram.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ምን​ባብ፡ ​ዘወ​ርኃ፡ ​መስ​ከረ​ም፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡  ​ወላ​ዕሌ​ነ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                            ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                            ​ወአ​ሜን ፨  ​ለይ​ኩን ፨ 
                                            ​ለይ​ኩን ፨
                                            {​መም​ህር​ነ፡} <fo:inline id="d1e93146PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡
                                                    ​ድን​ግል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93157LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqemt">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 32ra–59ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Teqemt</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93163LIT4035SenkessarDL#TeqeIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-3-1) Fol. 32ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: TeqeIntroduction</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡ ​አም​ላክ። ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ጥቅ​ምት። 
                                        ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​መዓ​ልቱ፡  ​፲፡  ወ ​፩፡  ​ሰዓቱ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​የሐ​ፅፅ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93194LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2) Fols 32ra–32rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Teqe1</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93200LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1Anestasya">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-1) Fols 32ra–32rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAnǝsṭāsyā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​አመ፡  ​፩፡  ​ለጥ​ቅም​ት፡ ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ኮነ​ት፡
                                            ​አን​ስጣ​ስያ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ወሰ​ማዕት ፨  ​ዛቲ፡ ​መስ​ትጋ​ድል​ት፡ ​ኮነ​ት፡
                                            ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ሮሜ፡ ​ወኮ​ኑ፡ ​አበ​ዊሃ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያነ ፨  ​ወሐ​ፀን​ዋ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ክብ​ር፡
                                            ​ወበ​ሠና​ይ፡ ​ሥር​ዓት፡ ​ወበ​ትም​ህር​ት፡ ​በቋ​ዒት፡
                                            ​ለነ​ፍስ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋ፡ ​ወበ​ትም​ህር​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ኢተ​መይ​ጠት፡ ​እም​ሃይ​ማኖ​ታ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሀለ​ወት፡
                                            ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​ዓቢ​ይ፡ ​እምድ  (c)  ​ኅረ​ዝ፡ ​አዘ​ዘ፡ ​መኰ​ንን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይም​ትሩ፡ ​ርእ​ሳ፡ ​በሰ​ይፍ፡
                                                ​ወአ​ንከ​ሩ፡ ​እለ፡ ነ ​በሩ፡ ​ህየ፡ ​እም​ጽን​ዓ፡ ​ነፍሳ ፨  ​ወጸ​ለየ​ት፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ነዋ​ኃ፡
                                            ​ወአ​ድነ​ነት፡ ​ርእ​ሳ፡ ​ለሰ​ይፍ፡ ​ወመ​ተራ፡ ​ርእ​ሳ፡ ​በሰ​ይፍ፡ ​ለቅ​ድስ​ት፡ ​አን​ስጣ​ስያ፡
                                            ​ወነ​ሥአ​ት፡ ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከታ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ራ፡
                                                <fo:inline id="d1e93237PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን​ግል።</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93250LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1SalAnestasya">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-2) Fol. 32rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAnǝsṭāsyā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93258LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1Heriton">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-3) Fol. 32rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Ḫǝriṭon</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93267LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe1SalMartha">
               <fo:inline>I-3-2-4) Fol. 32rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Martha</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93276LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3) Fols 32rc–32vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        2nd Ṭǝqǝmt
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93282LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2Sawiros">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3-1) Fols 32rc–32vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Sāwiros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93290LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2SalSawiros">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3-2) Fol. 32vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Sāwiros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93298LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe2Tekla">
               <fo:inline>I-3-3-3) Fol. 32vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Tekalā and Hǝryāqos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93308LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe3">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4) Fols 32vc–33rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        3rd Ṭǝqǝmt
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e93314LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe3Semon">
               <fo:inline>I-3-4-1) Fols 32vc–33rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Simeon
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
