                      id="d1e94916LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe30">
               <fo:inline>I-3-31) Fols 58va–59ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        30th Ṭǝqǝmt
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e94922LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe30Abreham">
               <fo:inline>I-3-31-1) Fols 58va–58vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAbrǝhām bāḥtāwi</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e94930LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe30SalAbreham">
               <fo:inline>I-3-31-2) Fol. 58vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAbrǝhām</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ነዳይ ፨  ​እም​ጥሪ​ት፡ ​ማሳ​ኒ፡ ​ወእ​ምኃ​ላፊ፡
                                            ​ንዋይ ፨  ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይሴ​ፎ፡ ​ረኪ​በ፡
                                            ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማይ ፨  ​ይከ​ድን፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡
                                            ​በጸ​ርቅ፡ ​ብሉይ ፨  ​ወሕ​ፍነ፡ ​ዓተ​ር፡
                                            ​ይሴ​ሰይ፡ ​ርሑ​ሰ፡ ​በማይ ፨ 
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e94959PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን​ግል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e94969LIT4035SenkessarDL#Teqe30Falibuna">
               <fo:inline>I-3-31-3) Fols 58vc–59ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Fālibunā and other saints</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The end of the commemoration has been added by a secondary hand.The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ተዝ​ካሮ​ሙ፡  ​ለፊ​ሊቡ​ና፡ ​ወከ​ይና ፨ 
                                            ​ወአ​ስተ​ርእ​ዮተ፡ ​ርእ​ሱ፡
                                            ​ለዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​መጥም ​ቅ፡ ​ወመ​ርቴ​ስ፡ ​ወማ​ርሳ።
                                            ​እግ<fo:inline>[ዚ]</fo:inline> (fol. 59ra)  ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ይም​ሐሮ፡ ​በጸ​ሎቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለፍ​ቁሮ​ሙ፡
                                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን። ። ። 
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95006LIT4035SenkessarDL#TeqeSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-3-32) Fol. 59ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Ṭǝqǝmt
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The subscription has been added by a secondary hand in the upper margin.The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ጥቅ​ምት፡ <fo:inline>በረደተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ሥም​ረቱ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ <fo:inline>ወባረከት፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                                            ​ወአ​ኰቴ​ት፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95031LIT4035SenkessarDL#Hedar">
               <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 59ra–89rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Hedar</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95037LIT4035SenkessarDL#HedaIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-4-1) Fol. 59ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: HedaIntroduction</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡ ​አም​ላክ ።  ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ኅዳር ።  ቡ ​ሩክ፡ ​መዓ​ልቱ፡
                                         ​፲፡  ​ሰዓቱ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​የሐ​ፅፅ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95066LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda1">
               <fo:inline>I-4-2) Fols 59ra–59rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Ḫǝdar
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95072LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda1Maksimos">
               <fo:inline>I-4-2-1) Fols 59ra–59rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Maksimos, Numanfyos, Fiqṭor and Filǝṗṗos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​አመ፡  ​፩፡  ​ለኅ​ዳር ፨  ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ኮኑ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​መስተ<fo:inline>፡  (!)</fo:inline>​ጋድ​ላን፡
                                            ​ሰማ​ዕታት ፤  ​መክ​ሲሞ​ስ፡ ​ወመ​ንፍ​ዮስ ፨  ​ወፊ​ቅጦ​ርዮ​ስ፡ ​ወፊ​ልጶስ ፤  ​እሉ፡ ​መስተ<fo:inline>፡  (!)</fo:inline>​ጋድ​ላን፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡
                                            ​ኮኑ፡ ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​አፍ​ራቂያ ፨  ​ወእ​ሙን​ቱሰ፡
                                            ​አኃ​ው፡ ​በመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨  ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​ወተ​ጋብ​ኡ፡ ​ኅቡ​ረ፡
                                            ​በበ​ይና​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ፍቅ​ረ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                             ​ወገ​ብሩ፡ ​ቦሙ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዘ፡ ​ወብ​ዙኃ​ን፡ ​እለ፡
                                            ​ነበ​ሩ፡ ​ህየ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​ትዕ​ግሥ​ቶሙ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱሳ​ን፡ ​ሰማ​ዕታት ፨  ​ወአ​ምኑ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት ፨  ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​አዘ​ዘ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡
                                            ​ከመ፡ ​ይም​ትሩ፡ ​አር​ዕስ​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ግም​ድዎ​ሙ፡ ​በበ​መን​ፈቆ​ሙ፡ ​በአ​ስይ​ፍት፡ ​በበ​ምታር ፨ 
                                            ​ወበ​እን​ተዝ፡ ​ነሥ​ኡ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡ ​በመ​ንግ​ሥተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሮሙ፡
                                                <fo:inline id="d1e95128PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                                  ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95140LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda1ArkeAngels">
               <fo:inline>I-4-2-2) Fol. 59rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: ʿĀrke-hymn to the angels</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95148LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda1SalTrinity">
               <fo:inline>I-4-2-3) Fols 59rb–59rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the Trinity and St Mary</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e95157LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda2">
               <fo:inline>I-4-3) Fols 59rc–59vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        2nd Ḫǝdar
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
