               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e96949LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda30SalGabraM2">
               <fo:inline>I-4-31-5) Fol. 89rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Gabra Masqal</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​ለከ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​ክቡር ፨  ​እን​ተ፡ ​ትት​ፌሣ​ሕ፡ ​በኃ​ይሉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨  ​ገብ​ረ፡
                                           ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​መዋ​ዒ፡ ​ወመ​ግረ​ሬ፡
                                        ​ፀር ፨  ​በመ​ዋዕ​ሊከ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ወፍ​ቅር ፨  ​ማኅ​ሌተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​መዝ​ሙር ፨  ​ተከ​ሥተ፡ ​በም​ድር ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e96985LIT4035SenkessarDL#Heda30Ananyos">
               <fo:inline>I-4-31-6) Fol. 89rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAnānyos and Ṗeṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ። ​ኮነ፡ ​አና​ንያኖ ​ስ፡ ​መነ​ኮስ፡ ​ዘዓ​ምድ፡ ​ወጴ​ጥሮ​ስ፡  ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ ፨
                                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e97003PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e97006PRS13550WalattaM">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e97016PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን​ግል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e97028LIT4035SenkessarDL#HedaSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-4-32) Fols 89rb–89rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Ḫǝdār</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​በዝ​የ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​በወ​ርኃ፡
                                            ​ኅዳ ር ፨  ​በሰ​ላመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ስቡ​ሕ፡
                                        ​ወል​ዑል፡ ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​ስሙ ፨  ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​እም​ኀቤ​ነ፡ ​ወለ​ነ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡
                                        ​እም​ኀቤ​ሁ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ይሴ​ፎ፡ ​ኪያ​ሁ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወጣ​ኒ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ፈጻ​ሚ፡ ​ወቦ​ቱ፡ ​ይሠ​ልጥ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ግብር ፨  ​ኪያ​ሁ፡ ​ናመ  (c)  ​ልክ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ረድ​ኤት​ነ፡
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        ፨
                                        ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e97068LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahsas">
               <fo:inline>I-5) Fols 90ra–126rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Tahsas</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e97074LIT4035SenkessarDL#TahsIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-5-1) Fol. 90ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Introduction for Tāḫśāś
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡
                                            ​አም​ላክ ። 
                                            ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ታኅ​ሣሥ፡ ቡ ​ሩክ፡ ​መዓ​ልቱ፡  ​፱፡ 
                                        ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ወእ​ምዝ፡
                                        ​ይት​ዌሰክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e97100LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2) Fols 90ra–91ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Tāḫśāś
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e97106LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs1Elyas">
               <fo:inline>I-5-2-1) Fols 90ra–90rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾElyās</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​አመ፡  ​፩፡  ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡
                                            ​አስ​ተር​እዮ​ተ፡ ​ኤል​ያስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡
                                            ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ኤል​ያስ፡ ​ቀና​ዒ፡ ​እም​ዘመ​ደ፡
                                            ​ሌዊ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወስ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ቡሁ፡ ​ኢያ​ሴን​ዩ፡ ​ወስ​ማ፡ ​ለእ​ሙ፡
                                            ​ቶና፡ ​ወተ​ብህ​ለ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አሁ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ተወ​ልደ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡
                                             ​፪፡  ​ዕደ​ወ፡ ​ብር​ሃና​ውያ​ነ፡ ​ይሰ​ግዱ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ወጠ​ብለ​ልዎ፡ ​በእ​ሳት፡
                                            ​ህየ​ንተ፡ ​አጽ​ርቅ​ት፡ ​ዘይ​ጠበ​ለሉ፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​ሕፃ​ናት ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወይ​በው​እ፡ ​ውስ​ቴቶ​ሙ፡
                                            ​ወይ​ትነ​ሥኡ፡ ​ሕያ​ዋኒ​ሆሙ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ይከ​ውን፡ ​ፍር​ሃት፡   (b) 
                                            ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘይ​ሬእ​ዮሙ፡
                                            ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ጸው​ዖሙ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​የዓ​ርጉ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡  ​በደ​መና ፨ 
                                            ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ይከ​ውን፡ ​ዓቢ​ይ፡ ​ድል​ቅል​ቅ፡ ​ወይ​መው​ቱ፡
                                             ​፸፻  ​ነፍስ ፤
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሮሙ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e97147PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
