               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99069LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs30SalZakaryas">
               <fo:inline>I-5-31-7) Fol. 125rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Zakāryās</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99077LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs30Bethlehem">
               <fo:inline>I-5-31-8) Fol. 125rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the children of Bethlehem</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ ለ ፡  ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ኢት​ዮጵ​ያ፡
                                            ​ተዝ​ካረ፡ ​ሕፃ​ናት፡ ​ዘቤ​ተ፡ ​ልሔ​ም፡ ​ዘቀ​ተሎ​ሙ፡ ​ሄሮ​ድስ፡ ​ዓላ​ዊ፡
                                            ​ወዜ​ናሆ​ሙሰ፡ ​ናሁ፡ ​ጽሑ​ፍ፡ ​አመ፡  ፫ ፡ ​ለጥር ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ተሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e99099PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99111LIT4035SenkessarDL#Tahs30SalBethlehem">
               <fo:inline>I-5-31-9) Fol. 125rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the children of Bethlehem</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​እብ​ል፡ ​ለለ ​፩፩ ፨ 
                                            ​ዘክ​ልኤ፡ ​ክረ​ምት፡ ​ወዘ​ይው​ሕዱ ፨  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ልደ​ቱ፡ ​ለቃ​ል፡ ​አመ፡ ​ብል​ሐ፡ ​አስ​ይፍ​ት፡ ​ተገ​መዱ ፨ 
                                            ​ሕፃ​ናት፡ ​ንጹ​ሐን፡ ​ወጽ​ሩያ​ን፡ ​ነገዱ ፤ 
                                            ​ከመ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡ ​ተወ​ልዱ ፤
                                            ​ለን​ጉሥ​ነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e99144PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን​ግል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99154LIT4035SenkessarDL#SubscriptionTahs">
               <fo:inline>I-5-32) Fol. 125rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                       Subscription for Tāḫśāś
                        
                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ታኅ​ሣሥ፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​በሥ​ምረ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ፈቃ​ደ፡ ​ወል​ዱ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወበ​ፍቅ​ረ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ጰራ​ቅሊ​ጦስ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                        ​አሜን ፤  ​ወአ​ሜን ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99176LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr">
               <fo:inline>I-6) Fols 126ra–162vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Terr</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99182LIT4035SenkessarDL#TerrIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-6-1) Fol. 126ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Introduction for Ṭǝrr
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ቅ ​ዱስ፡
                                         ፩ ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​ጥር፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡  ​፲፡ ​ሰዓ​ቱ፡ ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ይት​ዌሰ​ክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99208LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr1">
               <fo:inline>I-6-2) Fols 126ra–127rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Ṭǝrr
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99214LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr1Estifanos">
               <fo:inline>I-6-2-1) Fols 126ra–126rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of St Stephen the Protomartyr
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​አመ፡  ፩ ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ፡
                                            ​እስ​ጢፋ ​ኖስ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕተ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ዲያ​ቆና​ት፡ ​ወቀ ​ዳሜ፡
                                            ​ሰማ​ዕት፡
                                            ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዘመ​ጽሐ​ፈ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ስም​ዐ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አሁ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ምሉ​አ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ወኃ​ይል፡ ​ወይ​ገብ​ር፡
                                            ​ተአ​ምራ​ተ፡ ​ወመ​ንክ​ራተ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​አሕ​ዛብ ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ወሰ​ገደ፡ ​በብ​ረኪ​ሁ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ተወ​ከፋ፡ ​ለነ​ፍስ​የ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ ፨ 
                                            ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ኢ ​ትኈ​ልቍ ፡
                                            ​ሎሙ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ኃጢአ  (c)  ​ት፡
                                                ​ወተ​መሰ​ለ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እግ​ዚኡ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡  ​ይቤ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ ፨ 
                                            ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡ ​ሰብ ​እ፡ ​መሃ​ይም​ናን፡ ​ወጾ​ሩ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለቅ ​ዱስ፡ ​እስ​ጢፋ​ኖስ፡ ​ወለ​ሐዉ፡ ​ላዕሌ ​ሁ፡
                                            ​ዐቢ​የ፡ ​ላሐ፡ ​ወቀ​በርዎ ።
                                            ​በረ​ከቱ፡  ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሩ፡
                                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline id="d1e99264PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወልድ</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                                ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99276LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr1SalStephen">
               <fo:inline>I-6-2-2) Fol. 126rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Stephen</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e99284LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr1Lawdyanos">
               <fo:inline>I-6-2-3) Fols 126rc–126va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Lāwdyānos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
