               <fo:inline>I-6-31-1) Fols 161ra–161va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Ṗisṭis, ʾAlāṗis, ʾAgābis and their mother Sofyā</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
