               <fo:inline>I-6-31-7) Fol. 162rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾOrni</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101253LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30Gorgoryos">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-8) Fol. 162rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of Gorgoryos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101261LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30Akrestros">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-9) Fols 162rc–162va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā ʾAkrǝsṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101270LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30SalAkrestros">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-10) Fol. 162va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAkrǝsṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101280LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30ComOrni">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-11) Fol. 162vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the companions of ʾOrni</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ስም​ዓ፡ ​ኮኑ፡ ​፲ወ ​፫፡ ​፻፻፡  ወ ፴ 
                                            ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ማኅ​በራ​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ኦር​ኒ፡
                                            ​ወተ​ዝካ​ረ፡ ​ዕረ​ፍቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለጻ​ድቃ​ን፡ ​እለ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ዴጔ ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ ፨
                                                <fo:inline id="d1e101306PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡</fo:inline>
                                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101318LIT4035SenkessarDL#Terr30SalComOrni">
               <fo:inline>I-6-31-12) Fol. 162vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the companions of ʾOrni</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​እብ​ል፡ ​ለብ​ዙኃ​ን፡ ​አእ​ላፋት ፨ 
                                            ​እለ፡ ​ነጺ​ሮሙ፡ ​አም​ኑ፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ፡ ​ኦር​ኒ፡ ​እሞት ፨ 
                                            ​እሉ፡ ​አኃ​ው፡ ​ዘእ​ምአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ጥም​ቀት ፨ 
                                            ​ይሰ​ውሩ​ኒ፡ ​በጽ​ድቆ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ጌጋ​ይየ፡ ​ክሡት ፨ 
                                            ​ኃፍ​ረተ፡ ​ባዕ​ሉ፡ ​ፍጹ​መ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይሤ​ውር፡ ​ቤት ፨
                                            ​መም​ህር​ነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e101350PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን​ግል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101361LIT4035SenkessarDL#SubscriptionTerr">
               <fo:inline>I-6-32) Fol. 162vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Ṭǝrr</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​በዝ​የ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​በወ​ርኃ፡  ​ጥር፡ ​በሰ​ላመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አብ፡
                                        ​ዘሎ​ቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨  ​ወአ​ሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ለይ​ኩን፡ ​ለይ​ኩን ፨ 
                                        ​ወበ​ሉ፡ ​አቡ​ነ፡ ​ዘበ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101393LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakkatit">
               <fo:inline>I-7) Fols 163ra–187rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Yakkatit</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101399LIT4035SenkessarDL#YakkIntroduction">
               <fo:inline>I-7-1) Fol. 163ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Introduction for Yakkātit
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ቅ ​ዱስ፡
                                         ፩  ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​የካ​ቲት፡ ቡ ​ሩክ፡ ​መዓ​ልቱ፡
                                             ፲ ወ ፩ 
                                            ​ሰዓቱ ። 
                                            ​ወእም ​ዝ፡ ​የኀ​ፅፅ፡ ​ወይ​ዌስ​ክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101434LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2) Fols 163ra–163vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        1st Yakkātit
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101440LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1Council">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-1) Fols 163ra–163vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the council of Constantinople</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     
                                     ​አመ፡  ፩  ​ለየ​ካቲ ​ት። ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ጉባ​ኤ፡ ​ማኅ​በረ፡ 
                                     ​አበ​ው፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡
                                      ፻ ወ ፶ 
                                     ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ሳት፡
                                     ​እለ፡ ​ተጋ​ብኡ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ቍስ​ጥን​ጥን​ያ፡ ​በመ​ዋዕ​ለ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ቱ፡ ​ለን​ጉሥ፡
                                     ​ቴዎ​ዶስ​ዮስ፡ ​ዘየ​ዐቢ ፨ 
                                     ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ተጋ​ብኦ​ቶሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መቅ​ዶን​ዮስ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ቍስ​ጥን​ጥን​ያ፡ ​ወክ​ሕዶ፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡
                                     ​በእ​ከየ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ፍጡ​ር፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ፍጡ​ራን፡
                                 </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ወ  (b)  ​እም​ዝ፡ ​ሠር​ዑ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ማኅ​በር፡ ​ጉባ​ኤ፡ ​ቀኖ​ና፡ ​ወእ​ሙን​ቱ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​እደ​ዊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወለ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ይእ​ዜ፡ ​ይገ​ብሩ፡
                                            ​ሕጎ​ሙ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ተጋ​ብኦ​ቶሙ፡ ​ለእ​ሉ፡ ​አበ​ው፡
                                             ፻ ወ ፶ 
                                            ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ሳት፡ ​በዓ​መት፡  ​፶፻ 
                                            ወ ​፰፻
                                            ፹ ፡
                                            ወ ፪ ፡
                                            ​ለፍ​ጥረ​ተ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                                            ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ፡
                                                <fo:inline id="d1e101495PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወልድ</fo:inline> 
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101508LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1SalCouncil">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-2) Fol. 163vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the participants of the council of Constantinople</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101516LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1ConsecrationPetros">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-3) Fols 163vb–163vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the consecration of the church of Ṗeṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101525LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1SalConsecrationPetros">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-4) Fol. 163vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the consecration of the church of Ṗeṭros</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101533LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk1Asokanafer">
               <fo:inline>I-7-2-5) Fol. 163vc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾAsokānāfǝr and his wife</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101542LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3) Fols 163vc–166rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        2nd Yakkātit
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101548LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2Langinos">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-1) Fols 163vc–164rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Langinos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101556LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2SalLanginos">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-2) Fol. 164rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Langinos</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101564LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2Pawli">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-3) Fols 164rc–166ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Ṗawli</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101573LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2SalPawli">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-4) Fol. 166ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Ṗāwli</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101581LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2Tomas">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-5) Fols 166ra–166rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of a miracle of Thomas</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Part of the text is missing due to the miniature.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101591LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk2SalTomas">
               <fo:inline>I-7-3-6) Fol. 166rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Thomas</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101601LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4) Fols 166va–167vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        3rd Yakkātit
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101607LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3Yaqob">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4-1) Fols 166va–167ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Yāʿqob</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e101615LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk3SalYaqob">
               <fo:inline>I-7-4-2) Fol. 167ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Yāʿqob</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
