                      id="d1e103028LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk29Christ">
               <fo:inline>I-7-30-3) Fol. 186va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the birth of Christ</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103037LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk29SalChrist">
               <fo:inline>I-7-30-4) Fols 186va–186vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the birth of Christ</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103046LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk30">
               <fo:inline>I-7-31) Fols 186vb–187rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: 
                        30th Yakkātit
                        
                     </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103052LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk30Yohannes">
               <fo:inline>I-7-31-1) Fols 186vb–187ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of the invention of the head of St John the Baptist
                        </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103060LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk30SalYohannes">
               <fo:inline>I-7-31-2) Fol. 187ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to John the Baptist</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ሰላ​ም፡  ​እብ​ል፡ ​ለር​እስ​ከ፡ ​ክቡ​ር።
                                            ​ዘተ​ረክ​በ፡ ​ዮም፡ ​በን​ዋየ፡ ​ጽቡር ፨ 
                                            ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​ሰራ​ሪ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​አዕ​ዋፍ፡ ​ንስር ፨ 
                                            ​ንሥ​አኒ፡ ​በክ​ነፊ​ከ፡ ​ወአ​ዕድ​ወኒ፡ ​ለገ​ብር ፨ 
                                            ​ከመ፡ ​ኢያ​ስቆ​ቁ፡ ​ቀዊ​ምየ፡ ​በጽ​ንፋ፡ ​ለባ​ሕር ፨
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e103086PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን​ግል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103096LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk30Yohannes2">
               <fo:inline>I-7-31-3) Fols 187ra–187rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Discourse of John Chrysostom on John the Baptist</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103105LIT4035SenkessarDL#Yakk30Minas">
               <fo:inline>I-7-31-4) Fol. 187rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Commemoration of ʾabbā Minās</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                  ​ወበ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ተዝ​ካሩ፡ ​ለአ​ባ፡  ​ሚና​ስ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ዘእ​ስክ​ንድ​ርያ ፨
                                  ​በረ​ከቱ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡
                                      <fo:inline id="d1e103123PRS13551KidanaW">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡</fo:inline> ​ወለተ
                                      <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                  
                              </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103142LIT4035SenkessarDL#YakkSubscription">
               <fo:inline>I-7-32) Fols 187rb–187rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Subscription for Yakkātit</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ​ወር​ኃ፡ ​የካ​ቲት ።  ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ወ ​ሥም​ረተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                        ​ክር  (c)  ​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡
                                        ​ወላ​ዕሌ​ነ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​አሜን ፨  ​ወአ​ሜን ፨
                                        ​መም​ህር <fo:inline id="d1e103169PRS13549SardaD">​ሠር​ፀ፡ ​ድን​ግል።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e103178LIT4035SenkessarDL#YakkSupplication">
               <fo:inline>I-7-33) Fol. 187rc: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Synaxarion: Supplication for Yakkātit</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ለዘ​ጸሐ​ፎ፡ ​ወለ​ዘአ​ጽሐ​ፎ፡ ​ኅቡ​ረ፡ ​ይም ​ሐሮ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡ ​ስሞ​ሙ፡ ​በቀ​ለመ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወአ​ሜን ፨ ​ንጉ​ሥነ፡ ፨
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e103202PRS4015Fasilada">​ፋሲ​ለደ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ፨
                                   </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 58v–59r: The end of the last commemoration of the month for Ṭǝqǝmt
                                        and the subscription for the same month are added in the margins.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 60r: Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to ʾAtnātewos and ʾIrāʾi.
                                        The <fo:inline font-style="italic">salām</fo:inline>-hymn, which was not included in the main text, is added in the upper margin.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 64v: Synaxarion: ʿArke-hymn mentioning ʾƎgziʾ Kǝbrā.
                                        The <fo:inline font-style="italic">salām</fo:inline>-hymn, which was not included in the main text, is added in the upper margin.
                                        It does not stand in a direct relationship with the daily commemoration of the main text.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 71r: Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to Yoḥannǝs.
                                        The <fo:inline font-style="italic">salām</fo:inline>-hymn, which was not included in the main text, is added in the upper margin.
                                        It does not stand in a direct relationship with the daily commemoration of the main text.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 74v: Synaxarion: Salām-hymn to the righteous of Waṣif.
                                        The <fo:inline font-style="italic">salām</fo:inline>-hymn, which was not included in the main text, is added twice in the upper margin.
                                        It does not stand in a direct relationship with the daily commemoration of the main text.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 98r: Synaxarion: Salām-hymn.
                                        The <fo:inline font-style="italic">salām</fo:inline>-hymn, which was not included in the main text, is added in the upper margin.
                                        It does not stand in a direct relationship with the daily commemoration of the main text.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Occasionally, characters have been erased and corrections written over the erasure by the main hand, e.g. on
                                        fols 11vb, 62rc, 134vb. Rarely, entire lines are written in compressed script, e.g. on 60va. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘለ</fo:inline> is written in the
                                        margin on 95v and fol. 97r.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 2r, 59r, 163r: The name of the month is written in red and decorated in the upper margin.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Several stickers are glued onto
                                        the inner side of the front board: Two small white stickers, possibly with content ‘12’; a white sticker with the name of <fo:inline id="d1e103656PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> printed (‘<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡ ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>’), and the signature ‘Ms.
                                        Aeth. b. 6’, and possibly another signature, written in pencil; a red sticker with the printed initials ‘AGT’; a small white sticker with ‘A-1’ written in pen;
                                        a white sticker with the signature ‘Ms 45’.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>26 quires. II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 2r–9v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 10r–17v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 18r–25v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (Fols 26r–31v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 32r–39v)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 40r–47v)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 48r–55v)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">2+1 (Fols 56r–58v)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 59r–66v)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 67r–74v)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 75r–82v)</fo:inline> – XIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+1 (Fols 83r–89v)</fo:inline> – XIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 90r–97v)</fo:inline> – XV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 98r–105v)</fo:inline> – XVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 106r–113v)</fo:inline> – XVII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 114r–121v)</fo:inline> – XVIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (Fols 122r–125v)</fo:inline> – XIX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 126r–133v)</fo:inline> – XX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 134r–141v)</fo:inline> – XXI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 142r–149v)</fo:inline> – XXII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 150r–157v)</fo:inline> – XXIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 158r–165v)</fo:inline> – XXIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 166r–173v)</fo:inline> – XXV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 174r–181v)</fo:inline> – XXVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4+2 (Fols 182r–187v)</fo:inline> – B<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (Fols 188r–188v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 2ra–187rc: 3
                                    columns (35 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 115r.The characters per line per column are 16–21.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            390 × 346 mm (fol. 115r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            273 × 270 mm (fol. 115r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 45 mm, bottom: 73 mm, right: 49 mm, left: 27 mm, intercolumn: 19 mm (fol. 115r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling is visible; pricking is visible. Primary pricks are visible. Ruling pricks are mostly visible. The upper line is written above the
                                        ruling. The bottom line is written above the
                                        ruling. Ruling pattern (fols 1ra–187vc): 1A-1A-1A1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Small tears resulting from parchment making carefully amended on very few folios, e.g.
                                        fols 21, 73, 162.
                                        The small rounded holes from parchment making on 41, 68, 155 have not been repaired.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethb6">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethb6</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
   <fo:page-sequence initial-page-number="auto-odd" master-reference="Aethiopica-master">
