      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethe31"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. e. 31 (R)</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 48)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment scroll1900×200 mm, 705×195 mm, 650×200 mm, 578×200 mm (weight: 100g),  fols, nineteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e108602LIT5920JohnBeg">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1ra1–1ra20: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Beginning of the Gospel of John, CAe 5920.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text consists of John 1:1–5, followed by an elaboration on how
                                demons will not prevail over the owner of the scroll,
                                similar to how the Darkness could not overcome the Light
                                in the Gospel excerpt.
                            </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ቀዳሚ ​ሁ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡
                                ​ቃል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወእ ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                    ​ቃል፡ ​ወከ​ማሁ፡ ​ቀዳ​ሚሁ፡ ​እም​ቀዲሙ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ቃል፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ብዋ፡ ​መና​ፍስት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ርኩ​ሳን፡ ​ወሰ​ብእ፡ ​መሠ​ርያ​ን፡
                                ​ወአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ፀዋ​ጋን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሀ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e108655LIT7353PPSusenyos">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 1ra20–1ra76: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer of St Susǝnyos, Susi’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​ሱሲ፡), CAe 7353.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስመ መ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡
                                ​ወመ​ንፈስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ዘ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​ሱሲ፡ ​ወልዱ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወል​ዱ፡ ​ሱሲ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡
                                ​አሁ፡ ​ወእ​ምወ​አል​ያነ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​ዲዮ​ቅል​ጥያ​ኖስ፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ርአ​ዮ፡
                                ​መል​ዓከ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወሐ​ለየ፡ ​በል​ቡ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡
                                ​ወተ​ረፈ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ትእ​ዛዝ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ሕሊ​ና፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​ወእ​ምዝ፡
                                ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ፈነወ<fo:inline>። (!)</fo:inline> ​እን​ተ፡ ​ተሐ​ድስ፡ ​ለቅ​ኔ፡ ​አማ​ልክት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኀዘ​ነ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ይም​ትሩ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳት፡ ​ወነ​ሥአ፡
                                ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወኮነ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ትፍ​ሥሕ​ት፡
                                ​ወሐ​ሴት፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ስም​ዓ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ስም​ዓ፡
                                ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡
                                 ፲  ወ
                                     ​፫፻፺ 
                                ወ ፱  ​ሰማ​ዕታ​ት፡
                                ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይም​ሐረ​ነ፡ ​በጸ​ሎተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡
                                ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​የሐሉ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                ​አመ​ቱ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e108730LIT7354PPMikael">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 1ra76–1ra89: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer invoking angels and other holy entities, CAe 7354.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ወገ​ብር​ኤል፡
                                    ​ሱራፌ ል ፤ 
                                ​ወኪ​ሩቤል ፤ 
                                ​ወሩ​ፋኤል ፤ 
                                            ​ራጉ​ኤል፡ ​ወሳ​ቁኤ​ል፡ ​ሰዳ​ቅያ​ል፡ ​ወአ​ናን​ያል፡
                                 ፺ ወ ፱ 
                                ​ነገደ ፤ 
                                ​መላ​እክት ፤ 
                                በ ፬  ​እን​ስሳ፡
                                ​ፀዋ​ርያነ ፤ 
                                ​መን​በር ፤ 
                                በ ፳ ወ ፬  ​ካህ​ናተ፡
                                ​ሰማይ ፤ 
                                በ ፸ ወ ፪  ​አር​ድእ​ት፡
                                በ ​፫፻፲ ወ ፰  ​ርቱ​ዓነ፡
                                                                                    ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡
                                ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​ወሰ​ማዕ​ት፡ ​ደና​ግል፡ ​ወመ​ነኮ​ሳት፡ ​ኄራ​ን፡ ​ወገ​ዳማ​ውያ​ን፡
                                ​በጸ​ሎተ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​የሐ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ዓመ​ቱ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e108815LIT5135MagicFormula">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 1ra89–1ra103: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective formula against stomachache, CAe 5135.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡
                                ​ጸሎ<fo:inline>[​ት፡]</fo:inline> ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ፀት፡ ​እልፍ ​ሉል፡
                                ​እል​ፍሉ​ል፡ ​እል​ፍሉ​ል፡ ​እል​ፍሉ​ል፡ ​እም​ዘ፡ ​ይበ​ፀብ​ፅ፡
                                ​ከር​ሠ፡ ​ወይ​ፈነ​ቅል፡ ​ገበ​ዋተ፡ ​ወያ​ጠዊ፡ ​አን​ዣተ፡
                                ​ወአ​ማዑ​ተ፡ ​ሸገ​ር፡ ​ሸገ​ር፡ ​ሸገ​ር፡ ​ጀር፡ ​ጀር፡ ​ጀር፡ ​ጀር፡
                                ​አቁ​ም፡ ​ቄጼቤ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ቄጼ​ቤ፡ ​ቄጼ​ቤ፡ ​ቄፌ​ኑ፡ ​ቄፌ​ኑ፡ ​ቄፌ​ኑ፡
                                ​ብያ​ክ፡ ​ብያ​ክ፡ ​ሞሊ፡ ​መሞሊ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አርጋ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ዔ፡ ​ነፋ​ሰ፡ ​ወበ​ረድ፡
                                ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አር​ግዕ፡ ​ወአ​ቁም፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ፀት፡
                                ​እም​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​አመ​ትከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                                ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ሰአ​ኖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                ​ይመ​ትር፡ ​ነደ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e108866LIT7218PPYosomer">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 1ra104–1ra145: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Prayer where Mary utters Hebrew words, CAe 7218.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The same text is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 45 (third column, lines 47 to the end);
                                see Löfgren 1974,  136–137.
                            </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                        ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡ ​እሉ፡  ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡  ​ማር​ያም ​ሰ፡
                                    ​አእ​መረ​ት፡ ​ምክ​ሮሙ፡ ​ወት​ቤ፡ ​ዮሳ​ምር፡ ​አር​ሞሳ​ድክ​ኤል፡ ​አዶ​ናኤል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ​ሮሳ፡ ​ኪራ​ኪስ​ክኤ​ል፡ ​ርድ​አኒ፡
                                    ​በዛ​ቲ፡ ​ሰዓ​ት፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ጸለ​የት፡ ​በነ​ገረ፡ ​ዕብ​ራይ​ስጢ፡ ​ወት​ቤ፡
                                    ​ኪር​ምያ​ል፡ ​አደ፡ ​ኮዳ​ያል፡ ​ሕል​ማና፡ ​ያሰ​ርስ፡ ​ብን​ያክ​ኤል፡ ​ሶሮ​ስሳ​ብ፡ ​ሮስ​ሳብ፡ ​እር​ዳድ፡
                                    ​ለም​ንያ​ም፡ ​አል​ማስ፡ ​ጢራ​ጢብ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                    <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e108924LIT7253PPMarySaid">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 1ra145–1ra161: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Prayer where Mary utters Hebrew words, CAe 7253.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The same text is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 46 (third column, lines 1–19);
                                see Löfgren 1974,  137–138.
                            </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወት​ቤ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ ​በነ​ገረ፡ ​ዕብ​ራይ​ስጢ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ​ሰፎ​ሶፎ​ያሮ​ስቦ፡ ​ያክ​ርሜ​ል፡ ​ፒፒ​ያኤ​ል፡ ​ጵር​ስቦ​ስ፡ ​ጕር​ጓስ​ባይ፡ ​አዴ​ሌዕ፡ ​መት​ዋፎ​ን፡ ​ወርእ<fo:inline>እ (!)</fo:inline>​የቶ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡
                                 ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እም​ርሑ​ቅ፡ ​ወት​ቤ፡ ​ያክ​ርሜ​ል፡
                                ​ትብ​ያቶ​ያቶ​ላን፡ ​ጥብ​ያቶ​ጳራ​ን፡ ​ጰአ​ውያ​ን፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወተ​ዘር​ዉ፡ ​ሶቤ​ሃ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጢስ። ​ኮር​ኰር​ያስ​ም፡ ​ፓፓ​ል፡ ​ልጤ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​አን​ሰባ፡
                                ​ኪዱ​ክባ፡ ​ኵጉ​ኩያ​ስ፡ ​ምን​ያኤ​ል፡ ​ደት​ኤል፡ ​ስም​ዓኒ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>​፨፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e108983LIT7063Devils">
               <fo:inline>VII) Fols 1ra161–1ra177: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​አላ​ሁማ፡ ​ወያ​ኑራ፡ ​ሐሽ​ም፡), CAe 7063.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The prayer contains a sequence of Arabic or Islamic names or terms
                                used as ʾasmāt. The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ቡዳ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አላ​ሁማ፡ ​ወያ​ኑራ፡ ​ሐሸ​ምረ​ጅ፡ 
                                ​ለሐ​ቅረ​ጅ፡ ​ለቅ​መግ​ኑን፡ ​ዕል​ዋቁ​ን፡ ​ዕ፡ ​መሸ​ሾን፡ ​ጠበ​ሽበ​ሾን፡ ዘ<fo:inline>ረ (!)</fo:inline>​በቦ​ሙ፡
                                ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​እስ​ሮሙ፡ ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡ ​ወበ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ቃላ​ት፡ ​አስ​ተና​ግሮ፡ ​ለቡዳ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​መሠ​ርይ፡ ​ወለ​ሌጌ​ዎን፡ ​እኩ​ይ። ​ወለ​እመ፡ ​አሐ​ዞ፡ ​እደ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ይት​ናገ​ር፡ ​ሕሙ​ም፡ ​ፌራ፡ ​በቀ​ቢዕ፡
                                ​ስሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​መፍ​ርህ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ፌፌ​ድራ​ሆን፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡
                                ​ዝንቱ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​አን​ብቦ፡ ​ለዘ​ተእ​ኅዘ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​እም​አን​ጠረ​ኛ፡ ​ወቁ​መኛ፡ ​ቡዳ፡ ወ<fo:inline>ፍ (!)</fo:inline>​ለሻ፡
                                ​ወነ​ሀቢ፡ ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሀ። ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109049LIT7213PPQwertemat">
               <fo:inline>VIII) Fols 1ra177–1ra185: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer against the pain of rheumatism’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ጥማ​ት፡), CAe 7213.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text contains ʾasmāt.
                                The same text is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 45 (first column, lines 84–91).
                                It is reproduced below in its entirety.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ጥማ​ት፡ ​በሸ​ቤ፡ ​በሴ​በል፡ ​ሸሩም ​ያል፡
                                ​ግሩ<fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>​ያል፡ ​ግሩ​ሙያ​ል፡
                                ​ግር​ሙያ​ል፡ ​ሳም​አም፡ ​ስያ​ል፡ ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቍር​ጥማ​ት፡
                                ​ወአ​ይነ​ት፡ ​ወው​ግዓ​ት፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109096LIT7404LukeOneThirSev">
               <fo:inline>IX) Fols 1ra185–1ra186: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Luke 1:37, CAe 7404.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ነገር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ዘይ​ሰአ​ኖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109114LIT7212PPTaosAzyos">
               <fo:inline>X) Fols 1rb1–1rb38: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer containing ʾasmāt, CAe 7212.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The same text is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 45 (first column, lines 24–56).
                            </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    ​በእ​ንተ፡ ማ ​ዕሠ​ሮሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡  ​በስ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ 
                                ​በስ​ሙ፡ ​ለወ​ልድ፡ ​በስሙ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ታኦ​ስ፡ ​አዝ​ዮስ፡ ​ማሲ፡ ​ማክ​ዮስ፡
                                ​ማስ​ዮስ፡ ​አቅ​ዴፌ​ር፡ ​በስ​ሙ፡ ​በሐ​ራዋ​ን፡ ​ሐሪ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ፌኬ​ር፡ ​በጠ​ጁን፡ ​ዘሐ​ጁን፡
                                ​ፌል ​ፌል​ማኤ​ል፡
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​አል​ዶር፡ ​አዳ​ናት፡ ​ፌዳ፡ ​ታኦ​ስ፡ ​አብ​ሽቱ​ር፡ 
                                ​ፀባ​ዖት፡ ​ጮሕ፡ ​ዋረ​ቅ፡ ​ሐሩ​ርቃ​ኤል፡ ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​ቃል​ከ፡ ​ስሑ​ል፡ ​እሳ​ተ፡ ​መለ​ኮት፡
                                ​መግ​ዝም፡ ​መን፡ ​እን​ዳለ​ህ፡ ​አም​ርኤ​ሴር፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወይ​ፃዕ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ርኩ​ስ፡ ​ወለ​ዘአ​ኃዞ፡ ​ሰብእ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ወተ​ግባ​ረ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ወኀ​በ፡ ​ቦአ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​ይሰ​ደድ፡ ​እም​ላዕለ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ቤት፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​አል​ፋ፡ ​አል​ፋ፡ ​አል​ፋ፡ ​አል​ፋ፡ ​ፃዕ፡ ​ፃዕ፡ ​ወወ​ጺአ​ከ፡ ​ኢት​ግባ​እ፡
                                ​አል​ፋአ፡ ​ፃዕ፡ ​ይቤ​ለከ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                ​ወዝ​ክረ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ይደ​ምሰ​ስ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                ​ረኃ​ቁ፡ ​ወሰ​ስሉ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወሰ​ይጣ​ናት፡ ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109189LIT7217PPYaqi">
               <fo:inline>XI) Fols 1rb38–1rb67: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for expelling Budā, Bāryā, demons, devils, and different diseases, CAe 7217.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The same text, with minor variants, is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 45 (first column, lines 56–84).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ያቂ፡ ​ወያ​ቂ፡ ​አን​ተ፡  ​ሰይ​ጣን፡ ​ወአ​ንተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወአ​ንተ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ደስ​ክ፡
                                ​ወጉ​ዳሌ፡ ​ወአ​ንተ፡ ​ሌጌ​ዎን፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​ወሥ​ራይ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ፍል​ፀት፡ ​ወቍ​ርፀ​ት፡ ​ዘት​ትሜ​ሰል፡
                                ​በብ​ዙኅ፡ ​ጾታ። ​አራ​ህድ​ራህ​ያ፡ ​ምራ​ኤል፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አዶ​ናይ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                ​ወል​ድ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ነገ​ርኩ​ክሙ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​በሎ​ፍሐ​ም፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ፒል​ፒል​ማኤ​ል፡ ​ያሽ​ኩት፡ አ<fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>​ደ፡
                                ​ብር​ሃን<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ልብ​ሰ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ይበ​ርቅ፡ ​በቅ​ድመ፡
                                ​ገጹ፡ ​ወለ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ፀላ​ኢ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወለ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ጸላ​ኢ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ወለ​ኃይ<fo:inline>[​ለ፡]</fo:inline> ​ጸላ​ኢ፡
                                ​ወለ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ጸላ​ዒ፡ ​ሌጌ​ዎን<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ወለ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ጸላ​ኢ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​ወሥ​ራይ፡ ​ፍል​ፀት፡ ​ወቍ​ርፀ​ት፡ ​ውግ​ዓት፡ ​ወቍ​ርጥ​ማት፡ ​ፓን​ዋማ፡
                                ​አር​እዮ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ግር​ማ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ርአ​ዩ፡ ​ገጻ፡
                                ​ወኢ​ይስ​ምዑ፡ ​ድም​ፃ፡
                                ​ወኢ​ይል​ክፉ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሀ፡
                                ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109251LIT7241PPSalakwa">
               <fo:inline>XII) Fols 1rb67–1rb84: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer containing ʾasmāt, CAe 7241.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The same text, with minor variants, is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 46 (first column, lines 1–17).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                በ ​ስመ፡  ​በል፡
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማዕ​ሠሮ​ሙ፡  ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡
                                ​ሰላ​ኰ፡ ​ማያ​ቺ፡ ​እል​መለ​ኪ፡ ​ወሹ​ራ፡ ​ቀግ​ተራ፡ ​ወይ​ኑራ፡ ​ቀቲ፡
                                ​ማር​ዲ፡ ​በሐ​ቅ፡ ​መግ​ኑን፡ ​ኖቢ​ዮ፡ ​በሕት<fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>​ኪን፡
                                ​ናዝ​ዚ፡ ​ሐል​ጣቆ​ን፡ ​ከጠ​ውር፡
                                ​ሸጢ​ሽ፡ ​ሸን​ሸፈ፡ ​ቡዓ​ሊ፡ ​መን​አሊ፡ ​መል​ኩ፡ ​ያኤ​ልማ​ል፡  ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ምን​ቅብ​ሎ፡ ​መና​ርሲ<fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፡
                                ​መጀ​ሐም፡ ​አም​ኪራ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ወተ​ግባ​ረ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡
                                ​አድ​ኅነ​ኒ፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ሰይ​ጣን፡ ​እም​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ወእ​ምዲ​ያብ​ሎስ፡
                                ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሀ፡ ​ለአ​መትከ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109330LIT7244PPBaha">
               <fo:inline>XIII) Fols 1rb84–1rb104: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for releasing demons, CAe 7244.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The same text, with minor variants, is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 46 (first column, lines 17–39).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መስ​ጥመ፡  ​አጋ​ንንት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​በሐ​ሸቢ​ም፡ ​አሽ፡ ​አሽ​ረዋ​ሽ፡ ​አራ​ውት​ል፡
                                <fo:inline>(...)</fo:inline> ​ማሕ፡ ​ማሕ፡ ​ማማ​ማ፡ ​ተወ​ጐጐ​ፎ፡ <fo:inline>(...)</fo:inline>
                                ​ተወ​ጐጐ፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ማዕ​ሠሩ፡ ​ለሰ​ይጣ​ን፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​ሰጥ​ራር፡ ​አሸ​ቸራ፡ ​ገላ​ሹ፡ ​ጨጨ​ሹር፡ ​ገገ​ኤ፡ ​ድሉ​ር፡ ​ድም​አቹ፡ ​ሻሞ​ሲ፡ ​ፈጨ​ከተ​ር፡ ​ይቀ​ጠቅ​ጥ፡
                                ​ቈጨ​ር፡ ​ያመ​ዣር፡ ​ያስ​ሐብ​ር፡ ​በፍ​ጡነ፡ ​ፈር​ዳን፡ ​አል​ፈዳ​ን፡ ​አዮ​ስያስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ሮጻ​ሕ፡ ​ጰለ​መ፡  ዐ ​ቀለ​ማ፡ ​በዝ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡ ​ይሰ​ደድ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ብ፡
                                ​እም​አመ​ትከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109396LIT7355PPAbshun">
               <fo:inline>XIV) Fols 1rb105–1rb133: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer against the pain of ʿāynat, ʾabšun qǝbšun norodit ḥuri šufi’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​አብ​ሹን፡ ​ቅብ​ሹን፡ ​ኖሮ​ዲት፡ ​ሑሪ፡ ​ሹፊ፡), CAe 7355.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    ​ጸሎት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡
                                ​አብ​ሹን<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ቅብ​ሹን፡ ​ኖሮ​ዲት፡ ​ሑሪ፡ ​ሹፊ፡ ​ይስ​ድድ​ከ፡
                                ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በጽ​ንዓ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወም​ድር፡ ​እገ​ታይ፡
                                ​እገ​ታይ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እገ​ታይ፡ ​ውፃ​ዕ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​በከ​መ፡
                                ​ወጽ​አ፡ ​ዮሴ​ፍ፡ ​እም​ሕሱ​ም፡ ​ውፃ​ዕ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያና​ዊ፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​እስ​ላማ​ዊ፡
                                 ​ሙሴ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​አይ​ሁዳ​ዊ፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ግብ​ጻዊ፡ ​ወአ​ይነ፡ ​አረ​ማዊ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ወዲ​ያቆ​ናት፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡
                                ​ወአ​ሕዛ​ብ፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ወባ​ኒ፡ ​ወሀ​ባሊ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወሰ​ይጣ​ናት፡ ​ዓይነ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ወብ​እሲ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ<fo:inline>[ን]</fo:inline>፡
                                ​ወዓ<fo:inline>[ይ]</fo:inline>​ነ፡ ​ነገ​ርጋ​ር፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ዛር፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ኃያ​ል፡ ​ወበ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ክቡ​ር፡ ​ወበ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡
                                ​ወበ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡  ​አው​ገዝ​ኩክ​ሙ፡
                                ​ወሐ​ተም​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወሥ​ልጣ​ነ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​እም​አይ​ነተ፡
                                ​ባርያ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​እም​ድን​ጋፄ፡ ​አጋ​ንንት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ወሰ​ይጣ​ናት፡ ​ወእ​ምድ​ንጋ​ፄ፡ ​ወእ​ምዲ​ያብ​ሎስ፡ ​አድ​ኅነ​ኒ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109475LIT7366Bakama">
               <fo:inline>XV) Fols 1rb133–1rb156: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘As Solomon scattered the demons’ (​በከ​መ፡ ​ረበ​ቦሙ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡), CAe 7366.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below. The same text, with minor variants,
                                is attested in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 46 (third column, lines 48–75).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በከ​መ፡ ​ረበ​ቦሙ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡  ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​መሐ​ፍሎ​ን፡ ​መሐ​ፍሎ​ን፡ ​ዮፍ​ታሔ፡ ​ዮፍ​ታሔ፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡
                                ​ወጳ​ውሎ​ስ፡ ​ብር​ስባ​ሔል፡ ​ብር​ስባ​ሔል፡ ​ብር​ስባ​ሔል፡ ​አም​ላከ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ወጳ​ውሎ​ስ፡ ​ብር​ስባ​ሔል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ብር​ሃና​ኤል፡ ​ዓው​የን፡ ​ቆጶ​ንድ​ስ፡ ​ፐፔ​ሮስ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​አማ​ኑኤ​ል፡
                                ​እብ​ኖዲ፡ ​ትስ​ፉጣ፡ ​ታኦ​ስ፡ ​አዝ​ዮስ፡ ​ማስ​ያስ፡ ​ሳዶ​ርጨ፡ ​አላ​ዶር​ጨ፡ ​ዳና​ትጨ፡ ​ዳና​ትጨ፡
                                ​አዴ​ራጨ፡ ​በ፭​ቅን​ዋተ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​አም​ሐል​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ውገ​ዝኩ​ክሙ፡ ​ኀተ​ምኩ​ክሙ፡ ​ወለ​ጐም​ኩክ​ሙ፡
                                ​አሠ​ርኩ​ክሙ፡ ​ወቈ​ለፍ​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​በቃ​ለ፡ ​አብ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወወ​ልድ፡
                                ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​አን​ትሙ፡ ​ሾተ​ላይ፡ ​ወሾ​ተላ​ዊት፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወሰ​ይጣ​ናት፡
                                ​ከመ፡ ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሀ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109537LIT7409PPAammen">
               <fo:inline>XVI) Fols 1rb156–1rb162: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘In the name of the Father, I believe…’ (​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ኣአ​ምን፡), CAe 7409.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡  ​አአ​ምን፡
                                 ​በስ​መ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡  ​አአ​ምን፡ ​በስ ​መ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ 
                                ​አአ​ምን፡ በ ፫  ​አካ​ላት፡
                                ​ወበአ ፩  ​መለ​ኮት፡ ​ከመ፡
                                ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሀ፡ ለ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​አመ​ትከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109590LIT7254PPMagic">
               <fo:inline>XVII) Fols 1rb162–1rb170: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer against the pain of the evil eye’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡), CAe 7254.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below. The same text, with minor variants, is also attested
                                in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 46 (third column, lines 20–47).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዓይነ<fo:inline>[ት]</fo:inline>፡ ​ወዣ​ር፡  ​ወት​ግሪ​ዳ፡ <fo:inline>አድኅኖ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                                ​ይት​ነሣ​እ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወይ​ዘረ​ዉ፡ ​ፀሩ፡ ​ወይ​ጕየ​ዩ፡ ​ጸላ​ዕቱ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ገጹ፡ ​ተን​ሥእ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡
                                ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ወይ​ዘረ​ዉ፡ ​ፀር​ከ፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​አድ​ኅነ​ኒ፡ ​እም​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ለአ<fo:inline>ም (!)</fo:inline>​ትከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109655LIT7410PPElmakwnun">
               <fo:inline>XVIII) Fols 1rb171–1rb177: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer against stomache ache, ʾǝlmakʷnun ʾazbi ʾǝnzǝbi’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ውግ​ዓት፡ ​እል​መኵ​ኑን፡ ​አዝ​ቢ፡ ​እን​ዝቢ፡), CAe 7410.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ው ​ግዓ​ት፡ ​እል​መኵ​ኑን፡ ​አዝ​ቢ፡ ​እን​ዝቢ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ረቢ፡ ​ታኦ​ስ፡ ​ጋዖ​ስ፡ ​ባዖ​ስ፡ ​ምድ​ምያ​ኖስ፡ ​ዘይ​ትባ​ወና፡ ​የሐ​ቂ፡ ​የሐ​ብራ​ስቂ፡
                                ​በከ​መ፡ ​አድ​ኃን​ኩ፡ ​ለወ​ልደ፡ ​ከራ​ስቂ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ከማ​ሁ፡ <fo:inline>አድኅኖ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​እም​ውግ​ዓት፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109705LIT4697MagicPr">
               <fo:inline>XIX) Fols 1rb177–1rb183: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማእ​ሠሮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡), CAe 4697.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text consists of a stanza from the <fo:inline>“Salutations for Phanuel” (ሰላምታ፡ ዘፋኑኤል፡), CAe 2765</fo:inline>, followed by an invocation. The text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ሰዳ​ዴ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡
                                 ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡  ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​እም​ጽር​ሑ፡
                                ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ስክዩ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይኔ​ስሑ፡
                                ​ለጌ​ጋይ፡ ​ዘዘ​ዚአ​ሁ፡
                                ​ኦአ​ምላ​ከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​ዕቀባ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወአ​ድኅ​ና፡
                                ​እም​ዓይ​ነተ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109758LIT7363WaGassu">
               <fo:inline>XX) Fols 1rb184–1rb188: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘And the face of (?) the Perfect One in the darkness – the Devil feared and was afraid…’ (​ወገ​ጹ፡ ​ዘፍ​ጹም፡ ​በጽ​ልመ​ት፡ ​ፈር​ሃ፡ ​ወደ​ንገ​ጸ፡ ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ፡), CAe 7363.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below. The same text, with minor variants, is also attested
                                in MS Uppsala, O Etiop. 45 (first column, lines 92–97).</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወገ​ጹ፡ ​ዘፍ​ጹም፡ ​በጽ​ልመ​ት፡ ​ፈር​ሃ፡ ​ወደ​ንገ​ጸ፡ ​ዲያ​ብሎ​ስ፡ ​ርእዮ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ብሁ​ተ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በሥጋ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በሲ​ኦል፡
                                ​በዝ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e109803LIT7404LukeOneThirSev">
               <fo:inline>XXI) Fols 1rb188–1rb189: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Luke 1:37, CAe 7404.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እስ​መ፡ ​አልቦ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ሰአ​ኖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The verso is empty.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Scribal corrections or interventions are very rare. They consist of letters blotted out with black ink or added interlineally.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                                        The first owner, whose name originally mentioned in supplications throughout but later scratched or blotted out, was
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e110073PRS14802AmataMaryam">ʾAmata Māryām</fo:inline>. The secondary owner, whose name was added to supplications and subsequently
                                        also deleted, was <fo:inline id="d1e110075PRS14803WalattaRufael">Walatta Rufāʾel</fo:inline>. The third owner, added to supplications and also to some of the
                                        pictures, was <fo:inline id="d1e110077PRS14804WalattaMuse">Walatta Muse</fo:inline>.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Brillenbuchstaben</fo:inline> appear within the text
                                    of Textual Unit XIII.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Order of textual units and miniatures: Miniature 1; Column a: Textual units I–IV; Column b:
                                        Textual units X–XIII;
                                        Miniature 2;  Column a: Textual units V–IX; Column b:
                                        Textual units XIV–XXI;
                                        Miniature 3.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>The strips are sewn together with small parchment strips.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>2
                                    columns (103–104 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 13–17.The outer margins are delimited by a decorated band.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            500–510 × 180 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 10 mm, left: 9 mm, top: 17 mm, bottom: 70 mm, intercolumn: 13 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>2
                                    columns (83–85 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 13–17.The outer margins are delimited by a decorated band.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            625–643 × 172–180 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 9 mm, left: 8 mm, top: 11 mm, bottom: 12 mm, intercolumn: 11 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling is visible while pricking is not. Ruling is visible. Pricking is not visible.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Nineteenth century.. Fine handwriting. Characters are uniformly spaced. The same hand wrote
                                    ,
                                        , and
                                        .<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Few lines of the incipits and other lines within texts; some occurrences of holy names;
                                        the names of the owners
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e109975PRS14802AmataMaryam">ʾAmata Māryām</fo:inline>
                                        and <fo:inline id="d1e109977PRS14804WalattaMuse">Walatta Muse</fo:inline>; and
                                        elements of punctuation and numerals.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">
                                The scroll features three richly coloured figurative illustrations at the top, bottom, and middle,
                                that divide the text into two main areas of two columns each. 
                                Bands – filled with a variety of geometric, floral, and interlace patterns – frame the resulting
                                columns of text. The style of the scroll suggests it was executed in
                                the nineteenth century.
                            </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(284) <fo:inline>An unidentified demon with raised hands with snakes coiled around its head and a
                                    cross to exorcise it at the top.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(285) <fo:inline>Michael and Gabriel, identified by the captions <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ሚ<fo:inline>[ካ]</fo:inline>​ኤል፡</fo:inline> and 
                                <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወገ​ብርኤ<fo:inline>[ል]</fo:inline>፡</fo:inline> holding unsheathed swords
                                (printed in Levene 2019,  105).</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(286) <fo:inline>The angel Phanuel, identified by the caption <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፋኑ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>, strikes a demon on its head with a
                                sword. Caption: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገሃ​ነመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እሳት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.The upmost part of the scroll is damaged, affecting Miniature 1. The bottom part
                                    is darkened, affecting Miniature 3. Apart from that, the scroll is in good condition.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically and by the style of the
                            miniatures to the nineteenth century. Based on paleographic and
                            textual evidence, it was written by the same scribe who wrote the scrolls
                            <fo:inline/>,
                            <fo:inline/>, and
                            <fo:inline/>.
                            The name of the original owner was <fo:inline id="d1e110123PRS14802AmataMaryam">ʾAmata Māryām</fo:inline>;
                            later owners were <fo:inline id="d1e110126PRS14803WalattaRufael">Walatta Rufāʾel</fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e110128PRS14804WalattaMuse">Walatta Muse</fo:inline>
                            (see Varia note 3).
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript was bought by <fo:inline id="d1e110136PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> at Sotheby’s
                            on 17 October 1983 (‘Sotheby’s Other Properties’, lot
                            267) through the bookseller <fo:inline id="d1e110140PRS13559Thomas">Alan G. Thomas</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e110145PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Bibliography</fo:block>Levene 2019.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethe31">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethe31</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
