      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethg37"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 37</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 50)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex80×71 mm (weight: 100g), 53 fols (6 p. blank), 7 quires, mid-seventeenth century–1710.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111375LIT1828Mahale">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 6ra–46ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes, CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111383LIT1828Mahale#Moses1">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 6ra–8va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: First Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ለሙ​ሴ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     (fol. 6ra) 
                                    ፩ ​ንሴ​ብሖ፡ ​ለእግ ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ስቡ​ሐ፡ ​ዘተ​ሰብሐ ፨  ​ፈረ​ሰ፡ ​ወመ​ስተ​ፅዕ​ነ፡ ​ወረ​ወ፡
                                    ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕር ፨  ​ረዳ​ኤ፡ ​ወመ​ሰወ​ረ፡  ​ኮነ​ኒ፡
                                        ​ኦአ​ድኅ​ኖትየ ፤  ው<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡
                                    <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፡ ​አም  (b)  ​ላከ፡ ​አቡ​የ፡ ​ወዐ​ሌዕሉ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ቦአ፡ ​ሠረ​ገላ​ቲሁ፡ ​ለፈ​ርዖ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አፍ​ራሲ​ሁ፡ ​ወመ​ስተ​ፅዕ​ናን፡
                                      (fol. 8va)  
                                    ​ወአ​ስተ​ጋብ​አ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​ባሕር ፨ 
                                    ​ወደ​ቂቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ልሰ፡  ኃ ​ለፉ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​የብ​ሰ፡ ​ማእ​ከለ፡ ​ባሕር ፨ 
                                    ​ወማ​ይሰ፡ ​ሎሙ፡ ​አረ​ፍት፡ ​በይ​ምን፡ ​ወአ​ረፍ​ት፡ ​በጽግ<fo:inline>ብ (!)</fo:inline>ም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111452LIT1828Mahale#Moses2">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 10ra–13ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Second Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም፡ ​ሕግ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     (fol. 10ra) 
                                    
                                        ​አጽ​ምዕ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወእ​ንግ​ርከ ፨  ​ወት​ስማ​ዕ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​አፉያ ፨  ​ወት​ሰፈ​ዎ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ዝና​ም፡
                                    ​ለነ​ገርየ ፨  ​ወይ​ረድ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጠል፡ ​ነቢ​ብየ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ውሉ​ድ፡ ​እለ፡ ​አል​ቦሙ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖተ ፨  ​እሙ​ንቱ​ሰ፡ ​አቅ​ንዑ​ኒ፡ ​በዘ​ኢኮ​ነ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ምዕ​ዑኒ፡ ​በአ​ማል​ክቲ​ሆሙ ፨  ​ወአ​ነ፡ ​አቀ​ንዖ​ሙ፡ ​በዘ፡ ​ኢኮ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝብ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ምዕ​ዖሙ፡ ​በሕ​ዝብ፡ ​ዘኢ  (fol. 13ra)  ​ይሌ​ብዉ።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111508LIT1828Mahale#Moses3">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 14ra–17rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Third Song of Moses (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘሣ​ልስ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​እስ​መ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ትነ​ድድ፡ ​እመ​ዓትየ ፤ 
                                    ​ወታ​ውዒ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ታሕተ ፨  ​ወት​በል​ዓ፡ ​ለም​ድር፡ ​ወለ​ኵሉ፡ ​ፍሬሃ ፨ 
                                    ​ወያ​ድለ​ቀል​ቅ፡ ​መሠ​ረታ​ተ፡ ​አድ​ባር ፨ 
                                    ​ወያ​ስተ​ጋብ​ዕ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆ  (b)  ​ሙ፡ ​እኩየ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወይ​ስግ​ዱ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ፅኑ​ዕ፡ ​ውእቱ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ይት​ቤቀ​ል፡ ​ደመ፡
                                    ​ደቂቁ ፨  ​ወት​ቤቀ​ል፡ ​ወይ​ትፈ​ደይ፡ ​በቀ​ለ፡ ​ለፀሩ ፨ 
                                    ​ወይ​ትቤ​ቀሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለጸ  (b)  ​ላእቱ ፨  ​ወያ​ነጽ​ሕ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝቡ ፤
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111566LIT1828Mahale#Hannah">
               <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 18ra–19vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Hannah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሓና፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​ጸን​ዓ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨ 
                                    ​ወተ​ለዓ​ለ፡ ​ቀር​ንየ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​ወመ​ድኀ​ንየ ፨  ​ወር​ኅበ፡ ​አፉ​የ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ጸላ​እትየ ፨ 
                                    ​ወተ​ፈሣ​ሕኩ፡ ​በአ​ድኅ​ኖትከ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡   (b)   ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በገ​ቢረ፡ ​ፍት​ሕ፡ ​ወጽ​ድቅ፡ ​በማ​እከ​ለ፡ ​ምድር ፨  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዓር​ገ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​አን​ጐድ​ጐደ ፨ 
                                    ​ወውእ  (b)  ​ቱ፡ ​ጻድ​ቅ፡ ​ይኴ​ንን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​አጽ​ናፈ፡ ​ምድር ፨  ​ወይ​ሁቦ​ሙ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ለነ​ገሥ​ተ፡ ​ምድር ፨ 
                                    ​ወያ​ሌዕ​ል፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መሢሁ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111624LIT1828Mahale#Hezekiah">
               <fo:inline>I-5) Fols 21ra–22rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Prayer of Hezekiah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቅያ​ስ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​አን​ሰ፡ ​እቤ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃ፡ ​መዋ​ዕልየ ፨ 
                                    ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አና​ቅጸ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ኀደ​ጉ፡ ​ዘተ​ረፈ፡ ​ዓመ​ትየ ፨  ​ወእ​ቤ፡ ​ኢይ​ሬኢ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​እም​አዝ​ማድየ ፨ 
                                    ​ወሐ​ጐል​ኩ፡ ​ዘተ​ረፈ፡ ​ሕይ​ወትየ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሕያ​ዋን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይባ​ርኩ​ከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አነ፡ ​ይእዜ ፤  ​ዛቲ፡ ​ተግ​ሣጽ፡ ​ትኩ​ኒ፡ ​እም​ዮም፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ ፨ 
                                    ​እነ​ግር፡ ​ጽድ​ቀከ፡ ​በዳ​ኅናየ ፨  ​ወት  (b)  ​ረ፡ ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​ወእ​ዜም​ር፡ ​ለከ ፨ 
                                    ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት​የ፡ ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111677LIT1828Mahale#Manasseh">
               <fo:inline>I-6) Fols 23ra–25ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Prayer of Manasseh (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ምና​ሴ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አኀ​ዜ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለም ፨ 
                                    ​አም​ላኮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊነ ፨  ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ ​ወለ​ያዕ​ቆብ ፤
                                    ​ወለ​ኵሉ፡ ​ፍሬሆ ​ሙ፡ ​ለጻ​ድቃን ፨  ​ዘገ​በር​ከ፡ ​ሰማ​የ፡ ​ወም​ድረ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኵሉ፡   (b)   ​ዓለ​ሞሙ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​አኮ፡ ​ድል​ወት፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​አድ​ኃን​ከኒ፡ ​በብ​ዝኃ፡ ​ሣህ​ልከ ፨  ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወትየ ፨ 
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኪያ​ከ፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨ 
                                    ወ  (fol. 25ra)  ​ለከ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111736LIT1828Mahale#Jonah">
               <fo:inline>I-7) Fols 26ra–26vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Jonah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                      (fol. 26ra) 
                                     ​ጸራ​ኅኩ፡ ​በም​ንዳ​ቤየ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                        ​አም​ላኪየ ፨  ​ወሰ​ምዓ​ኒ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ከር​ሠ፡ ​ሲኦል ፨ 
                                        ​ወሰ​ምዓ​ኒ፡ ​ቃልየ ፨  ​ወገ​ደፈ​ኒ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ማእ​ምቀ፡ ​ልበ፡ ​ባሕር ፤
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ትብ​ጻሕ፡ ​ጸሎ​ትየ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜከ፡
                                      (b)   ​ጽር​ኃ፡ ​መቅ​ደስከ ፨  ​እለ​ሰ፡ ​ዓቀ​ቡ፡ ​ከን​ቶ፡ ​ሐሰ​ተ፡ ​ገደ​ፉ፡ ​ሣህሎ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ንሰ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​በተ​ጋን​ዮ፡ ​ዕሠ​ውእ፡ ​ለከ ፤  ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​ጸለ​ይኩ፡ ​በሕ​ይወት የ ፡
                                    ​አአ​ስዮ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111794LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths1">
               <fo:inline>I-8) Fols 28ra–30rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: First Song of the Three Youths in the Furnace (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ዘእ​ምኣ​ዛር​ያ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ ፨ 
                                    ​እኩ​ት፡ ​ወስ​ቡሕ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ጻድ​ቅ፡ ​አን​ተ፡  ​ዘኵ​ሉ፡  ​ዘአ​ምጻ​እከ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌየ ፤ 
                                    ​እሙ​ን፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ግብ​ርከ፡ ​ወር​ቱዕ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ፍና​ዊከ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወይ​ትኃ​ፈሩ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ትዕ​ግል​ቶሙ፡ ​ወይ​ትቀ​ጥቀ​ጥ፡ ​ኃይ​ሎሙ ፨  ​ወያ​እም​ሩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ባሕ​ቲትከ ፤  ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለም ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111850LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths2">
               <fo:inline>I-9) Fols 31ra–31va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Second Song of the Three Youths (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሠለ​ስቱ፡ ​ደቂ​ቅ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ ፨ 
                                    ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨  ​ወይ​ትባ​ረክ፡ ​ስመ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ሁ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡
                                     ​አን​ተ፡  ወ ​እኩ​ትኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡  ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​በጽ​ርሖ፡ ​ቅድ​ስተ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲከ ፤
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​መን​በረ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ከ፡ ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ወ ​ቡሩ​ክኒ ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨ 
                                    ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡
                                      (fol. 31va)  ​በም​ልዕ​ልተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111907LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths3">
               <fo:inline>I-10) Fols 33ra–34vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Third Song of the Three Youths (​ኀበ፡ ​ባረ​ኩ፡ ​ኣና​ንያ፡ ​ወኣ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​ይባ​ርክ​ዎ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ለአ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨ 
                                    ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨  ​ይባ​ርክ​ዎ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨ 
                                    ​ስቡ​ሕኒ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​ወት​ሑታ​ነ፡ ​ልብ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨  ስ ፨ 
                                    ​ይባ​ርክ​ዎ፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ለ  (b)  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፤  ስ ፨ 
                                    ​ንባ​ርኮ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨  ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                    ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e111966LIT1828Mahale#Habakkuk">
               <fo:inline>I-11) Fols 36ra–38va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Habakkuk (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዕን​ባቆ​ም፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕኩ፡ ​ድም​ፀከ፡ ​ወፈ​ራኅኩ ፤ 
                                    ​ርኢ​ኩ፡ ​ግብ​ረከ፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ርኩ ፨  ​በማ​ዕከ​ለ፡ ​ክል​ኤ፡ ​እን​ስሳ፡ ​ርኢ​ኩከ ፨ 
                                    ​ወከ​መ፡ ​ይቀ​ርብ፡ ​ዓመ​ቲሁ፡ ​ዓአ​ምረከ ፤  ​ወከ​መ፡ <fo:inline>ከመ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ይበጽ  (b)  ​ሕ፡ ​ጊዜ​ሁ፡ ​እሌ​በወከ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወአ​ልህ​ምት​ኒ፡ ​ኢይ​ትረ​ከቡ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ጎል ፨  ​ወአ​ንሰ፡ ​እት​ፌሣ​ሕ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፤ 
                                    ​ወእ​ትኃ​ሠይ፡ ​በአም  (fol. 38va)  ​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ወመ​ድኀ​ንየ ፤ 
                                    ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ኃይ​ልየ፡ ​ወፀ​ወንየ ፨  ​ዘይ​ሠር​ዖን፡ ​ለእ​ገር​የ፡ ​ወለ​ፍጻ​ሜየ፡ ፨ 
                                    ​ወዲ​በ፡ ​ልዑ​ላት፡ ​ያፄ​አነኒ ፨  ​ከመ፡ ​እማ​ዕ፡ ​በማ​ኅል​ይሁ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e112034LIT1828Mahale#Isaiah">
               <fo:inline>I-12) Fols 40ra–41rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Isaiah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ትገ​ይስ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ ፨ 
                                    ​አም​ላኪየ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ትእ​ዛዝ​ከ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​ምድር ፨ 
                                    ​ተመ​ሐሩ፡ ​ገቢ​ረ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ትነ​ብሩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ምድር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ጠል፡ ​ዘእ​ምኀ​ቤከ፡ ​ሕይ​ወቶ​ሙ፡ ​ውእቱ ፨  ​ወታ​ጠፍ​እ፡ ​ምድ​ሮሙ፡ ​ለኃ​ጥአን ፨ 
                                    ​ሑር፡ ​ሕዝ​ብየ፡ ​ወባ​ዕ፡ ​ቤተከ ፨  ​ወዕ​ፁ፡ ​ኆኅ​ተከ ፨ 
                                    ​ወተ​ሀባ​ዕ፡ ​ኅዳ​ጠ፡ ​ምዕረ ፨  ​እስ​ከ፡ ​የኃ​ልፍ፡ ​መዓ​ቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e112088LIT1828Mahale#Mary">
               <fo:inline>I-13) Fols 42ra–42va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Our Lady Mary (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡) or Magnificat</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ድን​ግል፤ ​፲፫  ​ተአ​ብዮ፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፤  ​ትት​ኃሠ​ይ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡
                                    ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒየ ፨ 
                                    ​እስመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ሕማ​ማ፡ ​ለዓ​መቱ ፨  ​ናሁ፡ ​እም​ይእ​ዜሰ፡ ​ያስ​ተበ​ጽኡ​ኒ፡
                                    ​ኵሉ፡ ​ትው​ልድ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወነ​ሰቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለኀ​ያላ​ን፡ ​እመ​ናብ​ርቲ​ሆሙ ፨ 
                                    ​አዕ​በዮ​ሙ፡ ለ  (fol. 42va)  ​ትሑ​ታን ፨ 
                                   ​ወአ​ጽገ​ቦሙ፡ ​እም​በረ​ከቱ፡ ​ለር​ኁባን ፨ 
                                    ​ወፈ​ነወ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዕራ​ቆሙ፡ ​ለብ​ዑላ​ን፤
                                    ​ወተ​ወክ​ፎ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ቍል​ኤሁ ፨ 
                                    ​ወተ​ዘከ​ረ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊነ ፨ 
                                    ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ዘር​ኡ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e112152LIT1828Mahale#Zachariah">
               <fo:inline>I-14) Fols 44ra–45ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Zachariah (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ካህ​ን፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                     <fo:inline>​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ። ​፲፬</fo:inline>
                                    ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​እስ​ራኤል ፨ 
                                    ​ዘተ​ሠሃ​ለነ፡ ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ተ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝበ፡ ​ዚአሁ ፨ 
                                    ​አን​ሥአ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መድ​ኀኒ​ትነ፡ ​እም​ቤተ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ገብሩ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በሣ​ህሉ፡ ​ወበ​ምሕ​ረቱ፡ ​ለአ​ምላ​ክነ ፨  ​ለዘ​ሐወ​ፀነ፡
                                    ​እም​አር​ያም ፨ 
                                    ​ወሠረ  (fol. 45ra)  ​ቀ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያር​እዮ​ሙ፡ ​ብር​ሃኖ ፨ 
                                    ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ይነ​ብሩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ​ወጽ​ላሎ​ተ፡ ​ሞት ፨ 
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​ያር​ትዕ፡ ​እገ​ሪነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ሰላም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e112202LIT1828Mahale#Simeon">
               <fo:inline>I-15) Fols 46ra–46rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes: Song of Simeon, or Nunc Dimittis (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     (fol. 46ra) 
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ፡ ​፲፭  ​ይእ​ዜ፡ ​ትስ​እር፡
                                    ​ለገብ ር ከ ፨ 
                                    ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዝከ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡
                                    ​ርእ​ያ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ትየ፡ ​አድ​ኅኖ​ተከ ፤ 
                                    ​ዘአ​ስተ​ዳሎ​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ ፤  ​ከመ፡
                                    ​ትክ​ሥት፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ለአ​ሕዛብ ፤ 
                                    ​ወክ​ብር፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ​ከ፡   (b)   ​እስ​ራኤል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1r–2v: Protective prayer containing excerpts from the Psalms of David. The name or names mentioned at the end of the text have
                                        been erased, and that of <fo:inline id="d1e112714PRS13177HaylG">Ḫāyl Giyorgis</fo:inline>, hardly legible, has been added in a crude hand above the erasure.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        Incipit:  :
                                            ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                            ​አስማ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​መግ​ረሬ፡ ​ፀር፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                            ​ወይዘ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ይጉ​የዩ፡ ​ጸላ​እት፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ሉ፡
                                            ​ኃጥ​አን፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወከ​ማሁ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ሙ፡
                                            ​ለር​ጉማ​ን፡ ​ሳጥ​ናኤ​ል፡
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 3r–4r: Protective prayer against criminals, containing <fo:inline>ʾasmāt</fo:inline> and Amharic words.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        Incipit:  :
                                            ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሰራ​ቂ፡ ​ወቀ​ማኛ፡ ​ሀያ​ዲ፡ ​ወተ​ጸጋ​ኪ፡ ​አመ​ኃል​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ውገ​ዝኩ​ክሙ፡
                                            ​በእ​ግዚ አ ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ክፍ​ልም​ያኖ​ስ፡ ​በኵ​ርኵ​ያኖ​ስ፡ ​በጢ​ኖ፡ ​ጠቅ​ያኖ​ስ፡ ​በብ​ርሃ​ናኤ​ል፡
                                            ​በብ​ርሃ​ናው​ል፡ ​በአ​ማኑ​ኑኤ​ል፡ ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ቲክ​ሙ፡ ​ይት​አር​ሩ፡
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 4v: Record written in Amharic by <fo:inline id="d1e112796PRS13152Warqenah">Warqǝnah</fo:inline>,
                                        who transfers his land, cattle, and money
                                        to <fo:inline id="d1e112798PRS13153Taytu">Ṭāytu</fo:inline>, followed by a list with the names of the judge, the eye witnesses and representatives of
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e112800PRS13152Warqenah">Warqǝnah</fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e112802PRS13153Taytu">Ṭāytu</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">
                           <fo:inline id="d1e112807PRS13152Warqenah">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​ልጅ፡</fo:inline> ​ወር​ቅነ​ህ፡</fo:inline> ​እር​ስቲ​ን፡  
                                        ​ከብ​ቲን፡ ​ያለ፡ ​ገዘ​ቤን፡
                                        ለ<fo:inline id="d1e112812PRS13153Taytu">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">ወ<fo:inline>[ይ]</fo:inline>​ዘሮ፡</fo:inline>
                              <fo:inline>ጠይቱ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline> ​ኣዋ​ርሻ​ለሁ፡
                                        ​ዳኛ​ው፡ <fo:inline id="d1e112821PRS13154Sibasi">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​ግራ​ዝማች</fo:inline>
                              <fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                            ​ሺበ​ሺ፡</fo:inline> ​ዕማ​ኞቹ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e112829PRS13155Sada">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​አቶ፡</fo:inline>
                                                ​ሳዳ</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​አቶ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e112838PRS13156WaldaM">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline>አቶ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                              </fo:inline> ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e112844PRS13157Hayle">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​አቶ፡</fo:inline> ​ኃይ​ሌ፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e112849PRS13159Daffar">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​አቶ፡</fo:inline> ​ደፋ​ር፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​የነ​ገር፡ ​አባ​ቴ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e112854PRS13158GabraW">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​አቶ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ገብረ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                            ​ወል​ድ፡</fo:inline> ​የወ​ይዘ​ሮ፡ ​ጣይ​ቱ፡ <fo:inline>የገር፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​አባ​ት፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e112869PRS13160Gezaw">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​አቶ፡</fo:inline> ​ግዛ​ው፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 5r: Note mentioning the name of the manuscript’s buyer, <fo:inline id="d1e112944PRS13148AmdaM">ʾAmda Masqal</fo:inline>,
                                        and condemning whoever might steal it.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ለዝ​ንቱ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​ዘተ​ሣየ​ጦ፡
                                        በ<fo:inline>ነ (!)</fo:inline>​ዋዩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e112956PRS13148AmdaM">​አም​ደ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡</fo:inline> ​ዘሰ​ረቆ፡ ​ውጉ​ዘ፡ ​ለይ​ኩን፡</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 41v: Supplication note for <fo:inline id="d1e112967PRS13149WaldaG">Walda Gabrǝʾel ʾAzāga</fo:inline> and
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e112969PRS13150WalattaM">Walatta Madḫǝn Ḍaḥaytu</fo:inline>. The note is written in red around Miniature 14.
                                        </fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ተማ​ኅፀ​ንኩ፡ ​በፍ​ቁር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ይቤ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e112986PRS13149WaldaG">​ወል​ደ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​አዛገ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline> ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​የ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ዕቀ​በኒ፡ ​እመ​ክራ፡ ​ሥጋ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወነ​ፍስ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ኪ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​አዛ​ገ፡ ​ወዘ​ከመ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ነት፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e112997PRS13150WalattaM">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​ወይ​ዘሮ፡</fo:inline> ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​መድ​ኅን፡
                                            ​ፀሐ​ይቱ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 46rb: Book of Odes: Song of Simeon, or Nunc Dimittis (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)The beginning of  is copied in a later hand next to the counterpart written in the main hand.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>7)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 46v: Book of Odes: Song of Simeon, or Nunc Dimittis (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡)Nearly the entire text of , written in black on two columns.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ይእ​ዜ፡ ​ትስ<fo:inline>[ዕ]</fo:inline>​ሮ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ። ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አዘ​ዝከ፡ ​እስመ
                                        ​ርዕ​ያ፡ ​አእ​ይን​ትየ፡ ​አድ​ኅኖ​ተከ። ​ዘአ​ስተ​ዳሎ​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ኩሉ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ። ​ከመ፡ ​ትክ​ሥት፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ለአ​ሕዛ​ብ፡ ​ወክ​ብረ፡ ለ</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>8)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 47r–51v: ‘The angels are praising Mary...’ (​ይዌ​ድስ​ዋ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ለማ​ርያ​ም፡), CAe 3108.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        Incipit:  :
                                            ​ይዌ​ድስ​ዋ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ለማ​ርያ​ም፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ውሳ​ጤ፡ ​መን​ጦላ​ዕት፡ ​ወይ​ብል​ዋ፡ ​በሐ​ኪማ፡ ​አር​ያም፡ ​ሀዳ​ስዩ፡ ​ጣዕ​ዋ።  ​ይቤ​ላ፡ ​መል​አክ፡
                                            ​ለማ​ርያ​ም፡ ​ተወ​ከፊ​ዮ፡ ​ለቃ​ል፡ ​ሀባ​ኪ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​ወበ​ማኅ​ፀነ፡ ​ዚአ​ኪ፡ ​የሀ​ድር። ።
                                         ... 
                                    </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The manuscript contains comparatively few scribal corrections. Sometimes, characters or words
                                        have been erased (e.g. fols 1vb, 10vb, 15ra), text is occasionally written over erasures on 18va, 23ra, 31ra.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 5r, 20v, 30v, 51v, 53r, 53v: Scribbles or pen trials, sometimes faded (fols 20v) or possibly erased (30v), partly illegible, in black and red.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 5r: Partly illegible note.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዝመ​ጽሐፍ ሐ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 51v: Note.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ብእ​ርስ​ናደ ​ቀለም ​ግብር</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 51v: Note, in red. The first part of the name is hardly legible.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ለገ​ብርከ <fo:inline id="d1e113106PRS13177HaylG">​ኀይል ​ጌዮ​ርጊስ</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 52ra–52vb: Unclear note written in black and completely erased. Remains of many numerals are visible.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>7)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 4r, 5r, 24r: Drawings of a cross, with surrounding note on fol. 5r
                                        (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዝ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ <fo:inline id="d1e113127PRS13161Baqqala">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​መምሬ</fo:inline> ​በቀለ</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>8)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 5r: Crude drawing of a human figure in red ink.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>9)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block> A white sticker, with the name of <fo:inline id="d1e113145PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡
                                            ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>) printed on it, and the signatures
                                        ‘Ms. Aeth. g. 37’ written in pencil, is  glued to the inner front board.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                The book is bound in wooden boards.
                              
                                The boards are flush with the bookblock and have shallow external bevels. The grain runs vertically.
                                The external surface of the boards is polished, while the inner surface exhibits signs of the working tool.
                              
                                Chainstitch sewing on two sewing stations (one pair). Two varieties of thread have been used: one Z-plied and a S-plied one; their ends are knotted in the centrefold of the last quire.
                              
                                The small holes close to the head of the quires are probably what remains of quire tackets.
                              </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner (1–53).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>7 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4+1 (Fols 1r–5v)</fo:inline> – I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 6r–13v)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 14r–21v)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 22r–29v)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 30r–37v)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 38r–45v)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (Fols 46r–53v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 6ra–46ra: 2
                                    columns (11–12 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 14r.The characters per line per column are 8–11.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            79 × 71 mm (fol. 14r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            46 × 51 mm (fol. 14r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 11 mm, bottom: 22 mm, right: 12 mm, left: 7 mm, intercolumn: 3 mm (fol. 14r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 47r–51v: 1
                                    column (11 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 48r.The characters per line are 13–16.The text is written in one column, disregarding the ruling pattern for two columns.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            79 × 71 mm (fol. 14r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            47 × 49 mm (fol. 48r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 13 mm, bottom: 19 mm, right: 10 mm, left: 9 mm (fol. 48r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1r–4v: 1
                                    column (2–18 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 2r.The characters per line are 17–19.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            79 × 71 mm (fol. 14r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            57 × 56 mm (fol. 2r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 8 mm, bottom: 14 mm, right: 6 mm, left: 3 mm (fol. 2r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling and pricking are visible. Primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the
                                        ruling. Primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the
                                        ruling. Ruling and pricking are not visible. Ruling pattern (fols 6ra–53vb): 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.  Ruling pattern (fols 6ra–53vb): 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->1550–1799. Fine and regular handwriting. The letters are slightly slanted towards the right, broad spaces between characters.
                                    ፮ and ጵ have
                                    the modern form (e.g. fols 23ra, 36vb).<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: The title and numeral at the beginning of each canticle; elements of punctuation signs.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">The prayers in the manuscript are prefaced by a portrait of
                          their composer. These are without captions, but their position in relation to each prayer,
                          and in some cases their iconography, allow for identification. The miniatures are
                        executed in the First Gondarine Style.
                       </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(291) Fol. 5v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112552PRS7181MosesM">Moses</fo:inline> receiving the Law.
                            </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(292) Fol. 9r: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112563PRS7181MosesM">Moses</fo:inline> with a tablet in his arm.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(293) Fol. 13v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112573PRS7181MosesM">Moses</fo:inline> with a tablet in his arm.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(294) Fol. 17v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112583PRS1948Anne">Anne</fo:inline> with a book in her arm.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(295) Fol. 20r: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112594PRS5330Hezekiah">Hezekiah</fo:inline> enthroned and crowned.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(296) Fol. 22v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112604PRS6644Manasseh">Manasseh</fo:inline> in chains.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(297) Fol. 25v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112614PRS5754Jonah">Jonah</fo:inline> vomited out of the fish.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(298) Fol. 27v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112624PRS3337Daniel">Daniel</fo:inline> in the lion den.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(299) Fol. v: <fo:inline>The <fo:inline id="d1e112635PRS11288AnAzMi">Three Holy Youths</fo:inline>.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(300) Fol. v: <fo:inline>The <fo:inline id="d1e112647PRS11288AnAzMi">Three Holy Youths</fo:inline> in the Fiery Furnace.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(301) Fol. 35v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112658PRS4914Habakkuk">Habakkuk</fo:inline> with a book in his arm.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(302) Fol. 39v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112668PRS5584Isaiah">Isaiah</fo:inline> with a book in his arm.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(303) Fol. 41v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112678PRS6819Mary">Mary</fo:inline> with a book in her arm. Her halo is differentiated from
                          that of the other figures in the volume.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(304) Fol. 43v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112688PRS10691Zechari">Zechariah</fo:inline> with a book in his arm.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(305) Fol. 45v: <fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline id="d1e112698PRS8854Simeon">Simeon</fo:inline> with a book in his arm.
                            </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Hole in the parchment on fols 2r from the parchment making process. Parchment repairs
                                    by sewing on 49, 50.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.The first folio and the outer margins of many pages are stained by dirt, e.g.
                                    fols 25, 30v, 31r. Insect droppings are present on some folios, e.g. 1r, 12v, 13r.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>mid-seventeenth century–1710</fo:inline>
                            The suggested dating of the mid-seventeenth century–1710 is based on the handwriting and the
                            style of the miniatures.
                            Several persons are mentioned in additional notes (see
                            Additional notes 1, 3 and 5 and
                            Varia notes 5 and 6),
                            among whom <fo:inline id="d1e113192PRS13148AmdaM">ʾAmda Masqal</fo:inline>, a buyer of the manuscript who can be assumed to have
                            owned or donated it (see Additional note 4).
                       </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The provenance of the manuscript is unknown.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e113202PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg37">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg37</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
   <fo:page-sequence initial-page-number="auto-odd" master-reference="Aethiopica-master">
      <fo:static-content flow-name="rest-region-before-odd">
         <fo:block-container height="100%" display-align="center">
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-width="40%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block text-align="right"/>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block text-align="center" font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus">Bodleian Aeth. d. 22</fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="right">
                           <fo:page-number/>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block-container>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:static-content flow-name="rest-region-before-even">
         <fo:block-container height="100%" display-align="center">
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-width="40%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="left">
                           <fo:page-number/>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block text-align="center" font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus">
                           <fo:inline>Eliana</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>Dal</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>Sasso</fo:inline>, <fo:inline>Jacopo</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>Gnisci</fo:inline>, <fo:inline>Jonas</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>Karlsson</fo:inline>, <fo:inline>Dorothea</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>Reule</fo:inline>, <fo:inline>Massimo</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>Villa</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="right"/>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block-container>
