               </fo:table-row>
            </fo:table-body>
         </fo:table>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:static-content flow-name="rest-region-before-first">
         <fo:table>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="40%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-body>
               <fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block text-align="right"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block text-align="center" font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="right"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
               </fo:table-row>
            </fo:table-body>
         </fo:table>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator">
         <fo:block space-before="5mm" space-after="5mm">
            <fo:leader leader-length="30%" rule-thickness="0pt"/>
         </fo:block>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethd21"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. d. 21</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 52)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex262×224 mm (weight: 378g), 6 fols, 1981/82.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                  The book has a modern binding fully covered in marbled paper with nonpareil pattern.
                                  The boards have squares that project beyond the edges of the bookblock.
                                  A paper label on which is printed in green colour ‘<fo:inline id="d1e114210PRS15506GabraKr">Gebre Kristos Salomon</fo:inline>’s paintings’ is pasted on the upper board.
                                </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
                                    The folios bearing the paintings on parchment are foliated in
                                    pencil in the upper right corner (1–6).
                                    The protective paper folios have not been considered in the foliation.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 2–5: 
                                    column ( written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on painted area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 2r.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            251 × 200 mm; 146 × 99 mm.
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            225 × 173 mm (fol. 2r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 11 mm, bottom: 9 mm, right: 10 mm, left: 10 mm (fol. 2r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 6: 
                                    column ( written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on painted area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 6r.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            251 × 200 mm; 146 × 99 mm.
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            128 × 85 mm (fol. 6r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 11 mm, bottom: 9 mm, right: 10 mm, left: 10 mm (fol. 6r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->1981/82.. Irregularly spaced characters; hasty appearance.<fo:block>Rubrication: Holy names.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">The manuscript contains a collection of six illuminations painted on singletons and glued to a book. 
                                They were executed by the Ethiopian artists <fo:inline id="d1e114110PRS15506GabraKr">Gabra Krǝstos Solomon</fo:inline> who signed his name at the bottom of the first five paintings
                                together with the date 1974 AM (1981/82 CE) in which they were painted. </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(306) Fol. 1r: <fo:inline>An ecclesiastical figure with a book in one hand and a
                                    flywhisk in the other.</fo:inline> Legend: </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(307) Fol. 2r: <fo:inline>King <fo:inline id="d1e114133PRS3417David">David</fo:inline> playing the
                                    harp.</fo:inline> Legend: </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(308) Fol. 3r: <fo:inline>Saint <fo:inline id="d1e114147PRS10245Yared">Yared</fo:inline>.</fo:inline> Legend: </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(309) Fol. 4r: <fo:inline>A musician playing a flute.</fo:inline> Legend: </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(310) Fol. 5r: <fo:inline>A priest playing a <fo:inline font-style="italic">kabaro</fo:inline>.</fo:inline> Legend: </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(311) Fol. 6r: <fo:inline>A musician playing a <fo:inline font-style="italic">māsinqo</fo:inline>.</fo:inline> Legend: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እዝ​ራ፡ ​በማ​ሲንቆ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The paintings are drawn on parchment and interleaved with paper.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.
                                  
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>1981/82</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The provenance of the manuscript is unknown.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The book entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e114229PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd21">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd21</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
