      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethg32"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 32</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Juel-Jensen 54)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex108×80 mm (weight: 18g), 10 fols, 1 quires, nineteenth century–2006.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e115067LIT6706PPSalotaHabt">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r–4v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer for gifts and the anointing of the Holy Spirit’ (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሀብ​ት፡ ​ወቅ​ብዓ​ተ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡), CAe 6706.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡  ​ሀብ​ት፡ ​ወቅ​ብዓ​ተ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱስ ፤  ​ወመ​ፍቅ​ረ፡ ​ሕዝብ ፤ 
                                ​ዘወ​ሀቦ​ሙ፡ እ ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ወ ​ኢነ​ሐፋ ፤  ​ወኢ​ነሐፋ ፤  ​ወኢ​ነሐፋ ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e115098LIT6706PPSalotaHabt#PPPsalm44">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 1r–3r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Prayer for gifts and the anointing of the Holy Spirit: Psalm 44, interspersed with protective words</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጐሥ​ዓ፡  ​ልብ​የ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ሠናየ ፨  ​አዔ​ዳዖ ፤ 
                                    ​አዔ​ዳዖ ፤  ​አዔ​ዳዖ ፨  ​ወአ​ነ፡ ​አየ​ድዕ፡ ​ግብ​ርየ፡ ​ለን​ጉሥ ፨ 
                                    ​ወሥ​ልጣኖ ፨  (fol. 1v)   ​ወሥ​ልጣኖ ፤  ​ወሥ​ልጣኖ ፤ 
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​ዓቀ​ለመ፡ ​ጸሐ​ፈ፡ ​ዘጠ​በጠ​በ፡ ​ይጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​ልሳ​ንየ ፨  ​ወረ​አን​ታ፡ ​ወረ​አን​ታ፡ ​ወረ​አንታ ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በእ​ንተ​ዝ፡ ​ቀብ​አከ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላክ  (fol. 3r)  ከ ፨  ​ኢና​ጧኢ​ነከ ፤ 
                                    ​ኢና​ጧኢ​ነከ ፤  ​ኢና​ጧኢ​ነከ ፨  ​ቅብ​አ፡ ​ትፍ​ሥሕ​ት፡ ​እም​እለ፡
                                    ​ከማከ ፨  ​አል​ከው​ስር ፤  ​አል​ከው​ስር ፤ 
                                    ​አል​ከው​ስር ፨ 
                                    ​ከር​ቤ፡ ​ወቀ​ንአ​ት፡ ​ወሰ​ሊሖ​ት፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​አል​ባሲከ ፨  ​አፈ​ሶሊ ፤ 
                                    ​አፈ​ሶሊ ፤  ​አፈ​ሶሊ ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e115186LIT6706PPSalotaHabt#PPPsalm151">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 3r–4r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Prayer for gifts and the anointing of the Holy Spirit: Psalm 151, interspersed with protective words</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ንዑ​ስ፡  ​አነ፡ ​እም​አኃ​ውየ ፨ 
                                    ​ለረ​ቢካ ፨  ​ወወ​ሬዛ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​አቡየ ፨  ​ወን​ሖር፡ ​ወእ​ርዒ፡ ​አባ​ግዓ፡
                                    ​አቡየ ፨  ​ወኑሖ ፨  ​እደ​ውየ፡ ​ይገ​ብራ፡
                                    ​መሰ​ንቆ ፨  ​ሸራኮ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ፃብዕ  (fol. 3v)  ​የ፡ ​ያስ​ተዋ​ድዳ፡ ​መዝ​ሙረ ፨  ​ወለ​አብ​ትር ፨  ​መኑ፡
                                    ​ነገ​ሮ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እየ፡ ​ፍል​ሞን ፨  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ሰም​ዓኒ ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በእ​ሉ፡ ​ቃላ​ት፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አን​ሣእ​ኮሙ፡ ​ወቀ​ባዕ​ኮሙ፡ ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ዳዊት ፤
                                     (fol. 4r)  ​ከማ​ሆሙ፡ ​ቅብ​ዓኒ፡ ​ወአ​ንሥ​አኒ፡ ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ነገ​ሥት፡ ​ወመ​ኳን​ንት ፤  ​ወመ​ሳፍ​ንት፡ ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡
                                    ​ወመ​ላእ​ክት ፤  ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​አዳ​ም፡ ​ወሔ​ዋን ፤  ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e115254LIT6706PPSalotaHabt#ExplicitDirective">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 4r–4v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Prayer for gifts and the anointing of the Holy Spirit: Directive</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The following is the entire text.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ድግ​ም፡ ​በሜ​ሮን ፤
                                    ​፵፱  ​ጊዜ፡ ​በቀ​ለመ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ጽፈ​ሕ፡ ​ከከ​ርቤ፡
                                    ​ጋር፡ ​ታጠን ፨  ​ዓዲ፡
                                     በ ​ነጭ፡ <fo:inline>ደሮ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​መረ​ቅ፡ ​በቀ​ይ፡ ​ቀለ​ም፡ ​ጽፈ​ሕ፡ ​ጨም​ረህ ፤ 
                                    ​አስ​ርተ​ህ፡ ​ብላ ፨ 
                                    መ  (fol. 4v)  ​ንካ​ውን፡ ​ወጭ​ቱን፡ ​ላባ​ውን፡ ​ጥፍ​ሩን፡ ​የታ​ጠብ​ክበ​ትን፡ ​የማ​ይበ​ላው​ን፡ ​ሁሉ፡ ​ከግ​ብ፡ ​ቅበር ፨ 
                                    ​ከአ​ምባ​ጨ፡ ​ተቀ​ጽላ፡ ​ክታ​ቡን፡ ​ያዝ ፨
                                    ፨ ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e115304LIT6707PPBuryingHearts">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 4v–6r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for burying the hearts of the enemies, CAe 6707.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አዳ​ታኤ​ል፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ዘያ​ድለ​ቀል​ቃ፡
                                ​ለም​ድር፡ ​ሰዱ​ቃኤ​ል፡  ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ዘይ​ስጥ​ቃ፡ ​ለባ​ሕር ፤ 
                                ​ወኤ​ቴኤ​ል፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ዘያ​ቀል​ጦ፡ ​ለሰ​ማይ ፤  ​በዝ፡
                                ​አስ​ማት፡ ​ድፍ​ን፡ ​ልቦ​ሙ፡ ​ለሰ​ብአ፡ ​እገሌ ፨ 
                                ​ያሙ​ጅጅ ፤  ​ያሙ​ጅብ ፤ 
                                ​አል  (fol. 5r)  ​ጀባ​ር፡ ​አል​ዣባር ፤ 
                                ​ገል​ማላዊ ፤  ​አል​ሐዲር ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወያ​ረስ​ኦሙ፡ ​ምክ​ሮሙ፡ ​ለመ​ላእ​ክት ፤
                                ፯  ​ጊዜ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አር​ስዕ፡ ​ነገ​ሮሙ ፤ 
                                ​ወዘ​ርዝ​ር፡ ​ምክ​ሮሙ ፤  ​ለሰ​ብአ፡ ​እገ​ሌ፡ ​እገ​ሌ፡
                                ​እገሌ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">በ ፯ 
                                ​ጠጠ​ር፡ በ ፯  ​የብ​ረት፡ ​አር፡
                                 ​፵፱  ​ጊዜ፡ ​ደግ​መህ፡
                                 ፬ ​ቱን፡
                                በ ፬  ​ማዕ​ዘን፡ ​በትን ፤
                                ፫ ​ቱ፡
                                ​ከቤ​ትህ፡ ከ ፫ ​ኛው፡
                                ማ  (fol. 6r)  ​ገር፡ ​ስቀል ፨
                                ፨ ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e115400LIT6708PPBuryingHearts">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 6r–7r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer for burying enemies’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መድ​ፍነ፡ ​ፀር፡), CAe 6708, in Gǝʿǝz and Amharic.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጸሎ​ት፡  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መድ​ፍነ፡ ​ፀር ፤ 
                                ​ገም​ድድ ፤  ​ፈር​ድድ ፤
                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፤ 
                                ​አም​ድድ ፤  ​ለም​ድድ ፤ 
                                ​አፈ​ርድድ ፤  ​ረም​ድድ ፤ 
                                ​ለም​ለሚ​ዎን ፤  ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​ዝን<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ቱ፡
                                ​አስ​ማቲከ ፤  ​ድፍ​ን፡ ​ልቦ​ሙ፡ ​ለፀ​ርየ፡ ​ወለ​ጸላ​ዕት​የ፡
                                ​ሊተ፡ ​ለገ​ብርከ ፤ <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​በሐ​ዋን፡ ​በዘ​ረጅን ፤  ​በጸ​ረጅን ፤
                                ፯  ​ጊዜ ፤  ​ዚረ​ፊማ​ኖስ ፤
                                ፫  ጊ ፤  ​ቲቲ​ማኖስ ፤
                                ፫  ​ጊ፡ ​አሽድ ፤  ​አል​ሽድ ፤ 
                                ​ፈቀጅ ፤  ​ወከ​መ፡ ​ጰይ​ጸጅ ፤  ​በሰ​ማይ፡ ​መን​በርከ ፤ 
                                ​ወበ​ታቦ​ራዊ፡ ​ስምከ ፤  ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ንኩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ትና​ገሩ​ኒ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ሕሡ​መ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ <fo:inline>ፍቅፍ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወሰ​ላም፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡ <fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">በ ፯  ​ጠጠ​ር፡
                                 ​፵፱  ​ጊዜ፡ ​ደግ​መህ፡  ፬ ​ቱን፡
                                ​በም​ሥራቅ ፤  (fol. 7r)  
                                ​በምዕ ፤  ​በሰ ፤ 
                                ​በደቡ ፤  ​በት​ን፡
                                 ፫ ​ቱን ፤ 
                                ​ፀርከ ፤  ​ከሚ​ጠጣ​ው፡ ​ውሀ፡ ​ጣለው ፨ 
                                ​ለመ​ፍት​ሔ፡ ​ሥራ​ይ፡ በ ​፵፱  ​ዘቢ​ብ፡
                                 ​፯፯  ​ጊዜ፡ ​ደግ​መህ፡
                                 ​፯፯ ​ቱን፡ ​ብላ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡
                                 ፯  ​ቀን። ​ጸሊ፡ ​በኅ​ቡዕ።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e115563LIT6709PPAsmat">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 7r–8v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer containing ʾasmāt and Arabic words, CAe 6709, in Gǝʿǝz and Arabic.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አስ​ቡን ፤  ​አላሁ ፤ 
                                ​ወኒ​አመል ፤ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፤ 
                                ​ያቅ​ሐር ፤  ​ያል​ጀባር ፤ 
                                ​ያዘ​ልበጥ ፤  ​ሸሸ​ዱድ ፤ 
                                ​ወለ​ዚነ ፤   ​ጁሐጁ ፤ 
                                ​ወና ፤  ​ለና​ህዴ ፤ 
                                ​የና​ሁም ፤
                                 (fol. 7v)  ​ሱብ​ላነ ፤ 
                                ​ወኮነ ፤  ​አላሁ ፤ 
                                ​ሙሐ​ንን ፤  ​ወወ ፤ 
                                ​የሐ​ልፊሁ ፤
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​ድግም ፤ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፯  ​ጊዜ፡ ​በብ​ር፡ ​ቀለ​በት፡ ​ግበ​ር፡ ​በአ​ጽባ​ቲከ ፨
                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>፤  ​ድግ​ም፡ ​በነ​ግህ፡ ​በበ​ዕለ​ቱ። ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ኢይ​ሬእ​የከ፡ ​ሰብ​እ።</fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኦእ​ኁየ፡ ​ኢት​ርስ​አኒ፡ ​በጸ​ሎት​ከ፡ ​በል​ቡና፡ ​ወበ​ቃለ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                ​ጸሊ፡ ​በኅ​ቡዕ፡   (fol. 8v)   ​በኵሊ ፤ 
                                ​ነቢ​ይን ፤  ​ወመ​ስተ​ቃር​ራን ፤ 
                                ​መሳ​ውር​ተ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን ፤  ​ፍታ​ሕ፡ ​ሥራ​የ፡
                                ​ዘተ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​በላ​ዕለ፡ ​ገብ​ርከ ፤  ​እገሌ ፤ 
                                ​በቀ​ይ፡ ​ቀለ​ም፡ በ ፫  ​አን​ቆቅ​ሆ፡ ​ጽፈ​ሕ፡
                                 ​፵፱  ​ጊዜ፡ ​ደግ​መህ፡
                                <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ብላ ፨</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. iv: Hardly legible text, probably a protective prayer in Amharic.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: Unclear note in Amharic, written in the upper margin by the same hand as Additional note 1.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​ተዳር<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>ም</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 2r: Hardly legible note in the lower margin, probably in Amharic, written in purple ink.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 2v: Unclear note written in pencil in the lower margin.
                                        Only the beginning, mentioning <fo:inline id="d1e115938PRS13882Kasahun">Kāsāhun</fo:inline>, is legible.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">
                           <fo:inline id="d1e115942PRS13882Kasahun">
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">​አለቃ</fo:inline> ​ካሳ​ሁን</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 6v: Unclear note in the upper margin, written in Amharic. Only the beginning is legible.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​ከመ​ፍት​ሔ፡ ​ሥር፡</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 9r: Protective prayer in Gǝʿǝz and Amharic, probably by the same
                                        hand as Additional note 2.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ፈቲ​ነ፡ <fo:inline>ብይርዕ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ <fo:inline>ይስራየል፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ድፍ​ን፡
                                    <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​የል፡ ​ዘደ​ፈን​ኮ፡ ​ልቦ፡ ​ለዲ​ያብ​ሎስ፡ ​ዘበ​ውቄ​ያኖ​ለጽ፡
                                        <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ትዕ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እብ​ነ፡ ​አቤ​ል፡ ​ጽኑ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                                        ​ከመ፡ ​አድ​ማስ፡ ​ጽኑ​እ፡ ​ከመ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ብነ፡ ​ቤል ​ሆር ​ሆር፡ ​ጽኑ​እ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡
                                        ​ድፍ​ን፡ ​ልቦ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ድክ​ም፡ ​ኃይ​ሎሙ፡ ​አይ​ናች​ሁ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                                        ​ጨለ​ማ፡ ​ጉል​በታ​ችሁ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ዲሁ​ን፡ ​ቄጠ​ማ፡ ​የኑ፡
                                        <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ቶች፡ ​የማ​ውቃ​ችሁ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ውቃ​ችሁ​ን፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Scribal corrections are very rare. On fols 6r, 8r, words are marked for deletion by
                                        encircling. Spaces left for insertion of the owner’s name have
                                        been left empty (e.g. 4r, 6v, 7v).</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 8v: A protective square of four lines with four characters per line follows the end of the main text.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 8v: Scribbles in the lower margin.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. ir: Remains of writing are faintly visible.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: ‘Ms. Aeth. g. 32’ is written in pencil in the lower margin.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                         The bifolios of the single-quire manuscript are held together by two tackets of parchment,
                         which pierce the folios at head and tail.
                       </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner carried out by the Bodleian Library in January 2020 (i+1–9).
                                    The first folio is foliated as fol. i.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
         <fo:block>1 quire. I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (Fols ir–9v)</fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1r–8v: 1
                                    column (13 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 1r.The characters per line are 12–13.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            108 × 80 mm (fol. 1r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            71 × 69 mm (fol. 1r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 13 mm, bottom: 27 mm, right: 10 mm, left: 11 mm (fol. 1r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Ruling is visible; pricking is visible
                                        (except on fols i, 9). Primary and ruling pricks are visible. The upper and bottom lines are written above the ruling.
                               Ruling pattern (fols 1r–8v): 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Nineteenth–twenty-first century.. Regular hand. The characters are bulky. <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Groups of lines or single words at the beginning of sections;
                                    elements of numerals and punctuation signs.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 6v);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ምዕ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ምዕ​ራብ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 7r);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ደቡ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ደቡ​ብ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 7r);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰ፡</fo:inline> for <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰሜ​ን፡</fo:inline> (fol. 7r).
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.
                                  The first and the last folios, as well as the lower margins of the folios are stained by dirt.
                                  The upper margins of the folios and the openings fols 1v–2r and fols 7v–8r
                                  are stained by pink ink.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth century–2006</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            nineteenth and the twenty-first century.
                            The introductory formula <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ <fo:inline>ይስራየል፡ (!)</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
                            used in the Additional note 6 (fol. 9r) might point to a
                            Beta ʾƎsrāʾel ownership of the manuscript at some point, but might also be
                            used here specifically in a protective context. The trinitarian introductory formula is
                            used in Textual unit I.
                            A certain <fo:inline id="d1e116078PRS13882Kasahun">Kāsāhun</fo:inline>, possibly a later owner of the manuscript, is mentioned in Additional note 4.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The provenance of the manuscript is unknown.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the
                            bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e116088PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:inline> after his death in 2006.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg32">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg32</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
