      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:static-content flow-name="rest-region-after-odd">
         <fo:table>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="40%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-body>
               <fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block text-align="right"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block text-align="center" font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus"><!--<fo:page-number/>--></fo:block>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="right"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
               </fo:table-row>
            </fo:table-body>
         </fo:table>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:static-content flow-name="rest-region-after-even">
         <fo:table>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="40%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-body>
               <fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="left"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="center"><!--<fo:page-number/>--></fo:block>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block text-align="left"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
               </fo:table-row>
            </fo:table-body>
         </fo:table>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:static-content flow-name="rest-region-before-first">
         <fo:table>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="40%"/>
            <fo:table-column column-width="30%"/>
            <fo:table-body>
               <fo:table-row>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block text-align="right"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block text-align="center" font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
                  <fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:block font-size="9pt" font-family="Ludolfus" text-align="right"/>
                  </fo:table-cell>
               </fo:table-row>
            </fo:table-body>
         </fo:table>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator">
         <fo:block space-before="5mm" space-after="5mm">
            <fo:leader leader-length="30%" rule-thickness="0pt"/>
         </fo:block>
      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLeu3"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 49</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Bodleian Ullendorff 3)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment codex101×90 mm (weight: 199g), 52 fols, mid-eighteenth–nineteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e117792LIT3575Mashaf">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 3ra–50vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Book of the Hours’ (​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ሰዓ​ታት፡), incomplete, CAe 3575.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm"> The text includes numerous prayers and hymns, among which the following:</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e117800LIT3994Hymn">
               <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 3ra–3rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Hallelujah, I make the sign of the cross and rise up’ (​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አዐ​ትብ፡ ​ወእ​ትነ​ሣእ፡), CAe 3994.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Cf. Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse 1954,  5–6.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሃሌ፡ ​ሉያ፡ ​አአ​ትብ፡ ​ወእ​ትነ​ሣእ፡ ​በስመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ። ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​ነሢ​እየ፡
                                    ​እት​መረ​ጐዝ፡ ​እመ​ኒ፡ ​ወደ​ቁ፡ ​እት<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ሣእ ፨  ​ወእ​መኒ፡ 
                                    <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ርኩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ​እግ​ዚአብ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ያበ​ርህ፡ ​ሊተ፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 3rb–6ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e117833">Praises in the form of trisagion</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Cf. Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse 1954,  6–8.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ጸባ​ኦት፡ ​ፍጹ​ም፡ ​ምሉ​ዕ፡ ​ሰማ​ያተ፡ ​ወም​ድረ፡ ​ቅድ  (fol. 3va)  ​ሳተ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲከ ፤
                                    ቅ ​ዱስ ፡  ቅ ​ዱስ ፡  ቅ ​ዱስ ፡
                                     ​እግ ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፤  ​ዘእ​ምቅ​ድመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ወይ​ሄሉ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ 
                                    ​ለዓ​ለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 6ra–6va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e117883">Praises to Our Lady Mary</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Cf. Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse 1954,  8–9.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እዌ<fo:inline>[​ድሰ​ኪ፡]</fo:inline>  ​ለኪ፡ ​ኦድ​ንግ​ል፡ ​ምል​ዕተ፡ ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​ይክ​ል፡ ​አፉ​የ፡ ​ያስ​ተበ​ፅዕ፡ 
                                    ​ዕበ​የኪ ፨  ​ልሳ​ነ፡ ​ኪሩ​ቤል፡ ​ኢይ​ክል፡ ​አብ​ጽሖ፡ <fo:inline>ውዳሴኬ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወአ​ፈ፡ ​ሱራ​ፌል፡ ​ኢይ​ፌጽ​ም፡ ​ነጊ​ረ፡
                                    ​እበ​የኪ፡ ​ማር​ያም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 6va–7va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e117918">Praises to Our Lady Mary</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Cf. Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse 1954,  11–12.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተዘከ<fo:inline>[​ር፡]</fo:inline>  እ ​ግዚ ​ኦ፡ ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​አግብ ​ርቲ ​ኪ፡
                                    ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ አ ​ብር ​ሃም፡ ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ ​ወያዕ  (b)  ​ቆብ፡ ​ምእ​መና​ኒከ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-5) Fols 7va–9ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e117956">Praises to Our Lady Mary</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Cf. Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse 1954,  12–13.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ንዒ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ኦድ​ንግ​ል፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ፍቁ​ርኪ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ<fo:inline>[፡ ]</fo:inline>​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትባ​ርኪ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌነ፡
                                     ​ንዒ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ኦድን  (b)  ​ግል፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አዳ​ም፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦሙሓ ፡ ​ዘ፡ ፍ<fo:inline>[ሥ]</fo:inline>​ሐ፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ።
                                     ​እግ ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፡  መ ​ሐረነ ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-6) Fols 9ra–11ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e118005">Praises to Our Lady Mary</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Cf. Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse 1954,  13–15.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ንሴ ​ብሖ ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ  (b)  ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ለዘ​በስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ይሴ​ባሕ፡ ​ዘኪ​ያሁ፡
                                    ​ይሴ​ብሑ፡ ​ማኅ​በረ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ፍሡ​ሐን፡ ​ወሎ​ቱ፡ ​ይት​ቀነ​ዩ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳተ፡ ​ጻድ​ቃን፡
                                    </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ገ ​ነይነ  ​ለኪ፡   (fol. 11ra) 
                                    ኦ ​ወለተ ፡  ዳ ​ዊት ፤ 
                                    ​ኃዳ​ስ፡  ቀ ​መር፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ​ምሥ​ጢር፡ ​ኰሰ​ኰሰ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ዘብ​ሩር።
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
               <fo:inline>I-7) Fols 11ra–50vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">
                     <fo:inline id="d1e118061">Supplication to Our Lady Mary, to the saints, the martyr, the righteous, etc.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Most sections are not easily identifiable due to incomplete rubrication.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ሰ አ ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡  ማ<fo:inline>[​ርያ​ም፡]</fo:inline> ​እም​ነ፡ ​ወእ​መ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                    ​ሞገ​ስነ፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ወክ​ብር​ነ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​አስ​ተም​ሐሪ፡ ​ለነ ፨ ሰ ​አሉ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡
                                    ​ስኩ​ራነ፡ ​መን​ፈስ<fo:inline>[፡ ]</fo:inline>​ምሉ​አነ፡</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                     ​ዘመ​ሐር​ነ፡ ​ወል​ድከ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​እን​ግል​ጋ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ንጼ​ሊ፡ ​እን​በለ፡ ​ንት​ጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ሀበ​ነ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ወጸ​ጋ፡
                                     ​ዘይሴ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋ፡ ​ሰብ። ​ሰብ፡
                                     <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ት፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ዘፈ​ጠረ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡
                                </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: 
                                        Beginning of a text in honour of the archangel <fo:inline id="d1e118376PRS8065Raguel">Rāguʾel</fo:inline>. The text, indicated as <fo:inline font-style="italic">dǝrsān</fo:inline> ‘homily’ in the title, contains <fo:inline font-style="italic">ʾasmāt</fo:inline>.
                                        The first line is preceded by an almost completely illegible line in red ink. The text breaks off abruptly.
                                        Some letters are illegible due to the ink, the handwriting, and the state of preservation of the folio.
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ድር​ሳን፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ራጉ​ኤል፡ ​ብሃ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​መብ​ሕኤ​ል፡
                                            ​በዕ​ትና​ኤል፡  በ ​ሃድ​ናኤ​ል፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ጽሐ​ድኤ​ል፡ ​እሎ​ንተ፡ ​ቃላ​ት፡
                                            ​ዘነ​ገሮ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ራጉ​ኤል፡ ​ብሑ​ር፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 1v–2v: , incomplete, CAe 5086..
                                        The prayer is written in the same hand of Additional note 1.
                                        The text begins on fols 2r,  then continues on fol. 2v, and terminates abruptly on fol. 1v.
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            Incipit:  :
                                                ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​በረ​ድ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ብር​ድ፡ ​አስ​ተባ​ርድ፡ ​ድኵ​ል፡ ​ተከ​ልከ​ል፡ ​ሽር፡
                                                <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እሰ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ታለ፡
                                                ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዘገ​ብረ፡ ​ሰማ​የ፡ ​ወመ​ድረ፡ ​ኢታ​ውር​ድ፡ <fo:inline>በርድ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                                            ... 
                                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Scribal corrections or interventions are not uncommon. They consist of interlinear additions (e.g. on fols 8rb, 11va, 38vb),
                                        additions in the upper margins (e.g. on 41va–43vb), and erasures (e.g. on fol. 45vb).
                                        The rubrication has not been executed on some folios (e.g. on 20va, 34rb, 35va and fols 36vb–50vb), leading to textual lacunas.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>A white sticker is glued to the inner side of the front board.
                                        The signature and the content of the manuscript are indicated in blue pen on the sticker:
                                        ‘MS. Eth. EU III Hymns to B.V. Mary’.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                   The book is bound in wooden boards.
                                 
                                   The boards are flush with the bookblock and have shallow external bevels. The grain runs vertically.
                                   The external surface of the boards is polished and presents a finishing layer of dark colour. The inner surface and the edges are rough.
                                 
                                   Chainstitch sewing on three sewing stations; Z-plied thread.
                                   The sewing is closed in the last quire, by knotting the ends of the thread to each other.
                                 
                                   The small holes close to the head and tail of the quires are probably what remains of quire tackets.
                                 
                                   The manuscript is provided with a leather one-piece single-walled satchel with the remnant of a hinging strap.
                                   The satchel is equipped with a main tapered flap extending from the back to the front panel to cover the opening of the book compartment.
                                   The fragment of a narrow leather hanging strap passes through two flaps extending from the bottom panel of the case.
                                   This satchel has the shelfmark Bodleian Aeth. g. 49*.
                                 </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Foliation</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Pencil foliation in the upper right corner (1–52).</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 3ra–50vb: 2
                                    columns (13–15 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Data on text area and margin dimensions taken from fol. 13r.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Leaf dimensions:
                                            70 × 71 mm (fol. 13r).
                                            </fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            70 × 71 mm (fol. 13r)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 12 mm, bottom: 17 mm, right: 10 mm, left: 7 mm, intercolumn: 17 mm (fol. 13r).
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Mid-eighteenth–nineteenth century.. Mediocre handwriting.
                                    Characters were occasionally carelessly executed; spacing between characters is  irregular.
                                    The graphemes ግ and ዚ in the word ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ are often written with ligature.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    The name of Mary and some words, in full or in abbreviated form;
                                    elements of the numerals and of the punctuation signs, including the text dividers.
                                </fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                             provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                             start-indent="cm">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅ፡ ​እ፡</fo:inline> for  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 3va, 4ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ግ</fo:inline> or  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ግነ</fo:inline> for  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ግነ​ይ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 4vb, 5ra, 5rb);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እዌ</fo:inline> for  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​እዌ​ድሰ​ኪ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 6ra, 8vb);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ማ</fo:inline> or  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማር</fo:inline> for  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 6rb, 11ra, 19ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>5)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ተ</fo:inline> for  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ተዘ​ከር፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fol. 7ra);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>6)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ሰ</fo:inline> or  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰአ</fo:inline> for  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰአ​ሊ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fols 11ra, 12rb, 34va);
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:inline>7)</fo:inline>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                          <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ቅ</fo:inline> for  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡</fo:inline> (e.g. on fol. 19va).
                                    </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
            <fo:block>Holes resulting from parchment making are found on e.g. fols 23, 39, 85.</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is deficient.
                                    Some folios present tears and losses, some likely caused by rodents (e.g. fols 10–12).
                                    The edges of most folios are darkened by use and humidity.
                                    Some folios are stained, others are torn (e.g. fols 10–13). Some folios are partly detached or missing,
                                    e.g. 31–33, , 43 and fol. 50.
                                    The ink is partly faded away, making some portions of text nearly illegible (e.g. on 3ra, 22va).
                                    The sewing is broken in several points.
                                    The back cover is split vertically in half. The two parts are held together by threads passing through pairs of holes drilled through the covers.
                                    Large tunnels formed by insects open into the covers.
                                    The hinging strap of the satchel is torn into two pieces.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>mid-eighteenth–nineteenth century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            mid-eighteenth and the nineteenth century. The manuscript provides no clues concerning its provenance and original owner.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
                            It was purchased at some time by <fo:inline id="d1e118496PRS9622Ullendor">Edward Ullendorff</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e118501PRS9622Ullendor">Edward Ullendorff</fo:inline> after his death in 2011.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLeu3">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLeu3</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
   </fo:page-sequence>
