      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLeu7"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 51 (R)</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Bodleian Ullendorff 7)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment scroll1245×100–112 mm, 545×112 mm, 498×110 mm, 236×100–104 mm (weight: 39g),  fols, nineteenth century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e121702LIT6850Prayer">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r1–1r9: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Prayer and blessing of St Sisinnius Protective prayer in the shape of a supplication to Susǝnyos, CAe 6850.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​ወኃ​ይለ፡ ​ረድ​ኤቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ይዕ​ቀባ፡ ​ወይ​ፈው​ሳ፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡
                                ​ወዓ​ይነ​ት፡ ​ዛር፡ ​ወት​ግሪ​ዳ፡ ​ጠቢ​ብ፡ ​ወቡ​ዳ፡ ​ተያ​ያዥ፡ ​ወእ​ጀ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ጽላ፡ ​ወጊ፡ ​ወፍ​ጊን፡ ​አል​ጉም፡ ​ወሾ​ተላ​ይ፡ ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ሕም​ዘ፡
                                ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​አመ​ትከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e121711PRS14045WalattaKi">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳ​ን።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e121720LIT4697MagicPr">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 1r10–1r38: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማእ​ሠሮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡), CAe 4697.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወሌ​ጌዎ​ን፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ሰዳ​ዴ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​እም​ጽር​ሁ፡ ​ከመ፡
                                    ኢ ​ይስ​ክዩ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይኔ​ስሁ፡ ​ለጌ​ጋይ፡ ​ዘዘ​ዚአ​ሁ፡  ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡  ​ሰዳ​ዴ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​እም​ገጸ፡ ​ፈጣ​ሪ፡
                                ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ኢያስ ​ተዋ​ድዩ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​በነ​ገረ፡ ​ኃጕ​ል፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                            ​በማ​ኅፀ​ነ፡ ​ሐና፡ ​እም​ኪ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ነ፡ ​ፈን​ዊዮ፡ ​ለፋ<fo:inline>[ኑ]</fo:inline>​ኤል፡ ​ይዕ​ቀብ፡ ​ኪያ​ነ፡ ​በረ​ምሐ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​ረጊ​ዞ፡
                                ​ሰይ​ጣነ፡ ​ኦአ​ምላ​ከ፡ ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​ዕቀ​ባ፡ ​ወአ​ድኅ​ና፡ ​እም​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ዛር፡ ​ወት​ግሪ​ዳ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e121742PRS14045WalattaKi">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳ​ን።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e121751LIT6851Prayer">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 1r39–1r83: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer against the disease of Budā, CAe 6851.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ቡዳ፡ ​ወቁ​መኛ፡ ​በስ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​አብ፡ ​በስ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​በስ​ሙ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ታኦ​ስ፡ ​አዝ ​ዮስ፡ ​ማሲ፡ ​ማስ​ያስ፡ ​አብ​ፌድ​ርስ፡ ​ሩፋ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ን፡
                                ​በጠ​ጄን፡ ​ዘሐ​ጄን፡ ​ዋኅ፡ ​ዋኅ፡ ​ዋኅ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ዓም​ደ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ልብ​ሰ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ይበ​ርቅ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ገጹ፡ ​ለኃ​ይለ፡ ​ፀላ​ኢ፡ ​ወፀ​ር፡ ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ፓን​ዋማ፡ ​ፒል​ሜ፡ ​ጴል​ሜ፡ ​ኢይ​ርአ​ይ፡ ​ገጻ፡ ​አር​እየ​ኒ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡
                                ​ግር​ማከ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ራማ፡ ​ኢይ​ርአ​ይ፡ ​ገጻ​ከ፡ ​ኢይ​ልክ​ፍ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለአ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e121766PRS14045WalattaKi">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳ​ን።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e121775LIT6852Prayer">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 1r83–1r115: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for binding the demons, CAe 6852.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማእ​ሠሮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንት፡ ​ዘተ​ናገ​ሮ፡ ​እስ​ክን​ድር፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡
                                    ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ዓር​ብ፡ ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ጎግ፡ ​ወማ​ጎግ፡ ​በጊ​ዜ፡ ​ምጽ​አቱ፡ ​ለሰ በ ​ድአ​ት፡  ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብ​ል፡ ​አሌ​ፍ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወቡ​ዳ፡ ​ተያ​ያዥ፡ ​ወእ​ጀ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ጽላ፡ ​ወጊ፡ ​ወፍ​ጌን፡ ​ወንለ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ሽ፡ ​ዓይ​ነት፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ወዓ​ይነ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡
                                ​መን​ሶ፡ ​ወሥ​ራይ፡ ​ይት​ሐተ​ሙ፡ ​በማ​ኅተ​መ፡ ​እሌ​ኒ፡ ​ንግ​ሥት፡ ​ወበ​ማኅ​ተመ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡
                                ​ለአ​መተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ <fo:inline id="d1e121793PRS14045WalattaKi">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳ​ን።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e121803LIT5441ApostolicCreed">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 1r115–1r124: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Creed of the Apostles, incomplete, CAe 5441.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እፎ፡ ​ቤተ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ኃደ​ረ፡
                                ​ከመ፡ ​ምስ​ኪን፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​አያ​ያት፡ ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ነሢ​ኦ፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                                ​ወተ​ቀት​ለ፡ ​ወተ​ንሥ​አ፡ ​እሙ​ታን፡ ​ዓር​ገ፡ ​በስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ዳግ​መ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​በስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ይኰ​ንን፡ ​ሕያ​ዋነ፡ ​ወሙ​ታነ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወላ​ዕሌ​ነ፡
                                ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡ ​ወሣ​ህል፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e121827LIT5696MagicPrayer">
               <fo:inline>VI) Fols 1r124–1r157: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ሐጹ​ረ፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡), CAe 5696.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The explicit is poorly readable due to the condition of the parchment.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​መስ​ቀል፡ ሐ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ር፡ ​ወጥ​ቅም፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ሐፁ​ር፡ ​ለክ​ርስ​ቲያ​ን፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ሐፁ​ር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡
                                    <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ዳ፡ ​ዕል​ዋን፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ሐፁ​ር፡  ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​ሐፁ​ር፡ ​ለት​ሑታ​ን፡ ​መስ​ቀለ፡ ​ሐፁ​ር፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The verso is blank.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Scribal corrections or interventions are very rare: they consist of letters added interlineally.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The name of the owner, <fo:inline id="d1e122044PRS14045WalattaKi">Walatta Kidān</fo:inline>, is mentioned in supplications throughout and introduced by the epithet
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አመ​ትከ፡</fo:inline>, ‘your maid’. Her name has been sometimes overwritten with another one, poorly legible.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Order of textual units and miniatures: Textual unit I, Miniature 1, Textual units II–IV
                                         (beginning),
                                         Miniature 2, Textual units IV (end)–VI.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>The three parchment strips are slightly overlapping and sewn together with a running stitch.The scroll is kept in a pipe case.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (9 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 14–15The text is delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            55 × 102 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 2–5 mm, left: 2–5 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (86 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 16–17The text is delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            447 × 105 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 2–5 mm, left: 2–5 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (31 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 13–16The text is delimited by a black line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            312 × 105 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
