      </fo:static-content>
      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLeu10"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 54 (R)</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Bodleian Ullendorff 10)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment scroll2000×97 mm, 790×97 mm, 790×97 mm, 420×97 mm,  fols, twentieth–twenty-first century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e124351LIT6811Protect">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r1–1r67: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer for binding the demons’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማእ​ሰረ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡), CAe 6811.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ማ ​ዕሠ​ረ፡
                                ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወአ​ልቦ፡ ​ስም፡ ​ዘየ​ሐዩ፡ ​በታ​ሕተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወም​ድር፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ስሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ዘት​ሬኢ፡ ​በዓ​ይነ፡ ​ጠባ​ይዕ፡
                                ​እሳ​ታዊ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እል​መን​ክር፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ዘት​ሬኢ፡ ​በዓ​ይነ፡ ​ጠባ​ይዕ፡ ​እሳ​ታዊ፡ ​ሹሐ​ል፡ ​እል​መክ​ኑን፡ ​በዝ፡ ​አስ​ማተ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡
                                ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለዓ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e124366PRS14046WalattaSa">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሰን​በት፡
                                    ​እን​ጐቻ ፨</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e124379LIT6853Prayer">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 1r68–1r120: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for binding the enemy, CAe 6853.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘአ​ሠሮ፡ ​ለጸ​ላኢ፡ 
                                ​በማ​ዕሠ​ረ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​አሌ​ፍ፡ ​መደ​ንግ​ፅ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​ጠፈ​ረ፡ ​ሰሎ​ሞን፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​ሎፍ​ሐም፡ ​መሐ​ፍሎ​ን፡
                                ​መሐ​ፍሎ​ን፡ ​መሐ​ፍሎ​ን፡ ​ንም​ሎስ፡ ​ንም​ሎስ፡ ​ንም​ሎስ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ዘት​ሬኢ፡ ​በዓ​ይነ፡ ​ጠባ​ይዕ፡ ​ማያ​ዊ፡ ​ተአ​ሠር፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​በቃ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢት​ቅረ​ቡ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳ፡
                                ​ወሥ​ጋሃ፡ ​ለዓ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e124397PRS14046WalattaSa">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ሰን​በት፡ ​እን​ጐቻ።</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e124408LIT6854Prayer">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 1r121–1r159: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Protective prayer for binding the demons Prayer for binding the demons, CAe 6854.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​፩፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ ​ት፡
                                ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማዕ​ሠረ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​አካ​ዕ፡ ​አካብ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ክስ​ብኤ​ል፡ ​ቤቃ፡ ​ሴቃ፡ ​ጼቃ፡ ​ዮድ፡ ​አኽ​ያ፡ ​ሸራ​ኽያ፡ ​በራ​ኽያ፡
                                ​ኤል​ሻዳ​ይ፡ ​ጸባ​ዖት፡ ​አዶ​ናይ፡ ​አማ​ኑኤ​ል፡ ​እል​መክ​ኑን፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​መጋ​ኛ፡ ​ወጉ​ስም​ት፡ ​ቡዳ፡ ​ወት​ግሪ​ዳ፡ ​ዛር፡ ​ወቸ​ነፈ​ር፡ ​ወእ​ምኵ​ሉ፡ ​ሕማ​ም፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለዓ​መት​ከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e124426PRS14046WalattaSa">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሰን​በት፡ ​እን​ጐቻ፡</fo:inline>
                                ​ሥመ​ር፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ይት​ከሃ​ለከ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ሰአ​ኖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                                        Short ownership note written in blue pen on the upper margin of the scroll.
                                        Part of the writing is poorly legible. The name of the original owner, <fo:inline id="d1e124579PRS14046WalattaSa">Walatta Sanbat ʾƎngʷaččā</fo:inline>, is clearly readable.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The verso is blank.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Scribal corrections are not frequent and consist of minimal interlinear additions.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The name of the owner, <fo:inline id="d1e124597PRS14046WalattaSa">Walatta Sanbat ʾƎngʷaččā</fo:inline>, is mentioned in supplications throughout and introduced by the epithet
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​አመ​ትከ፡</fo:inline>, ‘your maid’.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Brillenbuchstaben</fo:inline> are used in all textual units and at the end of the last text.
                                        The last text is also followed by a five-point star.
                                    </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Order of textual units and miniatures: Miniature 1, Textual units I–II,
                                        Miniature 2, Textual unit III.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>The three parchment strips are slightly overlapping and sewn together with a running stitch.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (161 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 7–11The text is delimited by a red line.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            784 × 81 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            top: 1 mm, bottom: 5 mm, right: 9 mm, left: 10 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Pricking and ruling are not visible.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Twentieth–twenty-first century.. 
                                    The handwriting is hasty. Characters have been executed with a thin nib.
                                <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: Few incipit lines of each text; the name of the Trinity; the words <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘአ​ሠሮ፡</fo:inline> and
                                    <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘአ​ሠር​ኮ፡</fo:inline> (in full or in part); the name of the owner; some elements of the punctuation signs.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block font-style="italic"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
         <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">A single band filled with a polychrome harlequin pattern marks the beginning 
                                of the text. The scroll features decorations were featured by one or
                                more unsteady hands. 
                                Given the variations in colour, and the retracing of lines, it is probable that some of the 
                                scroll’s features were added by a secondary and later hand.
                            </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Miniatures</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
            <fo:inline>(322) <fo:inline>A cross with foliated arms that curl onto its sides forming four pairs of eye-shaped
                                    elements is situated above a <fo:inline font-style="italic">tābot</fo:inline>-like element with a Greek cross inscribed upon it and
                                    surrounded by eyes at its corners.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(323) <fo:inline>An unidentified standing angel with an unsheathed sword.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
            <fo:inline>(324) <fo:inline>A star of David.</fo:inline>
            </fo:inline>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Headpieces</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Drawings</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-after="3mm"
                   space-before="2mm"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid">Other</fo:block>
         <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                   provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.
                                    The parchment is slightly crumpled due to rolling.
                                </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>twentieth–twenty-first century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to the period between the
                            twentieth and the twenty-first century.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The provenance and circumstances of production of the manuscript are unknown.
                            The original owner, indicated in the supplication formulas as <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዓመ​ትከ፡</fo:inline> ‘your maid’, was
                            <fo:inline id="d1e124646PRS14046WalattaSa">Walatta Sanbat ʾƎngʷaččā</fo:inline>.
                            The scroll was acquired at some point by <fo:inline id="d1e124648PRS9622Ullendor">Edward Ullendorff</fo:inline>.
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries as part of the bequest of <fo:inline id="d1e124653PRS9622Ullendor">Edward Ullendorff</fo:inline> after his death in 2011.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLeu10">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLeu10</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
