      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block id="BDLaethg47"
                   text-align="center"
                   page-break-inside="avoid"
                   page-break-after="avoid"
                   space-before="3mm">
            <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. g. 47 (R)</fo:block>
            <fo:block>(Or. lang. e. 45)</fo:block>
            <fo:block/>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm" white-space-collapse="true">Parchment scroll1510×87–90 mm, 475×88 mm, 556×88–90 mm, 500×87–90 mm (weight: 50g),  fols, nineteenth–twenty-first century.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e125919LIT1763Legend">
               <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r1–1r60: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Legend of St Susǝnyos and Wǝrzǝlyā (general record), CAe 1763.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡ ​ዋሕ​ድ፡ ​እሩ​ያን፡ ​በአ​ካል፡ ​ጸሎ ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡
                                <fo:inline>ሸቶላ (!)</fo:inline>
                                ​ወባ​ርያ፡ ​ወአ​የረ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                ​ሕያው<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ነባ​ቢ፡ ​ወተ​ናጋ​ሪ፡ ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​በእ​ንተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አሰ​ስሎ፡ ​ደዌ፡
                                ​እም​ሕፃ​ናት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​እለ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ይጠ​ብው፡ ​ጥበ፡ ​እሞሙ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አዲ፡ ​ዘየ​ሐይ​ዋ፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​ወዘ​ትጽ​ሕፎ፡ ​ለደ​ቂቃ፡
                                ​ወዘ​ትሰ​ቅሎ፡ ​ላእ​ሌሃ፡
                                ​ከመ፡ <fo:inline>ይበቁአ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​በረ​ድኤ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ወክ​ቡር፡ ​ስመ፡ ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ዓመ​ቱ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e125951PRS14043WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሥላ​ሴ፡ ​ሮህ፡</fo:inline>
                                ​ወሀ​ሎ፡ ፩ ​ብእሲ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡  ​ወአ​ውሰበ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ብ<fo:inline>[እ]</fo:inline>​ሲተ፡ ​ዘወ​ለደ​ት፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ተባ​እተ፡ ​ወበ​ቀዳ​ማይ፡
                                ​ወል​ድ፡ ​መጽ​አት፡ ​ውር​ዝል​ያ፡ ​ወቀ​ተለ​ቶ፡ ​ለወ​ልዳ፡ ​ወከ​ልሃ​ት፡ ​እሙ፡ ​ወበ​ከየ​ት፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​አ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሱስ​ንዮ​ስ፡ ​ወተ​ጽእ​ነ፡ ​ፈረ​ሱ፡ ​ወነ​ስአ፡ ​ኵና​ቶ፡ ​በየ​ማኑ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትብ​ል፡ ​በጾ​ታ፡ ​መአ​ርግ፡ ​ሊቃ​ነ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ወገ​ብር ፡  ​ኤል፡
                                    ​ሱራ​ፌል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ወኪ​ሩቤ​ል፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወሰ​ዳክ​ያል፡ ​እሉ፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡ ​እለ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ይቀ​ውሙ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡
                                ​መን​በሩ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​መእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​እብ፡ ​አሐዜ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘል​ፈ፡ ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ዓመ​ቱ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e125988PRS14043WalattaS"> ​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሥላ​ሴ፡</fo:inline> ​ሾር፡

                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e126003LIT5690MagicPrayer">
               <fo:inline>II) Fols 1r60–1r108: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Protective prayer against eye disease’ (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ነደ​ራ፡), CAe 5690.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ነደ​ራ፡ ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ሕ ​ማመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ይኮ​ኑ፡ ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​የሐ​ውር፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕ​ር፡ ​ጥብ​ርያ​ድስ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                ​፲ወ፪ ​አር​ዳኢ​ሁ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​መል​ክአ፡ ​ቦአት ት ፡ ​አረ​ጊት፡ ​ወይ​እቲ፡ ​መፍ​ርህ​ት፡ ​ጥቀ፡ ​መደ​ንግ​ጽት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኮና፡ ​አእ​ይን​ቲሃ፡ ​ይበ​ርቃ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኮከ​በ፡ ​ጽባ​ሕ፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ንስ​እዋኅ  ​ወአ​ውእ​ይዋ፡ ​በእ​ሳት፡ ​ወኤ​ውዋ፡ ​ምስ​ራቅ፡ ​ወም​እራብ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ሰሜ​ን፡ ​ወደ​ቡብ፡ ​ከመ፡ ይ ​ጥፋ​እ፡
                                ​ዝክ​ረ፡ ​ስሞ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ለመ፡ ​አለ​ም፡ ​ወከ​ማሁ፡ ​ይደ​ምስ​ስ፡ ​ስሞ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​ጋን​ንተ፡ ​ወለ​ባር​ያ፡ ​ወዛ​ር፡ ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ላዋ​ሽ፡ ​ለፍ​ጊን፡ ​ወለ፡ ​አል​ጉም፡ ​ለም​ታት፡ ​ወፍ​ልጸ​ተ፡ ​ርእ​ስ፡ ​ቍር​ጸት፡ ​ወፍ​ልጸ​ተ፡ ​ውግ​አት፡ ​ወቁ​ርጥ​ማት፡ ​መገ​ኛ፡
                                ​ወጉ​ስም​ት፡ ​ወበ​አለ፡ ​ግብር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወእ​ደ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​አድ​ኅና፡ ​ለዓ​መት​ከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e126038PRS14043WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሥላሴ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                                ​ሮህ፡ ​ሸር፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e126055LIT6844PPHemorrhage">
               <fo:inline>III) Fols 1r108–1r123: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Prayer against stilling blood’ (​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​አር​ግዖ፡ ​ደም፡), CAe 6844.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ <fo:inline>ጸሎት፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​አር​ግኦ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ደም፡ ​ለደ​ም፡ ​ለደም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ሰተ​ም፡ ​ሰር​ተም፡ ​ሰን​ኮር​ተም፡ ​ዘወ​ጽአ፡ ​ደም፡ ​ወማይ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​እም​ገቦ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወይ​ትወ​ዳእ፡ ​በቃ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡
                                ​ኢስ፡ ​አፍ​ሊስ፡ ​ሚል​ዮስ፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እኮ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​በረ​ድ፡ ​ወነ​ፍስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​አር​ግእ፡ ​ወአ​ቁም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ፍሬ፡ ​ማሕ​ጸና፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትለ​ድ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ወወ​ለተ፡ ​አመ​ትከ፡
                                <fo:inline id="d1e126091PRS14043WalattaS">​ወለ​ተ፡  ​ሥላ​ሴ፡</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ር፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e126106LIT6845PPSatolay">
               <fo:inline>IV) Fols 1r124–1r154: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ሸቶ​ላይ፡), CAe 6845.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The entire text is reproduced below.</fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩
                                    ​አም​ላክ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሕማመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ሸቶ​ላይ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ሸቶ​ላይ፡ ​ወሸ​ቶላ​ዊ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ዘ<fo:inline>ትቀት (!)</fo:inline> ​ሕፃ​ናተ፡ ​ወት​ቋር​ጽ፡ ​አማ​ሉተ፡ ​ወት​ጦዊ፡ ​አን​ጀተ፡
                                ​ወት​ቆረ​ጥም፡ ​አካ​ላተ፡ ​ወተ​ሐም​ም፡ ​አባ​ላተ፡ ​አም​ሐል​ኩከ፡ ​ወአ​ውገ​ዝኩ​ከ፡ ​ወለ​ጐም​ኩከ፡ ​ወአ​ሰር​ኩከ፡ ​ወቆ​ለፍ​ኩከ፡ ​ወሐ​ተም​ኩከ፡ ​በማ​ሕተመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​መለ​ኮት፡ ​ወካ​እበ፡ ​አሰ​ርኩ​ከ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ሸቶ​ላይ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​በዝ​ንቱ፡ ​አስ​ማት፡
                                ​መሐ​ጀን፡ ​መሐ​ጀን፡ ​መሐ​ጀን፡ ፲ ​ጊዜ፡ ​አመ​አጃ​ም፡ ​ቀለ​ጀም፡ ​ሸጀ​ም፡ ​ሹን፡ ​ሸድ​ን። ​ማው፡ ​ማው​ካ፡ ​ያሐ​ጀ፡ ​ያሐ​ጀ፡ ​የሐ​ጀ፡ ​የሐ​ቱደ​ጀ፡ ​አአ​ጠጨ​ታሕ፡
                                ​በጉ​ሎን​ቃር​ሌው​ስ፡ ​ማር፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡
                                ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​እን​ቱ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ከ፡ ​ቀጥ​ቀጦ፡ ​ወአ​ርኅ​ቆ፡ ​ወሰ​ድዶ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ጋኔ​ን፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ሸቶ​ላይ፡ ​ከመ፡ <fo:inline>ይጾእ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline>ወኢይቀረብ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ኀበ፡
                                ​አመ​ትከ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e126141PRS14043WalattaS">ወ ​ለተ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡</fo:inline> ​ሾር።
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                      font-family="Ludolfus"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      id="d1e126156LIT2765RepCh49">
               <fo:inline>V) Fols 1r154–1r189: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Salutations for Phanuel’ (​ሰላ​ምታ፡ ​ዘፋ​ኑኤ​ል፡), CAe 2765.</fo:inline>
               </fo:inline>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡  ፩ 
                                ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ማእ​ሰረ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ወባ​ርያ፡ ​ወአ​የረ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡
                                 ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡  ​ሰዳዴ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​እም​ገጸ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ፈጣ​ሪ፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያስ​ተዋ​ድዩ፡  ፸  ​በነ​ገር፡ ​ዘሐ​ጉል፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡
                            </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡  ​መቅ​ደሰ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ዘብኪ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ድኅ​ነ፡ ​በሕ​ጽነ፡
                                ​ሐና፡ ​እምኪ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                ​ተማ​ኅጸ​ነ፡ ​ፈገ​ውዮ፡ ​ለፋ​ኑኤ​ል፡ ​ገብ​ርኪ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይእ​ቀብ፡ ​ኪያ​ነ፡ ​በር​ምኃ፡ ​መስ​ቀሉ፡ ​ሰገዘ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ሰይ​ጣነ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                ​ፋኑ​ኤል፡ ​አድ​ኅነ​ኒ፡ ​እም​እደ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​እኩ​ያን፡ <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ለአ​መት<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​እማ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e126208PRS14044WalattaM">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em"
                           white-space-collapse="true">
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The verso is empty.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The manuscript contains no scribal corrections.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>The name of the owner, mentioned in supplications throughout, was
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e126406PRS14043WalattaS">Walatta Śǝllāse</fo:inline>. The name <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡</fo:inline> is always followed by
                                        the words <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሮህ፡</fo:inline> or <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሾር፡</fo:inline>/<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​ሸር፡</fo:inline>.
                                        It is unclear whether
                                    these form part of the personal name or have a different meaning, possibly connected to Amharic (via Arabic)
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​ሩሕ፡</fo:inline>, ‘spirit’, and  <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​ሸር፡</fo:inline>, ‘wickedness’.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Order of textual units and miniatures: Miniature 1, Textual unit I (beginning),
                                        Miniature 2, Textual units I (end)–III (beginning),
                                        Miniature 3, Textual units III
                                        (end)–V.</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>The three parchment strips are slightly overlapping and sewn together with a running stitch using a narrow parchment strip each.The manuscript is kept in a leather case composed of two parts which are attached to each other with blue yarn.</fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (50 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 12–14.The text area is delimited by a black frame.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            240 × 74 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 5–7 mm, left: 7 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (76 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 14–16.The text area is delimited by a black frame.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            341 × 76 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 6–10 mm, left: 6–10 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>1
                                    column (73 written lines)</fo:block>
                     <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">Number of characters per line: 13–16The text area is delimited by a black frame.</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Text area:
                                            354 × 77 mm ()</fo:block>
                     <fo:block page-break-after="avoid"
                               start-indent="10mm"
                               space-before="3mm"
                               space-after="3mm">Margins: 
                                            right: 4–8 mm, left: 6–7 mm ().
                                            </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm">
            <fo:block page-break-after="avoid" font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling and pricking</fo:block>
            <fo:block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                      provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:inline>Pricking and ruling are not visible. Pricking and ruling are not visible. Pricking and ruling are not visible.</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
            <fo:table>
               <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
               <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
               <fo:table-body>
                  <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                     <fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->Nineteenth–twenty-first century.. Trained hand. Characters are bulky and widely spaced.<fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                           <fo:block>Rubrication: The first two or three lines of prayers; holy names; the complete name of the owner or only the holy name contained in it;
                                <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለከ፡</fo:inline>/<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ለኪ፡</fo:inline>; parts of numerals. In the final supplication, the illegible
                                    name of the owner is followed by <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወእ​ማ፡
                                        ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline>, ‘and her mother <fo:inline id="d1e126381PRS14044WalattaM">Walatta Mikāʾel</fo:inline>’.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:table-cell>
                  </fo:table-row>
               </fo:table-body>
            </fo:table>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The condition is good.Small losses are present along the left margin in the bottom area of the scroll.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm" white-space-collapse="true">
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:inline>nineteenth–twenty-first century</fo:inline>
                            The manuscript can be dated palaeographically to period between the
                            nineteenth and the twenty-first century. Its original owner was <fo:inline id="d1e126456PRS14043WalattaS">Walatta Śǝllāse</fo:inline> (see Varia note 3).
                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>The circumstances of its production and acquisition by the library are not
                        known.</fo:block>
            <fo:block>The manuscript entered the Bodleian Libraries some time
                            before 2020.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                   space-after="3mm"
                   margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                   page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg47">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethg47</fo:basic-link>
         </fo:block>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
